#: src/input-format.md:143
msgid ""
"This chapter describes how a source file is interpreted as a sequence of "
"tokens."
msgstr "本章描述如何将源文件解释为一系列词法单元。"

#: src/input-format.md:145
msgid ""
"See [Crates and source files](crates-and-source-files.md) for a description "
"of how programs are organised into files."
msgstr ""
"关于程序如何组织成文件，参见 [crate 和源文件](crates-and-source-files.md)。"

#: src/input-format.md:151
msgid "Source encoding"
msgstr "源码编码"

#: src/input-format.md:157
msgid ""
"Each source file is interpreted as a sequence of Unicode characters encoded "
"in UTF-8."
msgstr "每个源文件都被解释为一个以 UTF-8 编码的 Unicode 字符序列。"

#: src/input-format.md:163
msgid "It is an error if the file is not valid UTF-8."
msgstr "如果文件不是有效的 UTF-8，则为错误。"

#: src/input-format.md:169
msgid "Byte order mark removal"
msgstr "字节顺序标记移除"

#: src/input-format.md:171
msgid ""
"If the first character in the sequence is `U+FEFF` ([BYTE ORDER MARK]"
"(https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Byte_order_mark#UTF-8)), it is removed."
msgstr ""
"如果序列中的第一个字符是 `U+FEFF` ([BYTE ORDER MARK](https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Byte_order_mark#UTF-8))，则移除它。"

#: src/input-format.md:177
msgid "CRLF normalization"
msgstr "CRLF 规范化"

#: src/input-format.md:179
msgid ""
"Each pair of characters `U+000D` (CR) immediately followed by `U+000A` (LF) "
"is replaced by a single `U+000A` (LF). This happens once, not repeatedly, so "
"after the normalization, there can still exist `U+000D` (CR) immediately "
"followed by `U+000A` (LF) in the input (e.g. if the raw input contained \"CR "
"CR LF LF\")."
msgstr ""
"每一对由 `U+000D` (CR) 后紧跟 `U+000A` (LF) 组成的字符都会替换为单个 "
"`U+000A` (LF)。此操作只发生一次，而非反复进行，因此在规范化之后，输入中仍可能"
"存在 `U+000D` (CR) 后紧跟 `U+000A` (LF) 的情况（例如原始输入包含 \"CR CR LF "
"LF\" 时）。"

#: src/input-format.md:181
msgid ""
"Other occurrences of the character `U+000D` (CR) are left in place (they are "
"treated as [whitespace](whitespace.md))."
msgstr ""
"字符 `U+000D` (CR) 的其他出现位置会保留原样（它们会被视为 [空白]"
"(whitespace.md)）。"

#: src/input-format.md:187
msgid "Shebang removal"
msgstr "Shebang 移除"

#: src/input-format.md:193
msgid ""
"If a [shebang](shebang.md) is present, it is removed from the input sequence "
"(and is therefore ignored)."
msgstr ""
"如果存在 [shebang](shebang.md)，则会从输入序列中移除它（因而会忽略它）。"

#: src/input-format.md:199
msgid "Tokenization"
msgstr "词法单元化"

#: src/input-format.md:201
msgid ""
"The resulting sequence of characters is then converted into tokens as "
"described in the remainder of this chapter."
msgstr "然后，得到的字符序列会按照本章其余部分的描述转换为词法单元。"

#: src/input-format.md:207
msgid ""
"The standard library [`include!`](../core/macro.include.html) macro applies "
"the following transformations to the file it reads:"
msgstr ""
"标准库 [`include!`](../core/macro.include.html) 宏会对其读取的文件应用以下转"
"换："

#: src/input-format.md:209
msgid "Byte order mark removal."
msgstr "字节顺序标记移除。"

#: src/input-format.md:210
msgid "CRLF normalization."
msgstr "CRLF 规范化。"

#: src/input-format.md:211
msgid ""
"Shebang removal when invoked in an item context (as opposed to expression or "
"statement contexts)."
msgstr "在条目上下文中调用时移除 shebang（区别于表达式或语句上下文）。"

#: src/input-format.md:213
msgid ""
"The [`include_str!`](../core/macro.include_str.html) and [`include_bytes!`]"
"(../core/macro.include_bytes.html) macros do not apply these transformations."
msgstr ""
"[`include_str!`](../core/macro.include_str.html) 和 [`include_bytes!`](../"
"core/macro.include_bytes.html) 宏不会应用这些转换。"

#: src/shebang.md:11
msgid ""
"A _[shebang](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shebang_(Unix))_ is an optional "
"line that is typically used in Unix-like systems to specify an interpreter "
"for executing the file."
msgstr ""
"_[shebang](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shebang_(Unix))_ 是一个可选的行，通"
"常在类 Unix 系统中用于指定执行该文件的解释器。"

#: src/shebang.md:22 src/macros.md:458
msgid "\"Hello!\""
msgstr "\"Hello!\""

#: src/shebang.md:35
msgid ""
"**<sup>Lexer</sup>** <br> <span class=\"grammar-text grammar-production\" "
"id=\"grammar-SHEBANG\" onclick=\"show_railroad()\">[SHEBANG]"
"(shebang.md#railroad-SHEBANG)</span> →   \n"
"    <span class=\"grammar-literal\">\\#!</span> !( ( <span class=\"grammar-"
"text\">[WHITESPACE](whitespace.md#grammar-WHITESPACE)</span> | <span "
"class=\"grammar-text\">[LINE_COMMENT](comments.md#grammar-LINE_COMMENT)</"
"span> | <span class=\"grammar-text\">[BLOCK_COMMENT](comments.md#grammar-"
"BLOCK_COMMENT)</span> )<sup>\\*</sup> <span class=\"grammar-literal\">\\[</"
"span> )   \n"
"    ~<span class=\"grammar-text\">[LF](whitespace.md#grammar-LF)</"
"span><sup>\\*</sup> ( <span class=\"grammar-text\">[LF]"
"(whitespace.md#grammar-LF)</span> | <span class=\"grammar-text\">[EOF](input-"
"format.md#grammar-EOF)</span> )"
msgstr ""
"**<sup>词法</sup>** <br> <span class=\"grammar-text grammar-production\" "
"id=\"grammar-SHEBANG\" onclick=\"show_railroad()\">[SHEBANG]"
"(shebang.md#railroad-SHEBANG)</span> →   \n"
"    <span class=\"grammar-literal\">\\#!</span> !( ( <span class=\"grammar-"
"text\">[WHITESPACE](whitespace.md#grammar-WHITESPACE)</span> | <span "
"class=\"grammar-text\">[LINE_COMMENT](comments.md#grammar-LINE_COMMENT)</"
"span> | <span class=\"grammar-text\">[BLOCK_COMMENT](comments.md#grammar-"
"BLOCK_COMMENT)</span> )<sup>\\*</sup> <span class=\"grammar-literal\">\\[</"
"span> )   \n"
"    ~<span class=\"grammar-text\">[LF](whitespace.md#grammar-LF)</"
"span><sup>\\*</sup> ( <span class=\"grammar-text\">[LF]"
"(whitespace.md#grammar-LF)</span> | <span class=\"grammar-text\">[EOF](input-"
"format.md#grammar-EOF)</span> )"

#: src/shebang.md:175
msgid ""
"The shebang starts with the characters `#!` and extends through the first "
"`U+000A` (LF) or through EOF if no LF is present. If the `#!` characters are "
"followed by `[` (ignoring any intervening [comments](comments.md) or "
"[whitespace](whitespace.md)), the line is not considered a shebang (to avoid "
"ambiguity with an [inner attribute](attributes.md))."
msgstr ""
"shebang 以字符 `#!` 开始，并延伸到第一个 `U+000A` (LF)，如果不存在 LF，则延伸"
"到 EOF。如果 `#!` 字符后跟着 `[`（忽略中间出现的任何 [注释](comments.md) 或"
"[空白](whitespace.md)），则该行不被视为 shebang（以避免与[内部属性]"
"(attributes.md)产生歧义）。"

#: src/shebang.md:181
msgid ""
"The shebang may appear immediately at the start of the file or after the "
"optional [byte order mark](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Byte_order_mark#UTF-8)."
msgstr ""
"shebang 可以紧接着出现在文件开头，或出现在可选的[字节顺序标记](https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Byte_order_mark#UTF-8)之后。"

