#: src/identifiers.md:303
msgid ""
"Identifiers follow the specification in [Unicode Standard Annex #31](https://"
"www.unicode.org/reports/tr31/tr31-43.html) for Unicode version 17.0, with "
"the additions described below. Some examples of identifiers:"
msgstr ""
"标识符遵循 [Unicode Standard Annex #31](https://www.unicode.org/reports/tr31/"
"tr31-43.html) 中针对 Unicode 17.0 版本的规范，并带有下文描述的补充。标识符的"
"一些示例："

#: src/identifiers.md:305
msgid "`foo`"
msgstr "`foo`"

#: src/identifiers.md:306
msgid "`_identifier`"
msgstr "`_identifier`"

#: src/identifiers.md:307
msgid "`r#true`"
msgstr "`r#true`"

#: src/identifiers.md:308
msgid "`Москва`"
msgstr "`Москва`"

#: src/identifiers.md:309
msgid "`東京`"
msgstr "`東京`"

#: src/identifiers.md:315
msgid "The profile used from UAX #31 is:"
msgstr "所使用的 UAX #31 profile 是："

#: src/identifiers.md:317
msgid ""
"Start := [`XID_Start`](http://unicode.org/cldr/utility/list-unicodeset.jsp?"
"a=%5B%3AXID_Start%3A%5D&abb=on&g=&i=), plus the underscore character (U+005F)"
msgstr ""
"Start := [`XID_Start`](http://unicode.org/cldr/utility/list-unicodeset.jsp?"
"a=%5B%3AXID_Start%3A%5D&abb=on&g=&i=)，加上下划线字符 (U+005F)"

#: src/identifiers.md:318
msgid ""
"Continue := [`XID_Continue`](http://unicode.org/cldr/utility/list-"
"unicodeset.jsp?a=%5B%3AXID_Continue%3A%5D&abb=on&g=&i=)"
msgstr ""
"Continue := [`XID_Continue`](http://unicode.org/cldr/utility/list-"
"unicodeset.jsp?a=%5B%3AXID_Continue%3A%5D&abb=on&g=&i=)"

#: src/identifiers.md:319
msgid "Medial := empty"
msgstr "Medial := 空"

#: src/identifiers.md:325
msgid ""
"Identifiers starting with an underscore are typically used to indicate an "
"identifier that is intentionally unused, and will silence the unused warning "
"in `rustc`."
msgstr ""
"以下划线开头的标识符通常用于表示有意不使用的标识符，并会抑制 `rustc` 中的未使"
"用警告。"

#: src/identifiers.md:334
msgid ""
"Identifiers may not be a [strict](keywords.md#strict-keywords) or [reserved]"
"(keywords.md#reserved-keywords) keyword without the `r#` prefix described "
"below in [raw identifiers](#raw-identifiers)."
msgstr ""
"如果没有下文[原始标识符](#raw-identifiers)中描述的 `r#` 前缀，标识符不能是[严"
"格关键字](keywords.md#strict-keywords)或[保留关键字](keywords.md#reserved-"
"keywords)。"

#: src/identifiers.md:340
msgid ""
"Zero width non-joiner (ZWNJ U+200C) and zero width joiner (ZWJ U+200D) "
"characters are not allowed in identifiers."
msgstr ""
"标识符中不允许出现零宽不连字字符（ZWNJ U+200C）和零宽连字字符（ZWJ U+200D）。"

#: src/identifiers.md:346
msgid ""
"Identifiers are restricted to the ASCII subset of [`XID_Start`](http://"
"unicode.org/cldr/utility/list-unicodeset.jsp?"
"a=%5B%3AXID_Start%3A%5D&abb=on&g=&i=) and [`XID_Continue`](http://"
"unicode.org/cldr/utility/list-unicodeset.jsp?"
"a=%5B%3AXID_Continue%3A%5D&abb=on&g=&i=) in the following situations:"
msgstr ""
"在以下情形中，标识符被限制为 [`XID_Start`](http://unicode.org/cldr/utility/"
"list-unicodeset.jsp?a=%5B%3AXID_Start%3A%5D&abb=on&g=&i=) 和 [`XID_Continue`]"
"(http://unicode.org/cldr/utility/list-unicodeset.jsp?"
"a=%5B%3AXID_Continue%3A%5D&abb=on&g=&i=) 的 ASCII 子集："

#: src/identifiers.md:348
msgid ""
"[`extern crate`](items/extern-crates.md) declarations (except the [AsClause]"
"(items/extern-crates.md#grammar-AsClause) identifier)"
msgstr ""
"[`extern crate`](items/extern-crates.md) 声明（[AsClause](items/extern-"
"crates.md#grammar-AsClause) 标识符除外）"

#: src/identifiers.md:349
msgid "External crate names referenced in a [path](paths.md)"
msgstr "[路径](paths.md)中引用的外部 crate 名称"

#: src/identifiers.md:350
msgid ""
"[Module](items/modules.md) names loaded from the filesystem without a "
"[`path` attribute](items/modules.md#the-path-attribute)"
msgstr ""
"在没有 [`path` 属性](items/modules.md#the-path-attribute)的情况下从文件系统加"
"载的[模块](items/modules.md)名称"

#: src/identifiers.md:351
msgid "[`no_mangle`](abi.md#the-no_mangle-attribute) attributed items"
msgstr "带有 [`no_mangle`](abi.md#the-no_mangle-attribute) 属性的项"

#: src/identifiers.md:352
msgid "Item names in [external blocks](items/external-blocks.md)"
msgstr "[外部块](items/external-blocks.md)中的项名称"

#: src/identifiers.md:358
msgid "Normalization"
msgstr "规范化"

#: src/identifiers.md:360
msgid ""
"Identifiers are normalized using Normalization Form C (NFC) as defined in "
"[Unicode Standard Annex #15](https://www.unicode.org/reports/tr15/"
"tr15-57.html). Two identifiers are equal if their NFC forms are equal."
msgstr ""
"标识符会使用 [Unicode Standard Annex #15](https://www.unicode.org/reports/"
"tr15/tr15-57.html) 中定义的规范化形式 C（NFC）进行规范化。如果两个标识符的 "
"NFC 形式相等，则这两个标识符相等。"

#: src/identifiers.md:362
msgid ""
"[Procedural](procedural-macros.md) and [declarative](macros-by-example.md) "
"macros receive normalized identifiers in their input."
msgstr ""
"[过程宏](procedural-macros.md)和[声明式宏](macros-by-example.md)在其输入中接"
"收规范化后的标识符。"

#: src/identifiers.md:368
msgid "Raw identifiers"
msgstr "原始标识符"

#: src/identifiers.md:374
msgid ""
"A raw identifier is like a normal identifier, but prefixed by `r#`. (Note "
"that the `r#` prefix is not included as part of the actual identifier.)"
msgstr ""
"原始标识符类似普通标识符，但带有 `r#` 前缀。（注意，`r#` 前缀不包含在实际标识"
"符中。）"

#: src/identifiers.md:380
msgid ""
"Unlike a normal identifier, a raw identifier may be any strict or reserved "
"keyword except the ones listed above for `RAW_IDENTIFIER`."
msgstr ""
"与普通标识符不同，原始标识符可以是任意严格关键字或保留关键字，但上面对 "
"`RAW_IDENTIFIER` 列出的那些除外。"

#: src/identifiers.md:386
msgid ""
"It is an error to use the [RESERVED_RAW_IDENTIFIER](identifiers.md#grammar-"
"RESERVED_RAW_IDENTIFIER) token."
msgstr ""
"使用 [RESERVED_RAW_IDENTIFIER](identifiers.md#grammar-"
"RESERVED_RAW_IDENTIFIER) 词法单元是错误。"

