#: src/comments.md:823
msgid "Non-doc comments"
msgstr "非文档注释"

#: src/comments.md:825
msgid ""
"Comments follow the general C++ style of line (`//`) and block (`/* ... */`) "
"comment forms. Nested block comments are supported."
msgstr ""
"注释遵循常见的 C++ 风格的行注释（`//`）和块注释（`/* ... */`）形式。支持嵌套"
"的块注释。"

#: src/comments.md:831
msgid "Non-doc comments are interpreted as a form of whitespace."
msgstr "非文档注释会被解释为空白的一种形式。"

#: src/comments.md:837
msgid "Doc comments"
msgstr "文档注释"

#: src/comments.md:843
msgid ""
"Line doc comments beginning with exactly _three_ slashes (`///`), and block "
"doc comments (`/** ... */`), both outer doc comments, are interpreted as a "
"special syntax for [`doc` attributes](../rustdoc/the-doc-attribute.html)."
msgstr ""
"以恰好 _三个_ 斜杠（`///`）开头的行文档注释，以及块文档注释（`/** ... */`）都"
"是外部文档注释，会被解释为 [`doc` 属性](../rustdoc/the-doc-attribute.html)的"
"特殊语法。"

#: src/comments.md:849
msgid ""
"That is, they are equivalent to writing `#[doc=\"...\"]` around the body of "
"the comment, i.e., `/// Foo` turns into `#[doc=\" Foo\"]` and `/** Bar */` "
"turns into `#[doc=\" Bar \"]`. They must therefore appear before something "
"that accepts an outer attribute."
msgstr ""
"也就是说，它们等价于围绕注释正文书写 `#[doc=\"...\"]`，即 `/// Foo` 会变成 "
"`#[doc=\" Foo\"]`，而 `/** Bar */` 会变成 `#[doc=\" Bar \"]`。因此，它们必须"
"出现在接受外部属性的对象之前。"

#: src/comments.md:855
msgid ""
"Line comments beginning with `//!` and block comments `/*! ... */` are doc "
"comments that apply to the parent of the comment, rather than the item that "
"follows."
msgstr ""
"以 `//!` 开头的行注释和块注释 `/*! ... */` 是文档注释，它们应用于该注释的父"
"级，而不是后面的项。"

#: src/comments.md:861
msgid ""
"That is, they are equivalent to writing `#![doc=\"...\"]` around the body of "
"the comment. `//!` comments are usually used to document modules that occupy "
"a source file."
msgstr ""
"也就是说，它们等价于围绕注释正文书写 `#![doc=\"...\"]`。`//!` 注释通常用于为"
"占据一个源文件的模块编写文档。"

#: src/comments.md:867
msgid "The character `U+000D` (CR) is not allowed in doc comments."
msgstr "文档注释中不允许出现字符 `U+000D` (CR)。"

#: src/comments.md:873
msgid ""
"It is conventional for doc comments to contain Markdown, as expected by "
"`rustdoc`. However, the comment syntax does not respect any internal "
"Markdown. ``/** `glob = \"*/*.rs\";` */`` terminates the comment at the "
"first `*/`, and the remaining code would cause a syntax error. This slightly "
"limits the content of block doc comments compared to line doc comments."
msgstr ""
"按照 `rustdoc` 的预期，文档注释通常包含 Markdown。然而，注释语法并不识别任何"
"内部 Markdown。``/** `glob = \"*/*.rs\";` */`` 会在第一个 `*/` 处终止注释，剩"
"余代码则会导致语法错误。与行文档注释相比，这会稍微限制块文档注释的内容。"

#: src/comments.md:882
msgid ""
"The sequence `U+000D` (CR) immediately followed by `U+000A` (LF) would have "
"been previously transformed into a single `U+000A` (LF)."
msgstr ""
"紧跟在 `U+000D` (CR) 之后的 `U+000A` (LF) 序列此前会已被转换为单个 `U+000A` "
"(LF)。"

#: src/comments.md:890
msgid ""
"//! A doc comment that applies to the implicit anonymous module of this "
"crate\n"
msgstr ""
"//! A doc comment that applies to the implicit anonymous module of this "
"crate\n"

#: src/comments.md:894
msgid ""
"//!  - Inner line doc\n"
"    //!! - Still an inner line doc (but with a bang at the beginning)\n"
msgstr ""
"//!  - Inner line doc\n"
"    //!! - Still an inner line doc (but with a bang at the beginning)\n"

#: src/comments.md:897
msgid "/*!  - Inner block doc */"
msgstr "/*!  - Inner block doc */"

#: src/comments.md:898
msgid "/*!! - Still an inner block doc (but with a bang at the beginning) */"
msgstr "/*!! - Still an inner block doc (but with a bang at the beginning) */"

#: src/comments.md:900
msgid ""
"//   - Only a comment\n"
"    ///  - Outer line doc (exactly 3 slashes)\n"
"    //// - Only a comment\n"
msgstr ""
"//   - Only a comment\n"
"    ///  - Outer line doc (exactly 3 slashes)\n"
"    //// - Only a comment\n"

#: src/comments.md:904
msgid "/*   - Only a comment */"
msgstr "/*   - Only a comment */"

#: src/comments.md:905
msgid "/**  - Outer block doc (exactly) 2 asterisks */"
msgstr "/**  - Outer block doc (exactly) 2 asterisks */"

#: src/comments.md:906
