#: src/tokens.md:3986
msgid "A _floating-point literal_ has one of two forms:"
msgstr "_浮点字面量_有两种形式之一："

#: src/tokens.md:3988
msgid ""
"A _decimal literal_ followed by a period character `U+002E` (`.`). This is "
"optionally followed by another decimal literal, with an optional _exponent_."
msgstr ""
"_十进制字面量_后跟一个句点字符 `U+002E`（`.`）。其后可以可选地跟随另一个十进"
"制字面量，并带有可选的_指数_。"

#: src/tokens.md:3989
msgid "A single _decimal literal_ followed by an _exponent_."
msgstr "单个_十进制字面量_后跟一个_指数_。"

#: src/tokens.md:3995
msgid ""
"Like integer literals, a floating-point literal may be followed by a suffix, "
"so long as the pre-suffix part does not end with `U+002E` (`.`). The suffix "
"may not begin with `e` or `E` if the literal does not include an exponent. "
"See [Floating-point literal expressions](expressions/literal-"
"expr.md#floating-point-literal-expressions) for the effect of these suffixes."
msgstr ""
"与整数字面量一样，浮点字面量可以跟随后缀，只要后缀前的部分不以 `U+002E`"
"（`.`）结尾。如果字面量不包含指数，则后缀不得以 `e` 或 `E` 开头。关于这些后缀"
"的效果，见[浮点字面量表达式](expressions/literal-expr.md#floating-point-"
"literal-expressions)。"

#: src/tokens.md:3997
msgid ""
"Examples of floating-point literals which are accepted as literal "
"expressions:"
msgstr "作为字面量表达式被接受的浮点字面量示例："

#: src/tokens.md:4007
msgid ""
"This last example is different because it is not possible to use the suffix "
"syntax with a floating point literal ending in a period. `2.f64` would "
"attempt to call a method named `f64` on `2`."
msgstr ""
"最后一个示例不同，因为不能对以句点结尾的浮点字面量使用后缀语法。`2.f64` 会尝"
"试在 `2` 上调用名为 `f64` 的方法。"

#: src/tokens.md:4009
msgid ""
"Note that `-1.0`, for example, is analyzed as two tokens: `-` followed by "
"`1.0`."
msgstr "注意，例如 `-1.0` 会被分析为两个 token：`-` 后跟 `1.0`。"

