#: src/tokens.md:4321
msgid ""
"Lifetime parameters and [loop labels](expressions/loop-expr.md#loop-labels) "
"use LIFETIME_OR_LABEL tokens. Any LIFETIME_TOKEN will be accepted by the "
"lexer, and for example, can be used in macros."
