"When used as an item or a statement, the [MacroInvocationSemi]"
"(macros.md#grammar-MacroInvocationSemi) form is used where a semicolon is "
"required at the end when not using curly braces. [Visibility qualifiers]"
"(visibility-and-privacy.md) are never allowed before a macro invocation or "
"[`macro_rules`](macros-by-example.md) definition."
msgstr ""
"用作项或语句时，如果没有使用花括号且末尾需要分号，则使用 "
"[MacroInvocationSemi](macros.md#grammar-MacroInvocationSemi) 形式。[可见性限"
"定符](visibility-and-privacy.md)绝不允许出现在宏调用或 [`macro_rules`]"
"(macros-by-example.md) 定义之前。"

