#: src/macros-by-example.md:769
msgid ""
"`macro_rules` allows users to define syntax extension in a declarative way.  "
"We call such extensions \"macros by example\" or simply \"macros\"."
msgstr ""
"`macro_rules` 允许用户以声明式方式定义语法扩展。我们称这类扩展为“示例宏”或简"
"称“宏”。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:771
msgid ""
"Each macro by example has a name, and one or more _rules_. Each rule has two "
"parts: a _matcher_, describing the syntax that it matches, and a "
"_transcriber_, describing the syntax that will replace a successfully "
"matched invocation. Both the matcher and the transcriber must be surrounded "
"by delimiters. Macros can expand to expressions, statements, items "
"(including traits, impls, and foreign items), types, or patterns."
msgstr ""
"每个示例宏都有一个名称，以及一条或多条<em>规则</em>。每条规则有两部分：<em>匹"
"配器</em>，描述它所匹配的语法；以及<em>转录器</em>，描述将替换成功匹配的调用"
"的语法。匹配器和转录器都必须由定界符包围。宏可以展开为表达式、语句、项（包括 "
"trait、impl 和外部项）、类型或模式。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:777
msgid "Transcribing"
msgstr "转录"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:783
msgid ""
"When a macro is invoked, the macro expander looks up macro invocations by "
"name, and tries each macro rule in turn. It transcribes the first successful "
"match; if this results in an error, then future matches are not tried."
msgstr ""
"调用宏时，宏展开器会按名称查找宏调用，并依次尝试每条宏规则。它会转录第一个成"
"功匹配的规则；如果这导致错误，则不会再尝试后续匹配。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:789
msgid ""
"When matching, no lookahead is performed; if the compiler cannot "
"unambiguously determine how to parse the macro invocation one token at a "
"time, then it is an error. In the following example, the compiler does not "
"look ahead past the identifier to see if the following token is a `)`, even "
"though that would allow it to parse the invocation unambiguously:"
msgstr ""
"匹配时不会进行向前看；如果编译器无法一次一个 token 地无歧义确定如何解析宏调"
"用，那么这就是错误。在下面的示例中，编译器不会越过标识符向前查看下一个 token "
"是否为 `)`，即使那样能让它无歧义地解析该调用："

#: src/macros-by-example.md:796
msgid "// Error: local ambiguity\n"
msgstr "// Error: local ambiguity\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:803
msgid ""
"In both the matcher and the transcriber, the `$` token is used to invoke "
"special behaviours from the macro engine (described below in [Metavariables]"
"(#metavariables) and [Repetitions](#repetitions)). Tokens that aren't part "
"of such an invocation are matched and transcribed literally, with one "
"exception. The exception is that the outer delimiters for the matcher will "
"match any pair of delimiters. Thus, for instance, the matcher `(())` will "
"match `{()}` but not `{{}}`. The character `$` cannot be matched or "
"transcribed literally."
msgstr ""
"在匹配器和转录器中，`$` token 用于调用宏引擎的特殊行为（下文的[元变量]"
"(#metavariables)和[重复](#repetitions)中会描述）。不属于这类调用的 token 会按"
"字面方式匹配和转录，但有一个例外。例外是，匹配器的外层定界符会匹配任意一对定"
"界符。因此，例如匹配器 `(())` 会匹配 `{()}`，但不会匹配 `{{}}`。字符 `$` 不能"
"按字面方式匹配或转录。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:809
msgid "Forwarding a matched fragment"
msgstr "转发已匹配的片段"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:811
msgid ""
"When forwarding a matched fragment to another macro-by-example, matchers in "
"the second macro will see an opaque AST of the fragment type. The second "
"macro can't use literal tokens to match the fragments in the matcher, only a "
"fragment specifier of the same type. The `ident`, `lifetime`, and `tt` "
"fragment types are an exception, and _can_ be matched by literal tokens. The "
"following illustrates this restriction:"
msgstr ""
"将已匹配的片段转发给另一个示例宏时，第二个宏中的匹配器会看到该片段类型的不透"
"明 AST。第二个宏不能用字面 token 来匹配匹配器中的这些片段，只能使用相同类型的"
"片段说明符。`ident`、`lifetime` 和 `tt` 片段类型是例外，<em>可以</em>由字面 "
"token 匹配。下面展示了这一限制："

#: src/macros-by-example.md:815
msgid "// ERROR:               ^^ no rules expected this token in macro call\n"
msgstr ""
"// ERROR:               ^^ no rules expected this token in macro call\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:826
msgid ""
"The following illustrates how tokens can be directly matched after matching "
"a `tt` fragment:"
msgstr "下面展示了在匹配 `tt` 片段之后，token 如何可以被直接匹配："

#: src/macros-by-example.md:829
msgid "// compiles OK\n"
msgstr "// compiles OK\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:845
msgid "Metavariables"
msgstr "元变量"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:851
msgid ""
"In the matcher, `$` _name_ `:` _fragment-specifier_ matches a Rust syntax "
"fragment of the kind specified and binds it to the metavariable `$`_name_."
msgstr ""
"在匹配器中，`$`<em>name</em>`:`<em>fragment-specifier</em> 会匹配指定种类的 "
"Rust 语法片段，并将其绑定到元变量 `$`<em>name</em>。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:857
msgid "Valid fragment specifiers are:"
msgstr "有效的片段说明符包括："

#: src/macros-by-example.md:859
msgid ""
"`block`: a [BlockExpressionNoInnerAttributes](expressions/block-"
"expr.md#grammar-BlockExpressionNoInnerAttributes)"
msgstr ""
"`block`：一个 [BlockExpressionNoInnerAttributes](expressions/block-"
"expr.md#grammar-BlockExpressionNoInnerAttributes)"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:860
msgid "`expr`: an [Expression](expressions.md#grammar-Expression)"
msgstr "`expr`：一个 [Expression](expressions.md#grammar-Expression)"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:861
msgid ""
"`expr_2021`: an [Expression](expressions.md#grammar-Expression) except "
"[UnderscoreExpression](expressions/underscore-expr.md#grammar-"
"UnderscoreExpression) and [ConstBlockExpression](expressions/block-"
"expr.md#grammar-ConstBlockExpression) (see [macro.decl.meta.edition2024]"
"(macros-by-example.md#r-macro.decl.meta.edition2024))"
msgstr ""
"`expr_2021`：一个 [Expression](expressions.md#grammar-Expression)，但不包括 "
"[UnderscoreExpression](expressions/underscore-expr.md#grammar-"
"UnderscoreExpression) 和 [ConstBlockExpression](expressions/block-"
"expr.md#grammar-ConstBlockExpression)（见 [macro.decl.meta.edition2024]"
"(macros-by-example.md#r-macro.decl.meta.edition2024)）"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:862
msgid ""
"`ident`: an [IDENTIFIER_OR_KEYWORD](identifiers.md#grammar-"
"IDENTIFIER_OR_KEYWORD) except `_`, [RAW_IDENTIFIER](identifiers.md#grammar-"
"RAW_IDENTIFIER), or [`$crate`](macros-by-example.md#r-"
"macro.decl.hygiene.crate)"
msgstr ""
"`ident`：一个 [IDENTIFIER_OR_KEYWORD](identifiers.md#grammar-"
"IDENTIFIER_OR_KEYWORD)，但不包括 `_`、[RAW_IDENTIFIER]"
"(identifiers.md#grammar-RAW_IDENTIFIER) 或 [`$crate`](macros-by-example.md#r-"
"macro.decl.hygiene.crate)"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:863
msgid "`item`: an [Item](items.md#grammar-Item)"
msgstr "`item`：一个 [Item](items.md#grammar-Item)"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:864
msgid "`lifetime`: a [LIFETIME_TOKEN](tokens.md#grammar-LIFETIME_TOKEN)"
msgstr "`lifetime`：一个 [LIFETIME_TOKEN](tokens.md#grammar-LIFETIME_TOKEN)"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:865
msgid ""
"`literal`: matches `-`<sup>?</sup>[LiteralExpression](expressions/literal-"
"expr.md#grammar-LiteralExpression)"
msgstr ""
"`literal`：匹配 `-`<sup>?</sup>[LiteralExpression](expressions/literal-"
"expr.md#grammar-LiteralExpression)"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:866
msgid ""
"`meta`: an [Attr](attributes.md#grammar-Attr), the contents of an attribute"
msgstr "`meta`：一个 [Attr](attributes.md#grammar-Attr)，即属性的内容"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:867
msgid ""
"`pat`: a [Pattern](patterns.md#grammar-Pattern) (see "
"[macro.decl.meta.edition2021](macros-by-example.md#r-"
"macro.decl.meta.edition2021))"
msgstr ""
"`pat`：一个 [Pattern](patterns.md#grammar-Pattern)（见 "
"[macro.decl.meta.edition2021](macros-by-example.md#r-"
"macro.decl.meta.edition2021)）"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:868
msgid "`pat_param`: a [PatternNoTopAlt](patterns.md#grammar-PatternNoTopAlt)"
msgstr ""
"`pat_param`：一个 [PatternNoTopAlt](patterns.md#grammar-PatternNoTopAlt)"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:869
msgid "`path`: a [TypePath](paths.md#grammar-TypePath)"
msgstr "`path`：一个 [TypePath](paths.md#grammar-TypePath)"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:870
msgid ""
"`stmt`: a [Statement](statements.md#grammar-Statement) without the trailing "
"semicolon (except for item statements that require semicolons)"
msgstr ""
"`stmt`：一个不带尾随分号的 [Statement](statements.md#grammar-Statement)（需要"
"分号的项语句除外）"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:871
msgid ""
"`tt`: a [TokenTree](macros.md#grammar-TokenTree) (a single [token]"
"(tokens.md) or tokens in matching delimiters `()`, `[]`, or `{}`)"
msgstr ""
"`tt`：一个 [TokenTree](macros.md#grammar-TokenTree)（单个 [token]"
"(tokens.md)，或匹配定界符 `()`、`[]` 或 `{}` 中的 token）"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:872
msgid "`ty`: a [Type](types.md#grammar-Type)"
msgstr "`ty`：一个 [Type](types.md#grammar-Type)"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:873
msgid ""
"`vis`: a possibly empty [Visibility](visibility-and-privacy.md#grammar-"
"Visibility) qualifier"
msgstr ""
"`vis`：一个可能为空的 [Visibility](visibility-and-privacy.md#grammar-"
"Visibility) 限定符"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:879
msgid ""
"In the transcriber, metavariables are referred to simply by `$`_name_, since "
"the fragment kind is specified in the matcher. Metavariables are replaced "
"with the syntax element that matched them. Metavariables can be transcribed "
"more than once or not at all."
msgstr ""
"在转录器中，元变量只需用 `$`<em>name</em> 引用，因为片段种类已在匹配器中指"
"定。元变量会被替换为与之匹配的语法元素。元变量可以被转录多次，也可以完全不被"
"转录。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:885
msgid ""
"The keyword metavariable [`$crate`](macros-by-example.md#r-"
"macro.decl.hygiene.crate) can be used to refer to the current crate."
msgstr ""
"关键字元变量 [`$crate`](macros-by-example.md#r-macro.decl.hygiene.crate) 可用"
"于指代当前 crate。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:895
msgid ""
"Starting with the 2021 edition, `pat` fragment-specifiers match top-level or-"
"patterns (that is, they accept [Pattern](patterns.md#grammar-Pattern))."
msgstr ""
"从 2021 edition 开始，`pat` 片段说明符会匹配顶层 or-pattern（也就是说，它们接"
"受 [Pattern](patterns.md#grammar-Pattern)）。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:897
msgid ""
"Before the 2021 edition, they match exactly the same fragments as "
"`pat_param` (that is, they accept [PatternNoTopAlt](patterns.md#grammar-"
"PatternNoTopAlt))."
msgstr ""
"在 2021 edition 之前，它们匹配的片段与 `pat_param` 完全相同（也就是说，它们接"
"受 [PatternNoTopAlt](patterns.md#grammar-PatternNoTopAlt)）。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:899
msgid ""
"The relevant edition is the one in effect for the `macro_rules!` definition."
msgstr "相关 edition 是 `macro_rules!` 定义所处的 edition。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:912
msgid ""
"Before the 2024 edition, `expr` fragment specifiers do not match "
"[UnderscoreExpression](expressions/underscore-expr.md#grammar-"
"UnderscoreExpression) or [ConstBlockExpression](expressions/block-"
"expr.md#grammar-ConstBlockExpression) at the top level. They are allowed "
"within subexpressions."
msgstr ""
"在 2024 edition 之前，`expr` 片段说明符在顶层不匹配 [UnderscoreExpression]"
"(expressions/underscore-expr.md#grammar-UnderscoreExpression) 或 "
"[ConstBlockExpression](expressions/block-expr.md#grammar-"
"ConstBlockExpression)。它们允许出现在子表达式内部。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:914
msgid ""
"The `expr_2021` fragment specifier exists to maintain backwards "
"compatibility with editions before 2024."
msgstr ""
"`expr_2021` 片段说明符的存在是为了维持与 2024 之前 edition 的向后兼容性。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:923
msgid "Repetitions"
msgstr "重复"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:929
msgid ""
"In both the matcher and transcriber, repetitions are indicated by placing "
"the tokens to be repeated inside `$(`…`)`, followed by a repetition "
"operator, optionally with a separator token between."
msgstr ""
"在匹配器和转录器中，重复通过将要重复的 token 放在 `$(`…`)` 内并跟随一个重复运"
"算符来表示，中间还可以选择性地带有一个分隔符 token。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:935
msgid ""
"The separator token can be any token other than a delimiter or one of the "
"repetition operators, but `;` and `,` are the most common. For instance, `$"
"( $i:ident ),*` represents any number of identifiers separated by commas. "
"Nested repetitions are permitted."
msgstr ""
"分隔符 token 可以是除定界符或重复运算符之外的任何 token，但 `;` 和 `,` 最常"
"见。例如，`$( $i:ident ),*` 表示任意数量的标识符，以逗号分隔。允许嵌套重复。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:941
msgid "The repetition operators are:"
msgstr "重复运算符包括："

#: src/macros-by-example.md:943
msgid "`*` --- indicates any number of repetitions."
msgstr "`*` —— 表示任意次数的重复。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:944
msgid "`+` --- indicates any number but at least one."
msgstr "`+` —— 表示任意次数，但至少一次。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:945
msgid "`?` --- indicates an optional fragment with zero or one occurrence."
msgstr "`?` —— 表示出现零次或一次的可选片段。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:951
msgid ""
"Since `?` represents at most one occurrence, it cannot be used with a "
"separator."
msgstr "由于 `?` 表示至多出现一次，所以它不能与分隔符一起使用。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:957
msgid ""
"The repeated fragment both matches and transcribes to the specified number "
"of the fragment, separated by the separator token. Metavariables are matched "
"to every repetition of their corresponding fragment. For instance, the `$"
"( $i:ident ),*` example above matches `$i` to all of the identifiers in the "
"list."
msgstr ""
"重复片段会匹配并转录为指定数量的片段，这些片段由分隔符 token 分隔。元变量会匹"
"配其对应片段的每一次重复。例如，上面的 `$( $i:ident ),*` 例子会将 `$i` 匹配到"
"列表中的所有标识符。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:959
msgid ""
"During transcription, additional restrictions apply to repetitions so that "
"the compiler knows how to expand them properly:"
msgstr "转录期间，对重复还会施加额外限制，以便编译器知道如何正确展开它们："

#: src/macros-by-example.md:961
msgid ""
"A metavariable must appear in exactly the same number, kind, and nesting "
"order of repetitions in the transcriber as it did in the matcher. So for the "
"matcher `$( $i:ident ),*`, the transcribers `=> { $i }`, `=> { $( $"
"( $i )* )* }`, and `=> { $( $i )+ }` are all illegal, but `=> { $( $i );* }` "
"is correct and replaces a comma-separated list of identifiers with a "
"semicolon-separated list."
msgstr ""
"元变量在转录器中出现时，必须与它在匹配器中一样，处于完全相同数量、种类和嵌套"
"顺序的重复中。因此，对于匹配器 `$( $i:ident ),*`，转录器 `=> { $i }`、`=> { $"
"( $( $i )* )* }` 和 `=> { $( $i )+ }` 都是非法的，但 `=> { $( $i );* }` 是正"
"确的，它会把逗号分隔的标识符列表替换为分号分隔的列表。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:962
msgid ""
"Each repetition in the transcriber must contain at least one metavariable to "
"decide how many times to expand it. If multiple metavariables appear in the "
"same repetition, they must be bound to the same number of fragments. For "
"instance, `( $( $i:ident ),* ; $( $j:ident ),* ) => (( $( ($i,$j) ),* ))` "
"must bind the same number of `$i` fragments as `$j` fragments. This means "
"that invoking the macro with `(a, b, c; d, e, f)` is legal and expands to "
"`((a,d), (b,e), (c,f))`, but `(a, b, c; d, e)` is illegal because it does "
"not have the same number. This requirement applies to every layer of nested "
"repetitions."
msgstr ""
"转录器中的每个重复都必须包含至少一个元变量，以决定它应展开多少次。如果同一个"
"重复中出现多个元变量，它们必须绑定到相同数量的片段。例如，`( $"
"( $i:ident ),* ; $( $j:ident ),* ) => (( $( ($i,$j) ),* ))` 必须将 `$i` 片段"
"和 `$j` 片段绑定到相同数量。这意味着用 `(a, b, c; d, e, f)` 调用该宏是合法"
"的，并会展开为 `((a,d), (b,e), (c,f))`，但 `(a, b, c; d, e)` 是非法的，因为它"
"们的数量不相同。此要求适用于嵌套重复的每一层。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:968
msgid "Scoping, exporting, and importing"
msgstr "作用域、导出和导入"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:974
msgid ""
"For historical reasons, the scoping of macros by example does not work "
"entirely like items. Macros have two forms of scope: textual scope, and path-"
"based scope. Textual scope is based on the order that things appear in "
"source files, or even across multiple files, and is the default scoping. It "
"is explained further below. Path-based scope works exactly the same way that "
"item scoping does. The scoping, exporting, and importing of macros is "
"controlled largely by attributes."
msgstr ""
"由于历史原因，示例宏的作用域并不完全像项那样工作。宏有两种形式的作用域：文本"
"作用域和基于路径的作用域。文本作用域基于事物在源文件中出现的顺序，甚至可以跨"
"多个文件，并且是默认作用域。下文会进一步说明它。基于路径的作用域与项作用域的"
"工作方式完全相同。宏的作用域、导出和导入很大程度上由属性控制。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:980
msgid ""
"When a macro is invoked by an unqualified identifier (not part of a multi-"
"part path), it is first looked up in textual scoping. If this does not yield "
"any results, then it is looked up in path-based scoping. If the macro's name "
"is qualified with a path, then it is only looked up in path-based scoping."
msgstr ""
"当通过非限定标识符（不是多段路径的一部分）调用宏时，会首先在文本作用域中查"
"找。如果这没有产生任何结果，则会在基于路径的作用域中查找。如果宏的名称带有路"
"径限定，则只会在基于路径的作用域中查找。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:984
msgid "// Path-based import.\n"
msgstr "// Path-based import.\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:986
msgid "// Textual definition.\n"
msgstr "// Textual definition.\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:990
msgid "// Textual lookup finds our macro first.\n"
msgstr "// Textual lookup finds our macro first.\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:991
msgid "// Path-based lookup ignores our macro, finds imported one.\n"
msgstr "// Path-based lookup ignores our macro, finds imported one.\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:998
msgid "Textual scope"
msgstr "文本作用域"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1004
msgid ""
"Textual scope is based largely on the order that things appear in source "
"files, and works similarly to the scope of local variables declared with "
"`let` except it also applies at the module level. When `macro_rules!` is "
"used to define a macro, the macro enters the scope after the definition "
"(note that it can still be used recursively, since names are looked up from "
"the invocation site), up until its surrounding scope, typically a module, is "
"closed. This can enter child modules and even span across multiple files:"
msgstr ""
"文本作用域很大程度上基于事物在源文件中出现的顺序，其工作方式类似于用 `let` 声"
"明的局部变量的作用域，只不过它也适用于模块级别。当使用 `macro_rules!` 定义宏"
"时，该宏会在定义之后进入作用域（注意，它仍然可以递归使用，因为名称是从调用位"
"置查找的），直到其外围作用域（通常是一个模块）闭合为止。这可以进入子模块，甚"
"至跨越多个文件："

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1008
msgid "//// src/lib.rs\n"
msgstr "//// src/lib.rs\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1010 src/macros-by-example.md:1019
msgid "// m!{} // Error: m is not in scope.\n"
msgstr "// m!{} // Error: m is not in scope.\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1015
msgid "// OK: appears after declaration of m.\n"
msgstr "// OK: appears after declaration of m.\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1021
msgid "//// src/has_macro/uses_macro.rs\n"
msgstr "//// src/has_macro/uses_macro.rs\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1024
msgid "// OK: appears after declaration of m in src/lib.rs\n"
msgstr "// OK: appears after declaration of m in src/lib.rs\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1031
msgid ""
"It is not an error to define a macro multiple times; the most recent "
"declaration will shadow the previous one unless it has gone out of scope."
msgstr ""
"多次定义同一个宏并不是错误；除非最近的声明已经离开作用域，否则它会遮蔽之前的"
"声明。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1046
msgid "// m!(1); // Error: no rule matches '1'\n"
msgstr "// m!(1); // Error: no rule matches '1'\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1058
msgid ""
"Macros can be declared and used locally inside functions as well, and work "
"similarly:"
msgstr "宏也可以在函数内部局部声明和使用，其工作方式类似："

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1062 src/macros-by-example.md:1068
msgid "// m!(); // Error: m is not in scope.\n"
msgstr "// m!(); // Error: m is not in scope.\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1076
msgid ""
"Textual scope name bindings for macros shadow path-based scope bindings to "
"macros."
msgstr "宏的文本作用域名称绑定会遮蔽宏的基于路径的作用域绑定。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1081
msgid "\"m2\""
msgstr "\"m2\""

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1084
msgid "// Resolves to path-based candidate from use declaration below.\n"
msgstr "// Resolves to path-based candidate from use declaration below.\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1086
msgid "// prints \"m2\\n\"\n"
msgstr "// prints \"m2\\n\"\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1087
msgid ""
"// Introduce second candidate for `m` with textual scope.\n"
"//\n"
"// This shadows path-based candidate from below for the rest of this\n"
"// example.\n"
msgstr ""
"// Introduce second candidate for `m` with textual scope.\n"
"//\n"
"// This shadows path-based candidate from below for the rest of this\n"
"// example.\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1094
msgid "\"m\""
msgstr "\"m\""

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1097
msgid ""
"// Introduce `m2` macro as path-based candidate.\n"
"//\n"
"// This item is in scope for this entire example, not just below the\n"
"// use declaration.\n"
msgstr ""
"// Introduce `m2` macro as path-based candidate.\n"
"//\n"
"// This item is in scope for this entire example, not just below the\n"
"// use declaration.\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1103
msgid ""
"// Resolves to the textual macro candidate from above the use\n"
"// declaration.\n"
msgstr ""
"// Resolves to the textual macro candidate from above the use\n"
"// declaration.\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1106
msgid "// prints \"m\\n\"\n"
msgstr "// prints \"m\\n\"\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1113
msgid ""
"For areas where shadowing is not allowed, see [name resolution ambiguities]"
"(names/name-resolution.md#r-names.resolution.expansion.imports.ambiguity)."
msgstr ""
"对于不允许遮蔽的区域，见[名称解析歧义](names/name-resolution.md#r-"
"names.resolution.expansion.imports.ambiguity)。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1128
msgid ""
"By default, a macro has no path-based scope. Macros can gain path-based "
"scope in two ways:"
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，宏没有基于路径的作用域。宏可以通过两种方式获得基于路径的作用域："

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1130
msgid "[Use declaration re-export](items/use-declarations.md#use-visibility)"
msgstr "[use 声明重导出](items/use-declarations.md#use-visibility)"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1131
msgid "[`macro_export`](#the-macro_export-attribute)"
msgstr "[`macro_export`](#the-macro_export-attribute)"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1137
msgid ""
"Macros can be re-exported to give them path-based scope from a module other "
"than the crate root."
msgstr "宏可以被重导出，从而让它们从 crate 根以外的模块获得基于路径的作用域。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1140
msgid "// OK: Path-based lookup finds `m` in the mac module.\n"
msgstr "// OK: Path-based lookup finds `m` in the mac module.\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1143
