msgstr "// Introduce macro `m` with textual scope.\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1148
msgid "// Reexport with path-based scope from within `m`'s textual scope.\n"
msgstr "// Reexport with path-based scope from within `m`'s textual scope.\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1157
msgid ""
"Macros have an implicit visibility of `pub(crate)`. `#[macro_export]` "
"changes the implicit visibility to `pub`."
msgstr ""
"宏具有隐式的 `pub(crate)` 可见性。`#[macro_export]` 会将隐式可见性改为 "
"`pub`。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1160 src/macros-by-example.md:1176
msgid "// Implicit visibility is `pub(crate)`.\n"
msgstr "// Implicit visibility is `pub(crate)`.\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1164 src/macros-by-example.md:1181
msgid "// Implicit visibility is `pub`.\n"
msgstr "// Implicit visibility is `pub`.\n"

