#: src/macros-by-example.md:1199
msgid "The `macro_use` attribute"
msgstr "`macro_use` 属性"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1205
msgid ""
"The _`macro_use` [attribute](attributes.md#r-attributes)_ has two purposes: "
"it may be used on modules to extend the scope of macros defined within them, "
"and it may be used on [`extern crate`](items/extern-crates.md#r-items.extern-"
"crate) to import macros from another crate into the [`macro_use` prelude]"
"(names/preludes.md#macro_use-prelude)."
msgstr ""
"<em>`macro_use` [属性](attributes.md#r-attributes)</em>有两个用途：它可以用在"
"模块上，以扩展其中定义的宏的作用域；也可以用在 [`extern crate`](items/extern-"
"crates.md#r-items.extern-crate) 上，以将另一个 crate 中的宏导入 [`macro_use` "
"prelude](names/preludes.md#macro_use-prelude)。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1233
msgid ""
"When used on modules, the `macro_use` attribute uses the [MetaWord]"
"(attributes.md#grammar-MetaWord) syntax."
msgstr ""
"用在模块上时，`macro_use` 属性使用 [MetaWord](attributes.md#grammar-"
"MetaWord) 语法。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1235
msgid ""
"When used on `extern crate`, it uses the [MetaWord](attributes.md#grammar-"
"MetaWord) and [MetaListIdents](attributes.md#grammar-MetaListIdents) "
"syntaxes. For more on how these syntaxes may be used, see "
"[macro.decl.scope.macro_use.prelude](macros-by-example.md#r-"
"macro.decl.scope.macro_use.prelude)."
msgstr ""
"用在 `extern crate` 上时，它使用 [MetaWord](attributes.md#grammar-MetaWord) "
"和 [MetaListIdents](attributes.md#grammar-MetaListIdents) 语法。关于这些语法"
"可如何使用的更多信息，见 [macro.decl.scope.macro_use.prelude](macros-by-"
"example.md#r-macro.decl.scope.macro_use.prelude)。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1241
msgid "The `macro_use` attribute may be applied to modules or `extern crate`."
msgstr "`macro_use` 属性可以应用于模块或 `extern crate`。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1247 src/macros-by-example.md:1397
#: src/items/extern-crates.md:288 src/items/external-blocks.md:934
#: src/attributes/testing.md:206 src/attributes/testing.md:318
#: src/attributes/derive.md:154 src/attributes/diagnostics.md:491
#: src/attributes/codegen.md:159 src/attributes/codegen.md:286
#: src/attributes/codegen.md:1301 src/attributes/limits.md:129
#: src/names/preludes.md:324
msgid ""
"`rustc` ignores use in other positions but lints against it. This may become "
"an error in the future."
msgstr ""
"`rustc` 会忽略在其他位置的使用，但会对此发出 lint。将来这可能会变成错误。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1256
msgid ""
"The `macro_use` attribute may not be used on [`extern crate self`](items/"
"extern-crates.md#r-items.extern-crate.self)."
msgstr ""
"`macro_use` 属性不能用于 [`extern crate self`](items/extern-crates.md#r-"
"items.extern-crate.self)。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1262
msgid "The `macro_use` attribute may be used any number of times on a form."
msgstr "`macro_use` 属性可以在一个形式上使用任意多次。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1264
msgid ""
"Multiple instances of `macro_use` in the [MetaListIdents]"
"(attributes.md#grammar-MetaListIdents) syntax may be specified. The union of "
"all specified macros will be imported."
msgstr ""
"可以指定多个使用 [MetaListIdents](attributes.md#grammar-MetaListIdents) 语法"
"的 `macro_use` 实例。所有指定宏的并集将被导入。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1270
msgid ""
"On modules, `rustc` lints against any [MetaWord](attributes.md#grammar-"
"MetaWord) `macro_use` attributes following the first."
msgstr ""
"在模块上，`rustc` 会对第一个之后的任何 [MetaWord](attributes.md#grammar-"
"MetaWord) `macro_use` 属性发出 lint。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1272
msgid ""
"On `extern crate`, `rustc` lints against any `macro_use` attributes that "
"have no effect due to not importing any macros not already imported by "
"another `macro_use` attribute. If two or more [MetaListIdents]"
"(attributes.md#grammar-MetaListIdents) `macro_use` attributes import the "
"same macro, the first is linted against. If any [MetaWord]"
"(attributes.md#grammar-MetaWord) `macro_use` attributes are present, all "
"[MetaListIdents](attributes.md#grammar-MetaListIdents) `macro_use` "
"attributes are linted against. If two or more [MetaWord]"
"(attributes.md#grammar-MetaWord) `macro_use` attributes are present, the "
"ones following the first are linted against."
msgstr ""
"在 `extern crate` 上，`rustc` 会对任何无效果的 `macro_use` 属性发出 lint；这"
"些属性之所以无效果，是因为它们没有导入任何尚未由另一个 `macro_use` 属性导入的"
"宏。如果两个或更多 [MetaListIdents](attributes.md#grammar-MetaListIdents) "
"`macro_use` 属性导入同一个宏，则会对第一个发出 lint。如果存在任何 [MetaWord]"
"(attributes.md#grammar-MetaWord) `macro_use` 属性，则会对所有 "
"[MetaListIdents](attributes.md#grammar-MetaListIdents) `macro_use` 属性发出 "
"lint。如果存在两个或更多 [MetaWord](attributes.md#grammar-MetaWord) "
"`macro_use` 属性，则会对第一个之后的那些发出 lint。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1281
msgid ""
"When `macro_use` is used on a module, the module's macro scope extends "
"beyond the module's lexical scope."
msgstr ""
"当 `macro_use` 用在模块上时，该模块的宏作用域会延伸到模块的词法作用域之外。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1304
msgid ""
"Specifying `macro_use` on an `extern crate` declaration in the crate root "
"imports exported macros from that crate."
msgstr ""
"在 crate 根中的 `extern crate` 声明上指定 `macro_use`，会从该 crate 导入已导"
"出的宏。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1306
msgid ""
"Macros imported this way are imported into the [`macro_use` prelude](names/"
"preludes.md#macro_use-prelude), not textually, which means that they can be "
"shadowed by any other name. Macros imported by `macro_use` can be used "
"before the import statement."
msgstr ""
"以这种方式导入的宏会导入到 [`macro_use` prelude](names/preludes.md#macro_use-"
"prelude)，而不是按文本方式导入；这意味着它们可以被任何其他名称遮蔽。由 "
"`macro_use` 导入的宏可以在导入语句之前使用。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1312
msgid ""
"`rustc` currently prefers the last macro imported in case of conflict. Don't "
"rely on this. This behavior is unusual, as imports in Rust are generally "
"order-independent. This behavior of `macro_use` may change in the future."
msgstr ""
"发生冲突时，`rustc` 目前偏向最后导入的宏。不要依赖这一点。此行为并不寻常，因"
"为 Rust 中的导入通常与顺序无关。`macro_use` 的此行为将来可能会改变。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1314
msgid ""
"For details, see [Rust issue #148025](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/"
"issues/148025)."
msgstr ""
"详情见 [Rust issue #148025](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/issues/"
"148025)。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1319
msgid ""
"When using the [MetaWord](attributes.md#grammar-MetaWord) syntax, all "
"exported macros are imported. When using the [MetaListIdents]"
"(attributes.md#grammar-MetaListIdents) syntax, only the specified macros are "
"imported."
msgstr ""
"使用 [MetaWord](attributes.md#grammar-MetaWord) 语法时，会导入所有已导出的"
"宏。使用 [MetaListIdents](attributes.md#grammar-MetaListIdents) 语法时，只会"
"导入指定的宏。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1327
msgid "// Or `#[macro_use]` to import all macros.\n"
msgstr "// Or `#[macro_use]` to import all macros.\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1331
msgid ""
"// self::lazy_static!{} // ERROR: lazy_static is not defined in `self`.\n"
msgstr ""
"// self::lazy_static!{} // ERROR: lazy_static is not defined in `self`.\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1341
msgid ""
"Macros to be imported with `macro_use` must be exported with [`macro_export`]"
"(macros-by-example.md#r-macro.decl.scope.macro_export)."
msgstr ""
"要用 `macro_use` 导入的宏必须用 [`macro_export`](macros-by-example.md#r-"
"macro.decl.scope.macro_export) 导出。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1348
msgid "The `macro_export` attribute"
msgstr "`macro_export` 属性"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1354
msgid ""
"The _`macro_export` [attribute](attributes.md#r-attributes)_ exports the "
"macro from the crate and makes it available in the root of the crate for "
"path-based resolution."
msgstr ""
"<em>`macro_export` [属性](attributes.md#r-attributes)</em>会从 crate 中导出"
"宏，并使其可在 crate 根中用于基于路径的解析。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1362
msgid "//  ^^^^ OK: Path-based lookup finds `m` in the current module.\n"
msgstr "//  ^^^^ OK: Path-based lookup finds `m` in the current module.\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1363 src/expressions/block-expr.md:257
#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:270 src/expressions/operator-expr.md:3002
#: src/destructors.md:723 src/destructors.md:725 src/destructors.md:797
#: src/const_eval.md:171
msgid "// As above.\n"
msgstr "// As above.\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1385
msgid ""
"The `macro_export` attribute uses the [MetaWord](attributes.md#grammar-"
"MetaWord) and [MetaListIdents](attributes.md#grammar-MetaListIdents) "
"syntaxes. With the [MetaListIdents](attributes.md#grammar-MetaListIdents) "
"syntax, it accepts a single [`local_inner_macros`](macros-by-example.md#r-"
"macro.decl.scope.macro_export.local_inner_macros) value."
msgstr ""
"`macro_export` 属性使用 [MetaWord](attributes.md#grammar-MetaWord) 和 "
"[MetaListIdents](attributes.md#grammar-MetaListIdents) 语法。使用 "
"[MetaListIdents](attributes.md#grammar-MetaListIdents) 语法时，它接受单个 "
"[`local_inner_macros`](macros-by-example.md#r-"
"macro.decl.scope.macro_export.local_inner_macros) 值。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1391
msgid ""
"The `macro_export` attribute may be applied to `macro_rules` definitions."
msgstr "`macro_export` 属性可以应用于 `macro_rules` 定义。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1406
msgid "Only the first use of `macro_export` on a macro has effect."
msgstr "在一个宏上，只有第一次使用 `macro_export` 会有效果。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1412 src/attributes/derive.md:169
#: src/attributes/codegen.md:382 src/attributes/codegen.md:512
#: src/names/preludes.md:198 src/names/preludes.md:339 src/abi.md:92
msgid "`rustc` lints against any use following the first."
msgstr "`rustc` 会对第一次之后的任何使用发出 lint。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1421
msgid ""
"By default, macros only have [textual scope](macros-by-example.md#r-"
"macro.decl.scope.textual) and cannot be resolved by path. When the "
"`macro_export` attribute is used, the macro is made available in the crate "
"root and can be referred to by its path."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，宏只有[文本作用域](macros-by-example.md#r-"
"macro.decl.scope.textual)，不能通过路径解析。使用 `macro_export` 属性时，宏会"
"在 crate 根中可用，并且可以通过它的路径引用。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1427
msgid ""
"Without `macro_export`, macros only have textual scope, so path-based "
"resolution of the macro fails."
msgstr ""
"没有 `macro_export` 时，宏只有文本作用域，因此该宏的基于路径的解析会失败。"

