#: src/conditional-compilation.md:374
msgid ""
"_Conditionally compiled source code_ is source code that is compiled only "
"under certain conditions."
msgstr "_条件编译的源代码_ 是只在特定条件下才编译的源代码。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:380
msgid ""
"Source code can be made conditionally compiled using the [`cfg`](#the-cfg-"
"attribute) and [`cfg_attr`](#the-cfg_attr-attribute) [attributes]"
"(attributes.md) and the built-in [`cfg!`](#the-cfg-macro) and [`cfg_select!`]"
"(#the-cfg_select-macro) [macros](macros.md)."
msgstr ""
"可以使用 [`cfg`](#the-cfg-attribute) 和 [`cfg_attr`](#the-cfg_attr-"
"attribute) [属性](attributes.md)，以及内置的 [`cfg!`](#the-cfg-macro) 和 "
"[`cfg_select!`](#the-cfg_select-macro) [宏](macros.md)，使源代码进行条件编"
"译。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:386
msgid ""
"Whether to compile can depend on the target architecture of the compiled "
"crate, arbitrary values passed to the compiler, and other things further "
"described below."
msgstr ""
"是否编译可以取决于被编译 crate 的目标架构、传递给编译器的任意值，以及下文进一"
"步描述的其他因素。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:392
msgid ""
"Each form of conditional compilation takes a _configuration predicate_ that "
"evaluates to true or false. The predicate is one of the following:"
msgstr ""
"每种条件编译形式都接受一个求值为 true 或 false 的_配置谓词_。该谓词是以下之"
"一："

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:398
msgid ""
"A configuration option. The predicate is true if the option is set, and "
"false if it is unset."
msgstr "配置选项。如果该选项已设置，则谓词为 true；如果未设置，则为 false。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:404
msgid ""
"`all()` with a comma-separated list of configuration predicates. It is true "
"if all of the given predicates are true, or if the list is empty."
msgstr ""
"`all()` 加上以逗号分隔的配置谓词列表。如果给定的所有谓词均为 true，或者列表为"
"空，则它为 true。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:410
msgid ""
"`any()` with a comma-separated list of configuration predicates. It is true "
"if at least one of the given predicates is true. If there are no predicates, "
"it is false."
msgstr ""
"`any()` 加上以逗号分隔的配置谓词列表。如果给定谓词中至少一个为 true，则它为 "
"true。如果没有谓词，则它为 false。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:416
msgid ""
"`not()` with a configuration predicate. It is true if its predicate is false "
"and false if its predicate is true."
msgstr ""
"`not()` 加上一个配置谓词。如果其谓词为 false，则它为 true；如果其谓词为 "
"true，则它为 false。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:422
msgid ""
"`true` or `false` literals, which are always true or false respectively."
msgstr "`true` 或 `false` 字面量，分别始终为 true 或 false。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:428
msgid ""
"_Configuration options_ are either names or key-value pairs, and are either "
"set or unset."
msgstr "_配置选项_ 要么是名称，要么是键值对，并且要么已设置，要么未设置。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:434
msgid "Names are written as a single identifier, such as `unix`."
msgstr "名称写作单个标识符，例如 `unix`。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:440
msgid ""
"Key-value pairs are written as an identifier, `=`, and then a string, such "
"as `target_arch = \"x86_64\"`."
msgstr ""
"键值对写作一个标识符、`=`，然后是一个字符串，例如 `target_arch = "
"\"x86_64\"`。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:446
msgid ""
"Whitespace around the `=` is ignored, so `foo=\"bar\"` and `foo = \"bar\"` "
"are equivalent."
msgstr "`=` 周围的空白会被忽略，因此 `foo=\"bar\"` 与 `foo = \"bar\"` 等价。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:455
msgid ""
"Keys do not need to be unique. For example, both `feature = \"std\"` and "
"`feature = \"serde\"` can be set at the same time."
msgstr ""
"键不需要唯一。例如，`feature = \"std\"` 和 `feature = \"serde\"` 可以同时被设"
"置。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:461
msgid "Set configuration options"
msgstr "设置配置选项"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:467
msgid ""
"Which configuration options are set is determined statically during the "
"compilation of the crate."
msgstr "哪些配置选项被设置，是在 crate 编译期间静态确定的。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:473
msgid "Some options are _compiler-set_ based on data about the compilation."
msgstr "某些选项会基于编译相关数据而_由编译器设置_。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:479
msgid ""
"Other options are _arbitrarily-set_ based on input passed to the compiler "
"outside of the code."
msgstr "其他选项会基于代码之外传递给编译器的输入而_任意设置_。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:485
msgid ""
"It is not possible to set a configuration option from within the source code "
"of the crate being compiled."
msgstr "无法从正在编译的 crate 的源代码内部设置配置选项。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:491
msgid ""
"For `rustc`, arbitrary-set configuration options are set using the [`--cfg`]"
"(../rustc/command-line-arguments.html#--cfg-configure-the-compilation-"
"environment) flag. Configuration values for a specified target can be "
"displayed with `rustc --print cfg --target $TARGET`."
msgstr ""
"对于 `rustc`，任意设置的配置选项使用 [`--cfg`](../rustc/command-line-"
"arguments.html#--cfg-configure-the-compilation-environment) 标志设置。可以用 "
"`rustc --print cfg --target $TARGET` 显示指定目标的配置值。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:500
msgid ""
"Configuration options with the key `feature` are a convention used by [Cargo]"
"(../cargo/reference/features.html) for specifying compile-time options and "
"optional dependencies."
msgstr ""
"键为 `feature` 的配置选项是 [Cargo](../cargo/reference/features.html) 用来指"
"定编译时选项和可选依赖项的一种约定。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:509
msgid "`target_arch`"
msgstr "`target_arch`"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:515
msgid ""
"Key-value option set once with the target's CPU architecture. The value is "
"similar to the first element of the platform's target triple, but not "
"identical."
msgstr ""
"键值选项，按目标的 CPU 架构设置一次。该值类似于平台目标三元组的第一个元素，但"
"并不完全相同。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:521 src/conditional-compilation.md:547
#: src/conditional-compilation.md:581 src/conditional-compilation.md:610
#: src/conditional-compilation.md:647 src/conditional-compilation.md:679
#: src/conditional-compilation.md:710 src/conditional-compilation.md:732
#: src/conditional-compilation.md:844
