#: src/conditional-compilation.md:553
msgid "`\"sse\"`"
msgstr "`\"sse\"`"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:554
msgid "`\"sse2\"`"
msgstr "`\"sse2\"`"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:555
msgid "`\"sse4.1\"`"
msgstr "`\"sse4.1\"`"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:557
msgid ""
"See the [`target_feature` attribute](attributes/codegen.md#the-"
"target_feature-attribute) for more details on the available features."
msgstr ""
"关于可用特性的更多细节，见 [`target_feature` 属性](attributes/codegen.md#the-"
"target_feature-attribute)。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:563
msgid ""
"An additional feature of `crt-static` is available to the `target_feature` "
"option to indicate that a [static C runtime](linkage.md#static-and-dynamic-c-"
"runtimes) is available."
msgstr ""
"`target_feature` 选项还可使用一个附加特性 `crt-static`，用于表示有[静态 C 运"
"行时](linkage.md#static-and-dynamic-c-runtimes)可用。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:569
msgid "`target_os`"
msgstr "`target_os`"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:575
msgid ""
"Key-value option set once with the target's operating system. This value is "
"similar to the second and third element of the platform's target triple."
msgstr ""
"键值选项，按目标的操作系统设置一次。该值类似于平台目标三元组的第二和第三个元"
"素。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:583 src/conditional-compilation.md:613
