"Key-value option set to further disambiguate the target with information "
"about the target ABI."
msgstr "键值选项，设置为关于目标 ABI 的信息，用于进一步消除目标的歧义。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:673
msgid ""
"For historical reasons, this value is only defined as not the empty-string "
"when actually needed for disambiguation. Thus, for example, on many GNU "
"platforms, this value will be empty."
msgstr ""
"出于历史原因，只有在确实需要消歧时，该值才被定义为非空字符串。因此，例如在许"
"多 GNU 平台上，该值会为空。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:682
msgid "`\"llvm\"`"
msgstr "`\"llvm\"`"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:683
msgid "`\"eabihf\"`"
msgstr "`\"eabihf\"`"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:684
msgid "`\"abi64\"`"
msgstr "`\"abi64\"`"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:690
msgid "`target_endian`"
msgstr "`target_endian`"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:692
msgid ""
"Key-value option set once with either a value of \"little\" or \"big\" "
"depending on the endianness of the target's CPU."
msgstr ""
"键值选项，根据目标 CPU 的字节序设置一次，其值为 \"little\" 或 \"big\"。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:698
msgid "`target_pointer_width`"
msgstr "`target_pointer_width`"

