#: src/conditional-compilation.md:774
msgid "`target_has_atomic_primitive_alignment`"
msgstr "`target_has_atomic_primitive_alignment`"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:780
msgid ""
"Key-value option set for each bit width where the [atomic](../core/sync/"
"atomic/index.html) type has the same alignment as the corresponding integer "
"type."
msgstr ""
"键值选项，会为 [atomic](../core/sync/atomic/index.html) 类型与对应整数类型具"
"有相同对齐的每个位宽分别设置。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:786
msgid ""
"The alignment is usually the same for a given bit width. However, on some "
"targets such as 32-bit x86, 64-bit atomic types such as [`AtomicI64`](../"
"core/sync/atomic/type.AtomicI64.html) have an alignment of 8 bytes while "
"`i64` is only aligned to 4 bytes. In this situation, "
"`target_has_atomic_primitive_alignment = \"64\"` is not set."
msgstr ""
"对于给定位宽，对齐通常相同。但是，在某些目标（例如 32 位 x86）上，诸如 "
"[`AtomicI64`](../core/sync/atomic/type.AtomicI64.html) 的 64 位原子类型具有 "
"8 字节对齐，而 `i64` 只对齐到 4 字节。在这种情况下，不会设置 "
"`target_has_atomic_primitive_alignment = \"64\"`。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:808
msgid "`test`"
msgstr "`test`"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:810
msgid ""
"Enabled when compiling the test harness. Done with `rustc` by using the [`--"
"test`](../rustc/command-line-arguments.html#--test-build-a-test-harness) "
"flag. See [Testing](attributes/testing.md) for more on testing support."
msgstr ""
"编译测试框架时启用。使用 `rustc` 时，通过 [`--test`](../rustc/command-line-"
"arguments.html#--test-build-a-test-harness) 标志完成。关于测试支持的更多内"
"容，见 [Testing](attributes/testing.md)。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:816
msgid "`debug_assertions`"
msgstr "`debug_assertions`"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:818
msgid ""
"Enabled by default when compiling without optimizations. This can be used to "
"enable extra debugging code in development but not in production.  For "
"example, it controls the behavior of the standard library's [`debug_assert!`]"
"(../core/macro.debug_assert.html) macro."
msgstr ""
"默认在不启用优化进行编译时启用。可用于在开发中启用额外调试代码，而不在生产中"
"启用。例如，它控制标准库 [`debug_assert!`](../core/macro.debug_assert.html) "
"宏的行为。"

