#: src/items.md:313
msgid ""
"An _item_ is a component of a crate. Items are organized within a crate by a "
"nested set of [modules](items/modules.md). Every crate has a single "
"\"outermost\" anonymous module; all further items within the crate have "
"[paths](paths.md) within the module tree of the crate."
msgstr ""
"_项_ 是 crate 的组成部分。项在 crate 中由一组嵌套的[模块](items/modules.md)组"
"织起来。每个 crate 都有一个单一的“最外层”匿名模块；crate 中的所有其他项都在"
"该 crate 的模块树中具有[路径](paths.md)。"

#: src/items.md:319
msgid ""
"Items are entirely determined at compile-time, generally remain fixed during "
"execution, and may reside in read-only memory."
msgstr "项完全在编译时确定，通常在执行期间保持固定，并且可以驻留在只读内存中。"

#: src/items.md:325
msgid "There are several kinds of items:"
msgstr "项有若干种："

#: src/items.md:327
msgid "[modules](items/modules.md)"
msgstr "[模块](items/modules.md)"

#: src/items.md:328
msgid "[`extern crate` declarations](items/extern-crates.md)"
msgstr "[`extern crate` 声明](items/extern-crates.md)"

#: src/items.md:329
msgid "[`use` declarations](items/use-declarations.md)"
msgstr "[`use` 声明](items/use-declarations.md)"

#: src/items.md:330
msgid "[function definitions](items/functions.md)"
msgstr "[函数定义](items/functions.md)"

#: src/items.md:331
msgid "[type alias definitions](items/type-aliases.md)"
msgstr "[类型别名定义](items/type-aliases.md)"

#: src/items.md:332
msgid "[struct definitions](items/structs.md)"
msgstr "[结构体定义](items/structs.md)"

#: src/items.md:333
msgid "[enumeration definitions](items/enumerations.md)"
msgstr "[枚举定义](items/enumerations.md)"

#: src/items.md:334
msgid "[union definitions](items/unions.md)"
msgstr "[联合体定义](items/unions.md)"

#: src/items.md:335
msgid "[constant items](items/constant-items.md)"
msgstr "[常量项](items/constant-items.md)"

#: src/items.md:336
msgid "[static items](items/static-items.md)"
msgstr "[静态项](items/static-items.md)"

#: src/items.md:337
msgid "[trait definitions](items/traits.md)"
msgstr "[trait 定义](items/traits.md)"

#: src/items.md:338
msgid "[implementations](items/implementations.md)"
msgstr "[实现](items/implementations.md)"

#: src/items.md:339
msgid "[`extern` blocks](items/external-blocks.md)"
msgstr "[`extern` 块](items/external-blocks.md)"

#: src/items.md:345
msgid ""
"Items may be declared in the [root of the crate](crates-and-source-"
"files.md), a [module](items/modules.md), or a [block expression](expressions/"
"block-expr.md)."
msgstr ""
"项可以在 [crate 的根](crates-and-source-files.md)、[模块](items/modules.md)或"
"[块表达式](expressions/block-expr.md)中声明。"

#: src/items.md:351
msgid ""
"A subset of items, called [associated items](items/associated-items.md), may "
"be declared in [traits](items/traits.md) and [implementations](items/"
"implementations.md)."
msgstr ""
"项的一个子集称为[关联项](items/associated-items.md)，可以在 [trait](items/"
"traits.md) 和[实现](items/implementations.md)中声明。"

#: src/items.md:357
msgid ""
"A subset of items, called external items, may be declared in [`extern` "
"blocks](items/external-blocks.md)."
msgstr ""
"项的一个子集称为外部项，可以在 [`extern` 块](items/external-blocks.md)中声"
"明。"

#: src/items.md:363
msgid ""
"Items may be defined in any order, with the exception of [`macro_rules`]"
"(macros-by-example.md) which has its own scoping behavior."
msgstr ""
"项可以按任意顺序定义，但具有自身作用域行为的 [`macro_rules`](macros-by-"
"example.md) 除外。"

#: src/items.md:369
msgid ""
"[Name resolution](names/name-resolution.md) of item names allows items to be "
"defined before or after where the item is referred to in the module or block."
msgstr ""
"项名称的[名称解析](names/name-resolution.md)允许项定义在模块或块中引用该项的"
"位置之前或之后。"

#: src/items.md:371
msgid ""
"See [item scopes](names/scopes.md#item-scopes) for information on the "
"scoping rules of items."
msgstr ""
"有关项的作用域规则的信息，参见[项作用域](names/scopes.md#item-scopes)。"

