#: src/items/extern-crates.md:160
msgid ""
"An _`extern crate` declaration_ specifies a dependency on an external crate."
msgstr "_`extern crate` 声明_ 指定对外部 crate 的依赖。"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:166
msgid ""
"The external crate is then bound into the declaring scope as the given "
"[identifier](../identifiers.md) in the [type namespace](../names/"
"namespaces.md)."
msgstr ""
"随后，该外部 crate 会在声明所在作用域中，作为给定的[标识符](../"
"identifiers.md)绑定到[类型命名空间](../names/namespaces.md)。"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:172
msgid ""
"Additionally, if the `extern crate` appears in the crate root, then the "
"crate name is also added to the [extern prelude](../names/preludes.md#extern-"
"prelude), making it automatically in scope in all modules."
msgstr ""
"此外，如果 `extern crate` 出现在 crate 根中，则 crate 名也会被加入 [extern "
"prelude](../names/preludes.md#extern-prelude)，使其在所有模块中自动进入作用"
"域。"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:178
msgid ""
"The `as` clause can be used to bind the imported crate to a different name."
msgstr "`as` 子句可用于将导入的 crate 绑定到另一个名称。"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:184
msgid ""
"The external crate is resolved to a specific `soname` at compile time, and a "
"runtime linkage requirement to that `soname` is passed to the linker for "
"loading at runtime. The `soname` is resolved at compile time by scanning the "
"compiler's library path and matching the optional `crate_name` provided "
"against the [`crate_name` attributes](../crates-and-source-files.md#the-"
"crate_name-attribute) that were declared on the external crate when it was "
"compiled. If no `crate_name` is provided, a default `name` attribute is "
"assumed, equal to the [identifier](../identifiers.md) given in the `extern "
"crate` declaration."
msgstr ""
"外部 crate 会在编译时解析为特定的 `soname`，并且对该 `soname` 的运行时链接需"
"求会被传递给链接器，以便在运行时加载。`soname` 的编译时解析方式是扫描编译器的"
"库路径，并将可选提供的 `crate_name` 与外部 crate 编译时声明的 [`crate_name` "
"属性](../crates-and-source-files.md#the-crate_name-attribute)进行匹配。如果未"
"提供 `crate_name`，则假定有一个默认的 `name` 属性，其值等于 `extern crate` 声"
"明中给出的[标识符](../identifiers.md)。"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:190
msgid ""
"The `self` crate may be imported which creates a binding to the current "
"crate. In this case the `as` clause must be used to specify the name to bind "
"it to."
msgstr ""
"可以导入 `self` crate，这会创建到当前 crate 的绑定。在这种情况下，必须使用 "
"`as` 子句指定要将其绑定到的名称。"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:192
msgid "Three examples of `extern crate` declarations:"
msgstr "`extern crate` 声明的三个示例："

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:198
msgid "// equivalent to: extern crate std as std;\n"
msgstr "// equivalent to: extern crate std as std;\n"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:200
msgid "// linking to 'std' under another name\n"
msgstr "// linking to 'std' under another name\n"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:207
msgid ""
"When naming Rust crates, hyphens are disallowed. However, Cargo packages may "
"make use of them. In such case, when `Cargo.toml` doesn't specify a crate "
"name, Cargo will transparently replace `-` with `_` (Refer to [RFC 940]"
"(https://github.com/rust-lang/rfcs/blob/master/text/0940-hyphens-considered-"
"harmful.md) for more details)."
msgstr ""
"命名 Rust crate 时，不允许使用连字符。不过，Cargo 包可以使用连字符。在这种情"
"况下，如果 `Cargo.toml` 未指定 crate 名，Cargo 会透明地将 `-` 替换为 `_`（更"
"多细节参见 [RFC 940](https://github.com/rust-lang/rfcs/blob/master/text/0940-"
"hyphens-considered-harmful.md)）。"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:209 src/attributes/diagnostics.md:428
msgid "Here is an example:"
msgstr "下面是一个示例："

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:213
msgid "// Importing the Cargo package hello-world\n"
msgstr "// Importing the Cargo package hello-world\n"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:214
msgid "// hyphen replaced with an underscore\n"
msgstr "// hyphen replaced with an underscore\n"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:221 src/items/use-declarations.md:682
msgid "Underscore imports"
msgstr "下划线导入"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:227
msgid ""
"An external crate dependency can be declared without binding its name in "
"scope by using an underscore with the form `extern crate foo as _`. This may "
"be useful for crates that only need to be linked, but are never referenced, "
"and will avoid being reported as unused."
msgstr ""
"可以使用下划线以 `extern crate foo as _` 的形式声明外部 crate 依赖，而不在作"
"用域中绑定其名称。对于只需要被链接、但从不被引用的 crate，这可能很有用，并且"
"可以避免被报告为未使用。"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:233
msgid ""
"The [`macro_use` attribute](../macros-by-example.md#the-macro_use-attribute) "
"works as usual and imports the macro names into the [`macro_use` prelude](../"
"names/preludes.md#macro_use-prelude)."
msgstr ""
"[`macro_use` 属性](../macros-by-example.md#the-macro_use-attribute)照常工作，"
"并将宏名称导入 [`macro_use` prelude](../names/preludes.md#macro_use-"
"prelude)。"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:240
msgid "The `no_link` attribute"
msgstr "`no_link` 属性"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:246
msgid ""
"The _`no_link` [attribute](../attributes.md#r-attributes)_ may be applied to "
"an `extern crate` item to prevent linking the crate."
msgstr ""
"_`no_link` [属性](../attributes.md#r-attributes)_ 可以应用于 `extern crate` "
"项，以阻止链接该 crate。"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:252
msgid "This is helpful, e.g., when only the macros of a crate are needed."
msgstr "例如，当只需要某个 crate 的宏时，这会很有用。"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:276
msgid ""
"The `no_link` attribute uses the [MetaWord](../attributes.md#grammar-"
"MetaWord) syntax."
msgstr ""
"`no_link` 属性使用 [MetaWord](../attributes.md#grammar-MetaWord) 语法。"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:282
msgid ""
"The `no_link` attribute may only be applied to an `extern crate` declaration."
msgstr "`no_link` 属性只能应用于 `extern crate` 声明。"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:297
msgid ""
"Only the first use of `no_link` on an `extern crate` declaration has effect."
msgstr "在 `extern crate` 声明上，只有第一次使用 `no_link` 会产生效果。"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:303 src/attributes/testing.md:74
#: src/attributes/testing.md:221 src/attributes/diagnostics.md:506
#: src/attributes/codegen.md:194 src/attributes/codegen.md:312
