msgid ""
"They cannot import [associated items](associated-items.md), [generic "
"parameters](generics.md), [local variables](../variables.md), paths with "
"[`Self`](../paths.md#self), or [tool attributes](../attributes.md#tool-"
"attributes). More restrictions are described below."
msgstr ""
"它们不能导入[关联项](associated-items.md)、[泛型参数](generics.md)、[局部变"
"量](../variables.md)、带有 [`Self`](../paths.md#self) 的路径，或[工具属性]"
"(../attributes.md#tool-attributes)。下面还会描述更多限制。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:371
msgid ""
"`use` will create bindings for all [namespaces](../names/namespaces.md) from "
"the imported entities, with the exception that a `self` import will only "
"import from the type namespace (as described below). For example, the "
"following illustrates creating bindings for the same name in two namespaces:"
msgstr ""
"`use` 会为被导入实体的所有[命名空间](../names/namespaces.md)创建绑定，但 "
"`self` 导入除外，它只会从类型命名空间导入（如下所述）。例如，下面展示了如何在"
"两个命名空间中为同一个名称创建绑定："

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:377
msgid "// Imports the `Foo` type and the `Foo` constructor.\n"
msgstr "// Imports the `Foo` type and the `Foo` constructor.\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:382
msgid "// Uses `Foo` from the value namespace.\n"
msgstr "// Uses `Foo` from the value namespace.\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:383
msgid "// Uses `Foo` From the type namespace.\n"
msgstr "// Uses `Foo` From the type namespace.\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:395
msgid ""
"In the 2015 edition, `use` paths are relative to the crate root. For example:"
msgstr "在 2015 edition 中，`use` 路径相对于 crate 根。例如："

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:403
msgid "// Resolves `foo` from the crate root.\n"
msgstr "// Resolves `foo` from the crate root.\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:405
msgid "// The `::` prefix explicitly resolves `foo`\n"
msgstr "// The `::` prefix explicitly resolves `foo`\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:406
msgid "// from the crate root.\n"
msgstr "// from the crate root.\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:413
msgid ""
"The 2015 edition does not allow use declarations to reference the [extern "
"prelude](../names/preludes.md#extern-prelude). Thus, [`extern crate`](extern-"
"crates.md) declarations are still required in 2015 to reference an external "
"crate in a `use` declaration. Beginning with the 2018 edition, `use` "
"declarations can specify an external crate dependency the same way `extern "
"crate` can."
msgstr ""
"2015 edition 不允许 `use` 声明引用 [extern prelude](../names/"
"preludes.md#extern-prelude)。因此，在 2015 中，若要在 `use` 声明中引用外部 "
"crate，仍然需要 [`extern crate`](extern-crates.md) 声明。从 2018 edition 开"
"始，`use` 声明可以像 `extern crate` 一样指定外部 crate 依赖。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:422
msgid "`as` renames"
msgstr "`as` 重命名"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:424
msgid ""
"The `as` keyword can be used to change the name of an imported entity. For "
"example:"
msgstr "`as` 关键字可用于更改被导入实体的名称。例如："

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:427
msgid "// Creates a non-public alias `bar` for the function `foo`.\n"
msgstr "// Creates a non-public alias `bar` for the function `foo`.\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:439
msgid "Brace syntax"
msgstr "花括号语法"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:445
msgid ""
"Braces can be used in the last segment of the path to import multiple "
"entities from the previous segment, or, if there are no previous segments, "
"from the current scope. Braces can be nested, creating a tree of paths, "
"where each grouping of segments is logically combined with its parent to "
"create a full path."
msgstr ""
"花括号可以用在路径的最后一个段中，以从前一个段导入多个实体；如果没有前面的"
"段，则从当前作用域导入。花括号可以嵌套，从而创建一个路径树，其中每组段都会在"
"逻辑上与其父级组合，以创建完整路径。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:448
msgid ""
"// Creates bindings to:\n"
"// - `std::collections::BTreeSet`\n"
"// - `std::collections::hash_map`\n"
"// - `std::collections::hash_map::HashMap`\n"
msgstr ""
"// Creates bindings to:\n"
"// - `std::collections::BTreeSet`\n"
"// - `std::collections::hash_map`\n"
"// - `std::collections::hash_map::HashMap`\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:459
msgid ""
"An empty brace does not import anything, though the leading path is "
"validated that it is accessible."
msgstr "空花括号不会导入任何内容，但会验证前导路径是可访问的。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:470
msgid ""
"In the 2015 edition, paths are relative to the crate root, so an import such "
"as `use {foo, bar};` will import the names `foo` and `bar` from the crate "
"root, whereas starting in 2018, those names are relative to the current "
"scope."
msgstr ""
"在 2015 edition 中，路径相对于 crate 根，因此像 `use {foo, bar};` 这样的导入"
"会从 crate 根导入名称 `foo` 和 `bar`；而从 2018 edition 开始，这些名称相对于"
"当前作用域。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:479
msgid "`self` imports"
msgstr "`self` 导入"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:485
msgid ""
"The keyword `self` may be used within [brace syntax](use-declarations.md#r-"
"items.use.multiple-syntax) to create a binding of the parent entity under "
"its own name."
msgstr ""
"关键字 `self` 可以在[花括号语法](use-declarations.md#r-items.use.multiple-"
"syntax)中使用，以父实体自身的名称创建其绑定。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:493
msgid "// Creates a binding for `stuff` and `foo`.\n"
msgstr "// Creates a binding for `stuff` and `foo`.\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:507
msgid ""
"`self` may also be used as the first segment of a path. The use of `self` as "
"the first segment and inside a `use` brace is logically the same; it means "
"the current module of the parent segment, or the current module if there is "
"no parent segment. See [`self`](../paths.md#self) in the paths chapter for "
"more information on the meaning of a leading `self`."
msgstr ""
"`self` 也可以用作路径的第一个段。将 `self` 用作第一个段，与在 `use` 的花括号"
"内使用它在逻辑上是相同的；它表示父段的当前模块，或者在没有父段时表示当前模"
"块。关于前导 `self` 含义的更多信息，参见路径章节中的 [`self`](../"
"paths.md#self)。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:516
msgid ""
"`self` may appear as the last segment of a `use` path, preceded by `::`. A "
"path of the form `P::self` is equivalent to `P::{self}`, and `P::self as "
"name` is equivalent to `P::{self as name}`."
msgstr ""
"`self` 可以出现在 `use` 路径的最后一个段，前面带有 `::`。形式为 `P::self` 的"
"路径等价于 `P::{self}`，而 `P::self as name` 等价于 `P::{self as name}`。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:522
msgid "// Equivalent to `use m::{self as _};`.\n"
msgstr "// Equivalent to `use m::{self as _};`.\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:523
msgid "// Equivalent to `use m::E::{self};`.\n"
msgstr "// Equivalent to `use m::E::{self};`.\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:531
msgid ""
"See [paths.qualifiers.mod-self.trailing](../paths.md#r-paths.qualifiers.mod-"
"self.trailing) for restrictions on the preceding path."
msgstr ""
"关于前置路径的限制，参见 [paths.qualifiers.mod-self.trailing](../paths.md#r-"
"paths.qualifiers.mod-self.trailing)。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:540
msgid ""
"When `self` is used within [brace syntax](use-declarations.md#r-"
"items.use.multiple-syntax), the path preceding the brace group must resolve "
"to a [module](modules.md#r-items.mod), [enumeration](enumerations.md#r-"
"items.enum), or [trait](traits.md#r-items.traits)."
msgstr ""
"当 `self` 在[花括号语法](use-declarations.md#r-items.use.multiple-syntax)中使"
"用时，花括号组之前的路径必须解析为[模块](modules.md#r-items.mod)、[枚举]"
"(enumerations.md#r-items.enum)或 [trait](traits.md#r-items.traits)。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:547 src/paths.md:1318
msgid "// OK: Modules can be parents of `self`.\n"
msgstr "// OK: Modules can be parents of `self`.\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:548
msgid "// OK: Enums can be parents of `self`.\n"
msgstr "// OK: Enums can be parents of `self`.\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:549 src/paths.md:1321
msgid "// OK: Traits can be parents of `self`.\n"
msgstr "// OK: Traits can be parents of `self`.\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:555 src/paths.md:1327
msgid "// ERROR: Structs cannot be parents of `self`.\n"
msgstr "// ERROR: Structs cannot be parents of `self`.\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:563
msgid ""
"`self` only creates a binding from the [type namespace](../names/"
"namespaces.md) of the parent entity. For example, in the following, only the "
"`foo` mod is imported:"
msgstr ""
"`self` 只会从父实体的[类型命名空间](../names/namespaces.md)创建绑定。例如，在"
"下面的代码中，只导入了 `foo` mod："

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:570
msgid ""
"// This only imports the module `foo`. The function `foo` lives in\n"
"// the value namespace and is not imported.\n"
msgstr ""
"// This only imports the module `foo`. The function `foo` lives in\n"
"// the value namespace and is not imported.\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:576
msgid "//~ ERROR `foo` is a module\n"
msgstr "//~ ERROR `foo` is a module\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:584
msgid "Glob imports"
msgstr "glob 导入"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:590
msgid ""
"The `*` character may be used as the last segment of a `use` path to import "
"all importable entities from the entity of the preceding segment. For "
"example:"
msgstr ""
"字符 `*` 可以用作 `use` 路径的最后一个段，以从前一个段所指的实体导入所有可导"
"入实体。例如："

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:593
msgid "// Creates a non-public alias to `bar`.\n"
msgstr "// Creates a non-public alias to `bar`.\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:603
msgid ""
"// Creates local aliases to `V1` and `V2`\n"
"        // of the `Example` enum.\n"
msgstr ""
"// Creates local aliases to `V1` and `V2`\n"
"        // of the `Example` enum.\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:615
msgid ""
"Items and named imports are allowed to shadow names from glob imports in the "
"same [namespace](../names/namespaces.md). That is, if there is a name "
"already defined by another item in the same namespace, the glob import will "
"be shadowed. For example:"
msgstr ""
"项和命名导入允许遮蔽同一[命名空间](../names/namespaces.md)中来自 glob 导入的"
"名称。也就是说，如果同一命名空间中已有由另一个项定义的名称，则 glob 导入会被"
"遮蔽。例如："

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:618
msgid ""
"// This creates a binding to the `clashing::Foo` tuple struct\n"
"// constructor, but does not import its type because that would\n"
"// conflict with the `Foo` struct defined here.\n"
"//\n"
"// Note that the order of definition here is unimportant.\n"
msgstr ""
"// This creates a binding to the `clashing::Foo` tuple struct\n"
"// constructor, but does not import its type because that would\n"
"// conflict with the `Foo` struct defined here.\n"
"//\n"
"// Note that the order of definition here is unimportant.\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:629
msgid "// Uses the constructor from `clashing::Foo`.\n"
msgstr "// Uses the constructor from `clashing::Foo`.\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:631
msgid ""
"// The struct expression uses the type from\n"
"    // the `Foo` struct defined above.\n"
msgstr ""
"// The struct expression uses the type from\n"
"    // the `Foo` struct defined above.\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:634
msgid "// `Bar` is also in scope due to the glob import.\n"
msgstr "// `Bar` is also in scope due to the glob import.\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:648
msgid ""
"For areas where shadowing is not allowed, see [name resolution ambiguities]"
"(../names/name-resolution.md#r-names.resolution.expansion.imports.ambiguity)."
msgstr ""
"对于不允许遮蔽的区域，请参见[名称解析歧义](../names/name-resolution.md#r-"
"names.resolution.expansion.imports.ambiguity)。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:657
msgid "`*` cannot be used as the first or intermediate segments."
msgstr "`*` 不能用作第一个段或中间段。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:663
msgid ""
"`*` cannot be used to import a module's contents into itself (such as `use "
"self::*;`)."
msgstr "`*` 不能用于将模块的内容导入其自身（例如 `use self::*;`）。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:673
msgid ""
"In the 2015 edition, paths are relative to the crate root, so an import such "
"as `use *;` is valid, and it means to import everything from the crate root. "
"This cannot be used in the crate root itself."
msgstr ""
"在 2015 edition 中，路径相对于 crate 根，因此像 `use *;` 这样的导入是有效的，"
"其含义是从 crate 根导入所有内容。这不能在 crate 根自身中使用。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:688
msgid ""
"Items can be imported without binding to a name by using an underscore with "
"the form `use path as _`. This is particularly useful to import a trait so "
"that its methods may be used without importing the trait's symbol, for "
"example if the trait's symbol may conflict with another symbol. Another "
"example is to link an external crate without importing its name."
msgstr ""
"可以使用下划线以 `use path as _` 的形式导入项，而不将其绑定到名称。这对于导"
"入 trait 尤其有用，这样就可以使用其方法而不导入该 trait 的符号，例如当该 "
"trait 的符号可能与另一个符号冲突时。另一个例子是链接外部 crate 而不导入其名"
"称。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:694
msgid ""
"Asterisk glob imports will import items imported with `_` in their "
"unnameable form."
msgstr "星号 glob 导入会以不可命名的形式导入通过 `_` 导入的项。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:706
msgid "// Underscore import avoids name conflict with this item.\n"
msgstr "// Underscore import avoids name conflict with this item.\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:718
msgid ""
"The unique, unnameable symbols are created after macro expansion so that "
"macros may safely emit multiple references to `_` imports. For example, the "
"following should not produce an error:"
msgstr ""
"唯一且不可命名的符号会在宏展开之后创建，因此宏可以安全地发出对 `_` 导入的多个"
"引用。例如，以下代码不应产生错误："

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:725
msgid ""
"// This expands to:\n"
"// use std as _;\n"
"// use std as _;\n"
msgstr ""
"// This expands to:\n"
"// use std as _;\n"
"// use std as _;\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:735 src/items/enumerations.md:573
msgid "Restrictions"
msgstr "限制"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:737
msgid "The following rules are restrictions for valid `use` declarations."
msgstr "以下规则是对有效 `use` 声明的限制。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:743
msgid ""
"When using `crate` to import the current crate, you must use `as` to define "
"the binding name."
msgstr "使用 `crate` 导入当前 crate 时，必须使用 `as` 定义绑定名称。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:753 src/items/use-declarations.md:798
#: src/items/use-declarations.md:826
msgid "// Not allowed:\n"
msgstr "// Not allowed:\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:754
msgid "// use crate;\n"
msgstr "// use crate;\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:755
msgid "// use crate::{self};\n"
msgstr "// use crate::{self};\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:765
msgid ""
"When using [`$crate`](../paths.md#r-paths.qualifiers.macro-crate) in a macro "
"transcriber to import the current crate, you must use `as` to define the "
"binding name."
msgstr ""
"在宏转录器中使用 [`$crate`](../paths.md#r-paths.qualifiers.macro-crate) 导入"
"当前 crate 时，必须使用 `as` 定义绑定名称。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:787
msgid ""
"When using `self` to import the current module, you must use `as` to define "
"the binding name."
msgstr "使用 `self` 导入当前模块时，必须使用 `as` 定义绑定名称。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:799
msgid "// use {self};\n"
msgstr "// use {self};\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:800
msgid "// use self;\n"
msgstr "// use self;\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:801
msgid "// use self::{self};\n"
msgstr "// use self::{self};\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:811
msgid ""
"When using `super` to import a parent module, you must use `as` to define "
"the binding name."
msgstr "使用 `super` 导入父模块时，必须使用 `as` 定义绑定名称。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:827
msgid "// use super;\n"
msgstr "// use super;\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:828
msgid "// use super::{self};\n"
msgstr "// use super::{self};\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:829
msgid "// use self::super;\n"
msgstr "// use self::super;\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:830
msgid "// use super::super;\n"
msgstr "// use super::super;\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:831
msgid "// use super::super::{self};\n"
msgstr "// use super::super::{self};\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:843
msgid ""
"`::` as the [extern prelude](../names/preludes.md#extern-prelude) cannot be "
"imported."
msgstr ""
"作为 [extern prelude](../names/preludes.md#extern-prelude) 的 `::` 不能被导"
"入。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:850
msgid "//~ Error\n"
msgstr "//~ Error\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:860
msgid ""
"In the 2015 edition, the prefix `::` refers to the crate root, so `use ::"
"{self as root};` is allowed because it is same as `use crate::{self as "
"root};`. Starting with the 2018 edition the `::` prefix refers to the extern "
"prelude, which cannot be directly imported."
msgstr ""
"在 2015 edition 中，前缀 `::` 指 crate 根，因此允许 `use ::{self as root};`，"
"因为它与 `use crate::{self as root};` 相同。从 2018 edition 开始，`::` 前缀"
"指 extern prelude，而它不能被直接导入。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:863
msgid "//~ Ok\n"
msgstr "//~ Ok\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:873
msgid ""
"As with any item definition, `use` imports cannot create duplicate bindings "
"of the same name in the same namespace in a module or block."
msgstr ""
"与任何项定义一样，`use` 导入不能在模块或块中的同一命名空间内创建同名的重复绑"
"定。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:879
msgid ""
"`use` paths cannot refer to enum variants through a [type alias](type-"
"aliases.md)."
msgstr "`use` 路径不能通过[类型别名](type-aliases.md)引用枚举变体。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:891 src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2982
#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2983
msgid "//~ OK\n"
msgstr "//~ OK\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:892 src/patterns.md:838 src/patterns.md:839
#: src/patterns.md:840 src/patterns.md:863
msgid "//~ ERROR\n"
msgstr "//~ ERROR\n"

