#: src/items/functions.md:704 src/expressions/closure-expr.md:264
msgid "The `async` qualifier is not allowed in the 2015 edition."
msgstr "2015 edition 中不允许使用 `async` 限定符。"

#: src/items/functions.md:706
msgid ""
"The `safe` function qualifier is only allowed semantically within `extern` "
"blocks."
msgstr "`safe` 函数限定符在语义上只允许用于 `extern` 块内。"

#: src/items/functions.md:708
msgid ""
"_Relevant to editions earlier than Rust 2024_: Within `extern` blocks, the "
"`safe` or `unsafe` function qualifier is only allowed when the `extern` is "
"qualified as `unsafe`."
msgstr ""
"_与 Rust 2024 之前的 edition 相关_：在 `extern` 块内，只有当 `extern` 限定为 "
"`unsafe` 时，才允许使用 `safe` 或 `unsafe` 函数限定符。"

#: src/items/functions.md:710
msgid ""
"Function parameters with only a type are only allowed in an associated "
"function of a [trait item](traits.md) in the 2015 edition."
msgstr ""
"仅含类型的函数参数只允许出现在 2015 edition 中 [trait 项](traits.md)的关联函"
"数里。"

#: src/items/functions.md:716
msgid ""
"A _function_ consists of a [block](../expressions/block-expr.md) (that's the "
"_body_ of the function), along with a name, a set of parameters, and an "
"output type. Other than a name, all these are optional."
msgstr ""
"<em>函数</em>由一个[块](../expressions/block-expr.md)（即函数的<em>主体</"
"em>）、一个名称、一组参数和一个输出类型组成。除名称外，所有这些部分都是可选"
"的。"

#: src/items/functions.md:722
msgid ""
"Functions are declared with the keyword `fn` which defines the given name in "
"the [value namespace](../names/namespaces.md) of the module or block where "
"it is located."
msgstr ""
"函数使用关键字 `fn` 声明，该关键字会在函数所在模块或块的[值命名空间](../"
"names/namespaces.md)中定义给定名称。"

#: src/items/functions.md:728
msgid ""
"Functions may declare a set of _input_ [_variables_](../variables.md) as "
"parameters, through which the caller passes arguments into the function, and "
"the _output_ [_type_](../types.md#type-expressions) of the value the "
"function will return to its caller on completion."
msgstr ""
"函数可以声明一组作为参数的输入[变量](../variables.md)，调用者通过这些参数向函"
"数传入实参；函数还可以声明完成时返回给调用者的值的输出[类型](../"
"types.md#type-expressions)。"

#: src/items/functions.md:734
msgid ""
"If the output type is not explicitly stated, it is the [unit type](../types/"
"tuple.md)."
msgstr "如果未显式声明输出类型，则它是 [unit 类型](../types/tuple.md)。"

#: src/items/functions.md:740
msgid ""
"When referred to, a _function_ yields a first-class _value_ of the "
"corresponding [zero-sized](../glossary.md#r-glossary.zst) [_function item "
"type_](../types/function-item.md), which when called evaluates to a direct "
"call to the function."
msgstr ""
"当被引用时，<em>函数</em>会产生对应[零大小](../glossary.md#r-glossary.zst)[函"
"数项类型](../types/function-item.md)的一等<em>值</em>；调用该值时，会求值为对"
"该函数的直接调用。"

#: src/items/functions.md:742
msgid "For example, this is a simple function:"
msgstr "例如，这是一个简单函数："

#: src/items/functions.md:754
msgid ""
"The `safe` function is semantically only allowed when used in an [`extern` "
"block](external-blocks.md)."
msgstr "`safe` 函数在语义上只允许用于 [`extern` 块](external-blocks.md)中。"

#: src/items/functions.md:760
msgid "Function parameters"
msgstr "函数参数"

#: src/items/functions.md:766
msgid ""
"Function parameters are irrefutable [patterns](../patterns.md), so any "
"pattern that is valid in an else-less `let` binding is also valid as a "
"parameter:"
msgstr ""
"函数参数是不可反驳的[模式](../patterns.md)，因此任何在不带 `else` 的 `let` 绑"
"定中有效的模式，也都可以作为参数："

#: src/items/functions.md:776
msgid ""
"If the first parameter is a [SelfParam](functions.md#grammar-SelfParam), "
"this indicates that the function is a [method](associated-items.md#methods)."
msgstr ""
"如果第一个参数是 [SelfParam](functions.md#grammar-SelfParam)，则表示该函数是"
"一个[方法](associated-items.md#methods)。"

#: src/items/functions.md:782
msgid ""
"Functions with a self parameter may only appear as an [associated function]"
"(associated-items.md#associated-functions-and-methods) in a [trait]"
"(traits.md) or [implementation](implementations.md)."
msgstr ""
"带有 self 参数的函数只能作为 [trait](traits.md) 或[实现](implementations.md)"
"中的[关联函数](associated-items.md#associated-functions-and-methods)出现。"

#: src/items/functions.md:788
msgid ""
"A parameter with the `...` token indicates a [variadic function](external-"
"blocks.md#variadic-functions), and may only be used as the last parameter of "
"an [external block](external-blocks.md) function. The variadic parameter may "
"have an optional identifier, such as `args: ...`."
msgstr ""
"带有 `...` token 的参数表示一个[变参函数](external-blocks.md#variadic-"
"functions)，并且只能用作[外部块](external-blocks.md)函数的最后一个参数。变参"
"参数可以带有可选的标识符，例如 `args: ...`。"

#: src/items/functions.md:794
msgid "Function body"
msgstr "函数体"

#: src/items/functions.md:800
msgid ""
"The body block of a function is conceptually wrapped in another block that "
"first binds the argument patterns and then `return`s the value of the "
"function's body. This means that the tail expression of the block, if "
"evaluated, ends up being returned to the caller. As usual, an explicit "
"return expression within the body of the function will short-cut that "
"implicit return, if reached."
msgstr ""
"从概念上说，函数的主体块会被包裹在另一个块中，该块先绑定实参模式，然后 "
"`return` 函数主体的值。这意味着，如果块的尾表达式被求值，最终会将其返回给调用"
"者。和通常一样，如果执行到函数体中的显式 return 表达式，它会提前结束这个隐式"
"返回。"

#: src/items/functions.md:802
msgid "For example, the function above behaves as if it was written as:"
msgstr "例如，上面的函数行为就像写成如下形式："

#: src/items/functions.md:806
msgid "// argument_0 is the actual first argument passed from the caller\n"
msgstr "// argument_0 is the actual first argument passed from the caller\n"

#: src/items/functions.md:817
msgid ""
"Functions without a body block are terminated with a semicolon. This form "
"may only appear in a [trait](traits.md) or [external block](external-"
"blocks.md)."
msgstr ""
"没有主体块的函数以分号结束。这种形式只能出现在 [trait](traits.md) 或[外部块]"
"(external-blocks.md)中。"

#: src/items/functions.md:823
msgid "Generic functions"
msgstr "泛型函数"

#: src/items/functions.md:829
msgid ""
"A _generic function_ allows one or more _parameterized types_ to appear in "
"its signature. Each type parameter must be explicitly declared in an angle-"
"bracket-enclosed and comma-separated list, following the function name."
msgstr ""
"<em>泛型函数</em>允许一个或多个<em>参数化类型</em>出现在其签名中。每个类型参"
"数都必须在函数名之后、由尖括号包围且以逗号分隔的列表中显式声明。"

#: src/items/functions.md:832
msgid "// foo is generic over A and B\n"
msgstr "// foo is generic over A and B\n"

#: src/items/functions.md:842
msgid ""
"Inside the function signature and body, the name of the type parameter can "
"be used as a type name."
msgstr "在函数签名和函数体内，类型参数的名称可以作为类型名称使用。"

#: src/items/functions.md:848
msgid ""
"[Trait](traits.md) bounds can be specified for type parameters to allow "
"methods from that trait to be called on values of that type. This is "
"specified using the `where` syntax:"
msgstr ""
"可以为类型参数指定 [trait](traits.md) 约束，以允许在该类型的值上调用来自该 "
"trait 的方法。这使用 `where` 语法指定："

#: src/items/functions.md:860
msgid ""
"When a generic function is referenced, its type is instantiated based on the "
"context of the reference. For example, calling the `foo` function here:"
msgstr ""
"当泛型函数被引用时，会根据该引用的上下文实例化其类型。例如，在这里调用 `foo` "
"函数："

#: src/items/functions.md:866
msgid "// details elided\n"
msgstr "// details elided\n"

#: src/items/functions.md:872
msgid "will instantiate type parameter `T` with `i32`."
msgstr "会用 `i32` 实例化类型参数 `T`。"

#: src/items/functions.md:878
msgid ""
"The type parameters can also be explicitly supplied in a trailing [path](../"
"paths.md) component after the function name. This might be necessary if "
"there is not sufficient context to determine the type parameters. For "
"example, `mem::size_of::<u32>() == 4`."
msgstr ""
"类型参数也可以在函数名之后的尾随[路径](../paths.md)组件中显式提供。如果没有足"
"够的上下文来确定类型参数，这可能是必要的。例如，`mem::size_of::<u32>() == "
"4`。"

#: src/items/functions.md:884
msgid "Extern function qualifier"
msgstr "Extern 函数限定符"

#: src/items/functions.md:890
msgid ""
"The `extern` function qualifier allows providing function _definitions_ that "
"can be called with a particular ABI:"
msgstr "`extern` 函数限定符允许提供可用特定 ABI 调用的函数<em>定义</em>："

#: src/items/functions.md:894 src/items/functions.md:905
msgid "\"ABI\""
msgstr "\"ABI\""

#: src/items/functions.md:901
msgid ""
"These are often used in combination with [external block](external-"
"blocks.md) items which provide function _declarations_ that can be used to "
"call functions without providing their _definition_:"
msgstr ""
"这些函数定义常与[外部块](external-blocks.md)项结合使用；外部块项提供函数<em>"
"声明</em>，可在不提供其<em>定义</em>的情况下调用函数："

#: src/items/functions.md:906 src/items/functions.md:907
msgid "/* no body */"
msgstr "/* no body */"

#: src/items/functions.md:917
msgid ""
"When `\"extern\" Abi?*` is omitted from `FunctionQualifiers` in function "
"items, the ABI `\"Rust\"` is assigned. For example:"
msgstr ""
"当函数项的 `FunctionQualifiers` 中省略 `\"extern\" Abi?*` 时，会分配 ABI "
"`\"Rust\"`。例如："

