"implementations), must include a [Type](../types.md#grammar-Type) "
"specification and may not include [Bounds](../trait-bounds.md#grammar-"
"Bounds)."
msgstr ""
"类型别名在作为 [trait impl](implementations.md#trait-implementations) 中的[关"
"联类型](associated-items.md#associated-types)使用时，必须包含 [Type](../"
"types.md#grammar-Type) 说明，且不得包含 [Bounds](../trait-bounds.md#grammar-"
"Bounds)。"

#: src/items/type-aliases.md:194
msgid ""
"Where clauses before the equals sign on a type alias in a [trait impl]"
"(implementations.md#trait-implementations) (like `type TypeAlias<T> where T: "
"Foo = Bar<T>`) are deprecated. Where clauses after the equals sign (like "
"`type TypeAlias<T> = Bar<T> where T: Foo`) are preferred."
msgstr ""
"[trait impl](implementations.md#trait-implementations) 中类型别名等号之前的 "
"where 子句（如 `type TypeAlias<T> where T: Foo = Bar<T>`）已弃用。优先使用等"
"号之后的 where 子句（如 `type TypeAlias<T> = Bar<T> where T: Foo`）。"

