#: src/items/enumerations.md:768
msgid "Variant visibility"
msgstr "变体可见性"

#: src/items/enumerations.md:770
msgid ""
"Enum variants syntactically allow a [Visibility](../visibility-and-"
"privacy.md#grammar-Visibility) annotation, but this is rejected when the "
"enum is validated. This allows items to be parsed with a unified syntax "
"across different contexts where they are used."
msgstr ""
"枚举变体在语法上允许 [Visibility](../visibility-and-privacy.md#grammar-"
"Visibility) 标注，但这会在验证 enum 时被拒绝。这使得项在其使用的不同上下文中"
"可以用统一语法解析。"

