"sup> <span class=\"grammar-literal\">;</span>"

#: src/items/constant-items.md:109
msgid ""
"A _constant item_ is an optionally named _[constant value](../"
"const_eval.md#constant-expressions)_ which is not associated with a specific "
"memory location in the program."
msgstr ""
"_常量项_ 是一个可以有名称也可以没有名称的 _[常量值](../"
"const_eval.md#constant-expressions)_，它不与程序中的特定内存位置关联。"

#: src/items/constant-items.md:115
msgid ""
"Constants are essentially inlined wherever they are used, meaning that they "
"are copied directly into the relevant context when used. This includes use "
"of constants from external crates, and non-[`Copy`](../special-types-and-"
"traits.md#copy) types. References to the same constant are not necessarily "
"guaranteed to refer to the same memory address."
msgstr ""
"常量本质上会在使用处内联，也就是说，使用常量时会将它们直接复制到相关上下文"
"中。这包括来自外部 crate 的常量以及非 [`Copy`](../special-types-and-"
"traits.md#copy) 类型。对同一常量的引用不一定保证指向同一内存地址。"

#: src/items/constant-items.md:121
msgid ""
"The constant declaration defines the constant value in the [value namespace]"
"(../names/namespaces.md) of the module or block where it is located."
msgstr ""
"常量声明会在其所在模块或块的[值命名空间](../names/namespaces.md)中定义该常量"
"值。"

#: src/items/constant-items.md:127
msgid ""
"Constants must be explicitly typed. The type must have a `'static` lifetime: "
"any references in the initializer must have `'static` lifetimes. References "
"in the type of a constant default to `'static` lifetime; see [static "
"lifetime elision](../lifetime-elision.md#const-and-static-elision)."
msgstr ""
"常量必须显式标注类型。其类型必须具有 `'static` 生命周期：初始化式中的任何引用"
"都必须具有 `'static` 生命周期。常量类型中的引用默认采用 `'static` 生命周期；"
"参见[static 生命周期省略](../lifetime-elision.md#const-and-static-elision)。"

#: src/items/constant-items.md:133
msgid ""
"A reference to a constant will have `'static` lifetime if the constant value "
"is eligible for [promotion](../destructors.md#r-destructors.scope.const-"
"promotion); otherwise, a temporary will be created."
msgstr ""
"如果常量值符合[提升](../destructors.md#r-destructors.scope.const-promotion)条"
"件，对该常量的引用将具有 `'static` 生命周期；否则，将创建一个临时值。"

#: src/items/constant-items.md:140 src/lifetime-elision.md:245
msgid "\"bitstring\""
msgstr "\"bitstring\""

#: src/items/constant-items.md:157
msgid ""
"The constant expression may only be omitted in a [trait definition]"
"(traits.md)."
msgstr "只有在 [trait 定义](traits.md) 中才可以省略常量表达式。"

#: src/items/constant-items.md:163
msgid "Constants with destructors"
msgstr "带析构器的常量"

#: src/items/constant-items.md:165
msgid ""
"Constants can contain destructors. Destructors are run when the value goes "
"out of scope."
msgstr "常量可以包含析构器。当值离开作用域时会运行析构器。"

#: src/items/constant-items.md:172
msgid "\"Dropped. Held {}.\""
msgstr "\"Dropped. Held {}.\""

#: src/items/constant-items.md:180
msgid ""
"// x gets dropped at end of function, calling drop.\n"
"    // prints \"Dropped. Held 0.\".\n"
msgstr ""
"// x gets dropped at end of function, calling drop.\n"
"    // prints \"Dropped. Held 0.\".\n"

#: src/items/constant-items.md:189
msgid "Unnamed constant"
msgstr "未命名常量"

#: src/items/constant-items.md:195
msgid ""
"Unlike an [associated constant](../items/associated-items.md#associated-"
"constants), a [free](../glossary.md#free-item) constant may be unnamed by "
"using an underscore instead of the name. For example:"
msgstr ""
"与[关联常量](../items/associated-items.md#associated-constants)不同，[自由]"
"(../glossary.md#free-item)常量可以通过使用下划线代替名称而成为未命名常量。例"
"如："

#: src/items/constant-items.md:199
msgid "// OK although it is the same name as above:\n"
msgstr "// OK although it is the same name as above:\n"

#: src/items/constant-items.md:208
msgid ""
"As with [underscore imports](use-declarations.md#underscore-imports), macros "
"may safely emit the same unnamed constant in the same scope more than once. "
"For example, the following should not produce an error:"
msgstr ""
"与[下划线导入](use-declarations.md#underscore-imports)一样，宏可以在同一作用"
"域中安全地多次发出相同的未命名常量。例如，以下代码不应产生错误："

#: src/items/constant-items.md:215
msgid ""
"// This expands to:\n"
"// const _: () = ();\n"
"// const _: () = ();\n"
msgstr ""
"// This expands to:\n"
"// const _: () = ();\n"
"// const _: () = ();\n"

#: src/items/constant-items.md:225
msgid "Evaluation"
msgstr "求值"

#: src/items/constant-items.md:227
msgid ""
"[Free](../glossary.md#free-item) constants are always [evaluated](../"
"const_eval.md) at compile-time to surface panics. This happens even within "
"an unused function:"
msgstr ""
"[自由](../glossary.md#free-item)常量总是在编译时[求值](../const_eval.md)以暴"
"露 panic。即使位于未使用的函数中也是如此："

#: src/items/constant-items.md:230
msgid "// Compile-time panic\n"
msgstr "// Compile-time panic\n"

#: src/items/constant-items.md:234
msgid "// A failing compile-time assertion\n"
msgstr "// A failing compile-time assertion\n"

