#: src/items/traits.md:171
msgid ""
"A _trait_ describes an abstract interface that types can implement. This "
"interface consists of [associated items](associated-items.md), which come in "
"three varieties:"
msgstr ""
"_trait_ 描述类型可以实现的抽象接口。此接口由[关联项](associated-items.md)组"
"成，关联项分为三类："

#: src/items/traits.md:173
msgid "[functions](associated-items.md#associated-functions-and-methods)"
msgstr "[函数](associated-items.md#associated-functions-and-methods)"

#: src/items/traits.md:174
msgid "[types](associated-items.md#associated-types)"
msgstr "[类型](associated-items.md#associated-types)"

#: src/items/traits.md:175
msgid "[constants](associated-items.md#associated-constants)"
msgstr "[常量](associated-items.md#associated-constants)"

#: src/items/traits.md:181
msgid ""
"The trait declaration defines a trait in the [type namespace](../names/"
"namespaces.md) of the module or block where it is located."
msgstr ""
"trait 声明会在其所在模块或块的[类型命名空间](../names/namespaces.md)中定义一"
"个 trait。"

#: src/items/traits.md:187
msgid ""
"Associated items are defined as members of the trait within their respective "
"namespaces. Associated types are defined in the type namespace. Associated "
"constants and associated functions are defined in the value namespace."
msgstr ""
"关联项在各自的命名空间中定义为 trait 的成员。关联类型在类型命名空间中定义。关"
"联常量和关联函数在值命名空间中定义。"

#: src/items/traits.md:193
msgid ""
"All traits define an implicit type parameter `Self` that refers to \"the "
"type that is implementing this interface\". Traits may also contain "
"additional type parameters. These type parameters, including `Self`, may be "
"constrained by other traits and so forth [as usual](generics.md)."
msgstr ""
"所有 trait 都定义一个隐式类型参数 `Self`，它指代“正在实现此接口的类型”。"
"trait 也可以包含额外的类型参数。这些类型参数（包括 `Self`）可以[像通常那样]"
"(generics.md)受其他 trait 等约束。"

#: src/items/traits.md:199
msgid ""
"Traits are implemented for specific types through separate [implementations]"
"(implementations.md)."
msgstr "trait 通过单独的[实现](implementations.md)为特定类型实现。"

#: src/items/traits.md:205
msgid ""
"Trait functions may omit the function body by replacing it with a semicolon. "
"This indicates that the implementation must define the function. If the "
"trait function defines a body, this definition acts as a default for any "
"implementation which does not override it. Similarly, associated constants "
"may omit the equal sign and expression to indicate implementations must "
"define the constant value. Associated types must never define the type, the "
"type may only be specified in an implementation."
msgstr ""
"trait 函数可以通过用分号替代函数体来省略函数体。这表示实现必须定义该函数。如"
"果 trait 函数定义了函数体，则该定义会作为任何未覆盖它的实现的默认定义。类似"
"地，关联常量可以省略等号和表达式，以表示实现必须定义该常量值。关联类型绝不能"
"定义类型；类型只能在实现中指定。"

#: src/items/traits.md:208
msgid "// Examples of associated trait items with and without definitions.\n"
msgstr "// 带定义和不带定义的关联 trait 项示例。\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:222
msgid ""
"Trait functions are not allowed to be [`const`](functions.md#const-"
"functions)."
msgstr "trait 函数不得是 [`const`](functions.md#const-functions)。"

#: src/items/traits.md:228
msgid "Trait bounds"
msgstr "trait 约束"

#: src/items/traits.md:230
msgid ""
"Generic items may use traits as [bounds](../trait-bounds.md) on their type "
"parameters."
msgstr "泛型项可以将 trait 用作其类型参数上的[约束](../trait-bounds.md)。"

#: src/items/traits.md:236
msgid "Generic traits"
msgstr "泛型 trait"

#: src/items/traits.md:238
msgid ""
"Type parameters can be specified for a trait to make it generic. These "
"appear after the trait name, using the same syntax used in [generic "
"functions](functions.md#generic-functions)."
msgstr ""
"可以为 trait 指定类型参数，使其成为泛型。它们出现在 trait 名称之后，使用与[泛"
"型函数](functions.md#generic-functions)相同的语法。"

#: src/items/traits.md:248
msgid "<a id=\"object-safety\"></a>"
msgstr "<a id=\"object-safety\"></a>"

#: src/items/traits.md:253
msgid "Dyn compatibility"
msgstr "dyn 兼容性"

#: src/items/traits.md:259
msgid ""
"A dyn-compatible trait can be the base trait of a [trait object](../types/"
"trait-object.md). A trait is _dyn compatible_ if it has the following "
"qualities:"
msgstr ""
"dyn 兼容 trait 可以作为 [trait 对象](../types/trait-object.md)的基础 trait。"
"如果 trait 具有以下性质，则它是 _dyn 兼容_ 的："

#: src/items/traits.md:265
msgid "All [supertraits](#supertraits) must also be dyn compatible."
msgstr "所有 [supertrait](#supertraits) 也必须是 dyn 兼容的。"

#: src/items/traits.md:271
msgid ""
"`Sized` must not be a [supertrait](#supertraits). In other words, it must "
"not require `Self: Sized`."
msgstr ""
"`Sized` 不得是 [supertrait](#supertraits)。换言之，它不得要求 `Self: Sized`。"

#: src/items/traits.md:277
msgid "It must not have any associated constants."
msgstr "它不得有任何关联常量。"

#: src/items/traits.md:283
msgid "It must not have any associated types with generics."
msgstr "它不得有任何带泛型的关联类型。"

#: src/items/traits.md:289
msgid ""
"All associated functions must either be dispatchable from a trait object or "
"be explicitly non-dispatchable:"
msgstr "所有关联函数必须要么可从 trait 对象分派，要么显式不可分派："

#: src/items/traits.md:290
msgid "Dispatchable functions must:"
msgstr "可分派函数必须："

#: src/items/traits.md:291
msgid ""
"Not have any type parameters (although lifetime parameters are allowed)."
msgstr "没有任何类型参数（但允许生命周期参数）。"

#: src/items/traits.md:292
msgid ""
"Be a [method](associated-items.md#methods) that does not use `Self` except "
"in the type of the receiver."
msgstr ""
"是一个[方法](associated-items.md#methods)，并且除了在接收者类型中之外不使用 "
"`Self`。"

#: src/items/traits.md:293
msgid "Have a receiver with one of the following types:"
msgstr "具有以下类型之一的接收者："

#: src/items/traits.md:294
msgid "`&Self` (i.e. `&self`)"
msgstr "`&Self`（即 `&self`）"

#: src/items/traits.md:295
msgid "`&mut Self` (i.e `&mut self`)"
msgstr "`&mut Self`（即 `&mut self`）"

#: src/items/traits.md:296
msgid "[`Box<Self>`](../special-types-and-traits.md#boxt)"
msgstr "[`Box<Self>`](../special-types-and-traits.md#boxt)"

#: src/items/traits.md:297
msgid "[`Rc<Self>`](../special-types-and-traits.md#rct)"
msgstr "[`Rc<Self>`](../special-types-and-traits.md#rct)"

#: src/items/traits.md:298
msgid "[`Arc<Self>`](../special-types-and-traits.md#arct)"
msgstr "[`Arc<Self>`](../special-types-and-traits.md#arct)"

#: src/items/traits.md:299
msgid ""
"[`Pin<P>`](../special-types-and-traits.md#pinp) where `P` is one of the "
"types above"
msgstr ""
"[`Pin<P>`](../special-types-and-traits.md#pinp)，其中 `P` 是上述类型之一"

#: src/items/traits.md:300
msgid "Not have an opaque return type; that is,"
msgstr "没有不透明返回类型；也就是说，"

#: src/items/traits.md:301
msgid "Not be an `async fn` (which has a hidden `Future` type)."
msgstr "不是 `async fn`（它有隐藏的 `Future` 类型）。"

#: src/items/traits.md:302
msgid ""
"Not have a return position `impl Trait` type (`fn example(&self) -> impl "
"Trait`)."
msgstr "没有返回位置 `impl Trait` 类型（`fn example(&self) -> impl Trait`）。"

#: src/items/traits.md:303
msgid ""
"Not have a `where Self: Sized` bound (receiver type of `Self` (i.e. `self`) "
"implies this)."
msgstr ""
"没有 `where Self: Sized` 约束（类型为 `Self` 的接收者（即 `self`）会隐含此约"
"束）。"

#: src/items/traits.md:304
msgid "Explicitly non-dispatchable functions require:"
msgstr "显式不可分派函数要求："

#: src/items/traits.md:305
msgid ""
"Have a `where Self: Sized` bound (receiver type of `Self` (i.e. `self`) "
"implies this)."
msgstr ""
"具有 `where Self: Sized` 约束（类型为 `Self` 的接收者（即 `self`）会隐含此约"
"束）。"

#: src/items/traits.md:311
msgid ""
"The [`AsyncFn`](../../core/ops/async_function/trait.AsyncFn.html), "
"[`AsyncFnMut`](../../core/ops/async_function/trait.AsyncFnMut.html), and "
"[`AsyncFnOnce`](../../core/ops/async_function/trait.AsyncFnOnce.html) traits "
"are not dyn-compatible."
msgstr ""
"[`AsyncFn`](../../core/ops/async_function/trait.AsyncFn.html)、[`AsyncFnMut`]"
"(../../core/ops/async_function/trait.AsyncFnMut.html) 和 [`AsyncFnOnce`]"
"(../../core/ops/async_function/trait.AsyncFnOnce.html) trait 不是 dyn 兼容"
"的。"

#: src/items/traits.md:317
msgid "This concept was formerly known as _object safety_."
msgstr "此概念以前称为 _object safety_。"

#: src/items/traits.md:325
msgid "// Examples of dyn compatible methods.\n"
msgstr "// dyn 兼容方法示例。\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:343
msgid ""
"// This trait is dyn compatible, but these methods cannot be dispatched on a "
"trait object.\n"
msgstr "// 此 trait 是 dyn 兼容的，但这些方法不能在 trait 对象上分派。\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:345
msgid "// Non-methods cannot be dispatched.\n"
msgstr "// 非方法不能分派。\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:347
msgid "// Self type isn't known until runtime.\n"
msgstr "// Self 类型直到运行时才可知。\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:349
msgid "// `other` may be a different concrete type of the receiver.\n"
msgstr "// `other` 可能是与接收者不同的具体类型。\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:351
msgid "// Generics are not compatible with vtables.\n"
msgstr "// 泛型与 vtable 不兼容。\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:360
msgid "// ERROR: cannot call with Self return\n"
msgstr "// 错误：不能以 Self 作为返回类型调用\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:361
msgid "// ERROR: cannot call with Self parameter\n"
msgstr "// 错误：不能以 Self 作为参数调用\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:362
msgid "// ERROR: cannot call with generic type\n"
msgstr "// 错误：不能以泛型类型调用\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:366
msgid "// Examples of dyn-incompatible traits.\n"
msgstr "// dyn 不兼容 trait 示例。\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:369
msgid "// ERROR: cannot have associated const\n"
msgstr "// 错误：不能有关联 const\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:371
msgid "// ERROR: associated function without Sized\n"
msgstr "// 错误：没有 Sized 的关联函数\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:372
msgid "// ERROR: Self in return type\n"
msgstr "// 错误：返回类型中有 Self\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:373
msgid "// ERROR: has generic type parameters\n"
msgstr "// 错误：具有泛型类型参数\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:374
msgid "// ERROR: nested receiver cannot be dispatched on\n"
msgstr "// 错误：不能在嵌套接收者上分派\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:385
msgid "// `Self: Sized` traits are dyn-incompatible.\n"
msgstr "// `Self: Sized` trait 是 dyn 不兼容的。\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:394
msgid "// Dyn-incompatible if `Self` is a type argument.\n"
msgstr "// 如果 `Self` 是类型实参，则 dyn 不兼容。\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:401
msgid "// ERROR: cannot use `Self` type parameter\n"
msgstr "// 错误：不能使用 `Self` 类型参数\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:408
msgid "Supertraits"
msgstr "Supertrait"

#: src/items/traits.md:414
msgid ""
"**Supertraits** are traits that are required to be implemented for a type to "
"implement a specific trait. Furthermore, anywhere a [generic](generics.md) "
"or [trait object](../types/trait-object.md) is bounded by a trait, it has "
"access to the associated items of its supertraits."
msgstr ""
"**Supertrait** 是为使某个类型实现特定 trait 而要求该类型必须实现的 trait。此"
"外，在任何由某个 trait 约束的[泛型](generics.md)或 [trait 对象](../types/"
"trait-object.md)处，都可以访问该 trait 的 supertrait 的关联项。"

#: src/items/traits.md:420
msgid ""
"Supertraits are declared by trait bounds on the `Self` type of a trait and "
"transitively the supertraits of the traits declared in those trait bounds. "
"It is an error for a trait to be its own supertrait."
msgstr ""
"Supertrait 通过 trait 的 `Self` 类型上的 trait 约束声明，并且还传递地包括这"
"些 trait 约束中所声明 trait 的 supertrait。trait 不能成为它自己的 "
"supertrait，否则是错误。"

#: src/items/traits.md:426
msgid "The trait with a supertrait is called a **subtrait** of its supertrait."
msgstr "带有 supertrait 的 trait 称为其 supertrait 的 **subtrait**。"

#: src/items/traits.md:428
msgid ""
"The following is an example of declaring `Shape` to be a supertrait of "
"`Circle`."
msgstr "下面的示例将 `Shape` 声明为 `Circle` 的 supertrait。"

#: src/items/traits.md:435
msgid ""
"And the following is the same example, except using [where clauses]"
"(generics.md#where-clauses)."
msgstr "下面是相同示例，不过使用 [where 子句](generics.md#where-clauses)。"

#: src/items/traits.md:442
msgid ""
"This next example gives `radius` a default implementation using the `area` "
"function from `Shape`."
msgstr "下一个示例使用来自 `Shape` 的 `area` 函数为 `radius` 提供默认实现。"

#: src/items/traits.md:448
msgid ""
"// A = pi * r^2\n"
"        // so algebraically,\n"
"        // r = sqrt(A / pi)\n"
msgstr ""
"// A = pi * r^2\n"
"        // 因此按代数变换，\n"
"        // r = sqrt(A / pi)\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:456
msgid "This next example calls a supertrait method on a generic parameter."
msgstr "下一个示例在泛型参数上调用 supertrait 方法。"

#: src/items/traits.md:462
msgid ""
"// Here we call the area method from the supertrait `Shape` of `Circle`.\n"
msgstr "// 这里调用 `Circle` 的 supertrait `Shape` 中的 area 方法。\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:463
msgid "\"Area: {}\""
msgstr "\"Area: {}\""

#: src/items/traits.md:464
msgid "\"Radius: {}\""
msgstr "\"Radius: {}\""

#: src/items/traits.md:468
msgid ""
"Similarly, here is an example of calling supertrait methods on trait objects."
msgstr "类似地，这里是一个在 trait 对象上调用 supertrait 方法的示例。"

#: src/items/traits.md:485
msgid "Unsafe traits"
msgstr "Unsafe trait"

#: src/items/traits.md:491
msgid ""
"Traits items that begin with the `unsafe` keyword indicate that "
"_implementing_ the trait may be [unsafe](../unsafety.md). It is safe to use "
"a correctly implemented unsafe trait. The [trait implementation]"
"(implementations.md#trait-implementations) must also begin with the `unsafe` "
"keyword."
msgstr ""
"以 `unsafe` 关键字开头的 trait 项表示_实现_该 trait 可能是[不安全](../"
"unsafety.md)的。使用正确实现的 unsafe trait 是安全的。[trait 实现]"
"(implementations.md#trait-implementations)也必须以 `unsafe` 关键字开头。"

#: src/items/traits.md:493
msgid ""
"[`Sync`](../special-types-and-traits.md#sync) and [`Send`](../special-types-"
"and-traits.md#send) are examples of unsafe traits."
msgstr ""
"[`Sync`](../special-types-and-traits.md#sync) 和 [`Send`](../special-types-"
"and-traits.md#send) 是 unsafe trait 的示例。"

#: src/items/traits.md:499
msgid "Parameter patterns"
msgstr "参数模式"

#: src/items/traits.md:505
msgid ""
"Parameters in associated functions without a body only allow [IDENTIFIER](../"
"identifiers.md#grammar-IDENTIFIER) or `_` [wild card](../"
"patterns.md#wildcard-pattern) patterns, as well as the form allowed by "
"[SelfParam](functions.md#grammar-SelfParam). `mut` [IDENTIFIER](../"
"identifiers.md#grammar-IDENTIFIER) is currently allowed, but it is "
"deprecated and will become a hard error in the future."
msgstr ""
"没有函数体的关联函数中的参数只允许 [IDENTIFIER](../identifiers.md#grammar-"
"IDENTIFIER) 或 `_` [通配符](../patterns.md#wildcard-pattern)模式，以及 "
"[SelfParam](functions.md#grammar-SelfParam) 所允许的形式。当前允许 `mut` "
"[IDENTIFIER](../identifiers.md#grammar-IDENTIFIER)，但它已弃用，并将在未来成"
"为硬错误。"

#: src/items/traits.md:517
msgid "// ERROR: patterns aren't allowed in functions without bodies\n"
msgstr "// 错误：无函数体的函数中不允许使用模式\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:525
msgid ""
"Parameters in associated functions with a body only allow irrefutable "
"patterns."
msgstr "带有函数体的关联函数中的参数只允许不可反驳模式。"

#: src/items/traits.md:529
msgid "// OK: is irrefutable\n"
msgstr "// OK：不可反驳\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:535 src/items/traits.md:536
msgid "// ERROR: pattern is refutable\n"
msgstr "// 错误：模式可反驳\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:548
msgid ""
"Prior to the 2018 edition, the pattern for an associated function parameter "
"is optional:"
msgstr "在 2018 edition 之前，关联函数参数的模式是可选的："

#: src/items/traits.md:551 src/items/traits.md:579 src/paths.md:1277
msgid "// 2015 Edition\n"
msgstr "// 2015 Edition\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:553
msgid "// OK: parameter identifiers are not required\n"
msgstr "// OK：不要求参数标识符\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:557
msgid "Beginning in the 2018 edition, patterns are no longer optional."
msgstr "从 2018 edition 开始，模式不再是可选的。"

#: src/items/traits.md:570
msgid ""
"Prior to the 2018 edition, parameters in associated functions with a body "
"are limited to the following kinds of patterns:"
msgstr ""
"在 2018 edition 之前，带有函数体的关联函数中的参数仅限于以下种类的模式："

#: src/items/traits.md:572
msgid "[IDENTIFIER](../identifiers.md#grammar-IDENTIFIER)"
msgstr "[IDENTIFIER](../identifiers.md#grammar-IDENTIFIER)"

#: src/items/traits.md:573
msgid "`mut` [IDENTIFIER](../identifiers.md#grammar-IDENTIFIER)"
msgstr "`mut` [IDENTIFIER](../identifiers.md#grammar-IDENTIFIER)"

#: src/items/traits.md:574
msgid "[`_`](../patterns.md#wildcard-pattern)"
msgstr "[`_`](../patterns.md#wildcard-pattern)"

#: src/items/traits.md:575
msgid "`&` [IDENTIFIER](../identifiers.md#grammar-IDENTIFIER)"
msgstr "`&` [IDENTIFIER](../identifiers.md#grammar-IDENTIFIER)"

#: src/items/traits.md:576
msgid "`&&` [IDENTIFIER](../identifiers.md#grammar-IDENTIFIER)"
msgstr "`&&` [IDENTIFIER](../identifiers.md#grammar-IDENTIFIER)"

#: src/items/traits.md:581
msgid "// ERROR: pattern not allowed\n"
msgstr "// 错误：不允许使用模式\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:585
msgid ""
"Beginning in 2018, all irrefutable patterns are allowed as described in "
"[items.traits.params.patterns-with-body](traits.md#r-"
"items.traits.params.patterns-with-body)."
msgstr ""
"从 2018 开始，允许 [items.traits.params.patterns-with-body](traits.md#r-"
"items.traits.params.patterns-with-body) 中所述的所有不可反驳模式。"

#: src/items/traits.md:594
msgid "Item visibility"
msgstr "项可见性"

#: src/items/traits.md:600
msgid ""
"Trait items syntactically allow a [Visibility](../visibility-and-"
"privacy.md#grammar-Visibility) annotation, but this is rejected when the "
"trait is validated. This allows items to be parsed with a unified syntax "
"across different contexts where they are used. As an example, an empty `vis` "
"macro fragment specifier can be used for trait items, where the macro rule "
"may be used in other situations where visibility is allowed."
msgstr ""
"trait 项在语法上允许使用 [Visibility](../visibility-and-privacy.md#grammar-"
"Visibility) 注解，但在验证 trait 时会拒绝这种注解。这允许在不同使用上下文中用"
"统一语法解析项。例如，可以对 trait 项使用空的 `vis` 宏片段说明符，而该宏规则"
"还可以用于其他允许可见性的场景。"

#: src/items/traits.md:617
msgid "// Visibility is allowed here.\n"
msgstr "// 这里允许可见性。\n"

