#: src/items/implementations.md:323
msgid ""
"An _implementation_ is an item that associates items with an _implementing "
"type_. Implementations are defined with the keyword `impl` and contain "
"functions that belong to an instance of the type that is being implemented "
"or to the type statically."
msgstr ""
"_实现_是将项与_实现类型_关联起来的项。实现使用关键字 `impl` 定义，并包含属于"
"被实现类型的某个实例或静态属于该类型的函数。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:329
msgid "There are two types of implementations:"
msgstr "实现分为两类："

#: src/items/implementations.md:331
msgid "inherent implementations"
msgstr "固有实现"

#: src/items/implementations.md:332
msgid "[trait](traits.md) implementations"
msgstr "[trait](traits.md) 实现"

#: src/items/implementations.md:338
msgid "Inherent implementations"
msgstr "固有实现"

#: src/items/implementations.md:344
msgid ""
"An inherent implementation is defined as the sequence of the `impl` keyword, "
"generic type declarations, a path to a nominal type, a where clause, and a "
"bracketed set of associable items."
msgstr ""
"固有实现被定义为依次由 `impl` 关键字、泛型类型声明、到名义类型的路径、where "
"子句以及一组用花括号括起的可关联项组成。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:350
msgid ""
"The nominal type is called the _implementing type_ and the associable items "
"are the _associated items_ to the implementing type."
msgstr "该名义类型称为_实现类型_，可关联项是该实现类型的_关联项_。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:356
msgid ""
"Inherent implementations associate the contained items to the implementing "
"type."
msgstr "固有实现将所包含的项关联到实现类型。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:362
msgid ""
"Inherent implementations can contain [associated functions](associated-"
"items.md#associated-functions-and-methods) (including [methods](associated-"
"items.md#methods)) and [associated constants](associated-items.md#associated-"
"constants)."
msgstr ""
"固有实现可以包含[关联函数](associated-items.md#associated-functions-and-"
"methods)（包括[方法](associated-items.md#methods)）和[关联常量](associated-"
"items.md#associated-constants)。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:368
msgid "They cannot contain associated type aliases."
msgstr "它们不能包含关联类型别名。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:374
msgid ""
"The [path](../paths.md) to an associated item is any path to the "
"implementing type, followed by the associated item's identifier as the final "
"path component."
msgstr ""
"到关联项的[路径](../paths.md)是到实现类型的任意路径，后跟作为最终路径组件的关"
"联项标识符。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:380
msgid ""
"A type can also have multiple inherent implementations. An implementing type "
"must be defined within the same crate as the original type definition."
msgstr ""
"一个类型也可以有多个固有实现。实现类型必须与原始类型定义在同一 crate 内定义。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:402
msgid "// Actual path to the implementing type and impl in the same module.\n"
msgstr "// 到同一模块中实现类型和 impl 的实际路径。\n"

#: src/items/implementations.md:405
msgid ""
"// Impl blocks in different modules are still accessed through a path to the "
"type.\n"
msgstr "// 不同模块中的 impl 块仍然通过到该类型的路径访问。\n"

#: src/items/implementations.md:408
msgid "// Re-exported paths to the implementing type also work.\n"
msgstr "// 到实现类型的重导出路径也可用。\n"

#: src/items/implementations.md:411
msgid ""
"// Does not work, because use in `values` is not pub.\n"
"    // values::Color::red();\n"
msgstr ""
"// 不工作，因为 `values` 中的 use 不是 pub。\n"
"    // values::Color::red();\n"

#: src/items/implementations.md:420
msgid "Trait implementations"
msgstr "trait 实现"

#: src/items/implementations.md:426
msgid ""
"A _trait implementation_ is defined like an inherent implementation except "
"that the optional generic type declarations are followed by a [trait]"
"(traits.md), followed by the keyword `for`, followed by a path to a nominal "
"type."
msgstr ""
"_trait 实现_的定义方式类似于固有实现，不同之处在于可选的泛型类型声明后面跟着"
"一个 [trait](traits.md)，再跟关键字 `for`，再跟到名义类型的路径。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:434
msgid ""
"The trait is known as the _implemented trait_. The implementing type "
"implements the implemented trait."
msgstr "该 trait 称为_被实现 trait_。实现类型实现该被实现 trait。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:440
msgid ""
"A trait implementation must define all non-default associated items declared "
"by the implemented trait, may redefine default associated items defined by "
"the implemented trait, and cannot define any other items."
msgstr ""
"trait 实现必须定义由被实现 trait 声明的所有非默认关联项，可以重新定义由被实"
"现 trait 定义的默认关联项，并且不能定义任何其他项。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:446
msgid ""
"The path to the associated items is `<` followed by a path to the "
"implementing type followed by `as` followed by a path to the trait followed "
"by `>` as a path component followed by the associated item's path component."
msgstr ""
"到关联项的路径是 `<`，后跟到实现类型的路径，再跟 `as`，再跟到 trait 的路径，"
"再跟作为路径组件的 `>`，最后跟关联项的路径组件。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:452
msgid ""
"[Unsafe traits](traits.md#unsafe-traits) require the trait implementation to "
"begin with the `unsafe` keyword."
msgstr ""
"[Unsafe traits](traits.md#unsafe-traits) 要求 trait 实现以 `unsafe` 关键字开"
"头。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:490
msgid "Trait implementation coherence"
msgstr "trait 实现一致性"

#: src/items/implementations.md:496
msgid ""
"A trait implementation is considered incoherent if either the orphan rules "
"check fails or there are overlapping implementation instances."
msgstr ""
"如果孤儿规则检查失败，或者存在重叠的实现实例，则认为 trait 实现是不一致的。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:502
msgid ""
"Two trait implementations overlap when there is a non-empty intersection of "
"the traits the implementation is for, the implementations can be "
"instantiated with the same type. <!-- This is probably wrong? Source: No two "
"implementations can be instantiable with the same set of types for the input "
"type parameters. -->"
msgstr ""
"当两个 trait 实现所针对的 trait 存在非空交集，并且这些实现可以用同一类型实例"
"化时，这两个 trait 实现重叠。 <!-- This is probably wrong? Source: No two "
"implementations can be instantiable with the same set of types for the input "
"type parameters. -->"

#: src/items/implementations.md:508
msgid "Orphan rules"
msgstr "孤儿规则"

#: src/items/implementations.md:514
msgid ""
"The _orphan rule_ states that a trait implementation is only allowed if "
"either the trait or at least one of the types in the implementation is "
"defined in the current crate. It prevents conflicting trait implementations "
"across different crates and is key to ensuring coherence."
msgstr ""
"_孤儿规则_规定，只有当 trait 或实现中的至少一个类型在当前 crate 中定义时，才"
"允许 trait 实现。它可以防止不同 crate 之间发生冲突的 trait 实现，是确保一致性"
"的关键。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:516
msgid ""
"An orphan implementation is one that implements a foreign trait for a "
"foreign type. If these were freely allowed, two crates could implement the "
"same trait for the same type in incompatible ways, creating a situation "
"where adding or updating a dependency could break compilation due to "
"conflicting implementations."
msgstr ""
"孤儿实现是指为外部类型实现外部 trait 的实现。如果自由允许这些实现，两个 "
"crate 就可以用不兼容的方式为同一类型实现同一 trait，从而造成这样一种情况：添"
"加或更新依赖可能因实现冲突而破坏编译。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:518
msgid ""
"The orphan rule enables library authors to add new implementations to their "
"traits without fear that they'll break downstream code. Without these "
"restrictions, a library couldn't add an implementation like `impl<T: "
"Display> MyTrait for T` without potentially conflicting with downstream "
"implementations."
msgstr ""
"孤儿规则使库作者能够向自己的 trait 添加新实现，而不必担心破坏下游代码。没有这"
"些限制，库就无法添加像 `impl<T: Display> MyTrait for T` 这样的实现，因为它可"
"能与下游实现冲突。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:524
msgid ""
"Given `impl<P1..=Pn> Trait<T1..=Tn> for T0`, an `impl` is valid only if at "
"least one of the following is true:"
msgstr ""
"给定 `impl<P1..=Pn> Trait<T1..=Tn> for T0`，只有至少满足以下条件之一时，"
"`impl` 才有效："

#: src/items/implementations.md:526
msgid "`Trait` is a [local trait](../glossary.md#local-trait)"
msgstr "`Trait` 是[本地 trait](../glossary.md#local-trait)"

#: src/items/implementations.md:527
msgid "All of"
msgstr "全部满足"

#: src/items/implementations.md:528
msgid ""
"At least one of the types `T0..=Tn` must be a [local type](../"
"glossary.md#local-type). Let `Ti` be the first such type."
msgstr ""
"类型 `T0..=Tn` 中必须至少有一个是[本地类型](../glossary.md#local-type)。令 "
"`Ti` 为第一个这样的类型。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:529
msgid ""
"No [uncovered type](../glossary.md#uncovered-type) parameters `P1..=Pn` may "
"appear in `T0..Ti` (excluding `Ti`)"
msgstr ""
"不得有[未覆盖类型](../glossary.md#uncovered-type)参数 `P1..=Pn` 出现在 "
"`T0..Ti` 中（不包括 `Ti`）"

#: src/items/implementations.md:535
msgid "Only the appearance of _uncovered_ type parameters is restricted."
msgstr "只限制_未覆盖_类型参数的出现。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:541
msgid ""
"Note that for the purposes of coherence, [fundamental types](../"
"glossary.md#fundamental-type-constructors) are special. The `T` in `Box<T>` "
"is not considered covered, and `Box<LocalType>` is considered local."
msgstr ""
"注意，出于一致性的目的，[基本类型](../glossary.md#fundamental-type-"
"constructors)是特殊的。`Box<T>` 中的 `T` 不被视为已覆盖，而 `Box<LocalType>` "
"被视为本地的。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:547
msgid "Generic implementations"
msgstr "泛型实现"

#: src/items/implementations.md:553
msgid ""
"An implementation can take [generic parameters](generics.md), which can be "
"used in the rest of the implementation. Implementation parameters are "
"written directly after the `impl` keyword."
msgstr ""
"实现可以接受[泛型参数](generics.md)，这些参数可以在实现的其余部分中使用。实现"
"参数直接写在 `impl` 关键字之后。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:561
msgid "/* Treat the integer as a sequence of bits */"
msgstr "/* 将整数视为位序列 */"

#: src/items/implementations.md:569
msgid ""
"Generic parameters _constrain_ an implementation if the parameter appears at "
"least once in one of:"
msgstr "如果参数至少在以下任一位置出现一次，则泛型参数_约束_一个实现："

#: src/items/implementations.md:571
msgid "The implemented trait, if it has one"
msgstr "被实现的 trait（如果有）"

#: src/items/implementations.md:572
msgid "The implementing type"
msgstr "实现类型"

#: src/items/implementations.md:573
msgid ""
"As an [associated type](associated-items.md#associated-types) in the [bounds]"
"(../trait-bounds.md) of a type that contains another parameter that "
"constrains the implementation"
msgstr ""
"作为某个类型的[约束](../trait-bounds.md)中的[关联类型](associated-"
"items.md#associated-types)，且该类型包含另一个约束该实现的参数"

#: src/items/implementations.md:579
msgid ""
"Type and const parameters must always constrain the implementation. "
"Lifetimes must constrain the implementation if the lifetime is used in an "
"associated type."
msgstr ""
"类型参数和 const 参数必须始终约束该实现。如果生命周期用于关联类型中，则生命周"
"期必须约束该实现。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:581
msgid "Examples of constraining situations:"
msgstr "约束情况示例："

#: src/items/implementations.md:589
msgid "// T constrains by being an argument to GenericTrait.\n"
msgstr "// T 通过作为 GenericTrait 的实参来形成约束。\n"

#: src/items/implementations.md:592
msgid "// T constrains by being an argument to GenericStruct\n"
msgstr "// T 通过作为 GenericStruct 的实参来形成约束\n"

#: src/items/implementations.md:595
msgid "// Likewise, N constrains by being an argument to ConstGenericStruct\n"
msgstr "// 同样，N 通过作为 ConstGenericStruct 的实参来形成约束\n"

#: src/items/implementations.md:598
msgid ""
"// T constrains by being in an associated type in a bound for type `U` which "
"is\n"
"// itself a generic parameter constraining the trait.\n"
msgstr ""
"// T 通过位于类型 `U` 的约束中的关联类型内来形成约束，而 `U`\n"
"// 本身是约束该 trait 的泛型参数。\n"

#: src/items/implementations.md:602
msgid ""
"// Like previous, except the type is `(U, isize)`. `U` appears inside the "
"type\n"
"// that includes `T`, and is not the type itself.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 与前例类似，但该类型是 `(U, isize)`。`U` 出现在包含 `T` 的类型内部，\n"
"// 而不是该类型本身。\n"

#: src/items/implementations.md:608
msgid "Examples of non-constraining situations:"
msgstr "非约束情况示例："

#: src/items/implementations.md:611
msgid ""
"// The rest of these are errors, since they have type or const parameters "
"that\n"
"// do not constrain.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 其余这些都是错误，因为它们有未形成约束的类型参数或\n"
"// const 参数。\n"

#: src/items/implementations.md:613
msgid "// T does not constrain since it does not appear at all.\n"
msgstr "// T 不形成约束，因为它完全没有出现。\n"

#: src/items/implementations.md:616
msgid "// N does not constrain for the same reason.\n"
msgstr "// N 因同样原因不形成约束。\n"

#: src/items/implementations.md:619
msgid "// Usage of T inside the implementation does not constrain the impl.\n"
msgstr "// 在实现内部使用 T 不会约束该 impl。\n"

#: src/items/implementations.md:624
msgid ""
"// T is used as an associated type in the bounds for U, but U does not "
"constrain.\n"
msgstr "// T 被用作 U 的约束中的关联类型，但 U 不形成约束。\n"

#: src/items/implementations.md:627
msgid ""
"// T is used in the bounds, but not as an associated type, so it does not "
"constrain.\n"
msgstr "// T 用在约束中，但不是作为关联类型使用，因此它不形成约束。\n"

#: src/items/implementations.md:632
msgid "Example of an allowed unconstraining lifetime parameter:"
msgstr "允许的不形成约束的生命周期参数示例："

#: src/items/implementations.md:639
msgid "Example of a disallowed unconstraining lifetime parameter:"
msgstr "不允许的不形成约束的生命周期参数示例："

#: src/items/implementations.md:653
msgid "Attributes on implementations"
msgstr "实现上的属性"

#: src/items/implementations.md:655
msgid ""
"Implementations may contain outer [attributes](../attributes.md) before the "
"`impl` keyword and inner [attributes](../attributes.md) inside the brackets "
"that contain the associated items. Inner attributes must come before any "
"associated items. The attributes that have meaning here are [`cfg`](../"
"conditional-compilation.md), [`deprecated`](../attributes/diagnostics.md#the-"
"deprecated-attribute), [`doc`](../../rustdoc/the-doc-attribute.html), and "
"[the lint check attributes](../attributes/diagnostics.md#lint-check-"
"attributes)."
msgstr ""
"实现可以在 `impl` 关键字之前包含外部[属性](../attributes.md)，并在包含关联项"
"的花括号内部包含内部[属性](../attributes.md)。内部属性必须位于任何关联项之"
"前。在此处有意义的属性是 [`cfg`](../conditional-compilation.md)、"
"[`deprecated`](../attributes/diagnostics.md#the-deprecated-attribute)、"
"[`doc`](../../rustdoc/the-doc-attribute.html) 和 [lint 检查属性](../"
"attributes/diagnostics.md#lint-check-attributes)。"

