#: src/items/external-blocks.md:209
msgid ""
"Starting with the 2024 Edition, the `unsafe` keyword is required "
"semantically."
msgstr "从 2024 Edition 开始，语义上要求使用 `unsafe` 关键字。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:215
msgid ""
"External blocks provide _declarations_ of items that are not _defined_ in "
"the current crate and are the basis of Rust's foreign function interface. "
"These are akin to unchecked imports."
msgstr ""
"外部块提供当前 crate 中未_定义_的项的_声明_，并且是 Rust 外部函数接口（FFI）"
"的基础。它们类似于未经检查的导入。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:221
msgid ""
"Two kinds of item _declarations_ are allowed in external blocks: [functions]"
"(functions.md) and [statics](static-items.md)."
msgstr ""
"外部块中允许两种项_声明_：[函数](functions.md)和[静态项](static-items.md)。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:227
msgid ""
"Calling unsafe functions or accessing unsafe statics that are declared in "
"external blocks is only allowed in an [`unsafe` context](../unsafe-"
"keyword.md)."
msgstr ""
"调用外部块中声明的 unsafe 函数，或访问其中声明的 unsafe 静态项，只允许在 "
"[`unsafe` 上下文](../unsafe-keyword.md)中进行。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:233
msgid ""
"The external block defines its functions and statics in the [value namespace]"
"(../names/namespaces.md) of the module or block where it is located."
msgstr ""
"外部块会在其所在模块或块的[值命名空间](../names/namespaces.md)中定义它的函数"
"和静态项。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:239
msgid ""
"The `unsafe` keyword is semantically required to appear before the `extern` "
"keyword on external blocks."
msgstr "对于外部块，语义上要求 `unsafe` 关键字出现在 `extern` 关键字之前。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:249
msgid ""
"Prior to the 2024 edition, the `unsafe` keyword is optional. The `safe` and "
"`unsafe` item qualifiers are only allowed if the external block itself is "
"marked as `unsafe`."
msgstr ""
"在 2024 edition 之前，`unsafe` 关键字是可选的。只有当外部块本身被标记为 "
"`unsafe` 时，才允许使用 `safe` 和 `unsafe` 项限定符。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:264
msgid ""
"Functions within external blocks are declared in the same way as other Rust "
"functions, with the exception that they must not have a body and are instead "
"terminated by a semicolon."
msgstr ""
"外部块中的函数以与其他 Rust 函数相同的方式声明，区别在于它们不得有函数体，而"
"是以分号结束。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:270
msgid ""
"Patterns are not allowed in parameters, only [IDENTIFIER](../"
"identifiers.md#grammar-IDENTIFIER) or `_` may be used."
msgstr ""
"参数中不允许使用模式，只可以使用 [IDENTIFIER](../identifiers.md#grammar-"
"IDENTIFIER) 或 `_`。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:276
msgid ""
"The `safe` and `unsafe` function qualifiers are allowed, but other function "
"qualifiers (e.g. `const`, `async`, `extern`) are not."
msgstr ""
"允许使用 `safe` 和 `unsafe` 函数限定符，但不允许使用其他函数限定符（例如 "
"`const`、`async`、`extern`）。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:282
msgid ""
"Functions within external blocks may be called by Rust code, just like "
"functions defined in Rust. The Rust compiler automatically translates "
"between the Rust ABI and the foreign ABI."
msgstr ""
"外部块中的函数可以由 Rust 代码调用，就像在 Rust 中定义的函数一样。Rust 编译器"
"会自动在 Rust ABI 与外部 ABI 之间转换。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:288
msgid ""
"A function declared in an extern block is implicitly `unsafe` unless the "
"`safe` function qualifier is present."
msgstr ""
"在 extern 块中声明的函数默认隐式为 `unsafe`，除非存在 `safe` 函数限定符。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:294
msgid ""
"When coerced to a function pointer, a function declared in an extern block "
"has type `for<'l1, ..., 'lm> extern \"abi\" fn(A1, ..., An) -> R`, where "
"`'l1`, ... `'lm` are its lifetime parameters, `A1`, ..., `An` are the "
"declared types of its parameters, and `R` is the declared return type."
msgstr ""
"当被强制转换为函数指针时，在 extern 块中声明的函数具有类型 `for<'l1, ..., "
"'lm> extern \"abi\" fn(A1, ..., An) -> R`，其中 `'l1`、...、`'lm` 是它的生命"
"周期参数，`A1`、...、`An` 是其参数的声明类型，`R` 是声明的返回类型。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:300
msgid "Statics"
msgstr "静态项"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:306
msgid ""
"Statics within external blocks are declared in the same way as [statics]"
"(static-items.md) outside of external blocks, except that they do not have "
"an expression initializing their value."
msgstr ""
"外部块中的静态项以与外部块之外的[静态项](static-items.md)相同的方式声明，但它"
"们没有用于初始化其值的表达式。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:312
msgid ""
"Unless a static item declared in an extern block is qualified as `safe`, it "
"is `unsafe` to access that item, whether or not it's mutable, because there "
"is nothing guaranteeing that the bit pattern at the static's memory is valid "
"for the type it is declared with, since some arbitrary (e.g. C) code is in "
"charge of initializing the static."
msgstr ""
"除非在 extern 块中声明的静态项被限定为 `safe`，否则访问该项就是 `unsafe`，无"
"论它是否可变；因为没有任何东西能保证该静态项内存中的位模式对其声明类型是有效"
"的，这是因为某些任意代码（例如 C 代码）负责初始化该静态项。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:318
msgid ""
"Extern statics can be either immutable or mutable just like [statics](static-"
"items.md) outside of external blocks."
msgstr ""
"extern 静态项可以是不可变的，也可以是可变的，就像外部块之外的[静态项](static-"
"items.md)一样。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:324
msgid ""
"An immutable static _must_ be initialized before any Rust code is executed. "
"It is not enough for the static to be initialized before Rust code reads "
"from it. Once Rust code runs, mutating an immutable static (from inside or "
"outside Rust) is UB, except if the mutation happens to bytes inside of an "
"`UnsafeCell`."
msgstr ""
"不可变静态项_必须_在任何 Rust 代码执行之前初始化。仅在 Rust 代码从该静态项读"
"取之前完成初始化是不够的。一旦 Rust 代码运行，修改不可变静态项（无论从 Rust "
"内部还是外部修改）都是 UB，除非修改发生在 `UnsafeCell` 内部的字节上。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:336
msgid ""
"The `extern` keyword can be followed by an optional [ABI](../glossary.md#r-"
"glossary.abi) string. The ABI specifies the calling convention of the "
"functions in the block. The calling convention defines a low-level interface "
"for functions, such as how arguments are placed in registers or on the "
"stack, how return values are passed, and who is responsible for cleaning up "
"the stack."
msgstr ""
"`extern` 关键字后可以跟一个可选的 [ABI](../glossary.md#r-glossary.abi) 字符"
"串。ABI 指定块中函数的调用约定。调用约定为函数定义低层接口，例如参数如何放入"
"寄存器或栈中、返回值如何传递，以及由谁负责清理栈。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:343
msgid "// Interface to the Windows API.\n"
msgstr "// Windows API 的接口。\n"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:344
msgid "\"system\""
msgstr "\"system\""

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:354
msgid "If the ABI string is not specified, it defaults to `\"C\"`."
msgstr "如果未指定 ABI 字符串，则默认为 `\"C\"`。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:360
msgid ""
"The `extern` syntax without an explicit ABI is being phased out, so it's "
"better to always write the ABI explicitly."
msgstr "不带显式 ABI 的 `extern` 语法正在逐步淘汰，因此最好始终显式写出 ABI。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:362
msgid ""
"For more details, see [Rust issue #134986](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/"
"issues/134986)."
msgstr ""
"更多细节见 [Rust issue #134986](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/issues/"
"134986)。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:371
msgid "The following ABI strings are supported on all platforms:"
msgstr "以下 ABI 字符串在所有平台上都受支持："

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:377
msgid ""
"`unsafe extern \"Rust\"` --- The native calling convention for Rust "
"functions and closures. This is the default when a function is declared "
"without using [`extern fn`](functions.md#r-items.fn.extern). The Rust ABI "
"offers no stability guarantees."
msgstr ""
"`unsafe extern \"Rust\"` --- Rust 函数和闭包的原生调用约定。当函数声明未使用 "
"[`extern fn`](functions.md#r-items.fn.extern) 时，这是默认值。Rust ABI 不提供"
"稳定性保证。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:383
msgid ""
"`unsafe extern \"C\"` --- The \"C\" ABI matches the default ABI chosen by "
"the dominant C compiler for the target."
msgstr ""
"`unsafe extern \"C\"` --- \"C\" ABI 与目标平台上主流 C 编译器所选择的默认 "
"ABI 匹配。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:389
msgid ""
"`unsafe extern \"system\"` --- This is equivalent to `extern \"C\"` except "
"on Windows x86_32 where it is equivalent to `\"stdcall\"` for non-variadic "
"functions, and equivalent to `\"C\"` for variadic functions."
msgstr ""
"`unsafe extern \"system\"` --- 这等价于 `extern \"C\"`，但在 Windows x86_32 "
"上例外：对于非变参函数，它等价于 `\"stdcall\"`；对于变参函数，它等价于 "
"`\"C\"`。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:395
msgid ""
"As the correct underlying ABI on Windows is target-specific, it's best to "
"use `extern \"system\"` when attempting to link Windows API functions that "
"don't use an explicitly defined ABI."
msgstr ""
"由于 Windows 上正确的底层 ABI 与目标相关，在尝试链接未使用显式定义 ABI 的 "
"Windows API 函数时，最好使用 `extern \"system\"`。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:404
msgid ""
"`extern \"C-unwind\"` and `extern \"system-unwind\"` --- Identical to "
"`\"C\"` and `\"system\"`, respectively, but with [different behavior]"
"(functions.md#unwinding) when the callee unwinds (by panicking or throwing a "
"C++ style exception)."
msgstr ""
"`extern \"C-unwind\"` 和 `extern \"system-unwind\"` --- 分别与 `\"C\"` 和 "
"`\"system\"` 相同，但当被调用方进行 unwind（通过 panic 或抛出 C++ 风格异常）"
"时具有[不同的行为](functions.md#unwinding)。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:410
msgid "There are also some platform-specific ABI strings:"
msgstr "还有一些平台特定的 ABI 字符串："

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:416
msgid ""
"`unsafe extern \"cdecl\"` --- The calling convention typically used with "
"x86_32 C code."
msgstr "`unsafe extern \"cdecl\"` --- x86_32 C 代码通常使用的调用约定。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:417 src/items/external-blocks.md:437
#: src/items/external-blocks.md:519 src/items/external-blocks.md:539
msgid "Only available on x86_32 targets."
msgstr "仅在 x86_32 目标上可用。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:418
msgid ""
"Corresponds to MSVC's `__cdecl` and GCC and clang's `__attribute__((cdecl))`."
msgstr ""
"对应于 MSVC 的 `__cdecl` 以及 GCC 和 clang 的 `__attribute__((cdecl))`。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:424 src/items/external-blocks.md:444
#: src/items/external-blocks.md:465 src/items/external-blocks.md:486
#: src/items/external-blocks.md:507 src/items/external-blocks.md:526
#: src/items/external-blocks.md:546
msgid "For details, see:"
msgstr "详情见："

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:426
msgid "<https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/cpp/cdecl>"
msgstr "<https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/cpp/cdecl>"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:427
msgid "<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/X86_calling_conventions#cdecl>"
msgstr "<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/X86_calling_conventions#cdecl>"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:436
msgid ""
"`unsafe extern \"stdcall\"` --- The calling convention typically used by the "
"[Win32 API](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/api/) on x86_32."
msgstr ""
"`unsafe extern \"stdcall\"` --- [Win32 API](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/windows/win32/api/) 在 x86_32 上通常使用的调用约定。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:438
msgid ""
"Corresponds to MSVC's `__stdcall` and GCC and clang's "
"`__attribute__((stdcall))`."
msgstr ""
"对应于 MSVC 的 `__stdcall` 以及 GCC 和 clang 的 `__attribute__((stdcall))`。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:446
msgid "<https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/cpp/stdcall>"
msgstr "<https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/cpp/stdcall>"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:447
msgid "<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/X86_calling_conventions#stdcall>"
msgstr "<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/X86_calling_conventions#stdcall>"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:456
msgid "`unsafe extern \"win64\"` --- The Windows x64 ABI."
msgstr "`unsafe extern \"win64\"` --- Windows x64 ABI。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:457 src/items/external-blocks.md:478
msgid "Only available on x86_64 targets."
msgstr "仅在 x86_64 目标上可用。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:458
msgid "\"win64\" is the same as the \"C\" ABI on Windows x86_64 targets."
msgstr "在 Windows x86_64 目标上，\"win64\" 与 \"C\" ABI 相同。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:459
msgid "Corresponds to GCC and clang's `__attribute__((ms_abi))`."
msgstr "对应于 GCC 和 clang 的 `__attribute__((ms_abi))`。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:467
msgid "<https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/build/x64-software-conventions>"
msgstr "<https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/build/x64-software-conventions>"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:468
msgid ""
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"X86_calling_conventions#Microsoft_x64_calling_convention>"
msgstr ""
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"X86_calling_conventions#Microsoft_x64_calling_convention>"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:477
msgid "`unsafe extern \"sysv64\"` --- The System V ABI."
msgstr "`unsafe extern \"sysv64\"` --- System V ABI。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:479
msgid "\"sysv64\" is the same as the \"C\" ABI on non-Windows x86_64 targets."
msgstr "在非 Windows x86_64 目标上，\"sysv64\" 与 \"C\" ABI 相同。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:480
msgid "Corresponds to GCC and clang's `__attribute__((sysv_abi))`."
msgstr "对应于 GCC 和 clang 的 `__attribute__((sysv_abi))`。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:488
msgid "<https://wiki.osdev.org/System_V_ABI>"
msgstr "<https://wiki.osdev.org/System_V_ABI>"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:489
msgid ""
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/X86_calling_conventions#System_V_AMD64_ABI>"
msgstr ""
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/X86_calling_conventions#System_V_AMD64_ABI>"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:498
msgid "`unsafe extern \"aapcs\"` --- The soft-float ABI for ARM."
msgstr "`unsafe extern \"aapcs\"` --- ARM 的软浮点 ABI。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:499
msgid "Only available on ARM32 targets."
msgstr "仅在 ARM32 目标上可用。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:500
msgid "\"aapcs\" is the same as the \"C\" ABI on soft-float ARM32."
msgstr "在软浮点 ARM32 上，\"aapcs\" 与 \"C\" ABI 相同。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:501
msgid "Corresponds to clang's `__attribute__((pcs(\"aapcs\")))`."
msgstr "对应于 clang 的 `__attribute__((pcs(\"aapcs\")))`。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:509
msgid ""
"[Arm Procedure Call Standard](https://developer.arm.com/documentation/"
"107656/0101/Getting-started-with-Armv8-M-based-systems/Procedure-Call-"
"Standard-for-Arm-Architecture--AAPCS-)"
msgstr ""
"[Arm Procedure Call Standard](https://developer.arm.com/documentation/"
"107656/0101/Getting-started-with-Armv8-M-based-systems/Procedure-Call-"
"Standard-for-Arm-Architecture--AAPCS-)"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:518
msgid ""
"`unsafe extern \"fastcall\"` --- A \"fast\" variant of stdcall that passes "
"some arguments in registers."
msgstr ""
"`unsafe extern \"fastcall\"` --- stdcall 的一种“快速”变体，会在寄存器中传递某"
"些参数。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:520
msgid ""
"Corresponds to MSVC's `__fastcall` and GCC and clang's "
"`__attribute__((fastcall))`."
msgstr ""
"对应于 MSVC 的 `__fastcall` 以及 GCC 和 clang 的 "
"`__attribute__((fastcall))`。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:528
msgid "<https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/cpp/fastcall>"
msgstr "<https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/cpp/fastcall>"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:529
msgid ""
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/X86_calling_conventions#Microsoft_fastcall>"
msgstr ""
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/X86_calling_conventions#Microsoft_fastcall>"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:538
msgid ""
"`unsafe extern \"thiscall\"` --- The calling convention typically used on C+"
"+ class member functions on x86_32 MSVC."
msgstr ""
"`unsafe extern \"thiscall\"` --- x86_32 MSVC 上 C++ 类成员函数通常使用的调用"
"约定。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:540
msgid ""
"Corresponds to MSVC's `__thiscall` and GCC and clang's "
"`__attribute__((thiscall))`."
msgstr ""
"对应于 MSVC 的 `__thiscall` 以及 GCC 和 clang 的 "
"`__attribute__((thiscall))`。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:548
msgid "<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/X86_calling_conventions#thiscall>"
msgstr "<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/X86_calling_conventions#thiscall>"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:549
msgid "<https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/cpp/thiscall>"
msgstr "<https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/cpp/thiscall>"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:558
msgid ""
"`unsafe extern \"efiapi\"` --- The ABI used for [UEFI](https://uefi.org/"
"specifications) functions."
msgstr ""
"`unsafe extern \"efiapi\"` --- [UEFI](https://uefi.org/specifications) 函数使"
"用的 ABI。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:559
msgid "Only available on x86 and ARM targets (32bit and 64bit)."
msgstr "仅在 x86 和 ARM 目标（32 位和 64 位）上可用。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:565
msgid ""
"Like `\"C\"` and `\"system\"`, most platform-specific ABI strings also have "
"a [corresponding `-unwind` variant](functions.md#unwinding); specifically, "
"these are:"
msgstr ""
"与 `\"C\"` 和 `\"system\"` 一样，大多数平台特定 ABI 字符串也有[对应的 `-"
"unwind` 变体](functions.md#unwinding)；具体包括："

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:567
msgid "`\"aapcs-unwind\"`"
msgstr "`\"aapcs-unwind\"`"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:568
msgid "`\"cdecl-unwind\"`"
msgstr "`\"cdecl-unwind\"`"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:569
msgid "`\"fastcall-unwind\"`"
msgstr "`\"fastcall-unwind\"`"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:570
msgid "`\"stdcall-unwind\"`"
msgstr "`\"stdcall-unwind\"`"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:571
msgid "`\"sysv64-unwind\"`"
msgstr "`\"sysv64-unwind\"`"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:572
msgid "`\"thiscall-unwind\"`"
msgstr "`\"thiscall-unwind\"`"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:573
msgid "`\"win64-unwind\"`"
msgstr "`\"win64-unwind\"`"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:579
msgid "Variadic functions"
msgstr "变参函数"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:581
msgid ""
"Functions within external blocks may be variadic by specifying `...` as the "
"last argument. The variadic parameter may optionally be specified with an "
"identifier."
msgstr ""
"外部块中的函数可以通过将 `...` 指定为最后一个实参来成为变参函数。变参参数可以"
"选择性地用标识符指定。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:588
msgid ""
"// SAFETY: This function guarantees it will not access\n"
"    // variadic arguments.\n"
msgstr ""
"// SAFETY：此函数保证它不会访问\n"
"    // 变参实参。\n"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:598
msgid ""
"The `safe` qualifier should not be used on a function in an `extern` block "
"unless that function guarantees that it will not access the variadic "
"arguments at all. Passing an unexpected number of arguments or arguments of "
"unexpected type to a variadic function may lead to [undefined behavior](../"
"behavior-considered-undefined.md#r-undefined)."
msgstr ""
"除非 `extern` 块中的函数保证它完全不会访问变参实参，否则不应在该函数上使用 "
"`safe` 限定符。向变参函数传递意外数量的实参或意外类型的实参可能导致[未定义行"
"为](../behavior-considered-undefined.md#r-undefined)。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:607
msgid ""
"Variadic parameters can only be specified within `extern` blocks with the "
"following ABI strings or their corresponding [`-unwind` variants]"
"(functions.md#r-items.fn.extern.unwind):"
msgstr ""
"变参参数只能在带有以下 ABI 字符串或其对应 [`-unwind` 变体](functions.md#r-"
"items.fn.extern.unwind)的 `extern` 块中指定："

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:609
msgid "`\"aapcs\"`"
msgstr "`\"aapcs\"`"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:610
msgid "`\"C\"`"
msgstr "`\"C\"`"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:611
msgid "`\"cdecl\"`"
msgstr "`\"cdecl\"`"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:612
msgid "`\"efiapi\"`"
msgstr "`\"efiapi\"`"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:613
msgid "`\"system\"`"
msgstr "`\"system\"`"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:614
msgid "`\"sysv64\"`"
msgstr "`\"sysv64\"`"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:615
msgid "`\"win64\"`"
msgstr "`\"win64\"`"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:621
msgid "Attributes on extern blocks"
msgstr "extern 块上的属性"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:627
msgid ""
"The following [attributes](../attributes.md) control the behavior of "
"external blocks."
msgstr "以下[属性](../attributes.md)控制外部块的行为。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:633
msgid "The `link` attribute"
msgstr "`link` 属性"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:639
msgid ""
"The _`link` attribute_ specifies the name of a native library that the "
"compiler should link with for the items within an `extern` block."
msgstr "_`link` 属性_指定编译器应为 `extern` 块中的项链接的原生库名称。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:645
msgid ""
"It uses the [MetaListNameValueStr](../attributes.md#grammar-"
"MetaListNameValueStr) syntax to specify its inputs. The `name` key is the "
"name of the native library to link. The `kind` key is an optional value "
"which specifies the kind of library with the following possible values:"
msgstr ""
"它使用 [MetaListNameValueStr](../attributes.md#grammar-MetaListNameValueStr) "
"语法来指定其输入。`name` 键是要链接的原生库名称。`kind` 键是一个可选值，用于"
"指定库的种类，可能的值如下："

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:651
msgid ""
"`dylib` --- Indicates a dynamic library. This is the default if `kind` is "
"not specified."
msgstr "`dylib` --- 表示动态库。如果未指定 `kind`，这是默认值。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:657
msgid "`static` --- Indicates a static library."
msgstr "`static` --- 表示静态库。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:663
msgid ""
"`framework` --- Indicates a macOS framework. This is only valid for macOS "
"targets."
msgstr "`framework` --- 表示 macOS framework。这仅对 macOS 目标有效。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:669
msgid ""
"`raw-dylib` --- Indicates a dynamic library where the compiler will generate "
"an import library to link against (see [`dylib` versus `raw-dylib`](#dylib-"
"versus-raw-dylib) below for details). This is only valid for Windows targets."
msgstr ""
"`raw-dylib` --- 表示一种动态库，编译器会为其生成要链接的导入库（详情见下文的 "
"[`dylib` versus `raw-dylib`](#dylib-versus-raw-dylib)）。这仅对 Windows 目标"
"有效。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:675
msgid "The `name` key must be included if `kind` is specified."
msgstr "如果指定了 `kind`，则必须包含 `name` 键。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:681
msgid ""
"The optional `modifiers` argument is a way to specify linking modifiers for "
"the library to link."
msgstr "可选的 `modifiers` 参数用于为要链接的库指定链接修饰符。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:687
msgid ""
"Modifiers are specified as a comma-delimited string with each modifier "
"prefixed with either a `+` or `-` to indicate that the modifier is enabled "
"or disabled, respectively."
msgstr ""
"修饰符被指定为以逗号分隔的字符串，每个修饰符前带有 `+` 或 `-` 前缀，分别表示"
"启用或禁用该修饰符。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:693
msgid ""
"Specifying multiple `modifiers` arguments in a single `link` attribute, or "
"multiple identical modifiers in the same `modifiers` argument is not "
"currently supported. Example: `#[link(name = \"mylib\", kind = \"static\", "
"modifiers = \"+whole-archive\")]`."
msgstr ""
"目前不支持在单个 `link` 属性中指定多个 `modifiers` 参数，也不支持在同一个 "
"`modifiers` 参数中指定多个相同的修饰符。例如：`#[link(name = \"mylib\", kind "
"= \"static\", modifiers = \"+whole-archive\")]`。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:699
msgid ""
"The `wasm_import_module` key may be used to specify the [WebAssembly module]"
"(https://webassembly.github.io/spec/core/syntax/modules.html) name for the "
"items within an `extern` block when importing symbols from the host "
"environment. The default module name is `env` if `wasm_import_module` is not "
"specified."
msgstr ""
"从宿主环境导入符号时，可以使用 `wasm_import_module` 键为 `extern` 块中的项指"
"定 [WebAssembly module](https://webassembly.github.io/spec/core/syntax/"
"modules.html) 名称。如果未指定 `wasm_import_module`，默认模块名为 `env`。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:703
msgid "\"crypto\""
msgstr "\"crypto\""

