msgstr "\"framework\""

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:723
msgid ""
"It is valid to add the `link` attribute on an empty extern block. You can "
"use this to satisfy the linking requirements of extern blocks elsewhere in "
"your code (including upstream crates) instead of adding the attribute to "
"each extern block."
msgstr ""
"可以在空 extern 块上添加 `link` 属性。你可以用这种方式满足代码中其他位置（包"
"括上游 crate）extern 块的链接要求，而不必为每个 extern 块添加该属性。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:729
msgid "Linking modifiers: `bundle`"
msgstr "链接修饰符：`bundle`"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:735 src/items/external-blocks.md:773
msgid ""
"This modifier is only compatible with the `static` linking kind. Using any "
"other kind will result in a compiler error."
msgstr ""
"此修饰符只与 `static` 链接种类兼容。使用任何其他种类都会导致编译器错误。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:741
msgid ""
"When building a rlib or staticlib `+bundle` means that the native static "
"library will be packed into the rlib or staticlib archive, and then "
"retrieved from there during linking of the final binary."
msgstr ""
"构建 rlib 或 staticlib 时，`+bundle` 表示原生静态库会被打包进 rlib 或 "
"staticlib 归档中，然后在链接最终二进制文件时从中取出。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:747
msgid ""
"When building a rlib `-bundle` means that the native static library is "
"registered as a dependency of that rlib \"by name\", and object files from "
"it are included only during linking of the final binary, the file search by "
"that name is also performed during final linking. When building a staticlib "
"`-bundle` means that the native static library is simply not included into "
"the archive and some higher level build system will need to add it later "
"during linking of the final binary."
msgstr ""
"构建 rlib 时，`-bundle` 表示原生静态库会“按名称”注册为该 rlib 的依赖，并且其"
"中的目标文件只会在链接最终二进制文件时包含进来，对该名称的文件搜索也会在最终"
"链接期间执行。构建 staticlib 时，`-bundle` 表示原生静态库不会被包含进归档中，"
"某个更高层的构建系统之后需要在链接最终二进制文件时添加它。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:753
msgid ""
"This modifier has no effect when building other targets like executables or "
"dynamic libraries."
msgstr "构建可执行文件或动态库等其他目标时，此修饰符没有效果。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:759
msgid "The default for this modifier is `+bundle`."
msgstr "此修饰符的默认值是 `+bundle`。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:761
msgid ""
"More implementation details about this modifier can be found in [`bundle` "
"documentation for rustc](../../rustc/command-line-arguments.html#linking-"
"modifiers-bundle)."
msgstr ""
"关于此修饰符的更多实现细节，可在 [rustc 的 `bundle` 文档](../../rustc/"
"command-line-arguments.html#linking-modifiers-bundle)中找到。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:767
msgid "Linking modifiers: `whole-archive`"
msgstr "链接修饰符：`whole-archive`"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:779
msgid ""
"`+whole-archive` means that the static library is linked as a whole archive "
"without throwing any object files away."
msgstr ""
"`+whole-archive` 表示将静态库作为完整归档进行链接，而不会丢弃任何目标文件。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:785
msgid "The default for this modifier is `-whole-archive`."
msgstr "此修饰符的默认值是 `-whole-archive`。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:787
msgid ""
"More implementation details about this modifier can be found in [`whole-"
"archive` documentation for rustc](../../rustc/command-line-"
"arguments.html#linking-modifiers-whole-archive)."
msgstr ""
"关于此修饰符的更多实现细节，可在 [rustc 的 `whole-archive` 文档](../../rustc/"
"command-line-arguments.html#linking-modifiers-whole-archive)中找到。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:793
msgid "Linking modifiers: `verbatim`"
msgstr "链接修饰符：`verbatim`"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:799
msgid "This modifier is compatible with all linking kinds."
msgstr "此修饰符与所有链接种类兼容。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:805
msgid ""
"`+verbatim` means that rustc itself won't add any target-specified library "
"prefixes or suffixes (like `lib` or `.a`) to the library name, and will try "
"its best to ask for the same thing from the linker."
msgstr ""
"`+verbatim` 表示 rustc 本身不会向库名称添加任何目标指定的库前缀或后缀（如 "
"`lib` 或 `.a`），并且会尽力要求链接器做同样的事情。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:811
msgid ""
"`-verbatim` means that rustc will either add a target-specific prefix and "
"suffix to the library name before passing it to linker, or won't prevent "
"linker from implicitly adding it."
msgstr ""
"`-verbatim` 表示 rustc 会在将库名称传递给链接器之前添加目标特定的前缀和后缀，"
"或者不会阻止链接器隐式添加它们。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:817
msgid "The default for this modifier is `-verbatim`."
msgstr "此修饰符的默认值是 `-verbatim`。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:819
msgid ""
"More implementation details about this modifier can be found in [`verbatim` "
"documentation for rustc](../../rustc/command-line-arguments.html#linking-"
"modifiers-verbatim)."
msgstr ""
"关于此修饰符的更多实现细节，可在 [rustc 的 `verbatim` 文档](../../rustc/"
"command-line-arguments.html#linking-modifiers-verbatim)中找到。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:825
msgid "`dylib` versus `raw-dylib`"
msgstr "`dylib` 与 `raw-dylib`"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:831
msgid ""
"On Windows, linking against a dynamic library requires that an import "
"library is provided to the linker: this is a special static library that "
"declares all of the symbols exported by the dynamic library in such a way "
"that the linker knows that they have to be dynamically loaded at runtime."
msgstr ""
"在 Windows 上，链接动态库要求向链接器提供导入库：这是一种特殊的静态库，它以某"
"种方式声明动态库导出的所有符号，使链接器知道这些符号必须在运行时动态加载。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:837
msgid ""
"Specifying `kind = \"dylib\"` instructs the Rust compiler to link an import "
"library based on the `name` key. The linker will then use its normal library "
"resolution logic to find that import library. Alternatively, specifying "
"`kind = \"raw-dylib\"` instructs the compiler to generate an import library "
"during compilation and provide that to the linker instead."
msgstr ""
"指定 `kind = \"dylib\"` 会指示 Rust 编译器基于 `name` 键链接一个导入库。随后"
"链接器会使用其正常的库解析逻辑来查找该导入库。或者，指定 `kind = \"raw-"
"dylib\"` 会指示编译器在编译期间生成一个导入库，并将其提供给链接器。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:843
msgid ""
"`raw-dylib` is only supported on Windows. Using it when targeting other "
"platforms will result in a compiler error."
msgstr ""
"`raw-dylib` 仅在 Windows 上受支持。以其他平台为目标时使用它会导致编译器错误。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:849
msgid "The `import_name_type` key"
msgstr "`import_name_type` 键"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:855
msgid ""
"On x86 Windows, names of functions are \"decorated\" (i.e., have a specific "
"prefix and/or suffix added) to indicate their calling convention. For "
"example, a `stdcall` calling convention function with the name `fn1` that "
"has no arguments would be decorated as `_fn1@0`. However, the [PE Format]"
"(https://learn.microsoft.com/windows/win32/debug/pe-format#import-name-type) "
"does also permit names to have no prefix or be undecorated. Additionally, "
"the MSVC and GNU toolchains use different decorations for the same calling "
"conventions which means, by default, some Win32 functions cannot be called "
"using the `raw-dylib` link kind via the GNU toolchain."
msgstr ""
"在 x86 Windows 上，函数名称会被“修饰”（即添加特定前缀和/或后缀）以表示其调用"
"约定。例如，名为 `fn1` 且没有参数的 `stdcall` 调用约定函数会被修饰为 "
"`_fn1@0`。不过，[PE Format](https://learn.microsoft.com/windows/win32/debug/"
"pe-format#import-name-type) 也允许名称没有前缀或不被修饰。此外，MSVC 和 GNU "
"工具链对相同调用约定使用不同的修饰方式，这意味着默认情况下，某些 Win32 函数无"
"法通过 GNU 工具链使用 `raw-dylib` 链接种类来调用。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:861
msgid ""
"To allow for these differences, when using the `raw-dylib` link kind you may "
"also specify the `import_name_type` key with one of the following values to "
"change how functions are named in the generated import library:"
msgstr ""
"为了适应这些差异，使用 `raw-dylib` 链接种类时，还可以为 `import_name_type` 键"
"指定以下值之一，以改变生成的导入库中函数的命名方式："

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:863
msgid ""
"`decorated`: The function name will be fully-decorated using the MSVC "
"toolchain format."
msgstr "`decorated`：函数名称将使用 MSVC 工具链格式进行完整修饰。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:864
msgid ""
"`noprefix`: The function name will be decorated using the MSVC toolchain "
"format, but skipping the leading `?`, `@`, or optionally `_`."
msgstr ""
"`noprefix`：函数名称将使用 MSVC 工具链格式进行修饰，但跳过开头的 `?`、`@` 或"
"可选的 `_`。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:865
msgid "`undecorated`: The function name will not be decorated."
msgstr "`undecorated`：函数名称不会被修饰。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:871
msgid ""
"If the `import_name_type` key is not specified, then the function name will "
"be fully-decorated using the target toolchain's format."
msgstr ""
"如果未指定 `import_name_type` 键，则函数名称将使用目标工具链的格式进行完整修"
"饰。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:877
msgid ""
"Variables are never decorated and so the `import_name_type` key has no "
"effect on how they are named in the generated import library."
msgstr ""
"变量从不会被修饰，因此 `import_name_type` 键不会影响它们在生成的导入库中的命"
"名方式。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:883
msgid ""
"The `import_name_type` key is only supported on x86 Windows. Using it when "
"targeting other platforms will result in a compiler error."
msgstr ""
"`import_name_type` 键仅在 x86 Windows 上受支持。以其他平台为目标时使用它会导"
"致编译器错误。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:890
msgid "The `link_name` attribute"
msgstr "`link_name` 属性"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:896
msgid ""
"The _`link_name` [attribute](../attributes.md)_ may be applied to "
"declarations inside an `extern` block to specify the symbol to import for "
"the given function or static."
msgstr ""
"_`link_name` [属性](../attributes.md)_可以应用于 `extern` 块内的声明，以指定"
"要为给定函数或静态项导入的符号。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:904
msgid "\"actual_symbol_name\""
msgstr "\"actual_symbol_name\""

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:916
msgid ""
"The `link_name` attribute uses the [MetaNameValueStr](../"
"attributes.md#grammar-MetaNameValueStr) syntax."
msgstr ""
"`link_name` 属性使用 [MetaNameValueStr](../attributes.md#grammar-"
"MetaNameValueStr) 语法。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:922
msgid ""
"The symbol name must not be the empty string or contain any `U+0000` (NUL) "
"bytes."
msgstr "符号名称不得为空字符串，也不得包含任何 `U+0000`（NUL）字节。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:928
msgid ""
"The `link_name` attribute may only be applied to a function or static item "
"in an `extern` block."
msgstr "`link_name` 属性只能应用于 `extern` 块中的函数或静态项。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:943
msgid "Only the first use of `link_name` on an item has effect."
msgstr "在一个项上，只有首次使用的 `link_name` 会生效。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:949 src/attributes/testing.md:333
#: src/abi.md:182 src/abi.md:239
msgid ""
"`rustc` lints against any use following the first with a future-"
"compatibility warning. This may become an error in the future."
msgstr ""
"`rustc` 会对第一次之后的任何使用发出未来兼容性警告。将来这可能会变成错误。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:958
msgid ""
"The `link_name` attribute may not be used with the [`link_ordinal`](external-"
"blocks.md#r-items.extern.attributes.link_ordinal) attribute."
msgstr ""
"`link_name` 属性不能与 [`link_ordinal`](external-blocks.md#r-"
"items.extern.attributes.link_ordinal) 属性一起使用。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:964
msgid "The `link_ordinal` attribute"
msgstr "`link_ordinal` 属性"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:970
msgid ""
"The _`link_ordinal` attribute_ can be applied on declarations inside an "
"`extern` block to indicate the numeric ordinal to use when generating the "
"import library to link against. An ordinal is a unique number per symbol "
"exported by a dynamic library on Windows and can be used when the library is "
"being loaded to find that symbol rather than having to look it up by name."
msgstr ""
"_`link_ordinal` 属性_可以应用于 `extern` 块内的声明，以表示生成要链接的导入库"
"时使用的数字序号。在 Windows 上，序号是动态库导出的每个符号对应的唯一数字；加"
"载该库时，可以使用它来查找该符号，而不必按名称查找。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:976
msgid ""
"`link_ordinal` should only be used in cases where the ordinal of the symbol "
"is known to be stable: if the ordinal of a symbol is not explicitly set when "
"its containing binary is built then one will be automatically assigned to "
"it, and that assigned ordinal may change between builds of the binary."
msgstr ""
"`link_ordinal` 只应在已知符号序号稳定的情况下使用：如果构建包含该符号的二进制"
"文件时没有显式设置该符号的序号，则会自动为它分配一个序号，而该分配的序号可能"
"会在该二进制文件的不同构建之间变化。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:983
msgid "\"exporter\""
msgstr "\"exporter\""

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:983
msgid "\"raw-dylib\""
msgstr "\"raw-dylib\""

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:994
msgid ""
"This attribute is only used with the `raw-dylib` linking kind. Using any "
"other kind will result in a compiler error."
msgstr ""
"此属性只与 `raw-dylib` 链接种类一起使用。使用任何其他种类都会导致编译器错误。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:1000
msgid ""
"Using this attribute with the `link_name` attribute will result in a "
"compiler error."
msgstr "将此属性与 `link_name` 属性一起使用会导致编译器错误。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:1008
msgid ""
"Attributes on extern function parameters follow the same rules and "
"restrictions as [regular function parameters](functions.md#attributes-on-"
"function-parameters)."
msgstr ""
"extern 函数参数上的属性遵循与[常规函数参数](functions.md#attributes-on-"
"function-parameters)相同的规则和限制。"

