#: src/items/generics.md:379
msgid ""
"[Functions](functions.md), [type aliases](type-aliases.md), [structs]"
"(structs.md), [enumerations](enumerations.md), [unions](unions.md), [traits]"
"(traits.md), and [implementations](implementations.md) may be "
"_parameterized_ by types, constants, and lifetimes. These parameters are "
"listed in angle <span class=\"parenthetical\">brackets (`<...>`)</span>, "
"usually immediately after the name of the item and before its definition. "
"For implementations, which don't have a name, they come directly after "
"`impl`."
msgstr ""
"[函数](functions.md)、[类型别名](type-aliases.md)、[结构体](structs.md)、[枚"
"举](enumerations.md)、[联合体](unions.md)、[trait](traits.md) 和[实现]"
"(implementations.md)可以按类型、常量和生命周期进行_参数化_。这些参数列在尖括"
"号 <span class=\"parenthetical\">（`<...>`）</span> 中，通常紧跟在项的名称之"
"后、定义之前。对于没有名称的实现，它们直接位于 `impl` 之后。"

#: src/items/generics.md:385
msgid ""
"The order of generic parameters is restricted to lifetime parameters and "
"then type and const parameters intermixed."
msgstr ""
"泛型参数的顺序受限为先是生命周期参数，然后是类型参数和 const 参数交错排列。"

#: src/items/generics.md:391
msgid ""
"The same parameter name may not be declared more than once in a "
"[GenericParams](generics.md#grammar-GenericParams) list."
msgstr ""
"同一参数名不得在 [GenericParams](generics.md#grammar-GenericParams) 列表中声"
"明多次。"

#: src/items/generics.md:393
msgid "Some examples of items with type, const, and lifetime parameters:"
msgstr "下面是带有类型、const 和生命周期参数的项的一些示例："

#: src/items/generics.md:407
msgid ""
"Generic parameters are in scope within the item definition where they are "
"declared. They are not in scope for items declared within the body of a "
"function as described in [item declarations](../statements.md#item-"
"declarations). See [generic parameter scopes](../names/scopes.md#generic-"
"parameter-scopes) for more details."
msgstr ""
"泛型参数在其声明所在的项定义内处于作用域中。对于函数体内声明的项，它们不在作"
"用域内，如[项声明](../statements.md#item-declarations)中所述。更多细节见[泛型"
"参数作用域](../names/scopes.md#generic-parameter-scopes)。"

#: src/items/generics.md:413
msgid ""
"[References](../types/pointer.md#shared-references-), [raw pointers](../"
"types/pointer.md#raw-pointers-const-and-mut), [arrays](../types/array.md), "
"[slices](../types/slice.md), [tuples](../types/tuple.md), and [function "
"pointers](../types/function-pointer.md) have lifetime or type parameters as "
"well, but are not referred to with path syntax."
msgstr ""
"[引用](../types/pointer.md#shared-references-)、[裸指针](../types/"
"pointer.md#raw-pointers-const-and-mut)、[数组](../types/array.md)、[切片](../"
"types/slice.md)、[元组](../types/tuple.md)和[函数指针](../types/function-"
"pointer.md)也有生命周期或类型参数，但不会使用路径语法引用它们。"

#: src/items/generics.md:419
msgid "`'_` and `'static` are not valid lifetime parameter names."
msgstr "`'_` 和 `'static` 不是有效的生命周期参数名。"

#: src/items/generics.md:425
msgid "Const generics"
msgstr "const 泛型"

#: src/items/generics.md:431
msgid ""
"_Const generic parameters_ allow items to be generic over constant values."
msgstr "_const 泛型参数_允许项在常量值上泛型化。"

#: src/items/generics.md:437
msgid ""
"The const identifier introduces a name in the [value namespace](../names/"
"namespaces.md) for the constant parameter, and all instances of the item "
"must be instantiated with a value of the given type."
msgstr ""
"const 标识符会在[值命名空间](../names/namespaces.md)中为常量参数引入一个名"
"称，并且该项的所有实例都必须以给定类型的值实例化。"

#: src/items/generics.md:443
msgid ""
"The only allowed types of const parameters are `u8`, `u16`, `u32`, `u64`, "
"`u128`, `usize`, `i8`, `i16`, `i32`, `i64`, `i128`, `isize`, `char` and "
"`bool`."
msgstr ""
"const 参数唯一允许的类型是 `u8`、`u16`、`u32`、`u64`、`u128`、`usize`、`i8`、"
"`i16`、`i32`、`i64`、`i128`、`isize`、`char` 和 `bool`。"

#: src/items/generics.md:449
msgid ""
"Const parameters can be used anywhere a [const item](constant-items.md) can "
"be used, with the exception that when used in a [type](../types.md) or "
"[array repeat expression](../expressions/array-expr.md), it must be "
"standalone (as described below). That is, they are allowed in the following "
"places:"
msgstr ""
"const 参数可以用在 [const 项](constant-items.md)可用的任何位置，但在[类型]"
"(../types.md)或[数组重复表达式](../expressions/array-expr.md)中使用时例外，它"
"必须是独立的（如下所述）。也就是说，它们允许出现在以下位置："

#: src/items/generics.md:451
msgid ""
"As an applied const to any type which forms a part of the signature of the "
"item in question."
msgstr "作为应用到某个类型上的 const 实参，而该类型构成所讨论项签名的一部分。"

#: src/items/generics.md:452
msgid ""
"As part of a const expression used to define an [associated const]"
"(associated-items.md#associated-constants), or as a parameter to an "
"[associated type](associated-items.md#associated-types)."
msgstr ""
"作为用于定义[关联 const](associated-items.md#associated-constants) 的 const "
"表达式的一部分，或作为[关联类型](associated-items.md#associated-types)的参"
"数。"

#: src/items/generics.md:453
msgid ""
"As a value in any runtime expression in the body of any functions in the "
"item."
msgstr "作为项中任意函数体内任意运行时表达式中的值。"

#: src/items/generics.md:454
msgid ""
"As a parameter to any type used in the body of any functions in the item."
msgstr "作为项中任意函数体内所用任意类型的参数。"

#: src/items/generics.md:455
msgid "As a part of the type of any fields in the item."
msgstr "作为项中任意字段类型的一部分。"

#: src/items/generics.md:458
msgid "// Examples where const generic parameters can be used.\n"
msgstr "// 可以使用 const 泛型参数的示例。\n"

#: src/items/generics.md:459
msgid "// Used in the signature of the item itself.\n"
msgstr "// 用于项自身的签名中。\n"

#: src/items/generics.md:462
msgid "// Used as a type within a function body.\n"
msgstr "// 在函数体内用作类型。\n"

#: src/items/generics.md:467
msgid "// Used as a field of a struct.\n"
msgstr "// 用作结构体字段。\n"

#: src/items/generics.md:472
msgid "// Used as an associated constant.\n"
msgstr "// 用作关联常量。\n"

#: src/items/generics.md:481
msgid "// Used as an associated type.\n"
msgstr "// 用作关联类型。\n"

#: src/items/generics.md:487
msgid "// Examples where const generic parameters cannot be used.\n"
msgstr "// 不能使用 const 泛型参数的示例。\n"

#: src/items/generics.md:489
msgid "// Cannot use in item definitions within a function body.\n"
msgstr "// 不能用于函数体内的项定义。\n"

#: src/items/generics.md:504
msgid ""
"As a further restriction, const parameters may only appear as a standalone "
"argument inside of a [type](../types.md) or [array repeat expression](../"
"expressions/array-expr.md). In those contexts, they may only be used as a "
"single segment [path expression](../expressions/path-expr.md), possibly "
"inside a [block](../expressions/block-expr.md) (such as `N` or `{N}`). That "
"is, they cannot be combined with other expressions."
msgstr ""
"作为进一步限制，const 参数在[类型](../types.md)或[数组重复表达式](../"
"expressions/array-expr.md)内部只能作为独立实参出现。在这些上下文中，它们只能"
"作为单段[路径表达式](../expressions/path-expr.md)使用，可以位于[块](../"
"expressions/block-expr.md)内（例如 `N` 或 `{N}`）。也就是说，它们不能与其他表"
"达式组合。"

#: src/items/generics.md:507
msgid "// Examples where const parameters may not be used.\n"
msgstr "// 不可以使用 const 参数的示例。\n"

#: src/items/generics.md:508
msgid ""
"// Not allowed to combine in other expressions in types, such as the\n"
"// arithmetic expression in the return type here.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 不允许在类型中与其他表达式组合，例如这里返回类型中的\n"
"// 算术表达式。\n"

#: src/items/generics.md:512
msgid "// Similarly not allowed for array repeat expressions.\n"
msgstr "// 同样，也不允许用于数组重复表达式。\n"

#: src/items/generics.md:521
msgid ""
"A const argument in a [path](../paths.md) specifies the const value to use "
"for that item."
msgstr "[路径](../paths.md)中的 const 实参指定该项要使用的 const 值。"

#: src/items/generics.md:527
msgid ""
"The argument must either be an [inferred const](generics.md#r-"
"items.generics.const.inferred) or be a [const expression](../"
"const_eval.md#constant-expressions) of the type ascribed to the const "
"parameter. The const expression must be a [block expression](../expressions/"
"block-expr.md) (surrounded with braces) unless it is a single path segment "
"(an [IDENTIFIER](../identifiers.md#grammar-IDENTIFIER)) or a [literal](../"
"expressions/literal-expr.md) (with a possibly leading `-` token)."
msgstr ""
"该实参必须要么是[推断 const](generics.md#r-items.generics.const.inferred)，要"
"么是该 const 参数所标注类型的 [const 表达式](../const_eval.md#constant-"
"expressions)。除非它是单段路径（[IDENTIFIER](../identifiers.md#grammar-"
"IDENTIFIER)）或[字面量](../expressions/literal-expr.md)（可能带有前导 `-` "
"token），否则 const 表达式必须是[块表达式](../expressions/block-expr.md)（用"
"花括号包围）。"

#: src/items/generics.md:533
msgid ""
"This syntactic restriction is necessary to avoid requiring infinite "
"lookahead when parsing an expression inside of a type."
msgstr "这种语法限制是必要的，以避免在类型内部解析表达式时需要无限前瞻。"

