#: src/items/generics.md:556
msgid ""
"In a generic argument list, an [inferred const](generics.md#r-"
"items.generics.const.inferred) is parsed as an [inferred type](../types/"
"inferred.md#grammar-InferredType) but then semantically treated as a "
"separate kind of [const generic argument](generics.md#r-"
"items.generics.const.argument)."
