"items.generics.const.argument)。"

#: src/items/generics.md:565
msgid ""
"Where a const argument is expected, an `_` (optionally surrounded by any "
"number of matching parentheses), called the _inferred const_ ([path rules]"
"(../paths.md#r-paths.expr.complex-const-params), [array expression rules](../"
"expressions/array-expr.md#r-expr.array.length-restriction)), can be used "
"instead. This asks the compiler to infer the const argument if possible "
"based on surrounding information."
msgstr ""
"在预期 const 实参的位置，可以改用 `_`（可选地由任意数量匹配的括号包围），称为"
