"类型参数的类型指定约束的方式。"

#: src/items/generics.md:884
msgid ""
"The `for` keyword can be used to introduce [higher-ranked lifetimes](../"
"trait-bounds.md#higher-ranked-trait-bounds). It only allows [LifetimeParam]"
"(generics.md#grammar-LifetimeParam) parameters."
msgstr ""
"`for` 关键字可用于引入[高阶生命周期](../trait-bounds.md#higher-ranked-trait-"
"bounds)。它只允许 [LifetimeParam](generics.md#grammar-LifetimeParam) 参数。"

#: src/items/generics.md:889
msgid "// Could use A<T: Iterator> instead\n"
msgstr "// 也可以改用 A<T: Iterator>\n"

#: src/items/generics.md:890
msgid "// Bound on an associated type\n"
msgstr "// 关联类型上的约束\n"

#: src/items/generics.md:891
msgid "// Bound on `String`, using the type parameter\n"
msgstr "// `String` 上的约束，使用类型参数\n"

#: src/items/generics.md:892 src/trait-bounds.md:565
msgid "// Allowed, but not useful\n"
msgstr "// 允许，但没有用处\n"

#: src/items/generics.md:904
msgid ""
"Generic lifetime and type parameters allow [attributes](../attributes.md) on "
"them. There are no built-in attributes that do anything in this position, "
"although custom derive attributes may give meaning to it."
msgstr ""
"泛型生命周期参数和类型参数允许带有[属性](../attributes.md)。没有内建属性会在"
"此位置产生任何作用，不过自定义 derive 属性可以为其赋予意义。"

#: src/items/generics.md:906
msgid ""
"This example shows using a custom derive attribute to modify the meaning of "
"a generic parameter."
msgstr "此示例展示如何使用自定义 derive 属性修改泛型参数的含义。"

#: src/items/generics.md:910
