msgid "[Built-in attributes](#built-in-attributes-index)"
msgstr "[内置属性](#built-in-attributes-index)"

#: src/attributes.md:340
msgid ""
"[Proc macro attributes](procedural-macros.md#the-proc_macro_attribute-"
"attribute)"
msgstr "[过程宏属性](procedural-macros.md#the-proc_macro_attribute-attribute)"

#: src/attributes.md:341
msgid ""
"[Derive macro helper attributes](procedural-macros.md#derive-macro-helper-"
"attributes)"
msgstr "[派生宏辅助属性](procedural-macros.md#derive-macro-helper-attributes)"

#: src/attributes.md:342
msgid "[Tool attributes](#tool-attributes)"
msgstr "[工具属性](#tool-attributes)"

#: src/attributes.md:348
msgid "Attributes may be applied to many forms in the language:"
msgstr "属性可以应用于语言中的许多形式："

#: src/attributes.md:350
msgid ""
"All [item declarations](items.md) accept outer attributes while [external "
"blocks](items/external-blocks.md), [functions](items/functions.md), "
"[implementations](items/implementations.md), and [modules](items/modules.md) "
"accept inner attributes."
msgstr ""
"所有[项声明](items.md)都接受外部属性，而[外部块](items/external-blocks.md)、"
"[函数](items/functions.md)、[实现](items/implementations.md)和[模块](items/"
"modules.md)接受内部属性。"

#: src/attributes.md:351
msgid ""
"Most [statements](statements.md) accept outer attributes (see [Expression "
"Attributes](expressions.md#expression-attributes) for limitations on "
"expression statements)."
msgstr ""
"大多数[语句](statements.md)接受外部属性（表达式语句的限制见[表达式属性]"
"(expressions.md#expression-attributes)）。"

#: src/attributes.md:352
msgid ""
"[Block expressions](expressions/block-expr.md) accept outer and inner "
"attributes, but only when they are the outer expression of an [expression "
"statement](statements.md#expression-statements) or the final expression of "
"another block expression."
msgstr ""
"[块表达式](expressions/block-expr.md)接受外部属性和内部属性，但仅限于该块表达"
"式是[表达式语句](statements.md#expression-statements)的外层表达式或另一个块表"
"达式的最终表达式时。"

#: src/attributes.md:353
msgid ""
"[Enum](items/enumerations.md) variants and [struct](items/structs.md) and "
"[union](items/unions.md) fields accept outer attributes."
msgstr ""
"[枚举](items/enumerations.md)变体以及[结构体](items/structs.md)和[联合体]"
"(items/unions.md)字段接受外部属性。"

#: src/attributes.md:354
msgid ""
"[Match expression arms](expressions/match-expr.md) accept outer attributes."
msgstr "[match 表达式分支](expressions/match-expr.md)接受外部属性。"

#: src/attributes.md:355
msgid ""
"[Generic lifetime or type parameter](items/generics.md) accept outer "
"attributes."
msgstr "[泛型生命周期或类型形参](items/generics.md)接受外部属性。"

#: src/attributes.md:356
msgid ""
"Expressions accept outer attributes in limited situations, see [Expression "
"Attributes](expressions.md#expression-attributes) for details."
msgstr ""
"表达式在有限情形下接受外部属性，详情见[表达式属性](expressions.md#expression-"
"attributes)。"

#: src/attributes.md:357
msgid ""
"[Function](items/functions.md), [closure](expressions/closure-expr.md) and "
"[function pointer](types/function-pointer.md) parameters accept outer "
"attributes. This includes attributes on variadic parameters denoted with "
"`...` in function pointers and [external blocks](items/external-"
"blocks.html#variadic-functions)."
msgstr ""
"[函数](items/functions.md)、[闭包](expressions/closure-expr.md)和[函数指针]"
"(types/function-pointer.md)形参接受外部属性。这包括函数指针和[外部块](items/"
"external-blocks.html#variadic-functions)中用 `...` 表示的变参形参上的属性。"

#: src/attributes.md:358
msgid ""
"[Inline assembly](inline-assembly.md) template strings and operands accept "
"outer attributes. Only certain attributes are accepted semantically; for "
"details, see [asm.attributes.supported-attributes](inline-assembly.md#r-"
"asm.attributes.supported-attributes)."
msgstr ""
"[内联汇编](inline-assembly.md)模板字符串和操作数接受外部属性。语义上只接受某"
"些属性；详情见 [asm.attributes.supported-attributes](inline-assembly.md#r-"
"asm.attributes.supported-attributes)。"

