#: src/attributes/codegen.md:1082
msgid ""
"See the [`target_feature` conditional compilation option](../conditional-"
"compilation.md#target_feature) for selectively enabling or disabling "
"compilation of code based on compile-time settings. Note that this option is "
"not affected by the `target_feature` attribute, and is only driven by the "
"features enabled for the entire crate."
msgstr ""
"有关基于编译时设置选择性启用或禁用代码编译，请参见[`target_feature` 条件编译"
"选项](../conditional-compilation.md#target_feature)。请注意，该选项不受 "
"`target_feature` 属性影响，而仅由为整个 crate 启用的特性驱动。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:1091
msgid ""
"Whether a feature is enabled can be checked at runtime using a platform-"
"specific macro from the standard library, for instance "
"[`is_x86_feature_detected`](../../std/arch/"
"macro.is_x86_feature_detected.html) or [`is_aarch64_feature_detected`](../../"
"std/arch/macro.is_aarch64_feature_detected.html)."
msgstr ""
"是否启用了某项特性，可以在运行时使用标准库中平台特定的宏进行检查，例如 "
"[`is_x86_feature_detected`](../../std/arch/"
"macro.is_x86_feature_detected.html) 或 [`is_aarch64_feature_detected`](../../"
"std/arch/macro.is_aarch64_feature_detected.html)。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:1097
msgid ""
"`rustc` has a default set of features enabled for each target and CPU. The "
"CPU may be chosen with the [`-C target-cpu`](../../rustc/codegen-options/"
"index.html#target-cpu) flag. Individual features may be enabled or disabled "
"for an entire crate with the [`-C target-feature`](../../rustc/codegen-"
"options/index.html#target-feature) flag."
msgstr ""
"`rustc` 会为每个目标和 CPU 默认启用一组特性。可以使用 [`-C target-cpu`]"
"(../../rustc/codegen-options/index.html#target-cpu) 标志选择 CPU。还可以使用 "
"[`-C target-feature`](../../rustc/codegen-options/index.html#target-feature) "
"标志为整个 crate 启用或禁用单独的特性。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:1106
msgid "The `track_caller` attribute"
msgstr "`track_caller` 属性"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:1112
msgid ""
"The `track_caller` attribute may be applied to any function with [`\"Rust\"` "
"ABI](../items/external-blocks.md#abi) with the exception of the entry point "
"`fn main`."
msgstr ""
"`track_caller` 属性可以应用于任何具有 [`\"Rust\"` ABI](../items/external-"
"blocks.md#abi) 的函数，但入口点 `fn main` 除外。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:1119
msgid ""
"When applied to functions and methods in trait declarations, the attribute "
"applies to all implementations. If the trait provides a default "
"implementation with the attribute, then the attribute also applies to "
"override implementations."
msgstr ""
"当该属性应用于 trait 声明中的函数和方法时，它会适用于所有实现。如果该 trait "
"提供了带有该属性的默认实现，那么该属性也适用于覆盖实现。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:1126
msgid ""
"When applied to a function in an `extern` block the attribute must also be "
"applied to any linked implementations, otherwise undefined behavior results. "
"When applied to a function which is made available to an `extern` block, the "
"declaration in the `extern` block must also have the attribute, otherwise "
"undefined behavior results."
msgstr ""
"当该属性应用于 `extern` 块中的函数时，任何链接到的实现也必须应用该属性，否则"
"会导致未定义行为。当该属性应用于某个向 `extern` 块提供的函数时，`extern` 块中"
"的声明也必须带有该属性，否则会导致未定义行为。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:1135
msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "行为"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:1137
msgid ""
"Applying the attribute to a function `f` allows code within `f` to get a "
"hint of the [`Location`](../../core/panic/location/struct.Location.html) of "
"the \"topmost\" tracked call that led to `f`'s invocation. At the point of "
"observation, an implementation behaves as if it walks up the stack from "
"`f`'s frame to find the nearest frame of an _unattributed_ function `outer`, "
"and it returns the [`Location`](../../core/panic/location/"
"struct.Location.html) of the tracked call in `outer`."
msgstr ""
"将该属性应用于函数 `f` 后，`f` 内部的代码便可以获得导致调用 `f` 的“最顶层”已"
"追踪调用的 [`Location`](../../core/panic/location/struct.Location.html) 提"
"示。在观察点上，某个实现的行为如同它从 `f` 的栈帧向上遍历调用栈，找到最近的未"
"带属性函数 `outer` 的栈帧，并返回 `outer` 中该已追踪调用的 [`Location`]"
"(../../core/panic/location/struct.Location.html)。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:1153
msgid ""
"`core` provides [`core::panic::Location::caller`](../../core/panic/location/"
"struct.Location.html#method.caller) for observing caller locations. It wraps "
"the [`core::intrinsics::caller_location`](../../core/intrinsics/"
"fn.caller_location.html) intrinsic implemented by `rustc`."
msgstr ""
"`core` 提供了 [`core::panic::Location::caller`](../../core/panic/location/"
"struct.Location.html#method.caller) 用于观测调用者位置。它封装了由 `rustc` 实"
"现的 [`core::intrinsics::caller_location`](../../core/intrinsics/"
"fn.caller_location.html) 内在函数。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:1162
msgid ""
"Because the resulting `Location` is a hint, an implementation may halt its "
"walk up the stack early. See [Limitations](#limitations) for important "
"caveats."
msgstr ""
"由于得到的 `Location` 只是一个提示，实现可以提前停止向上遍历调用栈。重要注意"
"事项请参见[局限性](#limitations)。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:1169
msgid ""
"When `f` is called directly by `calls_f`, code in `f` observes its callsite "
"within `calls_f`:"
msgstr ""
"`calls_f` 直接调用 `f` 时，`f` 中的代码会观测到它在 `calls_f` 中的调用位置："

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:1177
msgid "// <-- f() prints this location\n"
msgstr "// <-- f() prints this location\n"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:1181
msgid ""
"When `f` is called by another attributed function `g` which is in turn "
"called by `calls_g`, code in both `f` and `g` observes `g`'s callsite within "
"`calls_g`:"
msgstr ""
"当 `f` 由另一个带属性的函数 `g` 调用，而 `g` 又由 `calls_g` 调用时，`f` 和 "
"`g` 中的代码都会观测到 `g` 在 `calls_g` 中的调用位置："

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:1196
msgid "// <-- g() prints this location twice, once itself and once from f()\n"
msgstr "// <-- g() prints this location twice, once itself and once from f()\n"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:1200
msgid ""
"When `g` is called by another attributed function `h` which is in turn "
"called by `calls_h`, all code in `f`, `g`, and `h` observes `h`'s callsite "
"within `calls_h`:"
msgstr ""
"当 `g` 由另一个带属性的函数 `h` 调用，而 `h` 又由 `calls_h` 调用时，`f`、`g` "
"和 `h` 中的所有代码都会观测到 `h` 在 `calls_h` 中的调用位置："

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:1220
msgid ""
"// <-- prints this location three times, once itself, once from g(), once "
"from f()\n"
msgstr ""
"// <-- prints this location three times, once itself, once from g(), once "
"from f()\n"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:1224
msgid "And so on."
msgstr "以此类推。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:1230 src/types/impl-trait.md:330
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "限制"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:1236
msgid ""
"This information is a hint and implementations are not required to preserve "
"it."
msgstr "该信息只是提示，实现不必保留它。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:1242
msgid ""
"In particular, coercing a function with `#[track_caller]` to a function "
"pointer creates a shim which appears to observers to have been called at the "
"attributed function's definition site, losing actual caller information "
"across virtual calls. A common example of this coercion is the creation of a "
"trait object whose methods are attributed."
msgstr ""
"尤其是，将带有 `#[track_caller]` 的函数强制转换为函数指针时，会创建一个 "
"shim；对观察者来说，它似乎是在该带属性函数的定义位置被调用的，从而在虚调用间"
"丢失实际的调用者信息。这种强制转换的一个常见例子，是创建其方法带有该属性的 "
"trait 对象。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:1251
msgid ""
"The aforementioned shim for function pointers is necessary because `rustc` "
"implements `track_caller` in a codegen context by appending an implicit "
"parameter to the function ABI, but this would be unsound for an indirect "
"call because the parameter is not a part of the function's type and a given "
"function pointer type may or may not refer to a function with the attribute. "
"The creation of a shim hides the implicit parameter from callers of the "
"function pointer, preserving soundness."
msgstr ""
"上述用于函数指针的 shim 是必要的，因为 `rustc` 在代码生成上下文中通过向函数 "
"ABI 追加一个隐式参数来实现 `track_caller`，但这对于间接调用来说是不健全的，因"
"为该参数不是函数类型的一部分，而给定的函数指针类型既可能引用带有该属性的函"
"数，也可能不引用。创建 shim 会向函数指针的调用者隐藏这个隐式参数，从而保持健"
"全性。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:1261
msgid "The `instruction_set` attribute"
msgstr "`instruction_set` 属性"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:1267
msgid ""
"The _`instruction_set` [attribute](../attributes.md)_ specifies the "
"instruction set that a function will use during code generation. This allows "
"mixing more than one instruction set in a single program."
msgstr ""
"_`instruction_set` [属性](../attributes.md)_ 指定函数在代码生成期间将使用的指"
"令集。这允许在单个程序中混用多种指令集。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:1289
msgid ""
"The `instruction_set` attribute uses the [MetaListPaths](../"
"attributes.md#grammar-MetaListPaths) syntax to specify a single path "
"consisting of the architecture family name and instruction set name."
msgstr ""
"`instruction_set` 属性使用 [MetaListPaths](../attributes.md#grammar-"
"MetaListPaths) 语法来指定单一路径，该路径由架构族名称和指令集名称组成。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:1295
msgid ""
"The `instruction_set` attribute may only be applied to functions with "
"[bodies](../items/functions.md#r-items.fn.body) --- [closures](../"
"expressions/closure-expr.md#r-expr.closure), [async blocks](../expressions/"
"block-expr.md#r-expr.block.async), [free functions](../items/functions.md#r-"
"items.fn), [associated functions](../items/associated-items.md#r-"
"items.associated.fn) in an [inherent impl](../items/implementations.md#r-"
"items.impl.inherent) or [trait impl](../items/implementations.md#r-"
"items.impl.trait), and associated functions in a [trait definition](../items/"
"traits.md#r-items.traits) when those functions have a [default definition]"
"(../items/traits.md#r-items.traits.associated-item-decls) ."
msgstr ""
"`instruction_set` 属性只能应用于具有[函数体](../items/functions.md#r-"
"items.fn.body)的函数，包括[闭包](../expressions/closure-expr.md#r-"
"expr.closure)、[async 块](../expressions/block-expr.md#r-expr.block.async)、"
"[自由函数](../items/functions.md#r-items.fn)、[固有 impl](../items/"
"implementations.md#r-items.impl.inherent) 或 [trait impl](../items/"
"implementations.md#r-items.impl.trait) 中的[关联函数](../items/associated-"
"items.md#r-items.associated.fn)，以及在这些函数具有[默认定义](../items/"
"traits.md#r-items.traits.associated-item-decls)时，[trait 定义](../items/"
"traits.md#r-items.traits)中的关联函数。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:1319
msgid "The `instruction_set` attribute may be used only once on a function."
msgstr "`instruction_set` 属性在一个函数上只能使用一次。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:1325
msgid ""
"The `instruction_set` attribute may only be used with a target that supports "
"the given value."
msgstr "`instruction_set` 属性只能用于支持给定值的目标。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:1331
msgid ""
"When the `instruction_set` attribute is used, any inline assembly in the "
"function must use the specified instruction set instead of the target "
"default."
msgstr ""
"当使用 `instruction_set` 属性时，函数中的任何内联汇编都必须使用指定的指令集，"
