"CollapseDebuginfoAttribute)</span> → <span class=\"grammar-"
"literal\">collapse\\_debuginfo</span> <span class=\"grammar-literal\">(</"
"span> <span class=\"grammar-text\">[CollapseDebuginfoOption]"
"(debugger.md#grammar-CollapseDebuginfoOption)</span> <span class=\"grammar-"
"literal\">)</span>"
msgstr ""
"**<sup>语法</sup>** <br> <span class=\"grammar-text grammar-production\" "
"id=\"grammar-CollapseDebuginfoAttribute\" onclick=\"show_railroad()"
"\">[CollapseDebuginfoAttribute](debugger.md#railroad-"
"CollapseDebuginfoAttribute)</span> → <span class=\"grammar-"
"literal\">collapse\\_debuginfo</span> <span class=\"grammar-literal\">(</"
"span> <span class=\"grammar-text\">[CollapseDebuginfoOption]"
"(debugger.md#grammar-CollapseDebuginfoOption)</span> <span class=\"grammar-"
"literal\">)</span>"

#: src/attributes/debugger.md:280
msgid ""
"<span class=\"grammar-text grammar-production\" id=\"grammar-"
"CollapseDebuginfoOption\" onclick=\"show_railroad()"
"\">[CollapseDebuginfoOption](debugger.md#railroad-CollapseDebuginfoOption)</"
"span> →   \n"
"      <span class=\"grammar-literal\">yes</span>   \n"
"    \\| <span class=\"grammar-literal\">no</span>   \n"
"    \\| <span class=\"grammar-literal\">external</span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"grammar-text grammar-production\" id=\"grammar-"
"CollapseDebuginfoOption\" onclick=\"show_railroad()"
"\">[CollapseDebuginfoOption](debugger.md#railroad-CollapseDebuginfoOption)</"
"span> →   \n"
"      <span class=\"grammar-literal\">yes</span>   \n"
"    \\| <span class=\"grammar-literal\">no</span>   \n"
"    \\| <span class=\"grammar-literal\">external</span>"

#: src/attributes/debugger.md:381
msgid ""
"The `collapse_debuginfo` attribute may only be applied to a [`macro_rules` "
"definition](../macros-by-example.md)."
msgstr ""
"`collapse_debuginfo` 属性只能应用于 [`macro_rules` 定义](../macros-by-"
"example.md)。"

#: src/attributes/debugger.md:387
msgid "The `collapse_debuginfo` attribute may used only once on a macro."
msgstr "`collapse_debuginfo` 属性只能在一个宏上使用一次。"

#: src/attributes/debugger.md:393
msgid "The `collapse_debuginfo` attribute accepts these options:"
msgstr "`collapse_debuginfo` 属性接受以下选项："

#: src/attributes/debugger.md:395
msgid ""
"`#[collapse_debuginfo(yes)]` --- Code locations in debuginfo are collapsed."
msgstr "`#[collapse_debuginfo(yes)]` --- debuginfo 中的代码位置会被折叠。"

#: src/attributes/debugger.md:396
msgid ""
"`#[collapse_debuginfo(no)]` --- Code locations in debuginfo are not "
"collapsed."
msgstr "`#[collapse_debuginfo(no)]` --- debuginfo 中的代码位置不会被折叠。"

#: src/attributes/debugger.md:397
msgid ""
"`#[collapse_debuginfo(external)]` --- Code locations in debuginfo are "
"collapsed only if the macro comes from a different crate."
msgstr ""
"`#[collapse_debuginfo(external)]` --- 只有当宏来自不同的 crate 时，debuginfo "
"中的代码位置才会被折叠。"

#: src/attributes/debugger.md:403
msgid ""
"The `external` behavior is the default for macros that don't have this "
"attribute unless they are built-in macros. For built-in macros the default "
"is `yes`."
msgstr ""
"对于没有此属性的宏，除非它们是内置宏，否则 `external` 行为是默认行为。对于内"
"置宏，默认值是 `yes`。"

#: src/attributes/debugger.md:409
msgid ""
"`rustc` has a [`-C collapse-macro-debuginfo`](../../rustc/codegen-options/"
"index.html#collapse-macro-debuginfo) CLI option to override both the default "
"behavior and the values of any `#[collapse_debuginfo]` attributes."
msgstr ""
"`rustc` 有一个 [`-C collapse-macro-debuginfo`](../../rustc/codegen-options/"
"index.html#collapse-macro-debuginfo) CLI 选项，可覆盖默认行为以及任何 "
"`#[collapse_debuginfo]` 属性的值。"

#: src/statements-and-expressions.md:7
msgid ""
"Rust is _primarily_ an expression language. This means that most forms of "
"value-producing or effect-causing evaluation are directed by the uniform "
"syntax category of _expressions_. Each kind of expression can typically "
"_nest_ within each other kind of expression, and rules for evaluation of "
"expressions involve specifying both the value produced by the expression and "
"the order in which its sub-expressions are themselves evaluated."
msgstr ""
"Rust _主要_是一门表达式语言。这意味着，大多数产生值或造成效果的求值形式都由统"
"一的_表达式_语法类别来指导。每一种表达式通常都可以_嵌套_在其他每一种表达式之"
"内，而表达式的求值规则需要同时规定该表达式产生的值，以及其子表达式自身被求值"
"的顺序。"

#: src/statements-and-expressions.md:9
msgid ""
"In contrast, statements serve _mostly_ to contain and explicitly sequence "
"expression evaluation."
msgstr "相比之下，语句_大多_用于容纳表达式求值，并对其进行显式排序。"

