#: src/expressions.md:616
msgid ""
"The operands of these expressions are evaluated prior to applying the "
"effects of the expression. Expressions taking multiple operands are "
"evaluated left to right as written in the source code."
msgstr ""
"这些表达式的操作数会在应用该表达式的效果之前求值。接受多个操作数的表达式会按"
"照源代码中写出的顺序从左到右求值。"

#: src/expressions.md:622
msgid ""
"Which subexpressions are the operands of an expression is determined by "
"expression precedence as per the previous section."
msgstr "哪些子表达式是某个表达式的操作数，由上一节所述的表达式优先级决定。"

#: src/expressions.md:627
msgid ""
"For example, the two `next` method calls will always be called in the same "
"order:"
msgstr "例如，两个 `next` 方法调用总会以相同顺序被调用："

#: src/expressions.md:630
msgid "// Using vec instead of array to avoid references\n"
msgstr "// 使用 vec 而不是数组，以避免引用\n"

#: src/expressions.md:631
msgid "// since there is no stable owned array iterator\n"
msgstr "// 因为在编写此示例时\n"

#: src/expressions.md:632
msgid "// at the time this example was written.\n"
msgstr "// 还没有稳定的拥有所有权的数组迭代器。\n"

#: src/expressions.md:644
msgid ""
"Since this is applied recursively, these expressions are also evaluated from "
"innermost to outermost, ignoring siblings until there are no inner "
"subexpressions."
msgstr ""
"由于这一规则会递归应用，这些表达式也会从最内层到最外层求值，并且会忽略同级表"
"达式，直到不再有内部子表达式。"

#: src/expressions.md:653
msgid "Place expressions and value expressions"
msgstr "位置表达式和值表达式"

#: src/expressions.md:659
msgid ""
"Expressions are divided into two main categories: place expressions and "
"value expressions; there is also a third, minor category of expressions "
"called assignee expressions. Within each expression, operands may likewise "
"occur in either place context or value context. The evaluation of an "
"expression depends both on its own category and the context it occurs within."
msgstr ""
"表达式分为两大类：位置表达式和值表达式；另外还有第三个较小的表达式类别，称为"
"赋值目标表达式。在每个表达式内部，操作数同样可能出现在位置上下文或值上下文"
"中。表达式的求值既取决于它自身的类别，也取决于它所处的上下文。"

#: src/expressions.md:665
msgid ""
"A _place expression_ is an expression that represents a memory location."
msgstr "_位置表达式_是表示内存位置的表达式。"

#: src/expressions.md:671
msgid ""
"These expressions are [paths](expressions/path-expr.md) which refer to local "
"variables, [static variables](items/static-items.md), [dereferences]"
"(expressions/operator-expr.md#the-dereference-operator) (`*expr`), [array "
"indexing](expressions/array-expr.md#array-and-slice-indexing-expressions) "
"expressions (`expr[expr]`), [field](expressions/field-expr.md) references "
"(`expr.f`) and parenthesized place expressions."
msgstr ""
"这些表达式包括引用局部变量的[路径](expressions/path-expr.md)、[静态变量]"
"(items/static-items.md)、[解引用](expressions/operator-expr.md#the-"
"dereference-operator)（`*expr`）、[数组索引](expressions/array-expr.md#array-"
"and-slice-indexing-expressions)表达式（`expr[expr]`）、[字段](expressions/"
"field-expr.md)引用（`expr.f`），以及带括号的位置表达式。"

#: src/expressions.md:677
msgid "All other expressions are value expressions."
msgstr "所有其他表达式都是值表达式。"

#: src/expressions.md:683
msgid "A _value expression_ is an expression that represents an actual value."
msgstr "_值表达式_是表示实际值的表达式。"

#: src/expressions.md:689
msgid "The following contexts are _place expression_ contexts:"
msgstr "以下上下文是_位置表达式_上下文："

#: src/expressions.md:691
msgid ""
"The left operand of a [compound assignment](expressions/operator-"
"expr.md#compound-assignment-expressions) expression."
msgstr ""
"[复合赋值](expressions/operator-expr.md#compound-assignment-expressions)表达"
"式的左操作数。"

#: src/expressions.md:692
msgid ""
"The operand of a unary [borrow](expressions/operator-expr.md#borrow-"
"operators), [raw borrow](expressions/operator-expr.md#raw-borrow-operators) "
"or [dereference](expressions/operator-expr.md#the-dereference-operator) "
"operator."
msgstr ""
"一元[借用](expressions/operator-expr.md#borrow-operators)、[原始借用]"
"(expressions/operator-expr.md#raw-borrow-operators)或[解引用](expressions/"
"operator-expr.md#the-dereference-operator)运算符的操作数。"

#: src/expressions.md:693
msgid ""
"The operand of a [field expression](expressions/field-expr.md#r-expr.field)."
msgstr "[字段表达式](expressions/field-expr.md#r-expr.field)的操作数。"

#: src/expressions.md:694
msgid ""
"The indexed operand of an [array indexing expression](expressions/array-"
"expr.md#r-expr.array.index)."
msgstr ""
"[数组索引表达式](expressions/array-expr.md#r-expr.array.index)中被索引的操作"
"数。"

#: src/expressions.md:695
msgid ""
"The tuple operand of a [tuple indexing expression](expressions/tuple-"
"expr.md#r-expr.tuple-index)."
msgstr ""
"[元组索引表达式](expressions/tuple-expr.md#r-expr.tuple-index)的元组操作数。"

#: src/expressions.md:696
msgid "The operand of any [implicit borrow](#implicit-borrows)."
msgstr "任何[隐式借用](#implicit-borrows)的操作数。"

#: src/expressions.md:697
msgid "The initializer of a [let statement](statements.md#let-statements)."
msgstr "[let 语句](statements.md#let-statements)的初始化器。"

#: src/expressions.md:698
msgid ""
"The [scrutinee](glossary.md#scrutinee) of an [`if let`](expressions/if-"
"expr.md#if-let-patterns), [`match`](expressions/match-expr.md), or [`while "
"let`](expressions/loop-expr.md#while-let-patterns) expression."
msgstr ""
"[`if let`](expressions/if-expr.md#if-let-patterns)、[`match`](expressions/"
"match-expr.md) 或 [`while let`](expressions/loop-expr.md#while-let-patterns) "
"表达式的[被匹配值](glossary.md#scrutinee)。"

#: src/expressions.md:699
msgid ""
"The base of a [functional update](expressions/struct-expr.md#functional-"
"update-syntax) struct expression."
msgstr ""
"[函数式更新](expressions/struct-expr.md#functional-update-syntax) struct 表达"
"式的基底。"

#: src/expressions.md:705
msgid ""
"Historically, place expressions were called _lvalues_ and value expressions "
"were called _rvalues_."
msgstr "从历史上看，位置表达式曾称为 _lvalues_，值表达式曾称为 _rvalues_。"

#: src/expressions.md:714
msgid ""
"An _assignee expression_ is an expression that appears in the left operand "
"of an [assignment](expressions/operator-expr.md#assignment-expressions) "
"expression. Explicitly, the assignee expressions are:"
msgstr ""
"_赋值目标表达式_是出现在[赋值](expressions/operator-expr.md#assignment-"
"expressions)表达式左操作数中的表达式。明确地说，赋值目标表达式包括："

#: src/expressions.md:716
msgid "Place expressions."
msgstr "位置表达式。"

#: src/expressions.md:717
msgid "[Underscores](expressions/underscore-expr.md)."
msgstr "[下划线](expressions/underscore-expr.md)。"

#: src/expressions.md:718
msgid "[Tuples](expressions/tuple-expr.md) of assignee expressions."
msgstr "由赋值目标表达式组成的[元组](expressions/tuple-expr.md)。"

#: src/expressions.md:719
msgid ""
"[Slices](expressions/array-expr.md#r-expr.array.index) of assignee "
"expressions."
msgstr ""
"由赋值目标表达式组成的[切片](expressions/array-expr.md#r-expr.array.index)。"

#: src/expressions.md:720
msgid ""
"[Tuple structs](items/structs.md#r-items.struct.tuple) of assignee "
"expressions."
msgstr ""
"由赋值目标表达式组成的[元组 struct](items/structs.md#r-items.struct.tuple)。"

#: src/expressions.md:721
msgid ""
"[Structs](expressions/struct-expr.md#r-expr.struct) of assignee expressions "
"(with optionally named fields)."
msgstr ""
"由赋值目标表达式组成的 [struct](expressions/struct-expr.md#r-expr.struct)（带"
"有可选的命名字段）。"

#: src/expressions.md:722
msgid "[Unit structs](items/structs.md#r-items.struct.unit)"
msgstr "[单元 struct](items/structs.md#r-items.struct.unit)"

#: src/expressions.md:728
msgid "Arbitrary parenthesisation is permitted inside assignee expressions."
msgstr "赋值目标表达式内部允许任意加括号。"

#: src/expressions.md:734
msgid "Moved and copied types"
msgstr "移动和复制类型"

#: src/expressions.md:740
msgid ""
"When a place expression is evaluated in a value expression context, or is "
"bound by value in a pattern, it denotes the value held _in_ that memory "
"location."
msgstr ""
"当位置表达式在值表达式上下文中求值，或在模式中按值绑定时，它表示该内存位置_中"
"_保存的值。"

#: src/expressions.md:746
msgid ""
"If the type of that value implements [`Copy`](special-types-and-"
"traits.md#copy), then the value will be copied."
msgstr ""
"如果该值的类型实现了 [`Copy`](special-types-and-traits.md#copy)，则该值会被复"
"制。"

#: src/expressions.md:752
msgid ""
"In the remaining situations, if that type is [`Sized`](special-types-and-"
"traits.md#sized), then it may be possible to move the value."
msgstr ""
"在其余情况下，如果该类型是 [`Sized`](special-types-and-traits.md#sized)，则可"
"能可以移动该值。"

#: src/expressions.md:758
msgid "Only the following place expressions may be moved out of:"
msgstr "只有以下位置表达式可以被移出："

#: src/expressions.md:760
msgid "[Variables](variables.md) which are not currently borrowed."
msgstr "当前未被借用的[变量](variables.md)。"

#: src/expressions.md:761 src/expressions.md:797
msgid "[Temporary values](#temporaries)."
msgstr "[临时值](#temporaries)。"

#: src/expressions.md:762
msgid ""
"[Fields](expressions/field-expr.md) of a place expression which can be moved "
"out of and don't implement [`Drop`](special-types-and-traits.md#drop)."
msgstr ""
"可以被移出且未实现 [`Drop`](special-types-and-traits.md#drop) 的位置表达式的"
"[字段](expressions/field-expr.md)。"

#: src/expressions.md:763
msgid ""
"The result of [dereferencing](expressions/operator-expr.md#the-dereference-"
"operator) an expression with type [`Box<T>`](special-types-and-"
"traits.md#boxt) and that can also be moved out of."
msgstr ""
"对类型为 [`Box<T>`](special-types-and-traits.md#boxt) 且本身也可以被移出的表"
"达式进行[解引用](expressions/operator-expr.md#the-dereference-operator)所得的"
"结果。"

#: src/expressions.md:769
msgid ""
"After moving out of a place expression that evaluates to a local variable, "
"the location is deinitialized and cannot be read from again until it is "
"reinitialized."
msgstr ""
"从求值为局部变量的位置表达式中移出后，该位置会被反初始化，并且在重新初始化之"
"前不能再次读取。"

#: src/expressions.md:775
msgid ""
"In all other cases, trying to use a place expression in a value expression "
"context is an error."
msgstr "在所有其他情况下，尝试在值表达式上下文中使用位置表达式都是错误。"

#: src/expressions.md:781
msgid "Mutability"
msgstr "可变性"

#: src/expressions.md:787
msgid ""
"For a place expression to be [assigned](expressions/operator-"
"expr.md#assignment-expressions) to, mutably [borrowed](expressions/operator-"
"expr.md#borrow-operators), [implicitly mutably borrowed](#implicit-borrows), "
"or bound to a pattern containing `ref mut`, it must be _mutable_. We call "
"these _mutable place expressions_. In contrast, other place expressions are "
"called _immutable place expressions_."
msgstr ""
"若要对一个位置表达式进行[赋值](expressions/operator-expr.md#assignment-"
"expressions)、进行可变[借用](expressions/operator-expr.md#borrow-operators)、"
"进行[隐式可变借用](#implicit-borrows)，或将其绑定到包含 `ref mut` 的模式，它"
"必须是_可变的_。我们称这些表达式为_可变位置表达式_。相对地，其他位置表达式称"
"为_不可变位置表达式_。"

#: src/expressions.md:793
msgid "The following expressions can be mutable place expression contexts:"
msgstr "以下表达式可以是可变位置表达式上下文："

#: src/expressions.md:795
msgid "Mutable [variables](variables.md) which are not currently borrowed."
msgstr "当前未被借用的可变[变量](variables.md)。"

#: src/expressions.md:796
msgid "[Mutable `static` items](items/static-items.md#mutable-statics)."
msgstr "[可变 `static` 条目](items/static-items.md#mutable-statics)。"

#: src/expressions.md:798
msgid ""
"[Fields](expressions/field-expr.md): this evaluates the subexpression in a "
"mutable place expression context."
msgstr ""
"[字段](expressions/field-expr.md)：这会在可变位置表达式上下文中求值子表达式。"

#: src/expressions.md:799
msgid ""
"[Dereferences](expressions/operator-expr.md#the-dereference-operator) of a "
"`*mut T` pointer."
msgstr ""
"对 `*mut T` 指针的[解引用](expressions/operator-expr.md#the-dereference-"
"operator)。"

#: src/expressions.md:800
msgid ""
"Dereference of a variable, or field of a variable, with type `&mut T`. Note: "
"This is an exception to the requirement of the next rule."
msgstr ""
"对类型为 `&mut T` 的变量或变量字段的解引用。注意：这是下一条规则要求的例外。"

#: src/expressions.md:801
msgid ""
"Dereferences of a type that implements `DerefMut`: this then requires that "
"the value being dereferenced is evaluated in a mutable place expression "
"context."
msgstr ""
"对实现了 `DerefMut` 的类型进行解引用：这随后要求被解引用的值在可变位置表达式"
"上下文中求值。"

#: src/expressions.md:802
msgid ""
"[Array indexing](expressions/array-expr.md#array-and-slice-indexing-"
"expressions) of a type that implements `IndexMut`: this then evaluates the "
"value being indexed, but not the index, in mutable place expression context."
msgstr ""
"对实现了 `IndexMut` 的类型进行[数组索引](expressions/array-expr.md#array-and-"
"slice-indexing-expressions)：这随后会在可变位置表达式上下文中求值被索引的值，"
"但不会在该上下文中求值索引。"

#: src/expressions.md:808
msgid "Temporaries"
msgstr "临时值"

#: src/expressions.md:810
msgid ""
"When using a value expression in most place expression contexts, a temporary "
"unnamed memory location is created and initialized to that value. The "
"expression evaluates to that location instead, except if [promoted]"
"(destructors.md#constant-promotion) to a `static`. The [drop scope]"
"(destructors.md#drop-scopes) of the temporary is usually the end of the "
"enclosing statement."
msgstr ""
"在大多数位置表达式上下文中使用值表达式时，会创建一个临时的未命名内存位置，并"
"用该值初始化它。该表达式随后会求值为这个位置，除非它被[提升]"
"(destructors.md#constant-promotion)为 `static`。该临时值的[drop 作用域]"
"(destructors.md#drop-scopes)通常是外围语句的末尾。"

#: src/expressions.md:816
msgid "Super macros"
msgstr "super 宏"

#: src/expressions.md:822
msgid ""
"Certain built-in macros may create [temporaries](expressions.md#r-"
"expr.temporary) whose [scopes](destructors.md#r-destructors.scope.temporary) "
"may be [extended](destructors.md#r-destructors.scope.lifetime-extension). "
"These temporaries are _super temporaries_ and these macros are _super "
"macros_. [Invocations](macros.md#r-macro.invocation) of these macros are "
"_super macro call expressions_. Arguments to these macros may be _super "
"operands_."
msgstr ""
"某些内置宏可以创建[临时值](expressions.md#r-expr.temporary)，其[作用域]"
"(destructors.md#r-destructors.scope.temporary)可以被[延长](destructors.md#r-"
"destructors.scope.lifetime-extension)。这些临时值是 _super 临时值_，这些宏是 "
"_super 宏_。这些宏的[调用](macros.md#r-macro.invocation)是 _super 宏调用表达"
"式_。这些宏的实参可以是 _super 操作数_。"

#: src/expressions.md:828
msgid ""
"When a super macro call expression is an [extending expression]"
"(destructors.md#r-destructors.scope.lifetime-extension.exprs), its super "
"operands are [extending expressions](destructors.md#r-"
"destructors.scope.lifetime-extension.exprs) and the [scopes]"
"(destructors.md#r-destructors.scope.temporary) of the super temporaries are "
"[extended](destructors.md#r-destructors.scope.lifetime-extension). See "
"[destructors.scope.lifetime-extension.exprs](destructors.md#r-"
"destructors.scope.lifetime-extension.exprs)."
msgstr ""
"当 super 宏调用表达式是[延长表达式](destructors.md#r-"
"destructors.scope.lifetime-extension.exprs)时，它的 super 操作数是[延长表达"
"式](destructors.md#r-destructors.scope.lifetime-extension.exprs)，并且 super "
"临时值的[作用域](destructors.md#r-destructors.scope.temporary)会被[延长]"
"(destructors.md#r-destructors.scope.lifetime-extension)。见 "
"[destructors.scope.lifetime-extension.exprs](destructors.md#r-"
"destructors.scope.lifetime-extension.exprs)。"

#: src/expressions.md:837
msgid "`format_args!`"
msgstr "`format_args!`"

#: src/expressions.md:843
msgid ""
"Except for the format string argument, all arguments passed to [`format_args!"
"`](../core/macro.format_args.html) are _super operands_."
msgstr ""
"除格式字符串实参外，传给 [`format_args!`](../core/macro.format_args.html) 的"
"所有实参都是 _super 操作数_。"

