#: src/expressions.md:858
msgid ""
"The super operands of [`format_args!`](../core/macro.format_args.html) are "
"[implicitly borrowed](expressions.md#r-expr.implicit-borrow) and are "
"therefore [place expression contexts](expressions.md#r-expr.place-value). "
"When a [value expression](expressions.md#r-expr.place-value) is passed as an "
"argument, it creates a _super temporary_."
msgstr ""
"[`format_args!`](../core/macro.format_args.html) 的 super 操作数会被[隐式借"
"用](expressions.md#r-expr.implicit-borrow)，因此是[位置表达式上下文]"
"(expressions.md#r-expr.place-value)。当[值表达式](expressions.md#r-"
"expr.place-value)作为实参传入时，它会创建一个 _super 临时值_。"

