msgid "// <-- The temporary is extended, allowing use here.\n"
msgstr "// <-- 临时值的作用域被延长，因此允许在这里使用。\n"

#: src/expressions.md:866
msgid ""
"The expansion of a call to [`format_args!`](../core/macro.format_args.html) "
"sometimes creates other internal _super temporaries_."
msgstr ""
"对 [`format_args!`](../core/macro.format_args.html) 的调用进行展开时，有时会"
