#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:183
msgid ""
"A _literal expression_ is an expression consisting of a single token, rather "
"than a sequence of tokens, that immediately and directly denotes the value "
"it evaluates to, rather than referring to it by name or some other "
"evaluation rule."
msgstr ""
"_字面量表达式_是由单个 token 而不是 token 序列组成的表达式；它立即且直接表示"
"其求值结果，而不是通过名称或其他求值规则来引用该值。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:189
msgid ""
"A literal is a form of [constant expression](../const_eval.md#constant-"
"expressions), so is evaluated (primarily) at compile time."
msgstr ""
"字面量是一种[常量表达式](../const_eval.md#constant-expressions)，因此（主要）"
"在编译时求值。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:195
msgid ""
"Each of the lexical [literal](../tokens.md#literals) forms described earlier "
"can make up a literal expression, as can the keywords `true` and `false`."
msgstr ""
"前面描述的每种词法[字面量](../tokens.md#literals)形式都可以构成字面量表达式，"
"关键字 `true` 和 `false` 也可以。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:198 src/expressions/loop-expr.md:303
msgid "\"hello\""
msgstr "\"hello\""

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:198
msgid ""
"// string type\n"
"'5'"
msgstr ""
"// string type\n"
"'5'"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:199
msgid "// character type\n"
msgstr "// character type\n"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:200
msgid "// integer type\n"
msgstr "// integer type\n"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:207
msgid ""
"In the descriptions below, the _string representation_ of a token is the "
"sequence of characters from the input which matched the token's production "
"in a _Lexer_ grammar snippet."
msgstr ""
"在下面的描述中，token 的_字符串表示_是输入中与该 token 在 _Lexer_ 语法片段中"
"的产生式相匹配的字符序列。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:213
msgid ""
"This string representation never includes a character `U+000D` (CR) "
"immediately followed by `U+000A` (LF): this pair would have been previously "
"transformed into a single `U+000A` (LF)."
msgstr ""
"这种字符串表示绝不会包含后面紧跟 `U+000A` (LF) 的 `U+000D` (CR) 字符：这一对"
"字符此前已经被转换为单个 `U+000A` (LF)。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:228
msgid ""
"The descriptions of textual literal expressions below make use of several "
"forms of _escape_."
msgstr "下面对文本字面量表达式的描述使用了若干形式的_转义_。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:234
msgid "Each form of escape is characterised by:"
msgstr "每种转义形式都由以下内容刻画："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:235
msgid ""
"an _escape sequence_: a sequence of characters, which always begins with "
"`U+005C` (`\\`)"
msgstr "一个_转义序列_：一串字符，它总是以 `U+005C` (`\\`) 开头"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:236
msgid ""
"an _escaped value_: either a single character or an empty sequence of "
"characters"
msgstr "一个_转义后的值_：单个字符或一个空字符序列"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:238
msgid "In the definitions of escapes below:"
msgstr "在下面的转义定义中："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:239
msgid "An _octal digit_ is any of the characters in the range \\[`0`\\-`7`\\]."
msgstr "_八进制数字_是范围 \\[`0`\\-`7`\\] 内的任意字符。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:240
msgid ""
"A _hexadecimal digit_ is any of the characters in the ranges \\[`0`\\-"
"`9`\\], \\[`a`\\-`f`\\], or \\[`A`\\-`F`\\]."
msgstr ""
"_十六进制数字_是范围 \\[`0`\\-`9`\\]、\\[`a`\\-`f`\\] 或 \\[`A`\\-`F`\\] 内的"
"任意字符。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:246
msgid "Simple escapes"
msgstr "简单转义"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:248
msgid ""
"Each sequence of characters occurring in the first column of the following "
"table is an escape sequence."
msgstr "下表第一列中出现的每个字符序列都是一个转义序列。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:250
msgid ""
"In each case, the escaped value is the character given in the corresponding "
"entry in the second column."
msgstr "在每种情况下，转义后的值都是第二列对应条目给出的字符。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:252
msgid "Escape sequence"
msgstr "转义序列"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:252
msgid "Escaped value"
msgstr "转义后的值"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:254
msgid "U+0000 (NUL)"
msgstr "U+0000 (NUL)"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:255
msgid "U+0009 (HT)"
msgstr "U+0009 (HT)"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:256
msgid "U+000A (LF)"
msgstr "U+000A (LF)"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:257
msgid "U+000D (CR)"
msgstr "U+000D (CR)"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:258
msgid "U+0022 (QUOTATION MARK)"
msgstr "U+0022 (QUOTATION MARK)"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:259
msgid "U+0027 (APOSTROPHE)"
msgstr "U+0027 (APOSTROPHE)"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:260
msgid "U+005C (REVERSE SOLIDUS)"
msgstr "U+005C (REVERSE SOLIDUS)"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:266
msgid "8-bit escapes"
msgstr "8 位转义"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:268
msgid ""
"The escape sequence consists of `\\x` followed by two hexadecimal digits."
msgstr "该转义序列由 `\\x` 后跟两个十六进制数字组成。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:270 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:289
msgid ""
"The escaped value is the character whose [Unicode scalar value](http://"
"www.unicode.org/glossary/#unicode_scalar_value) is the result of "
"interpreting the final two characters in the escape sequence as a "
"hexadecimal integer, as if by [`u8::from_str_radix`](../../std/"
"primitive.u8.html#method.from_str_radix) with radix 16."
msgstr ""
"转义后的值是这样一个字符：它的 [Unicode 标量值](http://www.unicode.org/"
"glossary/#unicode_scalar_value)是将该转义序列中最后两个字符解释为十六进制整数"
"的结果，如同以基数 16 调用 [`u8::from_str_radix`](../../std/"
"primitive.u8.html#method.from_str_radix) 一样。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:276
msgid ""
"The escaped value therefore has a [Unicode scalar value](http://"
"www.unicode.org/glossary/#unicode_scalar_value) in the range of [`u8`](../"
"types/numeric.md)."
msgstr ""
"因此，转义后的值具有位于 [`u8`](../types/numeric.md) 范围内的 [Unicode 标量"
"值](http://www.unicode.org/glossary/#unicode_scalar_value)。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:285
msgid "7-bit escapes"
msgstr "7 位转义"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:287
msgid ""
"The escape sequence consists of `\\x` followed by an octal digit then a "
"hexadecimal digit."
msgstr "该转义序列由 `\\x` 后跟一个八进制数字，再后跟一个十六进制数字组成。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:297
msgid ""
"The escape sequence consists of `\\u{`, followed by a sequence of characters "
"each of which is a hexadecimal digit or `_`, followed by `}`."
msgstr ""
"该转义序列由 `\\u{` 后跟一串字符，再后跟 `}` 组成；这串字符中的每个字符都是十"
"六进制数字或 `_`。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:299
msgid ""
"The escaped value is the character whose [Unicode scalar value](http://"
"www.unicode.org/glossary/#unicode_scalar_value) is the result of "
"interpreting the hexadecimal digits contained in the escape sequence as a "
"hexadecimal integer, as if by [`u32::from_str_radix`](../../std/"
"primitive.u32.html#method.from_str_radix) with radix 16."
msgstr ""
"转义后的值是这样一个字符：它的 [Unicode 标量值](http://www.unicode.org/"
"glossary/#unicode_scalar_value)是将该转义序列中包含的十六进制数字解释为十六进"
"制整数的结果，如同以基数 16 调用 [`u32::from_str_radix`](../../std/"
"primitive.u32.html#method.from_str_radix) 一样。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:305
msgid ""
"The permitted forms of a [CHAR_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-CHAR_LITERAL) "
"or [STRING_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-STRING_LITERAL) token ensure that "
"there is such a character."
msgstr ""
"[CHAR_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-CHAR_LITERAL) 或 [STRING_LITERAL](../"
"tokens.md#grammar-STRING_LITERAL) token 的允许形式保证存在这样的字符。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:314
msgid "String continuation escapes"
msgstr "字符串续行转义"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:316
msgid ""
"The escape sequence consists of `\\` followed immediately by `U+000A` (LF), "
"and all following whitespace characters before the next non-whitespace "
"character. For this purpose, the whitespace characters are `U+0009` (HT), "
"`U+000A` (LF), `U+000D` (CR), and `U+0020` (SPACE)."
msgstr ""
"该转义序列由 `\\` 后面立即跟随的 `U+000A` (LF)，以及在下一个非空白字符之前所"
"有随后出现的空白字符组成。就此而言，空白字符是 `U+0009` (HT)、`U+000A` (LF)、"
"`U+000D` (CR) 和 `U+0020` (SPACE)。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:318
msgid "The escaped value is an empty sequence of characters."
msgstr "转义后的值是一个空字符序列。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:324
msgid ""
"The effect of this form of escape is that a string continuation skips "
"following whitespace, including additional newlines. Thus `a`, `b` and `c` "
"are equal:"
msgstr ""
"这种转义形式的效果是，字符串续行会跳过随后的空白，包括额外的换行。因此，`a`、"
"`b` 和 `c` 相等："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:327
msgid "\"foobar\""
msgstr "\"foobar\""

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:328 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:330
msgid "\"foo\\\n"
msgstr "\"foo\\\n"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:338
msgid ""
"Skipping additional newlines (as in example c) is potentially confusing and "
"unexpected. This behavior may be adjusted in the future. Until a decision is "
"made, it is recommended to avoid relying on skipping multiple newlines with "
"line continuations. See [this issue](https://github.com/rust-lang/reference/"
"pull/1042) for more information."
msgstr ""
"跳过额外的换行（如示例 c 中所示）可能令人困惑且出乎意料。这个行为将来可能会调"
"整。在作出决定之前，建议避免依赖通过续行跳过多个换行。更多信息见[此议题]"
"(https://github.com/rust-lang/reference/pull/1042)。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:347
msgid "Character literal expressions"
msgstr "字符字面量表达式"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:353
msgid ""
"A character literal expression consists of a single [CHAR_LITERAL](../"
"tokens.md#grammar-CHAR_LITERAL) token."
msgstr ""
"字符字面量表达式由单个 [CHAR_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-CHAR_LITERAL) "
"token 组成。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:359
msgid "The expression's type is the primitive [`char`](../types/char.md) type."
msgstr "该表达式的类型是基本类型 [`char`](../types/char.md)。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:365 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:440
#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:513 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:587
#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:668
msgid "The token must not have a suffix."
msgstr "该 token 不得带有后缀。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:371 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:519
msgid ""
"The token's _literal content_ is the sequence of characters following the "
"first `U+0027` (`'`) and preceding the last `U+0027` (`'`) in the string "
"representation of the token."
msgstr ""
"该 token 的_字面量内容_是其字符串表示中第一个 `U+0027` (`'`) 之后、最后一个 "
"`U+0027` (`'`) 之前的字符序列。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:377 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:525
msgid ""
"The literal expression's _represented character_ is derived from the literal "
"content as follows:"
msgstr "字面量表达式_所表示的字符_按如下方式从字面量内容派生："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:383 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:531
msgid ""
"If the literal content is one of the following forms of escape sequence, the "
"represented character is the escape sequence's escaped value:"
msgstr ""
"如果字面量内容是以下形式之一的转义序列，则所表示的字符是该转义序列的转义后的"
"值："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:384 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:459
#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:532 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:606
msgid "[Simple escapes](#simple-escapes)"
msgstr "[简单转义](#simple-escapes)"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:385 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:460
msgid "[7-bit escapes](#7-bit-escapes)"
msgstr "[7 位转义](#7-bit-escapes)"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:386 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:461
msgid "[Unicode escapes](#unicode-escapes)"
msgstr "[Unicode 转义](#unicode-escapes)"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:392 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:539
msgid ""
"Otherwise the represented character is the single character that makes up "
"the literal content."
msgstr "否则，所表示的字符就是组成该字面量内容的单个字符。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:398
msgid ""
"The expression's value is the [`char`](../types/char.md) corresponding to "
"the represented character's [Unicode scalar value](http://www.unicode.org/"
"glossary/#unicode_scalar_value)."
msgstr ""
"该表达式的值是与所表示字符的 [Unicode 标量值](http://www.unicode.org/"
"glossary/#unicode_scalar_value)相对应的 [`char`](../types/char.md)。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:404
msgid ""
"The permitted forms of a [CHAR_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-CHAR_LITERAL) "
"token ensure that these rules always produce a single character."
msgstr ""
"[CHAR_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-CHAR_LITERAL) token 的允许形式保证这些规"
"则总是产生单个字符。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:409
msgid "Examples of character literal expressions:"
msgstr "字符字面量表达式的示例："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:412
msgid "'R'"
msgstr "'R'"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:412
msgid ""
"// R\n"
"'\\''"
msgstr ""
"// R\n"
"'\\''"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:413
msgid ""
"// '\n"
"'\\x52'"
msgstr ""
"// '\n"
"'\\x52'"

