msgid ""
"// R\n"
"'\\u{00E6}'"
msgstr ""
"// R\n"
"'\\u{00E6}'"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:422
msgid "String literal expressions"
msgstr "字符串字面量表达式"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:428
msgid ""
"A string literal expression consists of a single [STRING_LITERAL](../"
"tokens.md#grammar-STRING_LITERAL) or [RAW_STRING_LITERAL](../"
"tokens.md#grammar-RAW_STRING_LITERAL) token."
msgstr ""
"字符串字面量表达式由单个 [STRING_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-"
"STRING_LITERAL) 或 [RAW_STRING_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-"
"RAW_STRING_LITERAL) token 组成。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:434
msgid ""
"The expression's type is a shared reference (with `static` lifetime) to the "
"primitive [`str`](../types/str.md) type. That is, the type is `&'static str`."
msgstr ""
"该表达式的类型是指向基本类型 [`str`](../types/str.md) 的共享引用（具有 "
"`static` 生命周期）。也就是说，该类型是 `&'static str`。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:446 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:593
msgid ""
"The token's _literal content_ is the sequence of characters following the "
"first `U+0022` (`\"`) and preceding the last `U+0022` (`\"`) in the string "
"representation of the token."
msgstr ""
"该 token 的_字面量内容_是其字符串表示中第一个 `U+0022` (`\"`) 之后、最后一个 "
"`U+0022` (`\"`) 之前的字符序列。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:452 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:599
msgid ""
"The literal expression's _represented string_ is a sequence of characters "
"derived from the literal content as follows:"
msgstr "字面量表达式_所表示的字符串_是按如下方式从字面量内容派生出的字符序列："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:458
msgid ""
"If the token is a [STRING_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-STRING_LITERAL), "
"each escape sequence of any of the following forms occurring in the literal "
"content is replaced by the escape sequence's escaped value."
msgstr ""
"如果该 token 是 [STRING_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-STRING_LITERAL)，则字面"
"量内容中出现的以下任一形式的每个转义序列都会被替换为该转义序列的转义后的值。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:462 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:608
msgid "[String continuation escapes](#string-continuation-escapes)"
msgstr "[字符串续行转义](#string-continuation-escapes)"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:464
msgid ""
"These replacements take place in left-to-right order. For example, the token "
"`\"\\\\x41\"` is converted to the characters `\\` `x` `4` `1`."
msgstr ""
"这些替换按从左到右的顺序进行。例如，token `\"\\\\x41\"` 会被转换为字符 `\\` "
"`x` `4` `1`。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:470
msgid ""
"If the token is a [RAW_STRING_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-"
"RAW_STRING_LITERAL), the represented string is identical to the literal "
"content."
msgstr ""
"如果该 token 是 [RAW_STRING_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-"
"RAW_STRING_LITERAL)，则所表示的字符串与字面量内容相同。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:476
msgid ""
"The expression's value is a reference to a statically allocated [`str`](../"
"types/str.md) containing the UTF-8 encoding of the represented string."
msgstr ""
"该表达式的值是对一个静态分配的 [`str`](../types/str.md) 的引用，该 [`str`]"
"(../types/str.md) 包含所表示字符串的 UTF-8 编码。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:478
msgid "Examples of string literal expressions:"
msgstr "字符串字面量表达式的示例："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:495
msgid "Byte literal expressions"
msgstr "字节字面量表达式"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:501
msgid ""
"A byte literal expression consists of a single [BYTE_LITERAL](../"
"tokens.md#grammar-BYTE_LITERAL) token."
msgstr ""
"字节字面量表达式由单个 [BYTE_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-BYTE_LITERAL) "
"token 组成。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:507
msgid ""
"The expression's type is the primitive [`u8`](../types/numeric.md) type."
msgstr "该表达式的类型是基本类型 [`u8`](../types/numeric.md)。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:533 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:607
msgid "[8-bit escapes](#8-bit-escapes)"
msgstr "[8 位转义](#8-bit-escapes)"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:545
msgid ""
"The expression's value is the represented character's [Unicode scalar value]"
"(http://www.unicode.org/glossary/#unicode_scalar_value)."
msgstr ""
"该表达式的值是所表示字符的 [Unicode 标量值](http://www.unicode.org/glossary/"
"#unicode_scalar_value)。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:551
msgid ""
"The permitted forms of a [BYTE_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-BYTE_LITERAL) "
"token ensure that these rules always produce a single character, whose "
"Unicode scalar value is in the range of [`u8`](../types/numeric.md)."
msgstr ""
"[BYTE_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-BYTE_LITERAL) token 的允许形式保证这些规"
"则总是产生单个字符，且其 Unicode 标量值位于 [`u8`](../types/numeric.md) 的范"
"围内。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:556
msgid "Examples of byte literal expressions:"
msgstr "字节字面量表达式的示例："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:559
msgid "b'R'"
msgstr "b'R'"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:559
msgid ""
"// 82\n"
"b'\\''"
msgstr ""
"// 82\n"
"b'\\''"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:560
msgid ""
"// 39\n"
"b'\\x52'"
msgstr ""
"// 39\n"
"b'\\x52'"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:561
msgid ""
"// 82\n"
"b'\\xA0'"
msgstr ""
"// 82\n"
"b'\\xA0'"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:562
msgid "// 160\n"
msgstr "// 160\n"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:569
msgid "Byte string literal expressions"
msgstr "字节字符串字面量表达式"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:575
msgid ""
"A byte string literal expression consists of a single [BYTE_STRING_LITERAL]"
"(../tokens.md#grammar-BYTE_STRING_LITERAL) or [RAW_BYTE_STRING_LITERAL](../"
"tokens.md#grammar-RAW_BYTE_STRING_LITERAL) token."
msgstr ""
"字节字符串字面量表达式由单个 [BYTE_STRING_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-"
"BYTE_STRING_LITERAL) 或 [RAW_BYTE_STRING_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-"
"RAW_BYTE_STRING_LITERAL) token 组成。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:581
msgid ""
"The expression's type is a shared reference (with `static` lifetime) to an "
"array whose element type is [`u8`](../types/numeric.md). That is, the type "
"is `&'static [u8; N]`, where `N` is the number of bytes in the represented "
"string described below."
msgstr ""
"该表达式的类型是指向某个数组的共享引用（具有 `static` 生命周期），该数组的元"
"素类型为 [`u8`](../types/numeric.md)。也就是说，该类型是 `&'static [u8; N]`，"
"其中 `N` 是下面描述的所表示字符串中的字节数。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:605
msgid ""
"If the token is a [BYTE_STRING_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-"
"BYTE_STRING_LITERAL), each escape sequence of any of the following forms "
"occurring in the literal content is replaced by the escape sequence's "
"escaped value."
msgstr ""
"如果该 token 是 [BYTE_STRING_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-"
"BYTE_STRING_LITERAL)，则字面量内容中出现的以下任一形式的每个转义序列都会被替"
"换为该转义序列的转义后的值。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:610
msgid ""
"These replacements take place in left-to-right order. For example, the token "
"`b\"\\\\x41\"` is converted to the characters `\\` `x` `4` `1`."
msgstr ""
"这些替换按从左到右的顺序进行。例如，token `b\"\\\\x41\"` 会被转换为字符 `\\` "
"`x` `4` `1`。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:616
msgid ""
"If the token is a [RAW_BYTE_STRING_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-"
"RAW_BYTE_STRING_LITERAL), the represented string is identical to the literal "
"content."
msgstr ""
"如果该 token 是 [RAW_BYTE_STRING_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-"
"RAW_BYTE_STRING_LITERAL)，则所表示的字符串与字面量内容相同。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:622
msgid ""
"The expression's value is a reference to a statically allocated array "
"containing the [Unicode scalar values](http://www.unicode.org/glossary/"
"#unicode_scalar_value) of the characters in the represented string, in the "
"same order."
msgstr ""
"该表达式的值是对一个静态分配数组的引用，该数组按相同顺序包含所表示字符串中各"
"字符的 [Unicode 标量值](http://www.unicode.org/glossary/"
"#unicode_scalar_value)。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:628
msgid ""
"The permitted forms of [BYTE_STRING_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-"
"BYTE_STRING_LITERAL) and [RAW_BYTE_STRING_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-"
"RAW_BYTE_STRING_LITERAL) tokens ensure that these rules always produce array "
"element values in the range of [`u8`](../types/numeric.md)."
msgstr ""
"[BYTE_STRING_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-BYTE_STRING_LITERAL) 和 "
"[RAW_BYTE_STRING_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-RAW_BYTE_STRING_LITERAL) "
"token 的允许形式保证这些规则总是产生位于 [`u8`](../types/numeric.md) 范围内的"
"数组元素值。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:633
msgid "Examples of byte string literal expressions:"
msgstr "字节字符串字面量表达式的示例："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:650
msgid "C string literal expressions"
msgstr "C 字符串字面量表达式"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:656
msgid ""
"A C string literal expression consists of a single [C_STRING_LITERAL](../"
"tokens.md#grammar-C_STRING_LITERAL) or [RAW_C_STRING_LITERAL](../"
"tokens.md#grammar-RAW_C_STRING_LITERAL) token."
msgstr ""
"C 字符串字面量表达式由单个 [C_STRING_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-"
"C_STRING_LITERAL) 或 [RAW_C_STRING_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-"
"RAW_C_STRING_LITERAL) token 组成。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:662
msgid ""
"The expression's type is a shared reference (with `static` lifetime) to the "
"standard library [CStr](../../core/ffi/c_str/struct.CStr.html) type. That "
"is, the type is `&'static core::ffi::CStr`."
msgstr ""
"该表达式的类型是指向标准库 [CStr](../../core/ffi/c_str/struct.CStr.html) 类型"
"的共享引用（具有 `static` 生命周期）。也就是说，该类型是 `&'static "
"core::ffi::CStr`。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:674
msgid ""
"The token's _literal content_ is the sequence of characters following the "
"first `\"` and preceding the last `\"` in the string representation of the "
"token."
msgstr ""
"该 token 的_字面量内容_是其字符串表示中第一个 `\"` 之后、最后一个 `\"` 之前的"
"字符序列。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:680
msgid ""
"The literal expression's _represented bytes_ are a sequence of bytes derived "
"from the literal content as follows:"
msgstr "字面量表达式_所表示的字节_是按如下方式从字面量内容派生出的字节序列："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:686
msgid ""
"If the token is a [C_STRING_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-C_STRING_LITERAL), "
"the literal content is treated as a sequence of items, each of which is "
"either a single Unicode character other than `\\` or an [escape](#escapes). "
"The sequence of items is converted to a sequence of bytes as follows:"
msgstr ""
"如果该 token 是 [C_STRING_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-C_STRING_LITERAL)，则"
"字面量内容会被视为一串项，其中每一项要么是除 `\\` 以外的单个 Unicode 字符，要"
"么是一个[转义](#escapes)。这串项按如下方式转换为字节序列："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:687
msgid "Each single Unicode character contributes its UTF-8 representation."
msgstr "每个单独的 Unicode 字符贡献其 UTF-8 表示。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:688
msgid ""
"Each [simple escape](#simple-escapes) contributes the [Unicode scalar value]"
"(http://www.unicode.org/glossary/#unicode_scalar_value) of its escaped value."
msgstr ""
"每个[简单转义](#simple-escapes)贡献其转义后的值的 [Unicode 标量值](http://"
"www.unicode.org/glossary/#unicode_scalar_value)。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:689
msgid ""
"Each [8-bit escape](#8-bit-escapes) contributes a single byte containing the "
"[Unicode scalar value](http://www.unicode.org/glossary/"
"#unicode_scalar_value) of its escaped value."
msgstr ""
"每个 [8 位转义](#8-bit-escapes)贡献一个字节，该字节包含其转义后的值的 "
"[Unicode 标量值](http://www.unicode.org/glossary/#unicode_scalar_value)。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:690
msgid ""
"Each [unicode escape](#unicode-escapes) contributes the UTF-8 representation "
"of its escaped value."
msgstr "每个 [unicode 转义](#unicode-escapes)贡献其转义后的值的 UTF-8 表示。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:691
msgid ""
"Each [string continuation escape](#string-continuation-escapes) contributes "
"no bytes."
msgstr "每个[字符串续行转义](#string-continuation-escapes)不贡献任何字节。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:697
msgid ""
"If the token is a [RAW_C_STRING_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-"
"RAW_C_STRING_LITERAL), the represented bytes are the UTF-8 encoding of the "
"literal content."
msgstr ""
"如果该 token 是 [RAW_C_STRING_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-"
"RAW_C_STRING_LITERAL)，则所表示的字节是字面量内容的 UTF-8 编码。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:703
msgid ""
"The permitted forms of [C_STRING_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-"
"C_STRING_LITERAL) and [RAW_C_STRING_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-"
"RAW_C_STRING_LITERAL) tokens ensure that the represented bytes never include "
"a null byte."
msgstr ""
"[C_STRING_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-C_STRING_LITERAL) 和 "
"[RAW_C_STRING_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-RAW_C_STRING_LITERAL) token 的允"
"许形式保证所表示的字节绝不会包含 null 字节。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:712
msgid ""
"The expression's value is a reference to a statically allocated [CStr](../../"
"core/ffi/c_str/struct.CStr.html) whose array of bytes contains the "
"represented bytes followed by a null byte."
msgstr ""
"该表达式的值是对一个静态分配的 [CStr](../../core/ffi/c_str/struct.CStr.html) "
"的引用，其字节数组包含所表示的字节，并在其后跟有一个 null 字节。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:714
msgid "Examples of C string literal expressions:"
msgstr "C 字符串字面量表达式的示例："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:730
msgid "\"\\xE6\""
msgstr "\"\\xE6\""

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:730
msgid "// [230]\n"
msgstr "// [230]\n"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:731
msgid "// [195, 166]\n"
msgstr "// [195, 166]\n"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:738
msgid "Integer literal expressions"
msgstr "整数字面量表达式"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:744
msgid ""
"An integer literal expression consists of a single [INTEGER_LITERAL](../"
"tokens.md#grammar-INTEGER_LITERAL) token."
msgstr ""
"整数字面量表达式由单个 [INTEGER_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-"
"INTEGER_LITERAL) token 组成。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:750
msgid ""
"If the token has a [suffix](../tokens.md#suffixes), the suffix must be the "
"name of one of the [primitive integer types](../types/numeric.md): `u8`, "
"`i8`, `u16`, `i16`, `u32`, `i32`, `u64`, `i64`, `u128`, `i128`, `usize`, or "
"`isize`, and the expression has that type."
msgstr ""
"如果该 token 带有[后缀](../tokens.md#suffixes)，则后缀必须是某个[基本整数类"
"型](../types/numeric.md)的名称：`u8`、`i8`、`u16`、`i16`、`u32`、`i32`、"
"`u64`、`i64`、`u128`、`i128`、`usize` 或 `isize`，且该表达式具有该类型。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:756 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:886
msgid ""
"If the token has no suffix, the expression's type is determined by type "
"inference:"
msgstr "如果该 token 没有后缀，则表达式的类型由类型推断决定："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:762
msgid ""
"If an integer type can be _uniquely_ determined from the surrounding program "
"context, the expression has that type."
msgstr "如果可以从周围程序上下文_唯一_确定一个整数类型，则该表达式具有该类型。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:768
msgid ""
"If the program context under-constrains the type, it defaults to the signed "
"32-bit integer `i32`."
msgstr "如果程序上下文对该类型的约束不足，则默认使用有符号 32 位整数 `i32`。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:774 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:904
msgid ""
"If the program context over-constrains the type, it is considered a static "
"type error."
msgstr "如果程序上下文对该类型约束过度，则视为静态类型错误。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:776
msgid "Examples of integer literal expressions:"
msgstr "整数字面量表达式的示例："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:779 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:780
#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:785 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:788
#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:791
msgid "// type i32\n"
msgstr "// type i32\n"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:781 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:782
msgid "// type u32\n"
msgstr "// type u32\n"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:783
msgid "// type u64\n"
msgstr "// type u64\n"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:786
msgid "// type u8\n"
msgstr "// type u8\n"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:789
msgid "// type i16\n"
msgstr "// type i16\n"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:792
msgid "// type i64\n"
msgstr "// type i64\n"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:794
msgid "// type usize\n"
msgstr "// type usize\n"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:801 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:921
msgid ""
"The value of the expression is determined from the string representation of "
"the token as follows:"
msgstr "该表达式的值按如下方式从该 token 的字符串表示确定："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:807
msgid ""
"An integer radix is chosen by inspecting the first two characters of the "
"string, as follows:"
msgstr "通过检查该字符串的前两个字符来选择整数基数，如下所示："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:809
msgid "`0b` indicates radix 2"
msgstr "`0b` 表示基数 2"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:810
msgid "`0o` indicates radix 8"
msgstr "`0o` 表示基数 8"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:811
msgid "`0x` indicates radix 16"
msgstr "`0x` 表示基数 16"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:812
msgid "otherwise the radix is 10."
msgstr "否则基数为 10。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:818
msgid ""
"If the radix is not 10, the first two characters are removed from the string."
msgstr "如果基数不是 10，则从该字符串中移除前两个字符。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:824 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:927
msgid "Any suffix is removed from the string."
msgstr "从该字符串中移除任何后缀。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:830 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:933
msgid "Any underscores are removed from the string."
msgstr "从该字符串中移除任何下划线。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:836
msgid ""
"The string is converted to a `u128` value as if by [`u128::from_str_radix`]"
"(../../std/primitive.u128.html#method.from_str_radix) with the chosen radix. "
"If the value does not fit in `u128`, it is a compiler error."
msgstr ""
"该字符串会按所选择的基数转换为一个 `u128` 值，如同调用 "
"[`u128::from_str_radix`](../../std/"
"primitive.u128.html#method.from_str_radix) 一样。如果该值无法放入 `u128`，则"
"为编译器错误。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:842
msgid ""
"The `u128` value is converted to the expression's type via a [numeric cast]"
"(operator-expr.md#numeric-cast)."
msgstr ""
"该 `u128` 值通过[数值转换](operator-expr.md#numeric-cast)转换为表达式的类型。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:848
msgid ""
"The final cast will truncate the value of the literal if it does not fit in "
"the expression's type. `rustc` includes a [lint check](../attributes/"
"diagnostics.md#lint-check-attributes) named `overflowing_literals`, "
"defaulting to `deny`, which rejects expressions where this occurs."
msgstr ""
"如果字面量的值无法放入表达式的类型，最终转换会截断该值。`rustc` 包含一个名为 "
"`overflowing_literals` 的 [lint 检查](../attributes/diagnostics.md#lint-"
"check-attributes)，其默认级别为 `deny`，会拒绝发生这种情况的表达式。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:857
msgid ""
"`-1i8`, for example, is an application of the [negation operator](operator-"
"expr.md#negation-operators) to the literal expression `1i8`, not a single "
"integer literal expression. See [Overflow](operator-expr.md#overflow) for "
"notes on representing the most negative value for a signed type."
msgstr ""
"例如，`-1i8` 是将[取负运算符](operator-expr.md#negation-operators)应用于字面"
"量表达式 `1i8`，而不是单个整数字面量表达式。关于如何表示有符号类型的最小负"
"值，见[溢出](operator-expr.md#overflow)中的说明。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:866
msgid "Floating-point literal expressions"
msgstr "浮点数字面量表达式"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:872
msgid "A floating-point literal expression has one of two forms:"
msgstr "浮点数字面量表达式具有以下两种形式之一："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:873
msgid "a single [FLOAT_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-FLOAT_LITERAL) token"
msgstr "单个 [FLOAT_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-FLOAT_LITERAL) token"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:874
msgid ""
"a single [INTEGER_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-INTEGER_LITERAL) token which "
"has a suffix and no radix indicator"
msgstr ""
"单个 [INTEGER_LITERAL](../tokens.md#grammar-INTEGER_LITERAL) token，它带有后"
"缀且没有进制指示符"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:880
msgid ""
"If the token has a [suffix](../tokens.md#suffixes), the suffix must be the "
"name of one of the [primitive floating-point types](../types/"
"numeric.md#floating-point-types): `f32` or `f64`, and the expression has "
"that type."
msgstr ""
"如果该 token 带有[后缀](../tokens.md#suffixes)，则后缀必须是某个[基本浮点数类"
"型](../types/numeric.md#floating-point-types)的名称：`f32` 或 `f64`，且该表达"
"式具有该类型。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:892
msgid ""
"If a floating-point type can be _uniquely_ determined from the surrounding "
"program context, the expression has that type."
msgstr ""
"如果可以从周围程序上下文_唯一_确定一个浮点数类型，则该表达式具有该类型。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:898
msgid "If the program context under-constrains the type, it defaults to `f64`."
msgstr "如果程序上下文对该类型的约束不足，则默认使用 `f64`。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:906
msgid "Examples of floating-point literal expressions:"
msgstr "浮点数字面量表达式的示例："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:909 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:910
#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:912 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:914
msgid "// type f64\n"
msgstr "// type f64\n"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:911 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:913
msgid "// type f32\n"
msgstr "// type f32\n"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:939
msgid ""
"The string is converted to the expression's type as if by [`f32::from_str`]"
"(../../core/primitive.f32.md#method.from_str) or [`f64::from_str`](../../"
"core/primitive.f64.md#method.from_str)."
msgstr ""
"该字符串会转换为表达式的类型，如同调用 [`f32::from_str`](../../core/"
"primitive.f32.md#method.from_str) 或 [`f64::from_str`](../../core/"
"primitive.f64.md#method.from_str) 一样。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:945
msgid ""
"`-1.0`, for example, is an application of the [negation operator](operator-"
"expr.md#negation-operators) to the literal expression `1.0`, not a single "
"floating-point literal expression."
msgstr ""
"例如，`-1.0` 是将[取负运算符](operator-expr.md#negation-operators)应用于字面"
"量表达式 `1.0`，而不是单个浮点数字面量表达式。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:954
msgid ""
"`inf` and `NaN` are not literal tokens. The [`f32::INFINITY`](../../std/"
"primitive.f32.html#associatedconstant.INFINITY), [`f64::INFINITY`](../../std/"
"primitive.f64.html#associatedconstant.INFINITY), [`f32::NAN`](../../std/"
"primitive.f32.html#associatedconstant.NAN), and [`f64::NAN`](../../std/"
"primitive.f64.html#associatedconstant.NAN) constants can be used instead of "
"literal expressions. In `rustc`, a literal large enough to be evaluated as "
"infinite will trigger the `overflowing_literals` lint check."
msgstr ""
"`inf` 和 `NaN` 不是字面量 token。可以使用 [`f32::INFINITY`](../../std/"
"primitive.f32.html#associatedconstant.INFINITY)、[`f64::INFINITY`](../../std/"
"primitive.f64.html#associatedconstant.INFINITY)、[`f32::NAN`](../../std/"
"primitive.f32.html#associatedconstant.NAN) 和 [`f64::NAN`](../../std/"
"primitive.f64.html#associatedconstant.NAN) 常量来代替字面量表达式。在 "
"`rustc` 中，大到足以被求值为无穷大的字面量会触发 `overflowing_literals` lint "
"检查。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:963
msgid "Boolean literal expressions"
msgstr "布尔字面量表达式"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:969
msgid ""
"A boolean literal expression consists of one of the keywords `true` or "
"`false`."
msgstr "布尔字面量表达式由关键字 `true` 或 `false` 之一组成。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:975
msgid ""
"The expression's type is the primitive [boolean type](../types/boolean.md), "
"and its value is:"
msgstr "该表达式的类型是基本[布尔类型](../types/boolean.md)，其值为："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:976
msgid "true if the keyword is `true`"
msgstr "如果关键字是 `true`，则为 true"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:977
msgid "false if the keyword is `false`"
msgstr "如果关键字是 `false`，则为 false"

