#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:201
msgid ""
"A _block expression_, or _block_, is a control flow expression and anonymous "
"namespace scope for items and variable declarations."
msgstr ""
"_块表达式_（或_块_）是一种控制流表达式，也是项和变量声明的匿名命名空间作用"
"域。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:207
msgid ""
"As a control flow expression, a block sequentially executes its component "
"non-item declaration statements and then its final optional expression."
msgstr ""
"作为控制流表达式，块会顺序执行其组成的非项声明语句，然后执行其可选的最终表达"
"式。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:213
msgid ""
"As an anonymous namespace scope, item declarations are only in scope inside "
"the block itself and variables declared by `let` statements are in scope "
"from the next statement until the end of the block. See the [scopes](../"
"names/scopes.md) chapter for more details."
msgstr ""
"作为匿名命名空间作用域，项声明只在块本身内部处于作用域内，而 `let` 语句声明的"
"变量从下一条语句开始直到块结束都处于作用域内。更多细节请参见[作用域](../"
"names/scopes.md)章节。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:219
msgid ""
"The syntax for a block is `{`, then any [inner attributes](../"
"attributes.md), then any number of [statements](../statements.md), then an "
"optional expression, called the final operand, and finally a `}`."
msgstr ""
"块的语法是 `{`，随后是任意[内部属性](../attributes.md)，随后是任意数量的[语"
"句](../statements.md)，随后是一个可选表达式（称为最终操作数），最后是 `}`。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:225
msgid ""
"Statements are usually required to be followed by a semicolon, with two "
"exceptions:"
msgstr "语句通常必须后跟分号，但有两个例外："

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:227
msgid "Item declaration statements do not need to be followed by a semicolon."
msgstr "项声明语句不需要后跟分号。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:228
msgid ""
"Expression statements usually require a following semicolon except if its "
"outer expression is a flow control expression."
msgstr "表达式语句通常需要后跟分号，但如果它的外层表达式是控制流表达式则例外。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:234
msgid ""
"Furthermore, extra semicolons between statements are allowed, but these "
"semicolons do not affect semantics."
msgstr "此外，语句之间允许出现额外的分号，但这些分号不影响语义。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:240
msgid ""
"When evaluating a block expression, each statement, except for item "
"declaration statements, is executed sequentially."
msgstr "求值块表达式时，除项声明语句外，每条语句都会按顺序执行。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:246
msgid "Then the final operand is executed, if given."
msgstr "然后，如果给出了最终操作数，则执行该最终操作数。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:252
msgid ""
"When a block contains a [final operand](block-expr.md#r-expr.block.inner-"
"attributes), the block has the type and value of that final operand."
msgstr ""
"当块包含[最终操作数](block-expr.md#r-expr.block.inner-attributes)时，该块具有"
"该最终操作数的类型和值。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:255
msgid "// `0u8` is the final operand.\n"
msgstr "// `0u8` 是最终操作数。\n"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:265
msgid ""
"When a block does not contain a [final operand](block-expr.md#r-"
"expr.block.inner-attributes) and the block does not diverge, the block has "
"[unit type](../types/tuple.md#r-type.tuple.unit) and [unit value](../types/"
"tuple.md#r-type.tuple.unit)."
msgstr ""
"当块不包含[最终操作数](block-expr.md#r-expr.block.inner-attributes)且该块不发"
"散时，该块具有[单元类型](../types/tuple.md#r-type.tuple.unit)和[单元值](../"
"types/tuple.md#r-type.tuple.unit)。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:268
msgid "// Has no final operand.\n"
msgstr "// 没有最终操作数。\n"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:278
msgid ""
"When a block does not contain a [final operand](block-expr.md#r-"
"expr.block.inner-attributes) and the block [diverges](block-expr.md#r-"
"expr.block.diverging), the block has the [never type](../types/never.md#r-"
"type.never) and has no final value (because its type is [uninhabited](../"
"glossary.md#r-glossary.uninhabited))."
msgstr ""
"当块不包含[最终操作数](block-expr.md#r-expr.block.inner-attributes)且该块[发"
"散](block-expr.md#r-expr.block.diverging)时，该块具有 [never 类型](../types/"
"never.md#r-type.never)，并且没有最终值（因为其类型是[无值](../glossary.md#r-"
"glossary.uninhabited)的）。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:281
msgid ""
"// Diverges and has no final operand.\n"
"//          ^^^^^^^^^^^^\n"
"// The body of a function is a block expression.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 发散且没有最终操作数。\n"
"//          ^^^^^^^^^^^^\n"
"// 函数的主体是块表达式。\n"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:290
msgid ""
"Observe that a block having no final operand is distinct from having an "
"explicit final operand with unit type.  E.g., even though this block "
"diverges, the type of the block is [unit](../types/tuple.md#r-"
"type.tuple.unit) rather than [never](../types/never.md#r-type.never)."
msgstr ""
"注意，没有最终操作数的块不同于具有单元类型的显式最终操作数的块。例如，即使此"
"块发散，该块的类型也是[单元](../types/tuple.md#r-type.tuple.unit)，而不是 "
"[never](../types/never.md#r-type.never)。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:293 src/expressions/block-expr.md:367
msgid "// ERROR: Mismatched types.\n"
msgstr "// ERROR：类型不匹配。\n"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:294
msgid "//          ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ This block has unit type.\n"
msgstr "//          ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ 此块具有单元类型。\n"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:304
msgid ""
"As a control flow expression, if a block expression is the outer expression "
"of an expression statement, the expected type is `()` unless it is followed "
"immediately by a semicolon."
msgstr ""
"作为控制流表达式，如果块表达式是表达式语句的外层表达式，则预期类型是 `()`，除"
"非它后面紧跟分号。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:313
msgid ""
"A block is considered to be [diverging](../divergence.md#r-divergence) if "
"all reachable control flow paths contain a diverging expression, unless that "
"expression is a [place expression](../expressions.md#r-expr.place-"
"value.place-memory-location) that is not read from."
msgstr ""
"如果所有可达控制流路径都包含一个发散表达式，则块被认为是[发散的](../"
"divergence.md#r-divergence)，除非该表达式是一个未被读取的[位置表达式](../"
"expressions.md#r-expr.place-value.place-memory-location)。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:318
msgid ""
"// There are no conditional statements, so this entire function body is "
"diverging.\n"
msgstr "// 没有条件语句，所以整个函数体是发散的。\n"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:323
msgid ""
"// All paths are diverging, so this entire function body is diverging.\n"
msgstr "// 所有路径都发散，所以整个函数体是发散的。\n"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:332
msgid ""
"// Some paths are not diverging, so this entire block is not diverging.\n"
msgstr "// 有些路径不发散，所以整个块不是发散的。\n"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:339
msgid ""
"// Note: This makes use of the unstable never type which is only available "
"on\n"
"// Rust's nightly channel. This is done for illustration purposes. It is\n"
"// possible to encounter this scenario in stable Rust, but requires a more\n"
"// convoluted example.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 注意：这里使用了不稳定的 never 类型，它只在\n"
"// Rust 的 nightly channel 上可用。这样做是为了说明。\n"
"// 在 stable Rust 中也可能遇到这种场景，但需要一个更\n"
"// 曲折的示例。\n"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:352
msgid "// A read of a place expression produces a diverging block.\n"
msgstr "// 读取位置表达式会产生发散块。\n"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:365
msgid "// Assignment to `_` means the place is not read.\n"
msgstr "// 对 `_` 赋值意味着该位置未被读取。\n"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:374
msgid ""
"Blocks are always [value expressions](../expressions.md#place-expressions-"
"and-value-expressions) and evaluate the last operand in value expression "
"context."
msgstr ""
"块始终是[值表达式](../expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-"
"expressions)，并在值表达式上下文中求值最后一个操作数。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:380
msgid ""
"This can be used to force moving a value if really needed. For example, the "
"following example fails on the call to `consume_self` because the struct was "
"moved out of `s` in the block expression."
msgstr ""
"如果确实需要，这可以用来强制移动一个值。例如，下面的示例在调用 "
"`consume_self` 时失败，因为结构体已在块表达式中从 `s` 移出。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:393
msgid "// Move the value out of `s` in the block expression.\n"
msgstr "// 在块表达式中把值从 `s` 移出。\n"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:396
msgid "// Fails to execute because `s` is moved out of.\n"
msgstr "// 执行失败，因为 `s` 已被移出。\n"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:408
msgid "`async` blocks"
msgstr "`async` 块"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:416
msgid ""
"**<sup>Syntax</sup>** <br> <span class=\"grammar-text grammar-production\" "
"id=\"grammar-AsyncBlockExpression\" onclick=\"show_railroad()"
"\">[AsyncBlockExpression](block-expr.md#railroad-AsyncBlockExpression)</"
"span> → <span class=\"grammar-literal\">async</span> <span class=\"grammar-"
"literal\">move</span><sup>?</sup> <span class=\"grammar-"
"text\">[BlockExpression](block-expr.md#grammar-BlockExpression)</span>"
msgstr ""
"**<sup>语法</sup>** <br> <span class=\"grammar-text grammar-production\" "
"id=\"grammar-AsyncBlockExpression\" onclick=\"show_railroad()"
"\">[AsyncBlockExpression](block-expr.md#railroad-AsyncBlockExpression)</"
"span> → <span class=\"grammar-literal\">async</span> <span class=\"grammar-"
"literal\">move</span><sup>?</sup> <span class=\"grammar-"
"text\">[BlockExpression](block-expr.md#grammar-BlockExpression)</span>"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:471
msgid ""
"An _async block_ is a variant of a block expression which evaluates to a "
"future."
msgstr "_async 块_是块表达式的一种变体，它求值为一个 future。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:477
msgid ""
"The final expression of the block, if present, determines the result value "
"of the future."
msgstr "块的最终表达式（如果存在）决定该 future 的结果值。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:483
msgid ""
"Executing an async block is similar to executing a closure expression: its "
"immediate effect is to produce and return an anonymous type."
msgstr ""
"执行 `async` 块类似于执行闭包表达式：它的即时效果是产生并返回一个匿名类型。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:489
msgid ""
"Whereas closures return a type that implements one or more of the "
"[`std::ops::Fn`](../../core/ops/function/trait.Fn.html) traits, however, the "
"type returned for an async block implements the [`std::future::Future`]"
"(../../core/future/future/trait.Future.html) trait."
msgstr ""
"不过，闭包返回的类型会实现一个或多个 [`std::ops::Fn`](../../core/ops/"
"function/trait.Fn.html) trait，而 `async` 块返回的类型实现 "
"[`std::future::Future`](../../core/future/future/trait.Future.html) trait。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:495
msgid "The actual data format for this type is unspecified."
msgstr "此类型的实际数据格式是未指定的。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:501
msgid ""
"The future type that rustc generates is roughly equivalent to an enum with "
"one variant per `await` point, where each variant stores the data needed to "
"resume from its corresponding point."
msgstr ""
"rustc 生成的 future 类型大致等价于一个 enum，其中每个 `await` 点对应一个变"
"体，每个变体都存储从相应点恢复所需的数据。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:514
msgid "Async blocks are only available beginning with Rust 2018."
msgstr "`async` 块仅从 Rust 2018 开始可用。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:523 src/types/closure.md:68
msgid "Capture modes"
msgstr "捕获模式"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:525
msgid ""
"Async blocks capture variables from their environment using the same "
"[capture modes](../types/closure.md#capture-modes) as closures. Like "
"closures, when written `async { .. }` the capture mode for each variable "
"will be inferred from the content of the block. `async move { .. }` blocks "
"however will move all referenced variables into the resulting future."
msgstr ""
"`async` 块使用与闭包相同的[捕获模式](../types/closure.md#capture-modes)从其环"
"境中捕获变量。与闭包一样，写作 `async { .. }` 时，每个变量的捕获模式将从块的"
"内容推断。不过，`async move { .. }` 块会把所有被引用的变量移动到生成的 "
"future 中。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:531
msgid "Async context"
msgstr "async 上下文"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:533
msgid ""
"Because async blocks construct a future, they define an **async context** "
"which can in turn contain [`await` expressions](await-expr.md). Async "
"contexts are established by async blocks as well as the bodies of async "
"functions, whose semantics are defined in terms of async blocks."
msgstr ""
"由于 `async` 块构造一个 future，它们定义了一个 **async 上下文**，该上下文又可"
"以包含 [`await` 表达式](await-expr.md)。async 上下文由 `async` 块以及 "
"`async` 函数的主体建立；`async` 函数主体的语义是以 `async` 块来定义的。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:539
msgid "Control-flow operators"
msgstr "控制流运算符"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:545
msgid "Async blocks act like a function boundary, much like closures."
msgstr "`async` 块的行为类似于函数边界，很像闭包。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:551
msgid ""
"Therefore, the `?` operator and `return` expressions both affect the output "
"of the future, not the enclosing function or other context. That is, `return "
"<expr>` from within an async block will return the result of `<expr>` as the "
"output of the future. Similarly, if `<expr>?` propagates an error, that "
"error is propagated as the result of the future."
msgstr ""
"因此，`?` 运算符和 `return` 表达式都会影响 future 的输出，而不是外围函数或其"
"他上下文。也就是说，在 `async` 块内部的 `return <expr>` 会把 `<expr>` 的结果"
"作为 future 的输出返回。类似地，如果 `<expr>?` 传播错误，该错误会作为 future "
"的结果被传播。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:557
msgid ""
"Finally, the `break` and `continue` keywords cannot be used to branch out "
"from an async block. Therefore the following is illegal:"
msgstr ""
"最后，`break` 和 `continue` 关键字不能用于从 `async` 块中跳出。因此，以下写法"
"是非法的："

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:562
msgid "// error[E0267]: `break` inside of an `async` block\n"
msgstr "// error[E0267]: `async` 块内部的 `break`\n"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:571
msgid "`const` blocks"
msgstr "`const` 块"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:579
msgid ""
