msgstr ""
"_有关何时使用 `unsafe` 的更多信息，请参见 [`unsafe` 块](../unsafe-"
"keyword.md#unsafe-blocks-unsafe-)_。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:750
msgid ""
"A block of code can be prefixed with the `unsafe` keyword to permit [unsafe "
"operations](../unsafety.md). Examples:"
msgstr ""
"可以在代码块前加上 `unsafe` 关键字，以允许[不安全操作](../unsafety.md)。示"
"例："

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:768 src/expressions/loop-expr.md:771
msgid "Labeled block expressions"
msgstr "带标签的块表达式"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:770
msgid ""
"Labeled block expressions are documented in the [Loops and other breakable "
"expressions](loop-expr.md#r-expr.loop.block-labels) section."
msgstr ""
"带标签的块表达式记载于[循环和其他可 `break` 表达式](loop-expr.md#r-"
"expr.loop.block-labels)一节。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:776
msgid "Attributes on block expressions"
msgstr "块表达式上的属性"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:782
msgid ""
"[Inner attributes](../attributes.md) are allowed directly after the opening "
"brace of a block expression in the following situations:"
msgstr ""
"在以下情况下，[内部属性](../attributes.md)允许直接出现在块表达式的开花括号之"
"后："

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:784
msgid ""
"[Function](../items/functions.md) and [method](../items/associated-"
"items.md#methods) bodies."
msgstr ""
"[函数](../items/functions.md)和[方法](../items/associated-items.md#methods)的"
"主体。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:785
msgid ""
"Loop bodies ([`loop`](loop-expr.md#infinite-loops), [`while`](loop-"
"expr.md#predicate-loops), and [`for`](loop-expr.md#iterator-loops))."
msgstr ""
"循环体（[`loop`](loop-expr.md#infinite-loops)、[`while`](loop-"
"expr.md#predicate-loops) 和 [`for`](loop-expr.md#iterator-loops)）。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:786
msgid "Block expressions used as a [statement](../statements.md)."
msgstr "作为[语句](../statements.md)使用的块表达式。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:787
msgid ""
"Block expressions as elements of [array expressions](array-expr.md), [tuple "
"expressions](tuple-expr.md), [call expressions](call-expr.md), and tuple-"
"style [struct](struct-expr.md) expressions."
msgstr ""
"作为[数组表达式](array-expr.md)、[元组表达式](tuple-expr.md)、[调用表达式]"
"(call-expr.md)和元组式 [struct](struct-expr.md) 表达式元素的块表达式。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:788
msgid "A block expression as the tail expression of another block expression."
msgstr "作为另一个块表达式尾表达式的块表达式。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:795
msgid ""
"The attributes that have meaning on a block expression are [`cfg`](../"
"conditional-compilation.md) and [the lint check attributes](../attributes/"
"diagnostics.md#lint-check-attributes)."
msgstr ""
"在块表达式上有意义的属性是 [`cfg`](../conditional-compilation.md) 和 [lint 检"
"查属性](../attributes/diagnostics.md#lint-check-attributes)。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:797
msgid ""
"For example, this function returns `true` on unix platforms and `false` on "
