"text\">[Expression](../expressions.md#grammar-Expression)</span>   \n"
"    \\| ( <span class=\"grammar-literal\">&</span> | <span class=\"grammar-"
"literal\">&&</span> ) <span class=\"grammar-literal\">raw</span> <span "
"class=\"grammar-literal\">mut</span> <span class=\"grammar-"
"text\">[Expression](../expressions.md#grammar-Expression)</span>"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:408
msgid ""
"The `&` (shared borrow) and `&mut` (mutable borrow) operators are unary "
"prefix operators."
msgstr "`&`（共享借用）和 `&mut`（可变借用）运算符是一元前缀运算符。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:414
msgid ""
"When applied to a [place expression](../expressions.md#place-expressions-and-"
"value-expressions), this expressions produces a reference (pointer) to the "
"location that the value refers to."
msgstr ""
"当应用于[位置表达式](../expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-"
"expressions)时，此表达式会产生指向该值所引用位置的引用（指针）。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:420
msgid ""
"The memory location is also placed into a borrowed state for the duration of "
"the reference. For a shared borrow (`&`), this implies that the place may "
"not be mutated, but it may be read or shared again. For a mutable borrow "
"(`&mut`), the place may not be accessed in any way until the borrow expires."
msgstr ""
"在该引用的持续期间，内存位置也会处于被借用状态。对于共享借用（`&`），这意味着"
"该位置不能被修改，但可以被读取或再次共享。对于可变借用（`&mut`），在借用期结"
"束之前，该位置不能以任何方式访问。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:426
msgid "`&mut` evaluates its operand in a mutable place expression context."
msgstr "`&mut` 在可变位置表达式上下文中求值其操作数。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:432
msgid ""
"If the `&` or `&mut` operators are applied to a [value expression](../"
"expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-expressions), then a [temporary "
"value](../expressions.md#temporaries) is created."
msgstr ""
"如果 `&` 或 `&mut` 运算符应用于[值表达式](../expressions.md#place-"
"expressions-and-value-expressions)，则会创建一个[临时值](../"
"expressions.md#temporaries)。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:434
msgid "These operators cannot be overloaded."
msgstr "这些运算符不能被重载。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:438
msgid "// a temporary with value 7 is created that lasts for this scope.\n"
msgstr "// 会创建一个值为 7 的临时值，其生命周期持续到此作用域结束。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:443
msgid ""
"// Mutably borrows `array` for this scope.\n"
"    // `array` may only be used through `mutable_reference`.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 在此作用域内可变借用 `array`。\n"
"    // `array` 只能通过 `mutable_reference` 使用。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:453
msgid ""
"Even though `&&` is a single token ([the lazy 'and' operator](#lazy-boolean-"
"operators)), when used in the context of borrow expressions it works as two "
"borrows:"
msgstr ""
"尽管 `&&` 是单个 token（[惰性 “and” 运算符](#lazy-boolean-operators)），但在"
"借用表达式上下文中使用时，它会作为两次借用工作："

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:456 src/expressions/operator-expr.md:459
msgid "// same meanings:\n"
msgstr "// 含义相同：\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:470
msgid "Raw borrow operators"
msgstr "原始借用运算符"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:476
msgid "`&raw const` and `&raw mut` are the _raw borrow operators_."
msgstr "`&raw const` 和 `&raw mut` 是_原始借用运算符_。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:482
msgid ""
"The operand expression of these operators is evaluated in place expression "
"context."
msgstr "这些运算符的操作数表达式在位置表达式上下文中求值。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:488
msgid ""
"`&raw const expr` then creates a const raw pointer of type `*const T` to the "
"given place, and `&raw mut expr` creates a mutable raw pointer of type `*mut "
"T`."
msgstr ""
"`&raw const expr` 会为给定位置创建类型为 `*const T` 的 const 裸指针，而 "
"`&raw mut expr` 会创建类型为 `*mut T` 的可变裸指针。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:494
msgid ""
"The raw borrow operators must be used instead of a borrow operator whenever "
"the place expression could evaluate to a place that is not properly aligned "
"or does not store a valid value as determined by its type, or whenever "
"creating a reference would introduce incorrect aliasing assumptions. In "
"those situations, using a borrow operator would cause [undefined behavior]"
"(../behavior-considered-undefined.md) by creating an invalid reference, but "
"a raw pointer may still be constructed."
msgstr ""
"只要位置表达式可能求值为未正确对齐的位置、按其类型判定未存储有效值的位置，或"
"创建引用会引入不正确的别名假设，就必须使用原始借用运算符，而不是借用运算符。"
"在这些情形中，使用借用运算符会通过创建无效引用而导致[未定义行为](../behavior-"
"considered-undefined.md)，但仍可以构造裸指针。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:496
msgid ""
"The following is an example of creating a raw pointer to an unaligned place "
"through a `packed` struct:"
msgstr "下面是通过 `packed` 结构体创建指向未对齐位置的裸指针的示例："

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:505
msgid ""
"// `&packed.f2` would create an unaligned reference, and thus be undefined "
"behavior!\n"
msgstr "// `&packed.f2` 会创建未对齐引用，因此是未定义行为！\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:511
msgid ""
"The following is an example of creating a raw pointer to a place that does "
"not contain a valid value:"
msgstr "下面是创建指向不包含有效值的位置的裸指针的示例："

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:520
msgid ""
"// `&uninit.as_mut().field` would create a reference to an uninitialized "
"`bool`,\n"
"// and thus be undefined behavior!\n"
msgstr ""
"// `&uninit.as_mut().field` 会创建指向未初始化 `bool` 的引用，\n"
"// 因此是未定义行为！\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:532
msgid "The dereference operator"
msgstr "解引用运算符"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:540
msgid ""
"**<sup>Syntax</sup>** <br> <span class=\"grammar-text grammar-production\" "
"id=\"grammar-DereferenceExpression\" onclick=\"show_railroad()"
"\">[DereferenceExpression](operator-expr.md#railroad-DereferenceExpression)</"
"span> → <span class=\"grammar-literal\">\\*</span> <span class=\"grammar-"
"text\">[Expression](../expressions.md#grammar-Expression)</span>"
msgstr ""
"**<sup>语法</sup>** <br> <span class=\"grammar-text grammar-production\" "
"id=\"grammar-DereferenceExpression\" onclick=\"show_railroad()"
"\">[DereferenceExpression](operator-expr.md#railroad-DereferenceExpression)</"
"span> → <span class=\"grammar-literal\">\\*</span> <span class=\"grammar-"
"text\">[Expression](../expressions.md#grammar-Expression)</span>"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:586
msgid "The `*` (dereference) operator is also a unary prefix operator."
msgstr "`*`（解引用）运算符也是一元前缀运算符。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:592
msgid ""
"When applied to a [pointer](../types/pointer.md) or [`Box`](../special-types-"
"and-traits.md#boxt), it denotes the pointed-to location."
msgstr ""
"当应用于[指针](../types/pointer.md)或 [`Box`](../special-types-and-"
"traits.md#boxt) 时，它表示被指向的位置。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:598
msgid ""
"If the expression is of type `&mut T`, `*mut T`, or `Box<T>`, and is either "
"a local variable, a (nested) field of a local variable or is a mutable "
"[place expression](../expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-"
"expressions), then the resulting memory location can be assigned to."
msgstr ""
"如果表达式的类型为 `&mut T`、`*mut T` 或 `Box<T>`，并且它是局部变量、局部变量"
"的（嵌套）字段，或者是可变[位置表达式](../expressions.md#place-expressions-"
"and-value-expressions)，则所得内存位置可以被赋值。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:604
msgid ""
"When applied to a [`Box`](../special-types-and-traits.md#boxt), the "
"resultant place may be [moved from](../expressions.md#r-expr.move.movable-"
"place)."
msgstr ""
"当应用于 [`Box`](../special-types-and-traits.md#boxt) 时，所得位置可以[从中移"
"出](../expressions.md#r-expr.move.movable-place)。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:610
msgid "Dereferencing a raw pointer requires `unsafe`."
msgstr "解引用裸指针需要 `unsafe`。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:616
msgid ""
"On non-pointer types `*x` is equivalent to `*std::ops::Deref::deref(&x)` in "
"an [immutable place expression context](../expressions.md#mutability) and "
"`*std::ops::DerefMut::deref_mut(&mut x)` in a mutable place expression "
"context, except that when `*x` undergoes [temporary lifetime extension](../"
"destructors.md#r-destructors.scope.lifetime-extension), the dereferenced "
"expression `x` also has its [temporary scope](../destructors.md#r-"
"destructors.scope.temporary) extended."
msgstr ""
"对于非指针类型，`*x` 在[不可变位置表达式上下文](../expressions.md#mutability)"
"中等价于 `*std::ops::Deref::deref(&x)`，在可变位置表达式上下文中等价于 "
"`*std::ops::DerefMut::deref_mut(&mut x)`；但当 `*x` 经历[临时生命周期延长]"
"(../destructors.md#r-destructors.scope.lifetime-extension)时，被解引用的表达"
"式 `x` 的[临时作用域](../destructors.md#r-destructors.scope.temporary)也会被"
"延长。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:630
msgid ""
"// The temporary holding the result of `String::new()` is extended\n"
"// to live to the end of the block, so `x` may be used in subsequent\n"
"// statements.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 保存 `String::new()` 结果的临时值会被延长，\n"
"// 存活到块结束，因此 `x` 可以在后续\n"
"// 语句中使用。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:638
msgid ""
"// The temporary holding the result of `String::new()` is dropped at\n"
"// the end of the statement, so it's an error to use `y` after.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 保存 `String::new()` 结果的临时值会在\n"
"// 语句末尾被丢弃，因此之后使用 `y` 是错误。\n"

