#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1822
msgid "Casting from a float to an integer will round the float towards zero"
msgstr "从浮点数转换为整数会将浮点数向零舍入"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1823
msgid "`NaN` will return `0`"
msgstr "`NaN` 将返回 `0`"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1824
msgid ""
"Values larger than the maximum integer value, including `INFINITY`, will "
"saturate to the maximum value of the integer type."
msgstr "大于最大整数值的值（包括 `INFINITY`）将饱和为该整数类型的最大值。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1825
msgid ""
"Values smaller than the minimum integer value, including `NEG_INFINITY`, "
"will saturate to the minimum value of the integer type."
msgstr "小于最小整数值的值（包括 `NEG_INFINITY`）将饱和为该整数类型的最小值。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1840
msgid ""
"Casting from an integer to float will produce the closest possible float \\*"
msgstr "从整数转换为浮点数会产生最接近的可表示浮点数 \\*"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1841 src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1868
msgid "if necessary, rounding is according to `roundTiesToEven` mode \\*\\*\\*"
msgstr "必要时，舍入按照 `roundTiesToEven` 模式进行 \\*\\*\\*"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1842 src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1869
msgid "on overflow, infinity (of the same sign as the input) is produced"
msgstr "发生溢出时，会产生（与输入符号相同的）无穷大"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1843
msgid ""
"note: with the current set of numeric types, overflow can only happen on "
"`u128 as f32` for values greater or equal to `f32::MAX + (0.5 ULP)`"
msgstr ""
"注意：对于当前这组数值类型，溢出只会发生在 `u128 as f32` 且值大于或等于 "
"`f32::MAX + (0.5 ULP)` 的情况下"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1847 src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1873
msgid "\"Rounded\""
msgstr "\"Rounded\""

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1855
msgid "Casting from an f32 to an f64 is perfect and lossless"
msgstr "从 f32 转换到 f64 是精确且无损的"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1867
msgid ""
"Casting from an f64 to an f32 will produce the closest possible f32 \\*\\*"
msgstr "从 f64 转换到 f32 会产生最接近的可表示 f32 \\*\\*"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1878
msgid ""
"\\* if integer-to-float casts with this rounding mode and overflow behavior "
"are not supported natively by the hardware, these casts will likely be "
"slower than expected."
msgstr ""
"\\* 如果硬件本身不支持采用这种舍入模式和溢出行为的整数到浮点数转换，这些转换"
"很可能比预期更慢。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1880
msgid ""
"\\*\\* if f64-to-f32 casts with this rounding mode and overflow behavior are "
"not supported natively by the hardware, these casts will likely be slower "
"than expected."
msgstr ""
"\\*\\* 如果硬件本身不支持采用这种舍入模式和溢出行为的 f64 到 f32 转换，这些转"
"换很可能比预期更慢。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1882
msgid ""
"\\*\\*\\* as defined in IEEE 754-2008 §4.3.1: pick the nearest floating "
"point number, preferring the one with an even least significant digit if "
"exactly halfway between two floating point numbers."
msgstr ""
"\\*\\*\\* 如 IEEE 754-2008 §4.3.1 所定义：选择最近的浮点数；如果恰好位于两个"
"浮点数正中间，则优先选择最低有效位为偶数的那个。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1888
msgid "Enum cast"
msgstr "枚举转换"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1894
msgid ""
"Casts an enum to its discriminant, then uses a numeric cast if needed. "
"Casting is limited to the following kinds of enumerations:"
msgstr ""
"将枚举转换为其判别值，然后在需要时使用数值转换。转换仅限于以下几类枚举："

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1896
msgid "[Unit-only enums](../items/enumerations.md#unit-only-enum)"
msgstr "[仅含单元变体的枚举](../items/enumerations.md#unit-only-enum)"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1897
msgid ""
"[Field-less enums](../items/enumerations.md#field-less-enum) without "
"[explicit discriminants](../items/enumerations.md#explicit-discriminants), "
"or where only unit-variants have explicit discriminants"
msgstr ""
"[无字段枚举](../items/enumerations.md#field-less-enum)，且没有[显式判别值]"
"(../items/enumerations.md#explicit-discriminants)，或者只有单元变体具有显式判"
"别值"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1910
msgid ""
"Casting is not allowed if the enum implements [`Drop`](../../core/ops/drop/"
"trait.Drop.html)."
msgstr ""
"如果枚举实现了 [`Drop`](../../core/ops/drop/trait.Drop.html)，则不允许转换。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1916
msgid "Primitive to integer cast"
msgstr "基本类型到整数转换"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1918
msgid "`false` casts to `0`, `true` casts to `1`"
msgstr "`false` 转换为 `0`，`true` 转换为 `1`"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1919
msgid ""
"`char` casts to the value of the code point, then uses a numeric cast if "
"needed."
msgstr "`char` 转换为码点的值，然后在需要时使用数值转换。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1925 src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1938
msgid "'Ö'"
msgstr "'Ö'"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1932
msgid "`u8` to `char` cast"
msgstr "`u8` 到 `char` 的转换"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1934
msgid "Casts to the `char` with the corresponding code point."
msgstr "转换为具有相应码点的 `char`。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1945
msgid "Pointer to address cast"
msgstr "指针到地址转换"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1947
msgid ""
"Casting from a raw pointer to an integer produces the machine address of the "
"referenced memory. If the integer type is smaller than the pointer type, the "
"address may be truncated; using `usize` avoids this."
msgstr ""
"从裸指针转换为整数会产生所引用内存的机器地址。如果整数类型小于指针类型，该地"
"址可能被截断；使用 `usize` 可以避免这种情况。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1953
msgid "Address to pointer cast"
msgstr "地址到指针转换"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1955
msgid ""
"Casting from an integer to a raw pointer interprets the integer as a memory "
"address and produces a pointer referencing that memory."
msgstr ""
"从整数转换为裸指针会将该整数解释为内存地址，并产生一个引用该内存的指针。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1961
msgid ""
"This interacts with the Rust memory model, which is still under development. "
"A pointer obtained from this cast may suffer additional restrictions even if "
"it is bitwise equal to a valid pointer. Dereferencing such a pointer may be "
"[undefined behavior](../behavior-considered-undefined.md) if aliasing rules "
"are not followed."
msgstr ""
"这会与仍在开发中的 Rust 内存模型相互作用。通过这种转换获得的指针即使与有效指"
"针按位相等，也可能受到额外限制。如果没有遵守别名规则，解引用这样的指针可能是"
"[未定义行为](../behavior-considered-undefined.md)。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1968
msgid "A trivial example of sound address arithmetic:"
msgstr "健全地址算术的一个简单示例："

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1974
msgid "// 4 == size_of::<i32>()\n"
msgstr "// 4 == size_of::<i32>()\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1986
msgid "Pointer-to-pointer cast"
msgstr "指针到指针转换"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1992
msgid ""
"`*const T` / `*mut T` can be cast to `*const U` / `*mut U` with the "
"following behavior:"
msgstr "`*const T` / `*mut T` 可以转换为 `*const U` / `*mut U`，行为如下："

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1998
msgid "If `T` and `U` are both sized, the pointer is returned unchanged."
msgstr "如果 `T` 和 `U` 都是确定大小类型，则原样返回指针。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2008
msgid "// The pointer address remains the same.\n"
msgstr "// 指针地址保持不变。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2019
msgid ""
"If `T` is unsized and `U` is sized, the cast discards all metadata that "
"completes the wide pointer `T` and produces a thin pointer `U` consisting of "
"the data part of the unsized pointer."
msgstr ""
"如果 `T` 是未确定大小类型而 `U` 是确定大小类型，则该转换会丢弃补全指向 `T` 的"
"宽指针所需的所有元数据，并产生一个指向 `U` 的瘦指针，其内容由该未确定大小指针"
"的数据部分组成。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2028
msgid "// Cast from wide pointer (*const [i32]) to thin pointer (*const i32)\n"
msgstr "// 从宽指针 (*const [i32]) 转换到瘦指针 (*const i32)\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2029
msgid "// discarding the length metadata.\n"
msgstr "// 丢弃长度元数据。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2041
msgid ""
"If `T` and `U` are both unsized, the pointer is also returned unchanged. In "
"particular, the metadata is preserved exactly. The cast can only be "
"performed if the metadata is compatible according to the below rules:"
msgstr ""
"如果 `T` 和 `U` 都是未确定大小类型，也会原样返回指针。特别是，元数据会被精确"
"保留。只有当元数据按以下规则兼容时，才能执行该转换："

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2047
msgid ""
"When `T` and `U` are unsized with slice metadata, they are always "
"compatible. The metadata of a slice is the number of elements, so casting "
"`*[u16] -> *[u8]` is legal but will result in reducing the number of bytes "
"by half."
msgstr ""
"当 `T` 和 `U` 都是带有切片元数据的未确定大小类型时，它们总是兼容。切片的元数"
"据是元素数量，因此转换 `*[u16] -> *[u8]` 是合法的，但会导致字节数减半。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2067
msgid ""
"When `T` and `U` are unsized with trait object metadata, the metadata is "
"compatible only when all of the following holds:"
msgstr ""
"当 `T` 和 `U` 都是带有 trait 对象元数据的未确定大小类型时，只有满足以下所有条"
"件，元数据才兼容："

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2068
msgid "The principal trait must be the same."
msgstr "principal trait（主体 trait）必须相同。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2082
msgid "// You can't cast to a different principal trait.\n"
msgstr "// 不能转换到不同的 principal trait。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2090
msgid "Auto traits may be removed."
msgstr "可以移除 auto trait。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2104
msgid "// Removing an auto trait.\n"
msgstr "// 移除 auto trait。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2112
msgid ""
"Auto traits may be added only if they are a super trait of the principal "
"trait."
msgstr ""
"只有当 auto trait 是 principal trait（主体 trait）的 super trait 时，才可以添"
"加该 auto trait。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2126
msgid "// Adding an auto trait.\n"
msgstr "// 添加 auto trait。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2138
msgid ""
"// Same as above, except trait Foo does not have Send as a super trait.\n"
msgstr "// 与上面相同，只是 trait Foo 没有将 Send 作为 super trait。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2146
msgid "Trailing lifetimes may only be shortened."
msgstr "尾随生命周期只能缩短。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2158
msgid "// Shortening the lifetime is allowed.\n"
msgstr "// 允许缩短生命周期。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2169
msgid "// It is not allowed to cast to a longer lifetime.\n"
msgstr "// 不允许转换到更长的生命周期。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2177
msgid "Generics (including lifetimes) and associated types must match exactly."
msgstr "泛型（包括生命周期）和关联类型必须精确匹配。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2190
msgid "// You can't cast to a different generic parameter.\n"
msgstr "// 不能转换到不同的泛型参数。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2208
msgid "// Forces equality\n"
msgstr "// 强制相等\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2223
msgid ""
"When `T` or `U` is a struct or tuple type whose last field is unsized, it "
"has the same metadata and compatibility rules as its last field."
msgstr ""
"当 `T` 或 `U` 是最后一个字段为未确定大小类型的结构体或元组类型时，它与其最后"
"一个字段具有相同的元数据和兼容性规则。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2235
msgid "// The metadata (length 3) is preserved when casting to a struct\n"
msgstr "// 转换到结构体时保留元数据（长度 3）\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2236
msgid "// where the last field is the unsized type `[u8]`.\n"
msgstr "// 其中最后一个字段是未确定大小类型 `[u8]`。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2239
msgid "// And preserved when casting back.\n"
msgstr "// 转换回来时也会保留。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2251
msgid "Assignment expressions"
msgstr "赋值表达式"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2259
msgid ""
"**<sup>Syntax</sup>** <br> <span class=\"grammar-text grammar-production\" "
"id=\"grammar-AssignmentExpression\" onclick=\"show_railroad()"
"\">[AssignmentExpression](operator-expr.md#railroad-AssignmentExpression)</"
"span> → <span class=\"grammar-text\">[Expression](../expressions.md#grammar-"
"Expression)</span> <span class=\"grammar-literal\">=</span> <span "
"class=\"grammar-text\">[Expression](../expressions.md#grammar-Expression)</"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"**<sup>语法</sup>** <br> <span class=\"grammar-text grammar-production\" "
"id=\"grammar-AssignmentExpression\" onclick=\"show_railroad()"
"\">[AssignmentExpression](operator-expr.md#railroad-AssignmentExpression)</"
"span> → <span class=\"grammar-text\">[Expression](../expressions.md#grammar-"
"Expression)</span> <span class=\"grammar-literal\">=</span> <span "
"class=\"grammar-text\">[Expression](../expressions.md#grammar-Expression)</"
"span>"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2313
msgid "An _assignment expression_ moves a value into a specified place."
msgstr "_赋值表达式_会将一个值移动到指定位置。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2319
msgid ""
"An assignment expression consists of a [mutable](../"
"expressions.md#mutability) [assignee expression](../expressions.md#place-"
"expressions-and-value-expressions), the _assignee operand_, followed by an "
"equals sign (`=`) and a [value expression](../expressions.md#place-"
"expressions-and-value-expressions), the _assigned value operand_."
msgstr ""
"赋值表达式由[可变](../expressions.md#mutability) [赋值目标表达式](../"
"expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-expressions)（即_赋值目标操作数_）"
"后接等号（`=`）和[值表达式](../expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-"
"expressions)（即_被赋的值操作数_）组成。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2325
msgid ""
"In its most basic form, an assignee expression is a [place expression](../"
"expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-expressions), and we discuss this "
"case first."
msgstr ""
"在最基本的形式中，赋值目标表达式是[位置表达式](../expressions.md#place-"
"expressions-and-value-expressions)，我们先讨论这种情况。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2331
msgid ""
"The more general case of destructuring assignment is discussed below, but "
"this case always decomposes into sequential assignments to place "
"expressions, which may be considered the more fundamental case."
msgstr ""
"更一般的解构赋值情况会在下文讨论，但这种情况总是分解为对位置表达式的顺序赋"
"值，而这可以被视为更基础的情况。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2337
msgid "Basic assignments"
msgstr "基本赋值"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2343
msgid ""
"Evaluating assignment expressions begins by evaluating its operands. The "
"assigned value operand is evaluated first, followed by the assignee "
"expression."
msgstr ""
"赋值表达式的求值从求值其操作数开始。先求值被赋的值操作数，然后求值赋值目标表"
"达式。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2349
msgid ""
"For destructuring assignment, subexpressions of the assignee expression are "
"evaluated left-to-right."
msgstr "对于解构赋值，赋值目标表达式的子表达式按从左到右的顺序求值。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2355
msgid ""
"This is different than other expressions in that the right operand is "
"evaluated before the left one."
msgstr "这与其他表达式不同，因为右操作数会先于左操作数求值。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2364
msgid ""
"It then has the effect of first [dropping](../destructors.md) the value at "
"the assigned place, unless the place is an uninitialized local variable or "
"an uninitialized field of a local variable."
msgstr ""
"然后，它的效果是先[丢弃](../destructors.md)被赋值位置处的值，除非该位置是未初"
"始化的局部变量或局部变量的未初始化字段。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2370
msgid ""
"Next it either [copies or moves](../expressions.md#moved-and-copied-types) "
"the assigned value to the assigned place."
msgstr ""
"接着，它会将被赋的值[复制或移动](../expressions.md#moved-and-copied-types)到"
"被赋值位置。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2376
msgid ""
"An assignment expression always produces [the unit value](../types/tuple.md)."
msgstr "赋值表达式始终产生[单元值](../types/tuple.md)。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2378 src/patterns.md:887
#: src/macro-ambiguity.md:38
msgid "Example:"
msgstr "示例："

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2390
msgid "Destructuring assignments"
msgstr "解构赋值"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2396
msgid ""
"Destructuring assignment is a counterpart to destructuring pattern matches "
"for variable declaration, permitting assignment to complex values, such as "
"tuples or structs. For instance, we may swap two mutable variables:"
msgstr ""
"解构赋值对应于变量声明中的解构模式匹配，允许对复杂值（如元组或结构体）赋值。"
"例如，我们可以交换两个可变变量："

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2399
msgid "// Swap `a` and `b` using destructuring assignment.\n"
msgstr "// 使用解构赋值交换 `a` 和 `b`。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2408
msgid ""
"In contrast to destructuring declarations using `let`, patterns may not "
"appear on the left-hand side of an assignment due to syntactic ambiguities. "
"Instead, a group of expressions that correspond to patterns are designated "
"to be [assignee expressions](../expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-"
"expressions), and permitted on the left-hand side of an assignment. Assignee "
"expressions are then desugared to pattern matches followed by sequential "
"assignment."
msgstr ""
"与使用 `let` 的解构声明不同，由于语法歧义，模式不能出现在赋值左侧。相反，与模"
"式对应的一组表达式会被指定为[赋值目标表达式](../expressions.md#place-"
"expressions-and-value-expressions)，并允许出现在赋值左侧。随后，赋值目标表达"
"式会脱糖为模式匹配，接着进行顺序赋值。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2414
msgid ""
"The desugared patterns must be irrefutable: in particular, this means that "
"only slice patterns whose length is known at compile-time, and the trivial "
"slice `[..]`, are permitted for destructuring assignment."
msgstr ""
"脱糖后的模式必须是不可反驳的：具体来说，这意味着只有长度在编译时已知的切片模"
"式，以及平凡切片 `[..]`，才允许用于解构赋值。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2416
msgid ""
"The desugaring method is straightforward, and is illustrated best by example."
msgstr "脱糖方法很直接，用示例最容易说明。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2426
msgid "// desugars to:\n"
msgstr "// 脱糖为：\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2452
msgid ""
"Identifiers are not forbidden from being used multiple times in a single "
"assignee expression."
msgstr "标识符并不禁止在单个赋值目标表达式中多次使用。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2458
msgid ""
"[Underscore expressions](./underscore-expr.md) and empty [range expressions]"
"(./range-expr.md) may be used to ignore certain values, without binding them."
msgstr ""
"[下划线表达式](./underscore-expr.md)和空[范围表达式](./range-expr.md)可用于忽"
"略某些值，而不绑定它们。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2464
msgid ""
"Note that default binding modes do not apply for the desugared expression."
msgstr "注意，默认绑定模式不适用于脱糖后的表达式。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2474
msgid ""
"The desugaring restricts the [temporary scope](../destructors.md#r-"
"destructors.scope.temporary) of the assigned value operand (the RHS) of a "
"destructuring assignment."
msgstr ""
"脱糖会限制解构赋值的被赋的值操作数（RHS）的[临时作用域](../destructors.md#r-"
"destructors.scope.temporary)。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2476
msgid ""
"In a basic assignment, the [temporary](../expressions.md#r-expr.temporary) "
"is dropped at the end of the enclosing temporary scope. Below, that's the "
"statement. Therefore, the assignment and use is allowed."
msgstr ""
"在基本赋值中，[临时值](../expressions.md#r-expr.temporary)会在外围临时作用域"
"的末尾被丢弃。在下面的例子中，也就是语句末尾。因此，赋值和使用是允许的。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2485
msgid ""
"Conversely, in a destructuring assignment, the temporary is dropped at the "
"end of the `let` statement in the desugaring. As that happens before we try "
"to assign to `x`, below, it fails."
msgstr ""
"相反，在解构赋值中，临时值会在脱糖中 `let` 语句的末尾被丢弃。由于这发生在下面"
"我们尝试赋值给 `x` 之前，因此会失败。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2494 src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2529
#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2545
msgid "This desugars to:"
msgstr "这会脱糖为："

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2502
msgid "//                     ^\n"
msgstr "//                     ^\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2503
msgid "//      The temporary is dropped here.\n"
msgstr "//      临时值在这里被丢弃。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2519
msgid ""
"Due to the desugaring, the assigned value operand (the RHS) of a "
"destructuring assignment is an [extending expression](../destructors.md#r-"
"destructors.scope.lifetime-extension.exprs) within a newly-introduced block."
msgstr ""
"由于脱糖，解构赋值的被赋的值操作数（RHS）是在新引入块内的[延长表达式](../"
"destructors.md#r-destructors.scope.lifetime-extension.exprs)。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2521
msgid ""
"Below, because the [temporary scope](../destructors.md#r-"
"destructors.scope.temporary) is extended to the end of this introduced "
"block, the assignment is allowed."
msgstr ""
"下面，因为[临时作用域](../destructors.md#r-destructors.scope.temporary)被延长"
"到这个引入块的末尾，所以赋值是允许的。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2537
msgid ""
"However, if we try to use `x`, even within the same statement, we'll get an "
"error because the [temporary](../expressions.md#r-expr.temporary) is dropped "
"at the end of this introduced block."
msgstr ""
"然而，如果我们尝试使用 `x`，即使是在同一条语句内，也会得到错误，因为[临时值]"
"(../expressions.md#r-expr.temporary)会在这个引入块的末尾被丢弃。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2566
msgid "Compound assignment expressions"
msgstr "复合赋值表达式"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2574
msgid ""
