#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2866
msgid ""
"_Compound assignment expressions_ combine arithmetic and logical binary "
"operators with assignment expressions."
msgstr "_复合赋值表达式_将算术和逻辑二元运算符与赋值表达式结合起来。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2876
msgid ""
"The syntax of compound assignment is a [mutable](../"
"expressions.md#mutability) [place expression](../expressions.md#place-"
"expressions-and-value-expressions), the _assigned operand_, then one of the "
"operators followed by an `=` as a single token (no whitespace), and then a "
"[value expression](../expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-"
"expressions), the _modifying operand_."
msgstr ""
"复合赋值的语法是一个[可变](../expressions.md#mutability) [位置表达式](../"
"expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-expressions)（即_被赋值操作数_），"
"然后是某个运算符后接 `=` 作为单个 token（没有空白），再后接一个[值表达式](../"
"expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-expressions)（即_修改操作数_）。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2882
msgid ""
"Unlike other place operands, the assigned place operand must be a place "
"expression."
msgstr "与其他位置操作数不同，被赋值位置操作数必须是位置表达式。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2888
msgid ""
"Attempting to use a value expression is a compiler error rather than "
"promoting it to a temporary."
msgstr "尝试使用值表达式会产生编译器错误，而不是将其提升为临时值。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2894
msgid ""
"Evaluation of compound assignment expressions depends on the types of the "
"operands."
msgstr "复合赋值表达式的求值取决于操作数的类型。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2900
msgid ""
"If the types of both operands are known, prior to monomorphization, to be "
"primitive, the right hand side is evaluated first, the left hand side is "
"evaluated next, and the place given by the evaluation of the left hand side "
"is mutated by applying the operator to the values of both sides."
msgstr ""
"如果在单态化之前即可知道两个操作数的类型都是基本类型，则先求值右侧，再求值左"
"侧，并通过将运算符应用于两侧的值来修改由左侧求值得到的位置。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2910
msgid ""
"// The RHS is evaluated first as both operands are of primitive\n"
"    // type.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 由于两个操作数都是基本类型，右侧（RHS）\n"
"    // 先求值。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2918
msgid ""
"// The LHS is evaluated first as `Wrapping<_>` is not a primitive\n"
"    // type.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 由于 `Wrapping<_>` 不是基本类型，左侧（LHS）\n"
"    // 先求值。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2926
msgid ""
"// The LHS is evaluated first as one of the operands is a generic\n"
"    // parameter, even though that generic parameter can be unified\n"
"    // with a primitive type due to the where clause bound.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 由于其中一个操作数是泛型参数，左侧（LHS）先求值，\n"
"    // 即使由于 where 子句约束，该泛型参数可以与\n"
"    // 基本类型统一。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2936
msgid ""
"// We supply a primitive type as the generic argument, but this\n"
"    // does not affect the evaluation order in `f3` when\n"
"    // monomorphized.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 我们提供基本类型作为泛型实参，\n"
"    // 但这不会影响单态化后 `f3` 中的\n"
"    // 求值顺序。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2947
msgid "This is unusual. Elsewhere left to right evaluation is the norm."
msgstr "这并不常见。在其他地方，从左到右求值是常规做法。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2949
msgid ""
"See the [eval order test](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/1.58.0/src/"
"test/ui/expr/compound-assignment/eval-order.rs) for more examples."
msgstr ""
"更多示例见 [eval order test](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/1.58.0/"
"src/test/ui/expr/compound-assignment/eval-order.rs)。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2958
msgid ""
"Otherwise, this expression is syntactic sugar for using the corresponding "
"trait for the operator (see [expr.arith-logic.behavior](operator-expr.md#r-"
"expr.arith-logic.behavior)) and calling its method with the left hand side "
"as the [receiver](method-call-expr.md#r-expr.method.intro) and the right "
"hand side as the next argument."
msgstr ""
"否则，此表达式是使用该运算符对应 trait（见 [expr.arith-logic.behavior]"
"(operator-expr.md#r-expr.arith-logic.behavior)）的语法糖，并以左侧作为[接收"
"者](method-call-expr.md#r-expr.method.intro)、右侧作为下一个参数来调用其方"
"法。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2960
msgid "For example, the following two statements are equivalent:"
msgstr "例如，下面两个语句是等价的："

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2965
msgid "// Statement 1.\n"
msgstr "// 语句 1。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2966
msgid "// Statement 2.\n"
msgstr "// 语句 2。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:2974
msgid ""
