#: src/expressions/grouped-expr.md:65
msgid ""
"A _parenthesized expression_ wraps a single expression, evaluating to that "
"expression. The syntax for a parenthesized expression is a `(`, then an "
"expression, called the _enclosed operand_, and then a `)`."
msgstr ""
"_带括号表达式_包装单个表达式，并求值为该表达式。带括号表达式的语法是一个 "
"`(`，随后是一个称为_被包围操作数_的表达式，最后是一个 `)`。"

#: src/expressions/grouped-expr.md:71
msgid ""
"Parenthesized expressions evaluate to the value of the enclosed operand."
msgstr "带括号表达式求值为被包围操作数的值。"

#: src/expressions/grouped-expr.md:77
msgid ""
"A parenthesized expression is a [place expression](../expressions.md#place-"
"expressions-and-value-expressions) if the enclosed operand is a place "
"expression, and is a value expression if the enclosed operand is a value "
"expression."
msgstr ""
"如果被包围操作数是位置表达式，则带括号表达式是[位置表达式](../"
"expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-expressions)；如果被包围操作数是值"
"表达式，则带括号表达式是值表达式。"

#: src/expressions/grouped-expr.md:83
msgid ""
"Parentheses can be used to explicitly modify the precedence order of "
"subexpressions within an expression."
msgstr "括号可用于显式修改表达式内子表达式的优先级顺序。"

#: src/expressions/grouped-expr.md:85
msgid "An example of a parenthesized expression:"
msgstr "带括号表达式的示例："

