#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:159
msgid ""
"_Array expressions_ construct [arrays](../types/array.md). Array expressions "
"come in two forms."
msgstr "_数组表达式_构造[数组](../types/array.md)。数组表达式有两种形式。"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:165
msgid "The first form lists out every value in the array."
msgstr "第一种形式列出数组中的每个值。"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:171
msgid ""
"The syntax for this form is a comma-separated list of expressions of uniform "
"type enclosed in square brackets."
msgstr "这种形式的语法是用方括号括起、以逗号分隔的同一类型表达式列表。"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:177
msgid ""
"This produces an array containing each of these values in the order they are "
"written."
msgstr "这会生成一个数组，其中按写出的顺序包含这些值。"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:183
msgid ""
"The syntax for the second form is two expressions separated by a semicolon "
"(`;`) enclosed in square brackets."
msgstr "第二种形式的语法是用方括号括起的两个表达式，二者以分号（`;`）分隔。"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:189
msgid "The expression before the `;` is called the _repeat operand_."
msgstr "`;` 前面的表达式称为_重复操作数_。"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:195
msgid "The expression after the `;` is called the _length operand_."
msgstr "`;` 后面的表达式称为_长度操作数_。"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:201
msgid ""
"The length operand must either be an [inferred const](../items/generics.md#r-"
"items.generics.const.inferred) or be a [constant expression](../"
"const_eval.md#constant-expressions) of type `usize` (e.g. a [literal](../"
"tokens.md#literals) or a [constant item](../items/constant-items.md))."
msgstr ""
"长度操作数必须是[推断 const](../items/generics.md#r-"
"items.generics.const.inferred)，或者是类型为 `usize` 的[常量表达式](../"
"const_eval.md#constant-expressions)（例如[字面量](../tokens.md#literals)或[常"
"量项](../items/constant-items.md)）。"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:206
msgid "// Constant item.\n"
msgstr "// Constant item.\n"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:215
msgid ""
"In an array expression, an [inferred const](../items/generics.md#r-"
"items.generics.const.inferred) is parsed as an [expression](../"
"expressions.md#grammar-Expression) but then semantically treated as a "
"separate kind of [const generic argument](../items/generics.md#r-"
"items.generics.const.argument)."
msgstr ""
"在数组表达式中，[推断 const](../items/generics.md#r-"
"items.generics.const.inferred) 会被解析为[表达式](../expressions.md#grammar-"
"Expression)，但随后在语义上会被视为另一类[const 泛型实参](../items/"
"generics.md#r-items.generics.const.argument)。"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:224
msgid ""
"An array expression of this form creates an array with the length of the "
"value of the length operand with each element being a copy of the repeat "
"operand. That is, `[a; b]` creates an array containing `b` copies of the "
"value of `a`."
msgstr ""
"这种形式的数组表达式会创建一个数组，其长度为长度操作数的值，并且每个元素都是"
"重复操作数的副本。也就是说，`[a; b]` 会创建一个包含 `b` 个 `a` 的值的副本的数"
"组。"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:230
msgid ""
"If the length operand has a value greater than 1 then this requires the "
"repeat operand to have a type that implements [`Copy`](../special-types-and-"
"traits.md#copy), to be a [const block expression](block-expr.md#r-"
"expr.block.const), or to be a [path](path-expr.md) to a constant item."
msgstr ""
"如果长度操作数的值大于 1，那么这要求重复操作数的类型实现 [`Copy`](../special-"
"types-and-traits.md#copy)，或者重复操作数是 [const 块表达式](block-expr.md#r-"
"expr.block.const)，或者是指向常量项的[路径](path-expr.md)。"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:236
msgid ""
"When the repeat operand is a const block or a path to a constant item, it is "
"evaluated the number of times specified in the length operand."
msgstr ""
"当重复操作数是 const 块或指向常量项的路径时，会按长度操作数指定的次数对它求"
"值。"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:242
msgid ""
"If that value is `0`, then the const block or constant item is not evaluated "
"at all."
msgstr "如果该值为 `0`，则根本不会对 const 块或常量项求值。"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:248
msgid ""
"For expressions that are neither a const block nor a path to a constant "
"item, it is evaluated exactly once, and then the result is copied the length "
"operand's value times."
msgstr ""
"对于既不是 const 块也不是指向常量项路径的表达式，会对它恰好求值一次，然后将结"
"果复制长度操作数的值所指定的次数。"

