"// The temporary holding the result of `vec![()]` is dropped at the\n"
"// end of the statement, so it's an error to use `y` after.\n"
msgstr ""
"// The temporary holding the result of `vec![()]` is dropped at the\n"
"// end of the statement, so it's an error to use `y` after.\n"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:359
msgid "Indices are zero-based for arrays and slices."
msgstr "数组和切片的索引从零开始。"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:365
msgid ""
"Array access is a [constant expression](../const_eval.md#constant-"
"expressions), so bounds can be checked at compile-time with a constant index "
"value. Otherwise a check will be performed at run-time that will put the "
"thread in a [_panicked state_](../panic.md) if it fails."
msgstr ""
"数组访问是[常量表达式](../const_eval.md#constant-expressions)，因此在索引值为"
"常量时，可以在编译时检查边界。否则会在运行时执行检查；如果检查失败，会使线程"
"进入 [_panic 状态_](../panic.md)。"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:368
msgid "// lint is deny by default.\n"
msgstr "// lint is deny by default.\n"

