#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:291
msgid ""
"A _struct expression_ creates a struct, enum, or union value. It consists of "
"a path to a [struct](../items/structs.md), [enum variant](../items/"
"enumerations.md), or [union](../items/unions.md) item followed by the values "
"for the fields of the item."
msgstr ""
"_结构体表达式_创建 struct、enum 或 union 值。它由指向 [struct](../items/"
"structs.md)、[枚举变体](../items/enumerations.md)或 [union](../items/"
"unions.md) 项的路径，后跟该项各字段的值组成。"

#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:293
msgid "The following are examples of struct expressions:"
msgstr "以下是结构体表达式的示例："

