#: src/expressions/closure-expr.md:392
msgid "Attributes on closure parameters"
msgstr "闭包形参上的属性"

#: src/expressions/closure-expr.md:398
msgid ""
"Attributes on closure parameters follow the same rules and restrictions as "
"[regular function parameters](../items/functions.md#attributes-on-function-"
"parameters)."
msgstr ""
"闭包形参上的属性遵循与[常规函数形参](../items/functions.md#attributes-on-"
"function-parameters)相同的规则和限制。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:5
msgid "Loops and other breakable expressions"
msgstr "循环和其他可 `break` 表达式"

