#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:108
msgid "Rust supports four loop expressions:"
msgstr "Rust 支持四种循环表达式："

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:110
msgid "A [`loop` expression](#infinite-loops) denotes an infinite loop."
msgstr "[`loop` 表达式](#infinite-loops)表示无限循环。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:111
msgid ""
"A [`while` expression](#predicate-loops) loops until a predicate is false."
msgstr "[`while` 表达式](#predicate-loops)会循环，直到谓词为 false。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:112
msgid ""
"A [`for` expression](#iterator-loops) extracts values from an iterator, "
"looping until the iterator is empty."
msgstr ""
"[`for` 表达式](#iterator-loops)从迭代器提取值，并循环直到该迭代器为空。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:113
msgid ""
"A [labeled block expression](loop-expr.md#r-expr.loop.block-labels) runs a "
"loop exactly once, but allows exiting the loop early with `break`."
msgstr ""
"[带标签的块表达式](loop-expr.md#r-expr.loop.block-labels)会运行一个恰好执行一"
"次的循环，但允许使用 `break` 提前退出该循环。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:119
msgid ""
"All four types of loop support [`break` expressions](#break-expressions), "
"and [labels](#loop-labels)."
msgstr ""
"所有四种循环都支持 [`break` 表达式](#break-expressions)和[标签](#loop-"
"labels)。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:125
msgid ""
"All except labeled block expressions support [`continue` expressions]"
"(#continue-expressions)."
msgstr ""
"除带标签的块表达式外，其他所有类型都支持 [`continue` 表达式](#continue-"
"expressions)。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:131
msgid ""
"Only `loop` and labeled block expressions support [evaluation to non-trivial "
"values](#break-and-loop-values)."
msgstr ""
"只有 `loop` 和带标签的块表达式支持[求值为非平凡值](#break-and-loop-values)。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:137
msgid "Infinite loops"
msgstr "无限循环"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:145
msgid ""
"**<sup>Syntax</sup>** <br> <span class=\"grammar-text grammar-production\" "
"id=\"grammar-InfiniteLoopExpression\" onclick=\"show_railroad()"
"\">[InfiniteLoopExpression](loop-expr.md#railroad-InfiniteLoopExpression)</"
"span> → <span class=\"grammar-literal\">loop</span> <span class=\"grammar-"
"text\">[BlockExpression](block-expr.md#grammar-BlockExpression)</span>"
msgstr ""
"**<sup>语法</sup>** <br> <span class=\"grammar-text grammar-production\" "
"id=\"grammar-InfiniteLoopExpression\" onclick=\"show_railroad()"
"\">[InfiniteLoopExpression](loop-expr.md#railroad-InfiniteLoopExpression)</"
"span> → <span class=\"grammar-literal\">loop</span> <span class=\"grammar-"
"text\">[BlockExpression](block-expr.md#grammar-BlockExpression)</span>"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:191
msgid ""
"A `loop` expression repeats execution of its body continuously: `loop "
"{ println!(\"I live.\"); }`."
msgstr "`loop` 表达式会持续重复执行其主体：`loop { println!(\"I live.\"); }`。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:197
msgid ""
"A `loop` expression without an associated `break` expression is [diverging]"
"(../divergence.md#r-divergence) and has type [`!`](../types/never.md#r-"
"type.never)."
msgstr ""
"没有关联 `break` 表达式的 `loop` 表达式是[发散的](../divergence.md#r-"
"divergence)，并具有 [`!`](../types/never.md#r-type.never) 类型。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:203
msgid ""
"A `loop` expression containing associated [`break` expression(s)](#break-"
"expressions) may terminate, and must have type compatible with the value of "
"the `break` expression(s)."
msgstr ""
"包含一个或多个关联 [`break` 表达式](#break-expressions)的 `loop` 表达式可能会"
"终止，并且必须具有与这些 `break` 表达式的值兼容的类型。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:209
msgid "Predicate loops"
msgstr "谓词循环"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:217
msgid ""
"**<sup>Syntax</sup>** <br> <span class=\"grammar-text grammar-production\" "
"id=\"grammar-PredicateLoopExpression\" onclick=\"show_railroad()"
"\">[PredicateLoopExpression](loop-expr.md#railroad-PredicateLoopExpression)</"
"span> → <span class=\"grammar-literal\">while</span> <span class=\"grammar-"
"text\">[Conditions](if-expr.md#grammar-Conditions)</span> <span "
"class=\"grammar-text\">[BlockExpression](block-expr.md#grammar-"
"BlockExpression)</span>"
msgstr ""
"**<sup>语法</sup>** <br> <span class=\"grammar-text grammar-production\" "
"id=\"grammar-PredicateLoopExpression\" onclick=\"show_railroad()"
"\">[PredicateLoopExpression](loop-expr.md#railroad-PredicateLoopExpression)</"
"span> → <span class=\"grammar-literal\">while</span> <span class=\"grammar-"
"text\">[Conditions](if-expr.md#grammar-Conditions)</span> <span "
"class=\"grammar-text\">[BlockExpression](block-expr.md#grammar-"
"BlockExpression)</span>"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:271
msgid ""
"A `while` loop expression allows repeating the evaluation of a block while a "
"set of conditions remain true."
msgstr "`while` 循环表达式允许在一组条件保持为 true 时重复求值一个块。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:277
msgid ""
"Condition operands must be either an [Expression](../expressions.md#grammar-"
"Expression) with a [boolean type](../types/boolean.md) or a conditional "
"`let` match. If all of the condition operands evaluate to `true` and all of "
"the `let` patterns successfully match their [scrutinee](../"
"glossary.md#scrutinee)s, then the loop body block executes."
msgstr ""
"条件操作数必须是具有[布尔类型](../types/boolean.md)的 [Expression](../"
"expressions.md#grammar-Expression)，或者是条件式 `let` 匹配。如果所有条件操作"
"数都求值为 `true`，并且所有 `let` 模式都成功匹配其[被匹配值](../"
"glossary.md#scrutinee)，则执行循环体块。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:283
msgid ""
"After the loop body successfully executes, the condition operands are re-"
"evaluated to determine if the body should be executed again."
msgstr "循环体成功执行之后，会重新求值条件操作数，以确定是否应再次执行主体。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:289
msgid ""
"If any condition operand evaluates to `false` or any `let` pattern does not "
"match its scrutinee, the body is not executed and execution continues after "
"the `while` expression."
msgstr ""
"如果任何条件操作数求值为 `false`，或者任何 `let` 模式没有匹配其被匹配值，则不"
"执行主体，并在 `while` 表达式之后继续执行。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:295
msgid "A `while` expression evaluates to `()`."
msgstr "`while` 表达式求值为 `()`。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:297
msgid "An example:"
msgstr "示例："

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:312
msgid "`while let` patterns"
msgstr "`while let` 模式"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:318
msgid ""
"`let` patterns in a `while` condition allow binding new variables into scope "
"when the pattern matches successfully. The following examples illustrate "
"bindings using `let` patterns:"
msgstr ""
"`while` 条件中的 `let` 模式允许在模式成功匹配时将新变量绑定进作用域。以下示例"
"展示使用 `let` 模式的绑定："

