#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:553
msgid ""
"`IntoIterator`, `Iterator`, and `Option` are always the standard library "
"items here, not whatever those names resolve to in the current scope."
msgstr ""
"这里的 `IntoIterator`、`Iterator` 和 `Option` 始终是标准库项，而不是这些名称"
"在当前作用域中解析到的任何项。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:555
msgid ""
"The variable names `next`, `iter`, and `val` are for exposition only, they "
"do not actually have names the user can type."
msgstr ""
"变量名 `next`、`iter` 和 `val` 仅用于说明，它们实际上并没有用户可键入的名称。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:561
msgid ""
"The outer `match` is used to ensure that any [temporary values](../"
"expressions.md#temporaries) in `iter_expr` don't get dropped before the loop "
"is finished. `next` is declared before being assigned because it results in "
"types being inferred correctly more often."
msgstr ""
"外层 `match` 用于确保 `iter_expr` 中的任何[临时值](../"
"expressions.md#temporaries)不会在循环结束前被丢弃。`next` 在赋值前声明，是因"
"为这样更常能让类型被正确推断。"

