#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:937
msgid ""
"When `continue` is encountered, the current iteration of the associated loop "
"body is immediately terminated, returning control to the loop _head_."
msgstr ""
"遇到 `continue` 时，会立即终止关联循环体的当前迭代，并把控制流返回到循环_首部"
"_。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:943
msgid ""
"A `continue` expression is [diverging](../divergence.md#r-divergence) and "
"has a type of [`!`](../types/never.md#r-type.never)."
msgstr ""
"`continue` 表达式是[发散的](../divergence.md#r-divergence)，并具有 [`!`](../"
"types/never.md#r-type.never) 类型。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:949
msgid ""
"In the case of a `while` loop, the head is the conditional operands "
"controlling the loop."
msgstr "对于 `while` 循环，首部是控制该循环的条件操作数。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:955
msgid ""
"In the case of a `for` loop, the head is the call-expression controlling the "
"loop."
msgstr "对于 `for` 循环，首部是控制该循环的调用表达式。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:961
msgid ""
"Like `break`, `continue` is normally associated with the innermost enclosing "
"loop, but `continue 'label` may be used to specify the loop affected."
msgstr ""
"与 `break` 类似，`continue` 通常与最内层外围循环关联，但可以使用 `continue "
"'label` 指定受影响的循环。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:967
msgid "A `continue` expression is only permitted in the body of a loop."
msgstr "`continue` 表达式只允许出现在循环体内。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:973
msgid "`break` and loop values"
msgstr "`break` 和循环值"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:979
msgid ""
"When associated with a `loop`, a break expression may be used to return a "
"value from that loop, via one of the forms `break EXPR` or `break 'label "
"EXPR`, where `EXPR` is an expression whose result is returned from the "
"`loop`. For example:"
msgstr ""
"当与 `loop` 关联时，`break` 表达式可以用于从该循环返回一个值，形式为 `break "
"EXPR` 或 `break 'label EXPR`；其中 `EXPR` 是一个表达式，其结果会从该 `loop` "
"返回。例如："

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:990
msgid "// first number in Fibonacci sequence over 10:\n"
msgstr "// Fibonacci 数列中第一个超过 10 的数：\n"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:999
msgid ""
"The type of a `loop` with associated `break` expressions is the [least upper "
"bound](../type-coercions.md#r-coerce.least-upper-bound) of all of the break "
"operands."
msgstr ""
"带有关联 `break` 表达式的 `loop` 的类型是所有 `break` 操作数的[最小上界](../"
"type-coercions.md#r-coerce.least-upper-bound)。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:1025
msgid ""
"A `loop` with associated `break` expressions does not [diverge](../"
"divergence.md#r-divergence) if any of the break operands do not diverge. If "
"all of the `break` operands diverge, then the `loop` expression also "
"diverges."
msgstr ""
"如果任何 `break` 操作数不发散，则带有关联 `break` 表达式的 `loop` 不会[发散]"
"(../divergence.md#r-divergence)。如果所有 `break` 操作数都发散，那么该 "
"`loop` 表达式也会发散。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:1033
msgid "// This loop is diverging because all `break` operands are diverging.\n"
msgstr "// 此循环是发散的，因为所有 `break` 操作数都发散。\n"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:1046
msgid "// The type of this loop is i32 even though one of the breaks is\n"
msgstr "// 此循环的类型是 i32，即使其中一个 `break` 是\n"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:1047
msgid "// diverging.\n"
msgstr "// 发散的。\n"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:1054
msgid "// ERROR: expected `!`, found `i32`\n"
msgstr "// ERROR: 预期 `!`，但找到 `i32`\n"

