#: src/expressions/if-expr.md:397
msgid ""
"The syntax of an `if` expression is a sequence of one or more condition "
"operands separated by `&&`, followed by a consequent block, any number of "
"`else if` conditions and blocks, and an optional trailing `else` block."
msgstr ""
"`if` 表达式的语法是一个或多个以 `&&` 分隔的条件操作数序列，后跟一个结果块、任"
"意数量的 `else if` 条件和块，以及一个可选的尾随 `else` 块。"

#: src/expressions/if-expr.md:403
msgid ""
"Condition operands must be either an [Expression](../expressions.md#grammar-"
"Expression) with a [boolean type](../types/boolean.md) or a conditional "
"`let` match."
msgstr ""
"条件操作数必须是具有[布尔类型](../types/boolean.md)的 [Expression](../"
"expressions.md#grammar-Expression)，或者是条件式 `let` 匹配。"

#: src/expressions/if-expr.md:409
msgid ""
"If all of the condition operands evaluate to `true` and all of the `let` "
"patterns successfully match their [scrutinee](../glossary.md#scrutinee)s, "
"the consequent block is executed and any subsequent `else if` or `else` "
"block is skipped."
msgstr ""
"如果所有条件操作数都求值为 `true`，并且所有 `let` 模式都成功匹配其[被匹配值]"
"(../glossary.md#scrutinee)，则执行结果块，并跳过任何后续的 `else if` 或 "
"`else` 块。"

#: src/expressions/if-expr.md:415
msgid ""
"If any condition operand evaluates to `false` or any `let` pattern does not "
"match its scrutinee, the consequent block is skipped and any subsequent "
"`else if` condition is evaluated."
msgstr ""
"如果任何条件操作数求值为 `false`，或者任何 `let` 模式没有匹配其被匹配值，则跳"
"过结果块，并对任何后续的 `else if` 条件求值。"

#: src/expressions/if-expr.md:421
msgid ""
"If all `if` and `else if` conditions evaluate to `false` then any `else` "
"block is executed."
msgstr ""
"如果所有 `if` 和 `else if` 条件都求值为 `false`，则执行存在的 `else` 块。"

#: src/expressions/if-expr.md:427
msgid ""
"An `if` expression evaluates to the same value as the executed block, or "
"`()` if no block is evaluated."
msgstr "`if` 表达式求值为被执行块的同一值；如果没有块被求值，则求值为 `()`。"

#: src/expressions/if-expr.md:433
msgid "An `if` expression must have the same type in all situations."
msgstr "`if` 表达式在所有情况下必须具有相同的类型。"

