#: src/expressions/if-expr.md:554 src/expressions/match-expr.md:926
msgid ""
"Similar to a `&&` [LazyBooleanExpression](operator-expr.md#grammar-"
"LazyBooleanExpression), each operand is evaluated from left-to-right until "
"an operand evaluates as `false` or a `let` match fails, in which case the "
"subsequent operands are not evaluated."
msgstr ""
"类似于 `&&` [LazyBooleanExpression](operator-expr.md#grammar-"
"LazyBooleanExpression)，每个操作数会从左到右求值，直到某个操作数求值为 "
"`false` 或某个 `let` 匹配失败；在这种情况下，后续操作数不会被求值。"

#: src/expressions/if-expr.md:560
msgid ""
"The bindings of each pattern are put into scope to be available for the next "
"condition operand and the consequent block."
msgstr "每个模式的绑定都会被放入作用域，以供下一个条件操作数和结果块使用。"

