msgid "\"one\""
msgstr "\"one\""

#: src/expressions/match-expr.md:673
msgid "\"two\""
msgstr "\"two\""

#: src/expressions/match-expr.md:674
msgid "\"three\""
msgstr "\"three\""

#: src/expressions/match-expr.md:675
msgid "\"four\""
msgstr "\"four\""

#: src/expressions/match-expr.md:676
msgid "\"five\""
msgstr "\"five\""

#: src/expressions/match-expr.md:677
msgid "\"something else\""
msgstr "\"something else\""

#: src/expressions/match-expr.md:685
msgid ""
"Variables bound within the pattern are scoped to the match guard and the "
"arm's expression."
msgstr "模式内绑定的变量作用域限于匹配守卫和该分支的表达式。"

#: src/expressions/match-expr.md:691
msgid ""
"The [binding mode](../patterns.md#binding-modes) (move, copy, or reference) "
"depends on the pattern."
msgstr ""
"[绑定模式](../patterns.md#binding-modes)（移动、复制或引用）取决于模式。"

#: src/expressions/match-expr.md:697
msgid ""
"Multiple match patterns may be joined with the `|` operator. Each pattern "
"will be tested in left-to-right sequence until a successful match is found."
msgstr ""
"多个匹配模式可以用 `|` 运算符连接。每个模式会按从左到右的顺序测试，直到找到成"
"功匹配。"

#: src/expressions/match-expr.md:702
msgid "\"not many\""
msgstr "\"not many\""

#: src/expressions/match-expr.md:703 src/expressions/match-expr.md:707
msgid "\"a few\""
msgstr "\"a few\""

#: src/expressions/match-expr.md:704
msgid "\"lots\""
msgstr "\"lots\""

