msgstr "[`if let` 表达式](expressions/if-expr.md)"

#: src/patterns.md:371
msgid "[`while let` expressions](expressions/loop-expr.md#while-let-patterns)"
msgstr "[`while let` 表达式](expressions/loop-expr.md#while-let-patterns)"

