#: src/patterns.md:1469
msgid ""
"_Range patterns_ match scalar values within the range defined by their "
"bounds. They comprise a _sigil_ (`..` or `..=`) and a bound on one or both "
"sides."
msgstr ""
"_范围模式_匹配由其边界定义的范围内的标量值。它们由一个 _sigil_（符号标记，"
"`..` 或 `..=`）以及一侧或两侧的边界组成。"

#: src/patterns.md:1471
msgid ""
"A bound on the left of the sigil is called a _lower bound_. A bound on the "
"right is called an _upper bound_."
msgstr "该 sigil 左侧的边界称为_下界_。右侧的边界称为_上界_。"

#: src/patterns.md:1477
msgid ""
"The _exclusive range pattern_ matches all values from the lower bound up to, "
"but not including the upper bound. It is written as its lower bound, "
"followed by `..`, followed by the upper bound."
msgstr ""
"_排除上界的范围模式_匹配从下界开始直到上界、但不包括上界的所有值。它写作下"
"界，后接 `..`，再后接上界。"

#: src/patterns.md:1479
msgid ""
"For example, a pattern `'m'..'p'` will match only `'m'`, `'n'` and `'o'`, "
"specifically **not** including `'p'`."
msgstr ""
"例如，模式 `'m'..'p'` 只会匹配 `'m'`、`'n'` 和 `'o'`，明确**不**包括 `'p'`。"

#: src/patterns.md:1485
msgid ""
"The _inclusive range pattern_ matches all values from the lower bound up to "
"and including the upper bound. It is written as its lower bound, followed by "
"`..=`, followed by the upper bound."
msgstr ""
"_包含上界的范围模式_匹配从下界开始直到并包括上界的所有值。它写作下界，后接 "
"`..=`，再后接上界。"

#: src/patterns.md:1487
msgid ""
"For example, a pattern `'m'..='p'` will match only the values `'m'`, `'n'`, "
"`'o'`, and `'p'`."
msgstr "例如，模式 `'m'..='p'` 只会匹配值 `'m'`、`'n'`、`'o'` 和 `'p'`。"

#: src/patterns.md:1493
msgid ""
"The _from range pattern_ matches all values greater than or equal to the "
"lower bound. It is written as its lower bound followed by `..`."
msgstr "_起始范围模式_匹配所有大于或等于下界的值。它写作下界后接 `..`。"

#: src/patterns.md:1495
msgid ""
"For example, `1..` will match any integer greater than or equal to 1, such "
"as 1, 9, or 9001, or 9007199254740991 (if it is of an appropriate size), but "
"not 0, and not negative numbers for signed integers."
msgstr ""
"例如，`1..` 会匹配任何大于或等于 1 的整数，例如 1、9、9001，或者 "
"9007199254740991（如果它的大小合适），但不匹配 0；对于有符号整数，也不匹配负"
"数。"

#: src/patterns.md:1501
msgid ""
"The _to exclusive range pattern_ matches all values less than the upper "
"bound. It is written as `..` followed by the upper bound."
msgstr "_排除终止范围模式_匹配所有小于上界的值。它写作 `..` 后接上界。"

#: src/patterns.md:1503
msgid ""
"For example, `..10` will match any integer less than 10, such as 9, 1, 0, "
"and for signed integer types, all negative values."
msgstr ""
"例如，`..10` 会匹配任何小于 10 的整数，例如 9、1、0；对于有符号整数类型，还会"
"匹配所有负值。"

#: src/patterns.md:1509
msgid ""
"The _to inclusive range pattern_ matches all values less than or equal to "
"the upper bound. It is written as `..=` followed by the upper bound."
msgstr "_包含终止范围模式_匹配所有小于或等于上界的值。它写作 `..=` 后接上界。"

#: src/patterns.md:1511
msgid ""
"For example, `..=10` will match any integer less than or equal to 10, such "
"as 10, 1, 0, and for signed integer types, all negative values."
msgstr ""
"例如，`..=10` 会匹配任何小于或等于 10 的整数，例如 10、1、0；对于有符号整数类"
"型，还会匹配所有负值。"

#: src/patterns.md:1517
msgid ""
"A range pattern must be nonempty; it must span at least one value in the set "
"of possible values for its type. In other words:"
msgstr "范围模式必须非空；它必须覆盖其类型的可能值集合中的至少一个值。换言之："

#: src/patterns.md:1519
msgid ""
"In `a..=b`, a ≤ b must be the case. For example, it is an error to have a "
"range pattern `10..=0`, but `10..=10` is allowed."
msgstr ""
"在 `a..=b` 中，必须满足 a ≤ b。例如，范围模式 `10..=0` 是错误，但允许 "
"`10..=10`。"

#: src/patterns.md:1520
msgid ""
"In `a..b`, a \\< b must be the case. For example, it is an error to have a "
"range pattern `10..0` or `10..10`."
msgstr ""
"在 `a..b` 中，必须满足 a \\< b。例如，范围模式 `10..0` 或 `10..10` 是错误。"

#: src/patterns.md:1521
msgid ""
"In `..b`, b must not be the smallest value of its type. For example, it is "
"an error to have a range pattern `..-128i8` or `..f64::NEG_INFINITY`."
msgstr ""
"在 `..b` 中，b 不得是其类型的最小值。例如，范围模式 `..-128i8` 或 "
"`..f64::NEG_INFINITY` 是错误。"

#: src/patterns.md:1527
msgid "A bound is written as one of:"
msgstr "边界写作以下形式之一："

#: src/patterns.md:1529
msgid "A character, byte, integer, or float literal."
msgstr "字符、字节、整数或浮点数字面量。"

#: src/patterns.md:1530
msgid "A `-` followed by an integer or float literal."
msgstr "一个 `-` 后接整数或浮点数字面量。"

#: src/patterns.md:1531
msgid "A [path](expressions/path-expr.md)."
msgstr "一个[路径](expressions/path-expr.md)。"

#: src/patterns.md:1538
msgid ""
"We syntactically accept more than this for a _[RangePatternBound]"
"(patterns.md#grammar-RangePatternBound)_. We later reject the other things "
"semantically."
msgstr ""
"对于 _[RangePatternBound](patterns.md#grammar-RangePatternBound)_，我们在语法"
"上接受的内容多于这些。其他内容随后会在语义上被拒绝。"

#: src/patterns.md:1547
msgid ""
"If a bound is written as a path, after macro resolution, the path must "
"resolve to a constant item of the type `char`, an integer type, or a float "
"type."
msgstr ""
"如果边界写作路径，则在宏解析之后，该路径必须解析为类型为 `char`、整数类型或浮"
"点数类型的常量项。"

#: src/patterns.md:1553
msgid ""
"The range pattern matches the type of its upper and lower bounds, which must "
"be the same type."
msgstr "范围模式匹配其上界和下界的类型，二者必须是同一类型。"

#: src/patterns.md:1559
msgid ""
"If a bound is a [path](expressions/path-expr.md), the bound matches the type "
"and has the value of the [constant](items/constant-items.md) the path "
"resolves to."
msgstr ""
"如果边界是[路径](expressions/path-expr.md)，则该边界匹配该路径所解析到的[常"
"量](items/constant-items.md)的类型，并具有该常量的值。"

#: src/patterns.md:1565
msgid ""
"If a bound is a literal, the bound matches the type and has the value of the "
"corresponding [literal expression](expressions/literal-expr.md)."
msgstr ""
"如果边界是字面量，则该边界匹配对应[字面量表达式](expressions/literal-expr.md)"
"的类型，并具有该字面量表达式的值。"

#: src/patterns.md:1571
msgid ""
"If a bound is a literal preceded by a `-`, the bound matches the same type "
"as the corresponding [literal expression](expressions/literal-expr.md) and "
"has the value of [negating](expressions/operator-expr.md#negation-operators) "
"the value of the corresponding literal expression."
msgstr ""
"如果边界是前面带有 `-` 的字面量，则该边界匹配对应[字面量表达式](expressions/"
"literal-expr.md)的相同类型，并具有对该字面量表达式的值进行[取负](expressions/"
"operator-expr.md#negation-operators)后的值。"

#: src/patterns.md:1577
