msgid "covariant"
msgstr "协变"

#: src/subtyping.md:89
msgid "`&'a mut T`"
msgstr "`&'a mut T`"

#: src/subtyping.md:89 src/subtyping.md:91 src/subtyping.md:95
#: src/subtyping.md:97
msgid "invariant"
msgstr "不变"

#: src/subtyping.md:90 src/type-coercions.md:243
msgid "`*const T`"
msgstr "`*const T`"

#: src/subtyping.md:91 src/type-coercions.md:244
msgid "`*mut T`"
msgstr "`*mut T`"

#: src/subtyping.md:92
msgid "`[T]` and `[T; n]`"
msgstr "`[T]` 和 `[T; n]`"

#: src/subtyping.md:93
msgid "`fn() -> T`"
msgstr "`fn() -> T`"

#: src/subtyping.md:94
msgid "`fn(T) -> ()`"
msgstr "`fn(T) -> ()`"

#: src/subtyping.md:94
msgid "contravariant"
msgstr "逆变"

#: src/subtyping.md:95
msgid "`std::cell::UnsafeCell<T>`"
msgstr "`std::cell::UnsafeCell<T>`"

#: src/subtyping.md:96
msgid "`std::marker::PhantomData<T>`"
msgstr "`std::marker::PhantomData<T>`"

#: src/subtyping.md:97
msgid "`dyn Trait<T> + 'a`"
msgstr "`dyn Trait<T> + 'a`"

#: src/subtyping.md:103
msgid ""
"The variance of other `struct`, `enum`, and `union` types is decided by "
"looking at the variance of the types of their fields. If the parameter is "
"used in positions with different variances then the parameter is invariant. "
"For example the following struct is covariant in `'a` and `T` and invariant "
"in `'b`, `'c`, and `U`."
msgstr ""
"其他 `struct`、`enum` 和 `union` 类型的型变，通过查看其字段类型的型变来决定。"
"如果参数被用在具有不同型变的位置中，则该参数是不变的。例如，以下结构体在 "
"`'a` 和 `T` 上是协变的，在 `'b`、`'c` 和 `U` 上是不变的。"

#: src/subtyping.md:108
msgid ""
"// This makes `Variance` covariant in 'a, and would\n"
"                            // make it covariant in U, but U is used later\n"
msgstr ""
"// 这使 `Variance` 在 'a 上协变，并且本会使它\n"
"                            // 在 U 上协变，但 U 稍后还会被使用\n"

#: src/subtyping.md:110
msgid "// Covariant in T\n"
msgstr "// 在 T 上协变\n"

#: src/subtyping.md:111
msgid "// Invariant in 'b\n"
msgstr "// 在 'b 上不变\n"

#: src/subtyping.md:112
msgid "// Invariant in U, makes the whole struct invariant\n"
msgstr "// 在 U 上不变，使整个结构体不变\n"

#: src/subtyping.md:114
msgid ""
"// Both co- and contravariant, makes 'c invariant\n"
"                            // in the struct.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 同时协变和逆变，使 'c 在该结构体中\n"
"                            // 不变。\n"

#: src/subtyping.md:123
msgid ""
"When used outside of an `struct`, `enum`, or `union`, the variance for "
"parameters is checked at each location separately."
msgstr ""
"当在 `struct`、`enum` 或 `union` 之外使用时，参数的型变会在每个位置分别检查。"

#: src/subtyping.md:128
msgid ""
"// 'long is used inside of a tuple in both a co- and invariant position.\n"
msgstr "// 'long 在元组内同时用于协变位置和不变位置。\n"

#: src/subtyping.md:131
msgid ""
"// As the variance at these positions is computed separately,\n"
"    // we can freely shrink 'long in the covariant position.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 由于这些位置上的型变是分别计算的，\n"
"    // 我们可以在协变位置自由缩短 'long。\n"

#: src/subtyping.md:137
msgid "// 'middle is used in both a co- and contravariant position.\n"
msgstr "// 'middle 同时用于协变位置和逆变位置。\n"

#: src/subtyping.md:140
msgid ""
"// As the variance at these positions is computed separately,\n"
"    // we can freely shrink 'middle in the covariant position\n"
"    // and extend it in the contravariant position.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 由于这些位置上的型变是分别计算的，\n"
"    // 我们可以在协变位置自由缩短 'middle，\n"
"    // 并在逆变位置扩展它。\n"

