#: src/trait-bounds.md:505
msgid ""
"[Trait](items/traits.md#trait-bounds) and lifetime bounds provide a way for "
"[generic items](items/generics.md) to restrict which types and lifetimes are "
"used as their parameters. Bounds can be provided on any type in a [where "
"clause](items/generics.md#where-clauses). There are also shorter forms for "
"certain common cases:"
msgstr ""
"[Trait](items/traits.md#trait-bounds) 约束和生命周期约束为[泛型项](items/"
"generics.md)提供了一种方式，用于限制哪些类型和生命周期可用作其参数。约束可以"
"在 [where 子句](items/generics.md#where-clauses)中的任何类型上给出。对于某些"
"常见情况，也有较短的形式："

#: src/trait-bounds.md:507
msgid ""
"Bounds written after declaring a [generic parameter](items/generics.md): `fn "
"f<A: Copy>() {}` is the same as `fn f<A>() where A: Copy {}`."
msgstr ""
"写在声明[泛型形参](items/generics.md)之后的约束：`fn f<A: Copy>() {}` 与 `fn "
"f<A>() where A: Copy {}` 相同。"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:508
msgid ""
"In trait declarations as [supertraits](items/traits.md#supertraits): `trait "
"Circle : Shape {}` is equivalent to `trait Circle where Self : Shape {}`."
msgstr ""
"在 trait 声明中作为 [supertrait](items/traits.md#supertraits)：`trait "
"Circle : Shape {}` 等价于 `trait Circle where Self : Shape {}`。"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:509
msgid ""
"In trait declarations as bounds on [associated types](items/associated-"
"items.md#associated-types): `trait A { type B: Copy; }` is equivalent to "
"`trait A where Self::B: Copy { type B; }`."
msgstr ""
"在 trait 声明中作为[关联类型](items/associated-items.md#associated-types)上的"
"约束：`trait A { type B: Copy; }` 等价于 `trait A where Self::B: Copy { type "
"B; }`。"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:515
msgid ""
"Bounds on an item must be satisfied when using the item. When type checking "
"and borrow checking a generic item, the bounds can be used to determine that "
"a trait is implemented for a type. For example, given `Ty: Trait`"
msgstr ""
"使用某个项时，必须满足该项上的约束。在对泛型项进行类型检查和借用检查时，可以"
"使用这些约束来判定某个类型实现了某个 trait。例如，给定 `Ty: Trait`"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:517
msgid ""
"In the body of a generic function, methods from `Trait` can be called on "
"`Ty` values. Likewise associated constants on the `Trait` can be used."
msgstr ""
"在泛型函数体中，可以在 `Ty` 值上调用来自 `Trait` 的方法。同样，也可以使用 "
"`Trait` 上的关联常量。"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:518
msgid "Associated types from `Trait` can be used."
msgstr "可以使用来自 `Trait` 的关联类型。"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:519
msgid ""
"Generic functions and types with a `T: Trait` bounds can be used with `Ty` "
"being used for `T`."
msgstr ""
"带有 `T: Trait` 约束的泛型函数和类型可以在以 `Ty` 作为 `T` 的情况下使用。"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:529
msgid "// Can call method because T: Shape\n"
msgstr "// 可以调用方法，因为 T: Shape\n"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:534
msgid "// doesn't move sh because T: Copy\n"
msgstr "// 不会移动 sh，因为 T: Copy\n"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:535
msgid "// Can use generic function because T: Shape\n"
msgstr "// 可以使用泛型函数，因为 T: Shape\n"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:541
msgid "// Type Figure<U> is well-formed because U: Shape\n"
msgstr "// 类型 Figure<U> 是良构的，因为 U: Shape\n"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:544
msgid "\"Figure of two {}\""
msgstr "\"两个 {} 组成的 Figure\""

#: src/trait-bounds.md:545
msgid "// Can use associated function\n"
msgstr "// 可以使用关联函数\n"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:554
msgid ""
"Bounds that don't use the item's parameters or [higher-ranked lifetimes]"
"(#higher-ranked-trait-bounds) are checked when the item is defined. It is an "
"error for such a bound to be false."
msgstr ""
"不使用该项的参数或[高阶生命周期](#higher-ranked-trait-bounds)的约束，会在定义"
"该项时被检查。这样的约束若为假，则是错误。"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:560
msgid ""
"[`Copy`](../core/marker/trait.Copy.html), [`Clone`](../core/clone/"
"trait.Clone.html), and [`Sized`](../core/marker/trait.Sized.html) bounds are "
"also checked for certain generic types when using the item, even if the use "
"does not provide a concrete type. It is an error to have `Copy` or `Clone` "
"as a bound on a mutable reference, [trait object](types/trait-object.md), or "
"[slice](types/slice.md). It is an error to have `Sized` as a bound on a "
"trait object or slice."
msgstr ""
"对于某些泛型类型，在使用该项时也会检查 [`Copy`](../core/marker/"
"trait.Copy.html)、[`Clone`](../core/clone/trait.Clone.html) 和 [`Sized`](../"
"core/marker/trait.Sized.html) 约束，即使该使用没有提供具体类型。在可变引用、"
"[trait 对象](types/trait-object.md)或[切片](types/slice.md)上以 `Copy` 或 "
"`Clone` 作为约束是错误。在 trait 对象或切片上以 `Sized` 作为约束也是错误。"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:566
msgid "// Error: `i32` is not an iterator\n"
msgstr "// 错误：`i32` 不是迭代器\n"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:567
msgid "// (at use) Error: the trait bound is not satisfied\n"
msgstr "// （使用时）错误：未满足 trait 约束\n"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:568
msgid "// (at use) Error: size cannot be known at compilation\n"
msgstr "// （使用时）错误：无法在编译时知道大小\n"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:579
msgid ""
"Trait and lifetime bounds are also used to name [trait objects](types/trait-"
"object.md)."
msgstr ""
"Trait 约束和生命周期约束也用于命名 [trait 对象](types/trait-object.md)。"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:585
msgid "`?Sized`"
msgstr "`?Sized`"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:587
msgid ""
"`?` is only used to relax the implicit [`Sized`](../core/marker/"
"trait.Sized.html) trait bound for [type parameters](types/parameters.md) or "
"[associated types](items/associated-items.md#associated-types). `?Sized` may "
"not be used as a bound for other types."
msgstr ""
"`?` 只用于放宽[类型形参](types/parameters.md)或[关联类型](items/associated-"
"items.md#associated-types)的隐式 [`Sized`](../core/marker/trait.Sized.html) "
"trait 约束。`?Sized` 不得用作其他类型的约束。"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:593
msgid "Lifetime bounds"
msgstr "生命周期约束"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:599
msgid "Lifetime bounds can be applied to types or to other lifetimes."
msgstr "生命周期约束可以应用于类型，也可以应用于其他生命周期。"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:605
msgid ""
"The bound `'a: 'b` is usually read as `'a` _outlives_ `'b`. `'a: 'b` means "
"that `'a` lasts at least as long as `'b`, so a reference `&'a ()` is valid "
"whenever `&'b ()` is valid."
msgstr ""
"约束 `'a: 'b` 通常读作 `'a` _outlives_ `'b`。`'a: 'b` 表示 `'a` 至少与 `'b` "
"一样长，因此只要 `&'b ()` 有效，引用 `&'a ()` 就有效。"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:609
msgid "// &'a i32 is a subtype of &'b i32 because 'a: 'b\n"
msgstr "// &'a i32 是 &'b i32 的子类型，因为 'a: 'b\n"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:610
msgid "// &'b &'a i32 is well formed because 'a: 'b\n"
msgstr "// &'b &'a i32 是良构的，因为 'a: 'b\n"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:618
msgid ""
"`T: 'a` means that all lifetime parameters of `T` outlive `'a`. For example, "
"if `'a` is an unconstrained lifetime parameter, then `i32: 'static` and "
"`&'static str: 'a` are satisfied, but `Vec<&'a ()>: 'static` is not."
msgstr ""
"`T: 'a` 表示 `T` 的所有生命周期参数都比 `'a` 活得更久。例如，如果 `'a` 是一个"
"未受约束的生命周期参数，那么 `i32: 'static` 和 `&'static str: 'a` 得到满足，"
"但 `Vec<&'a ()>: 'static` 不满足。"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:624
msgid "Higher-ranked trait bounds"
msgstr "高阶 trait 约束"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:632
msgid ""
"**<sup>Syntax</sup>** <br> <span class=\"grammar-text grammar-production\" "
"id=\"grammar-ForLifetimes\" onclick=\"show_railroad()\">[ForLifetimes](trait-"
"bounds.md#railroad-ForLifetimes)</span> → <span class=\"grammar-"
"literal\">for</span> <span class=\"grammar-text\">[GenericParams](items/"
"generics.md#grammar-GenericParams)</span>"
msgstr ""
"**<sup>语法</sup>** <br> <span class=\"grammar-text grammar-production\" "
"id=\"grammar-ForLifetimes\" onclick=\"show_railroad()\">[ForLifetimes](trait-"
"bounds.md#railroad-ForLifetimes)</span> → <span class=\"grammar-"
"literal\">for</span> <span class=\"grammar-text\">[GenericParams](items/"
"generics.md#grammar-GenericParams)</span>"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:678
msgid ""
"Trait bounds may be _higher ranked_ over lifetimes. These bounds specify a "
"bound that is true _for all_ lifetimes. For example, a bound such as "
"`for<'a> &'a T: PartialEq<i32>` would require an implementation like"
msgstr ""
"Trait 约束可以在生命周期上是_高阶_的。这些约束指定了对_所有_生命周期都为真的"
"约束。例如，像 `for<'a> &'a T: PartialEq<i32>` 这样的约束会要求有如下实现"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:688
msgid ""
"and could then be used to compare a `&'a T` with any lifetime to an `i32`."
msgstr "然后可用于将具有任意生命周期的 `&'a T` 与 `i32` 进行比较。"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:690
msgid ""
"Only a higher-ranked bound can be used here, because the lifetime of the "
"reference is shorter than any possible lifetime parameter on the function:"
msgstr ""
"这里只能使用高阶约束，因为该引用的生命周期短于函数上任何可能的生命周期参数："

#: src/trait-bounds.md:703
msgid ""
"Higher-ranked lifetimes may also be specified just before the trait: the "
"only difference is the [scope](names/scopes.md#higher-ranked-trait-bound-"
"scopes) of the lifetime parameter, which extends only to the end of the "
"following trait instead of the whole bound. This function is equivalent to "
"the last one."
msgstr ""
"高阶生命周期也可以正好指定在 trait 之前：唯一的区别是生命周期参数的[作用域]"
"(names/scopes.md#higher-ranked-trait-bound-scopes)，它只延伸到后续 trait 的末"
"尾，而不是整个约束的末尾。此函数等价于上一个函数。"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:716
msgid "Implied bounds"
msgstr "隐含约束"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:722
msgid ""
"Lifetime bounds required for types to be well-formed are sometimes inferred."
msgstr "类型成为良构类型所需的生命周期约束有时会被推断出来。"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:728
msgid ""
"The type parameter `T` is required to outlive `'a` for the type `&'a T` to "
"be well-formed. This is inferred because the function signature contains the "
"type `&'a T` which is only valid if `T: 'a` holds."
msgstr ""
"为了使类型 `&'a T` 成为良构类型，类型参数 `T` 必须比 `'a` 活得更久。这会被推"
"断出来，因为函数签名包含类型 `&'a T`，而该类型只有在 `T: 'a` 成立时才有效。"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:734
msgid ""
"Implied bounds are added for all parameters and outputs of functions. Inside "
"of `requires_t_outlives_a` you can assume `T: 'a` to hold even if you don't "
"explicitly specify this:"
msgstr ""
"隐含约束会为函数的所有参数和输出添加。在 `requires_t_outlives_a` 内部，即使没"
"有显式指定这一点，也可以假定 `T: 'a` 成立："

#: src/trait-bounds.md:740
msgid ""
"// This compiles, because `T: 'a` is implied by\n"
"    // the reference type `&'a T`.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 这可以编译，因为 `T: 'a` 由\n"
"    // 引用类型 `&'a T` 隐含。\n"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:749
msgid ""
"// This errors, because `T: 'a` is not implied by\n"
"    // the function signature.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 这会出错，因为 `T: 'a` 并不由\n"
"    // 函数签名隐含。\n"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:759
msgid ""
"Only lifetime bounds are implied, trait bounds still have to be explicitly "
"added. The following example therefore causes an error:"
msgstr ""
"只有生命周期约束会被隐含，trait 约束仍然必须显式添加。因此，下面的示例会导致"
"错误："

#: src/trait-bounds.md:763
msgid "// error[E0277]: `T` doesn't implement `Debug`\n"
msgstr "// error[E0277]：`T` 未实现 `Debug`\n"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:772
msgid ""
"Lifetime bounds are also inferred for type definitions and impl blocks for "
"any type:"
msgstr "也会为类型定义以及任何类型的 impl 块推断生命周期约束："

#: src/trait-bounds.md:776
msgid ""
"// This requires `T: 'a` to be well-formed\n"
"    // which is inferred by the compiler.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 这要求 `T: 'a` 才能成为良构类型，\n"
"    // 这一点由编译器推断。\n"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:782
msgid ""
"// This requires `T: 'a` to be well-formed,\n"
"    // which is inferred by the compiler.\n"
"    //\n"
"    // Note that `T: 'a` is required even when only\n"
"    // using `Enum::OtherVariant`.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 这要求 `T: 'a` 才能成为良构类型，\n"
"    // 这一点由编译器推断。\n"
"    //\n"
"    // 注意，即使只使用 `Enum::OtherVariant`，\n"
"    // 也要求 `T: 'a`。\n"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:792
msgid ""
"// This would error because `T: 'a` is not implied by any type\n"
"// in the impl header.\n"
"//     impl<'a, T> Trait<'a, T> for () {}\n"
msgstr ""
"// 这会出错，因为 `T: 'a` 不由 impl 头部中的\n"
"// 任何类型隐含。\n"
"//     impl<'a, T> Trait<'a, T> for () {}\n"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:796
msgid "// This compiles as `T: 'a` is implied by the self type `&'a T`.\n"
msgstr "// 这可以编译，因为 `T: 'a` 由 self 类型 `&'a T` 隐含。\n"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:805
msgid "Use bounds"
msgstr "Use 约束"

#: src/trait-bounds.md:807
msgid ""
"Certain bounds lists may include a `use<..>` bound to control which generic "
"parameters are captured by the `impl Trait` [abstract return type](types/"
"impl-trait.md#abstract-return-types).  See [precise capturing](types/impl-"
"trait.md#precise-capturing) for more details."
msgstr ""
"某些约束列表可以包含 `use<..>` 约束，用于控制哪些泛型参数会被 `impl Trait` "
"[抽象返回类型](types/impl-trait.md#abstract-return-types)捕获。更多细节请参见"
"[精确捕获](types/impl-trait.md#precise-capturing)。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:11
msgid ""
"**Type coercions** are implicit operations that change the type of a value. "
"They happen automatically at specific locations and are highly restricted in "
"what types actually coerce."
msgstr ""
"**类型强制转换**是改变值的类型的隐式操作。它们会在特定位置自动发生，并且对于"
"实际可强制转换的类型有很严格的限制。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:17
msgid ""
"Any conversions allowed by coercion can also be explicitly performed by the "
"[type cast operator](expressions/operator-expr.md#type-cast-expressions), "
"`as`."
msgstr ""
"任何可由强制转换允许的转换，也都可以通过[类型转换运算符](expressions/"
"operator-expr.md#type-cast-expressions) `as` 显式执行。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:19
msgid ""
"Coercions are originally defined in [RFC 401](https://github.com/rust-lang/"
"rfcs/blob/master/text/0401-coercions.md) and expanded upon in [RFC 1558]"
"(https://github.com/rust-lang/rfcs/blob/master/text/1558-closure-to-fn-"
"coercion.md)."
msgstr ""
"强制转换最初在 [RFC 401](https://github.com/rust-lang/rfcs/blob/master/text/"
"0401-coercions.md) 中定义，并在 [RFC 1558](https://github.com/rust-lang/rfcs/"
"blob/master/text/1558-closure-to-fn-coercion.md) 中得到扩展。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:25
msgid "Coercion sites"
msgstr "强制转换位置"

#: src/type-coercions.md:31
msgid ""
"A coercion can only occur at certain coercion sites in a program; these are "
"typically places where the desired type is explicit or can be derived by "
"propagation from explicit types (without type inference). Possible coercion "
"sites are:"
msgstr ""
"强制转换只能发生在程序中的某些强制转换位置；这些位置通常是期望类型显式给出，"
"或可以从显式类型传播推导出来（不经过类型推断）的地方。可能的强制转换位置包"
"括："

#: src/type-coercions.md:37
msgid "`let` statements where an explicit type is given."
msgstr "给出了显式类型的 `let` 语句。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:39 src/type-coercions.md:59 src/type-coercions.md:77
msgid "For example, `&mut 42` is coerced to have type `&i8` in the following:"
msgstr "例如，在下面的代码中，`&mut 42` 被强制转换为类型 `&i8`："

#: src/type-coercions.md:49
msgid "`static` and `const` item declarations (similar to `let` statements)."
msgstr "`static` 和 `const` 项声明（类似于 `let` 语句）。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:55
msgid "Arguments for function calls"
msgstr "函数调用的实参"

#: src/type-coercions.md:57
msgid ""
"The value being coerced is the actual parameter, and it is coerced to the "
"type of the formal parameter."
msgstr "被强制转换的值是实际参数，它会被强制转换为形式参数的类型。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:69
msgid ""
"For method calls, the receiver (`self` parameter) type is coerced "
"differently, see the documentation on [method-call expressions](expressions/"
"method-call-expr.md) for details."
msgstr ""
"对于方法调用，接收者（`self` 参数）的类型会以不同方式强制转换；详情见[方法调"
"用表达式](expressions/method-call-expr.md)的文档。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:75
msgid "Instantiations of struct, union, or enum variant fields"
msgstr "结构体、联合体或枚举变体字段的实例化"

#: src/type-coercions.md:91
msgid ""
"Function results—either the final line of a block if it is not semicolon-"
"terminated or any expression in a `return` statement"
msgstr ""
"函数结果，即块中未以分号结束时的最后一行，或 `return` 语句中的任何表达式"

#: src/type-coercions.md:93
msgid ""
"For example, `x` is coerced to have type `&dyn Display` in the following:"
msgstr "例如，在下面的代码中，`x` 被强制转换为类型 `&dyn Display`："

#: src/type-coercions.md:106
msgid "Assigned value operands in assignment expressions"
msgstr "赋值表达式中被赋的值操作数"

#: src/type-coercions.md:108
msgid "For example, `y` is coerced to have type `&i8` in the following:"
msgstr "例如，在下面的代码中，`y` 被强制转换为类型 `&i8`："

#: src/type-coercions.md:119
msgid ""
"If the expression in one of these coercion sites is a coercion-propagating "
"expression, then the relevant sub-expressions in that expression are also "
"coercion sites. Propagation recurses from these new coercion sites. "
"Propagating expressions and their relevant sub-expressions are:"
msgstr ""
"如果这些强制转换位置之一中的表达式是会传播强制转换的表达式，那么该表达式中的"
"相关子表达式也会成为强制转换位置。传播会从这些新的强制转换位置递归进行。会传"
"播的表达式及其相关子表达式如下："

#: src/type-coercions.md:125
msgid ""
"Array literals, where the array has type `[U; n]`. Each sub-expression in "
"the array literal is a coercion site for coercion to type `U`."
msgstr ""
"数组字面量，其中数组具有类型 `[U; n]`。数组字面量中的每个子表达式都是强制转换"
"到类型 `U` 的强制转换位置。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:131
msgid ""
"Array literals with repeating syntax, where the array has type `[U; n]`. The "
"repeated sub-expression is a coercion site for coercion to type `U`."
msgstr ""
"带有重复语法的数组字面量，其中数组具有类型 `[U; n]`。被重复的子表达式是强制转"
"换到类型 `U` 的强制转换位置。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:137
msgid ""
"Tuples, where a tuple is a coercion site to type `(U_0, U_1, ..., U_n)`. "
"Each sub-expression is a coercion site to the respective type, e.g. the "
"zeroth sub-expression is a coercion site to type `U_0`."
msgstr ""
"元组，其中元组是强制转换到类型 `(U_0, U_1, ..., U_n)` 的强制转换位置。每个子"
"表达式都是强制转换到对应类型的强制转换位置，例如第零个子表达式是强制转换到类"
"型 `U_0` 的强制转换位置。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:143
msgid ""
"Parenthesized sub-expressions (`(e)`): if the expression has type `U`, then "
"the sub-expression is a coercion site to `U`."
msgstr ""
"带括号的子表达式（`(e)`）：如果表达式具有类型 `U`，则该子表达式是强制转换到 "
"`U` 的强制转换位置。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:149
msgid ""
"Blocks: if a block has type `U`, then the last expression in the block (if "
"it is not semicolon-terminated) is a coercion site to `U`. This includes "
"blocks which are part of control flow statements, such as `if`/`else`, if "
"the block has a known type."
msgstr ""
"块：如果块具有类型 `U`，则块中的最后一个表达式（如果它未以分号结束）是强制转"
"换到 `U` 的强制转换位置。如果作为控制流语句一部分的块具有已知类型，这也包括例"
"如 `if`/`else` 中的块。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:155
msgid "Coercion types"
msgstr "强制转换类型"

#: src/type-coercions.md:161
msgid "Coercion is allowed between the following types:"
msgstr "下列类型之间允许强制转换："

#: src/type-coercions.md:167
msgid ""
"`T` to `U` if `T` is a [subtype](subtyping.md) of `U` (_reflexive case_)"
msgstr ""
"如果 `T` 是 `U` 的[子类型](subtyping.md)，则从 `T` 到 `U`（_自反情形_）"

#: src/type-coercions.md:173
msgid ""
"`T_1` to `T_3` where `T_1` coerces to `T_2` and `T_2` coerces to `T_3` "
"(_transitive case_)"
msgstr ""
"从 `T_1` 到 `T_3`，其中 `T_1` 强制转换到 `T_2`，且 `T_2` 强制转换到 `T_3`（_"
"传递情形_）"

#: src/type-coercions.md:175
msgid "Note that this is not fully supported yet."
msgstr "注意，这尚未得到完全支持。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:181
msgid "`&mut T` to `&T`"
msgstr "从 `&mut T` 到 `&T`"

#: src/type-coercions.md:187
msgid "`*mut T` to `*const T`"
msgstr "从 `*mut T` 到 `*const T`"

#: src/type-coercions.md:193
msgid "`&T` to `*const T`"
msgstr "从 `&T` 到 `*const T`"

#: src/type-coercions.md:199
msgid "`&mut T` to `*mut T`"
msgstr "从 `&mut T` 到 `*mut T`"

#: src/type-coercions.md:205
msgid ""
"`&T` or `&mut T` to `&U` if `T` implements `Deref<Target = U>`. For example:"
msgstr ""
"如果 `T` 实现了 `Deref<Target = U>`，则从 `&T` 或 `&mut T` 到 `&U`。例如："

#: src/type-coercions.md:225
msgid "'y'"
msgstr "'y'"

#: src/type-coercions.md:226
msgid "//&mut CharContainer is coerced to &char.\n"
msgstr "//&mut CharContainer is coerced to &char.\n"

#: src/type-coercions.md:234
msgid "`&mut T` to `&mut U` if `T` implements `DerefMut<Target = U>`."
msgstr "如果 `T` 实现了 `DerefMut<Target = U>`，则从 `&mut T` 到 `&mut U`。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:240
msgid "TyCtor(`T`) to TyCtor(`U`), where TyCtor(`T`) is one of"
msgstr "从 TyCtor(`T`) 到 TyCtor(`U`)，其中 TyCtor(`T`) 是下列之一："

#: src/type-coercions.md:241
msgid "`&T`"
msgstr "`&T`"

#: src/type-coercions.md:242
msgid "`&mut T`"
msgstr "`&mut T`"

#: src/type-coercions.md:245 src/special-types-and-traits.md:17
msgid "`Box<T>`"
msgstr "`Box<T>`"

#: src/type-coercions.md:247
msgid ""
"and where `U` can be obtained from `T` by [unsized coercion](#unsized-"
"coercions)."
msgstr "且其中 `U` 可以通过[非定长强制转换](#unsized-coercions)从 `T` 获得。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:257
msgid "Function item types to `fn` pointers"
msgstr "函数项类型到 `fn` 指针"

#: src/type-coercions.md:263
msgid "Non capturing closures to `fn` pointers"
msgstr "非捕获闭包到 `fn` 指针"

#: src/type-coercions.md:269
msgid "`!` to any `T`"
msgstr "`!` 到任意 `T`"

#: src/type-coercions.md:275
msgid "Unsized coercions"
msgstr "非定长强制转换"

#: src/type-coercions.md:281
msgid ""
"The following coercions are called `unsized coercions`, since they relate to "
"converting types to unsized types, and are permitted in a few cases where "
"other coercions are not, as described above. They can still happen anywhere "
"else a coercion can occur."
msgstr ""
"以下强制转换称为 `unsized coercions`（非定长强制转换），因为它们涉及将类型转"
"换为非定长类型，并且如上所述，在少数其他强制转换不被允许的情形中也被允许。它"
"们仍然可以在强制转换可以发生的其他任何位置发生。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:287
msgid ""
"Two traits, [`Unsize`](../core/marker/trait.Unsize.html) and "
"[`CoerceUnsized`](../core/ops/unsize/trait.CoerceUnsized.html), are used to "
"assist in this process and expose it for library use. The following "
"coercions are built-ins and, if `T` can be coerced to `U` with one of them, "
"then an implementation of `Unsize<U>` for `T` will be provided:"
msgstr ""
"两个 trait，[`Unsize`](../core/marker/trait.Unsize.html) 和 [`CoerceUnsized`]"
"(../core/ops/unsize/trait.CoerceUnsized.html)，用于辅助这一过程，并将其暴露给"
"库使用。以下强制转换是内建的；如果 `T` 可以通过其中之一强制转换为 `U`，则会"
"为 `T` 提供 `Unsize<U>` 的实现："

#: src/type-coercions.md:293
msgid "`[T; n]` to `[T]`."
msgstr "`[T; n]` 到 `[T]`。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:299
msgid ""
"`T` to `dyn U`, when `T` implements `U + Sized`, and `U` is [dyn compatible]"
"(items/traits.md#dyn-compatibility)."
msgstr ""
"当 `T` 实现 `U + Sized`，且 `U` 是 [dyn 兼容](items/traits.md#dyn-"
"compatibility)的，则 `T` 到 `dyn U`。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:305
msgid ""
"`dyn T` to `dyn U`, when `U` is one of `T`'s [supertraits](items/"
"traits.md#supertraits)."
msgstr ""
"当 `U` 是 `T` 的[父 trait](items/traits.md#supertraits) 之一时，`dyn T` 到 "
"`dyn U`。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:306
msgid ""
"This allows dropping auto traits, i.e. `dyn T + Auto` to `dyn U` is allowed."
msgstr "这允许丢弃 auto trait，即允许从 `dyn T + Auto` 到 `dyn U` 的强制转换。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:307
msgid ""
"This allows adding auto traits if the principal trait has the auto trait as "
"a super trait, i.e. given `trait T: U + Send {}`, `dyn T` to `dyn T + Send` "
"or to `dyn U + Send` coercions are allowed."
msgstr ""
"如果主 trait 将该 auto trait 作为父 trait，则这允许添加 auto trait，即给定 "
"`trait T: U + Send {}`，允许从 `dyn T` 到 `dyn T + Send` 或到 `dyn U + Send` "
"的强制转换。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:313
msgid "`Foo<..., T, ...>` to `Foo<..., U, ...>`, when:"
msgstr "在满足以下条件时，`Foo<..., T, ...>` 到 `Foo<..., U, ...>`："

#: src/type-coercions.md:314
msgid "`Foo` is a struct."
msgstr "`Foo` 是一个结构体。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:315
msgid "`T` implements `Unsize<U>`."
msgstr "`T` 实现 `Unsize<U>`。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:316
msgid "The last field of `Foo` has a type involving `T`."
msgstr "`Foo` 的最后一个字段具有涉及 `T` 的类型。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:317
msgid ""
"If that field has type `Bar<T>`, then `Bar<T>` implements `Unsize<Bar<U>>`."
msgstr "如果该字段的类型为 `Bar<T>`，则 `Bar<T>` 实现 `Unsize<Bar<U>>`。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:318
msgid "T is not part of the type of any other fields."
msgstr "`T` 不是任何其他字段类型的一部分。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:324
msgid ""
"Additionally, a type `Foo<T>` can implement `CoerceUnsized<Foo<U>>` when `T` "
"implements `Unsize<U>` or `CoerceUnsized<Foo<U>>`. This allows it to provide "
"an unsized coercion to `Foo<U>`."
msgstr ""
"此外，当 `T` 实现 `Unsize<U>` 或 `CoerceUnsized<Foo<U>>` 时，类型 `Foo<T>` 可"
"以实现 `CoerceUnsized<Foo<U>>`。这允许它提供到 `Foo<U>` 的非定长强制转换。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:330
msgid ""
"While the definition of the unsized coercions and their implementation has "
"been stabilized, the traits themselves are not yet stable and therefore "
"can't be used directly in stable Rust."
msgstr ""
"虽然非定长强制转换的定义及其实现已经稳定，但这些 trait 本身尚未稳定，因此不能"
"在 stable Rust 中直接使用。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:339
msgid "Least upper bound coercions"
msgstr "最小上界强制转换"

#: src/type-coercions.md:345
msgid ""
"In some contexts, the compiler must coerce together multiple types to try "
"and find the most general type. This is called a \"Least Upper Bound\" "
"coercion. LUB coercion is used and only used in the following situations:"
msgstr ""
"在某些上下文中，编译器必须将多个类型共同强制转换，以尝试寻找最通用的类型。这"
"称为“最小上界”（Least Upper Bound）强制转换。LUB 强制转换仅在以下情形中使用："

#: src/type-coercions.md:347
msgid "To find the common type for a series of if branches."
msgstr "为一系列 if 分支寻找共同类型。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:348
msgid "To find the common type for a series of match arms."
msgstr "为一系列 match 分支寻找共同类型。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:349
msgid "To find the common type for array elements."
msgstr "为数组元素寻找共同类型。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:350
msgid ""
"To find the common type for a [labeled block expression](expressions/loop-"
"expr.md#r-expr.loop.block-labels) among the break operands and the final "
"block operand."
msgstr ""
"为[带标签块表达式](expressions/loop-expr.md#r-expr.loop.block-labels)在 "
"break 操作数和最终块操作数之间寻找共同类型。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:351
msgid ""
"To find the common type for an [`loop` expression with break expressions]"
"(expressions/loop-expr.md#r-expr.loop.break-value) among the break operands."
msgstr ""
"为[带 break 表达式的 `loop` 表达式](expressions/loop-expr.md#r-"
"expr.loop.break-value)在各 break 操作数之间寻找共同类型。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:352
msgid ""
"To find the type for the return type of a closure with multiple return "
"statements."
msgstr "为具有多个 return 语句的闭包的返回类型寻找类型。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:353
msgid ""
"To check the type for the return type of a function with multiple return "
"statements."
msgstr "为具有多个 return 语句的函数的返回类型检查类型。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:359
msgid ""
"In each such case, there are a set of types `T0..Tn` to be mutually coerced "
"to some target type `T_t`, which is unknown to start."
msgstr ""
"在每一种这样的情形中，都有一组类型 `T0..Tn` 需要相互强制转换到某个目标类型 "
"`T_t`，而该目标类型起初是未知的。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:365
msgid ""
"Computing the LUB coercion is done iteratively. The target type `T_t` begins "
"as the type `T0`. For each new type `Ti`, we consider whether"
msgstr ""
"LUB 强制转换的计算以迭代方式完成。目标类型 `T_t` 初始为类型 `T0`。对于每个新"
"类型 `Ti`，会考虑是否"

#: src/type-coercions.md:371
msgid ""
"If `Ti` can be coerced to the current target type `T_t`, then no change is "
"made."
msgstr "如果 `Ti` 可以强制转换为当前目标类型 `T_t`，则不做更改。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:377
msgid ""
"Otherwise, check whether `T_t` can be coerced to `Ti`; if so, the `T_t` is "
"changed to `Ti`. (This check is also conditioned on whether all of the "
"source expressions considered thus far have implicit coercions.)"
msgstr ""
"否则，检查 `T_t` 是否可以强制转换为 `Ti`；如果可以，则将 `T_t` 改为 `Ti`。"
"（此检查还以到目前为止所考虑的所有源表达式是否都有隐式强制转换为条件。）"

#: src/type-coercions.md:383
msgid ""
"If not, try to compute a mutual supertype of `T_t` and `Ti`, which will "
"become the new target type."
msgstr ""
"如果不可以，则尝试计算 `T_t` 和 `Ti` 的共同超类型，它将成为新的目标类型。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:388
msgid "// For if branches\n"
msgstr "// For if branches\n"

#: src/type-coercions.md:397
msgid "// For match arms\n"
msgstr "// For match arms\n"

#: src/type-coercions.md:404
msgid "// For array elements\n"
msgstr "// For array elements\n"

#: src/type-coercions.md:407
msgid "// For closure with multiple return statements\n"
msgstr "// For closure with multiple return statements\n"

#: src/type-coercions.md:419
msgid "// For type checking of function with multiple return statements\n"
msgstr "// For type checking of function with multiple return statements\n"

#: src/type-coercions.md:431
msgid ""
"In these examples, types of the `ba*` are found by LUB coercion. And the "
"compiler checks whether LUB coercion result of `a`, `b`, `c` is `i32` in the "
"processing of the function `foo`."
msgstr ""
"在这些示例中，`ba*` 的类型由 LUB 强制转换确定。并且在处理函数 `foo` 时，编译"
"器会检查 `a`、`b`、`c` 的 LUB 强制转换结果是否为 `i32`。"

#: src/type-coercions.md:433
msgid "Caveat"
msgstr "注意事项"

#: src/type-coercions.md:435
msgid ""
"This description is obviously informal. Making it more precise is expected "
"to proceed as part of a general effort to specify the Rust type checker more "
"precisely."
msgstr ""
"这一描述显然是非正式的。预计会将其进一步精确化，作为更精确地规定 Rust 类型检"
"查器这一整体工作的一部分。"

#: src/divergence.md:11
msgid ""
"A _diverging expression_ is an expression that never completes normal "
"execution."
msgstr "_发散表达式_是永远不会完成正常执行的表达式。"

#: src/divergence.md:15
msgid "\"This function never returns!\""
msgstr "\"This function never returns!\""

#: src/divergence.md:19
msgid "// This line never completes.\n"
msgstr "// 这一行永不完成。\n"

#: src/divergence.md:20
msgid "\"This is never printed: {x}\""
msgstr "\"This is never printed: {x}\""

#: src/divergence.md:24
msgid "See the following rules for specific expression divergence behavior:"
msgstr "有关特定表达式发散行为，请参见以下规则："

#: src/divergence.md:26
