"[expr.if.diverging](expressions/if-expr.md#r-expr.if.diverging) --- `if` "
"expressions."
msgstr ""
"[expr.if.diverging](expressions/if-expr.md#r-expr.if.diverging) --- `if` 表达"
"式。"

#: src/divergence.md:28
msgid ""
"[expr.loop.block-labels.type](expressions/loop-expr.md#r-expr.loop.block-"
"labels.type) --- Labeled block expressions with `break`."
msgstr ""
"[expr.loop.block-labels.type](expressions/loop-expr.md#r-expr.loop.block-"
"labels.type) --- 带有 `break` 的带标签块表达式。"

#: src/divergence.md:29
msgid ""
"[expr.loop.break-value.diverging](expressions/loop-expr.md#r-expr.loop.break-"
"value.diverging) --- `loop` expressions with `break`."
msgstr ""
"[expr.loop.break-value.diverging](expressions/loop-expr.md#r-expr.loop.break-"
"value.diverging) --- 带有 `break` 的 `loop` 表达式。"

#: src/divergence.md:30
msgid ""
"[expr.loop.break.diverging](expressions/loop-expr.md#r-"
"expr.loop.break.diverging) --- `break` expressions."
msgstr ""
"[expr.loop.break.diverging](expressions/loop-expr.md#r-"
"expr.loop.break.diverging) --- `break` 表达式。"

#: src/divergence.md:31
msgid ""
"[expr.loop.continue.diverging](expressions/loop-expr.md#r-"
"expr.loop.continue.diverging) --- `continue` expressions."
msgstr ""
"[expr.loop.continue.diverging](expressions/loop-expr.md#r-"
"expr.loop.continue.diverging) --- `continue` 表达式。"

#: src/divergence.md:32
msgid ""
"[expr.loop.infinite.diverging](expressions/loop-expr.md#r-"
"expr.loop.infinite.diverging) --- Infinite `loop` expressions."
msgstr ""
"[expr.loop.infinite.diverging](expressions/loop-expr.md#r-"
"expr.loop.infinite.diverging) --- 无限 `loop` 表达式。"

#: src/divergence.md:33
msgid ""
"[expr.match.diverging](expressions/match-expr.md#r-expr.match.diverging) --- "
"`match` expressions."
msgstr ""
"[expr.match.diverging](expressions/match-expr.md#r-expr.match.diverging) --- "
"`match` 表达式。"

#: src/divergence.md:34
msgid ""
"[expr.match.empty](expressions/match-expr.md#r-expr.match.empty) --- Empty "
"`match` expressions."
msgstr ""
"[expr.match.empty](expressions/match-expr.md#r-expr.match.empty) --- 空 "
"`match` 表达式。"

#: src/divergence.md:35
msgid ""
"[expr.return.diverging](expressions/return-expr.md#r-expr.return.diverging) "
"--- `return` expressions."
msgstr ""
"[expr.return.diverging](expressions/return-expr.md#r-expr.return.diverging) "
"--- `return` 表达式。"

#: src/divergence.md:36
msgid ""
"[type.never.constraint](types/never.md#r-type.never.constraint) --- Function "
"calls returning `!`."
msgstr ""
"[type.never.constraint](types/never.md#r-type.never.constraint) --- 返回 `!` "
"的函数调用。"

#: src/divergence.md:42
msgid ""
"The [`panic!`](../std/macro.panic.html) macro and related panic-generating "
"macros like [`unreachable!`](../core/macro.unreachable.html) also have the "
"type [`!`](types/never.md#r-type.never) and are diverging."
msgstr ""
"[`panic!`](../std/macro.panic.html) 宏以及像 [`unreachable!`](../core/"
"macro.unreachable.html) 这样的相关 panic 生成宏也具有 [`!`](types/never.md#r-"
"type.never) 类型，并且是发散的。"

#: src/divergence.md:51
msgid ""
"Any expression of type [`!`](types/never.md#r-type.never) is a diverging "
"expression. However, diverging expressions are not limited to type [`!`]"
"(types/never.md#r-type.never); expressions of other types may also diverge "
"(e.g., `Some(loop {})` has type `Option<!>`)."
msgstr ""
"任何类型为 [`!`](types/never.md#r-type.never) 的表达式都是发散表达式。不过，"
"发散表达式并不限于类型 [`!`](types/never.md#r-type.never)；其他类型的表达式也"
"可能发散（例如，`Some(loop {})` 的类型是 `Option<!>`）。"

#: src/divergence.md:57
msgid ""
"Though `!` is considered an uninhabited type, a type being uninhabited is "
"not sufficient for it to diverge."
msgstr "虽然 `!` 被视为无值类型，但一个类型无值并不足以使其发散。"

#: src/divergence.md:65
msgid "// This has a type of `!`.\n"
msgstr "// 这具有 `!` 类型。\n"

#: src/divergence.md:66
msgid "// So, the entire function is considered diverging.\n"
msgstr "// 因此，整个函数被视为发散。\n"

#: src/divergence.md:68
msgid "// OK: The type of the body is `!` which matches the return type.\n"
msgstr "// OK：主体的类型是 `!`，与返回类型匹配。\n"

#: src/divergence.md:71
msgid "// This type is uninhabited.\n"
msgstr "// 此类型无值。\n"

#: src/divergence.md:72
msgid "// However, the entire function is not considered diverging.\n"
msgstr "// 然而，整个函数并不被视为发散。\n"

#: src/divergence.md:74
msgid "// ERROR: The type of the body is `()` but expected type `!`.\n"
msgstr "// ERROR：主体的类型是 `()`，但期望类型是 `!`。\n"

#: src/divergence.md:85
msgid ""
"Divergence can propagate to the surrounding block. See [expr.block.diverging]"
"(expressions/block-expr.md#r-expr.block.diverging)."
msgstr ""
"发散可以传播到外围块。请参见 [expr.block.diverging](expressions/block-"
"expr.md#r-expr.block.diverging)。"

#: src/divergence.md:94
msgid "Fallback"
msgstr "回退"

#: src/divergence.md:96
msgid ""
"If a type to be inferred is only unified with diverging expressions, then "
"that type will be inferred to be [`!`](types/never.md#r-type.never)."
msgstr ""
"如果待推断类型只与发散表达式统一，那么该类型将被推断为 [`!`](types/"
"never.md#r-type.never)。"

#: src/divergence.md:105
msgid "// ERROR: The trait bound `!: Default` is not satisfied.\n"
msgstr "// ERROR：trait 约束 `!: Default` 未被满足。\n"

#: src/divergence.md:118
msgid "Before the 2024 edition, the type was inferred to instead be `()`."
msgstr "在 2024 edition 之前，该类型会改为被推断为 `()`。"

#: src/divergence.md:127
msgid ""
"Importantly, type unification may happen _structurally_, so the fallback `!` "
"may be part of a larger type. The following compiles:"
msgstr ""
"重要的是，类型统一可以_结构性地_发生，因此回退得到的 `!` 可能是更大类型的一部"
"分。以下代码可以编译："

#: src/divergence.md:131
msgid "// This has the type `Option<!>`, not `!`\n"
msgstr "// 这具有 `Option<!>` 类型，而不是 `!`\n"

#: src/destructors.md:11
msgid ""
"When an [initialized](glossary.md#initialized) [variable](variables.md) or "
"[temporary](expressions.md#temporaries) goes out of [scope](#drop-scopes), "
"its _destructor_ is run or it is _dropped_. [Assignment](expressions/"
"operator-expr.md#assignment-expressions) also runs the destructor of its "
"left-hand operand, if it's initialized. If a variable has been partially "
"initialized, only its initialized fields are dropped."
msgstr ""
"当一个[已初始化](glossary.md#initialized)的[变量](variables.md)或[临时值]"
"(expressions.md#temporaries)离开[作用域](#drop-scopes)时，会运行它的_析构器"
"_，或者说它会被_丢弃_。[赋值](expressions/operator-expr.md#assignment-"
"expressions)也会在其左操作数已初始化时运行该左操作数的析构器。如果变量只被部"
"分初始化，则只会丢弃其已初始化的字段。"

#: src/destructors.md:17
msgid "The destructor of a type `T` consists of:"
msgstr "类型 `T` 的析构器由以下部分组成："

#: src/destructors.md:19
msgid ""
"If `T: Drop`, calling [`<T as core::ops::Drop>::drop`](../core/ops/drop/"
"trait.Drop.html#method.drop)"
msgstr ""
"如果 `T: Drop`，调用 [`<T as core::ops::Drop>::drop`](../core/ops/drop/"
"trait.Drop.html#method.drop)"

#: src/destructors.md:20
msgid "Recursively running the destructor of all of its fields."
msgstr "递归运行其所有字段的析构器。"

#: src/destructors.md:21
msgid ""
"The fields of a [struct](types/struct.md) are dropped in declaration order."
msgstr "[结构体](types/struct.md)的字段按声明顺序丢弃。"

#: src/destructors.md:22
msgid ""
"The fields of the active [enum variant](types/enum.md) are dropped in "
"declaration order."
msgstr "活动的[枚举变体](types/enum.md)的字段按声明顺序丢弃。"

#: src/destructors.md:23
msgid "The fields of a [tuple](types/tuple.md) are dropped in order."
msgstr "[元组](types/tuple.md)的字段按顺序丢弃。"

#: src/destructors.md:24
msgid ""
"The elements of an [array](types/array.md) or owned [slice](types/slice.md) "
"are dropped from the first element to the last."
msgstr ""
"[数组](types/array.md)或拥有所有权的 [slice](types/slice.md) 的元素从第一个到"
"最后一个依次丢弃。"

#: src/destructors.md:25
msgid ""
"The variables that a [closure](types/closure.md) captures by move are "
"dropped in an unspecified order."
msgstr "[闭包](types/closure.md)通过 move 捕获的变量以未指定的顺序丢弃。"

#: src/destructors.md:26
msgid ""
"[Trait objects](types/trait-object.md) run the destructor of the underlying "
"type."
msgstr "[Trait 对象](types/trait-object.md)会运行底层类型的析构器。"

#: src/destructors.md:27
msgid "Other types don't result in any further drops."
msgstr "其他类型不会导致任何进一步的丢弃。"

#: src/destructors.md:33
msgid ""
"If a destructor must be run manually, such as when implementing your own "
"smart pointer, [`core::ptr::drop_in_place`](../core/ptr/"
"fn.drop_in_place.html) can be used."
msgstr ""
"如果必须手动运行析构器，例如在实现自己的智能指针时，可以使用 "
"[`core::ptr::drop_in_place`](../core/ptr/fn.drop_in_place.html)。"

#: src/destructors.md:35 src/destructors.md:408
msgid "Some examples:"
msgstr "一些示例："

#: src/destructors.md:46
msgid "\"drops when overwritten\""
msgstr "\"被覆盖时丢弃\""

#: src/destructors.md:47
msgid "\"drops when scope ends\""
msgstr "\"作用域结束时丢弃\""

#: src/destructors.md:49
msgid "\"Tuple first\""
msgstr "\"元组第一个\""

#: src/destructors.md:49
msgid "\"Tuple second\""
msgstr "\"元组第二个\""

#: src/destructors.md:51
msgid "// No destructor run on assignment.\n"
msgstr "// 赋值时不运行析构器。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:53
msgid "\"Drops when moved\""
msgstr "\"移动时丢弃\""

#: src/destructors.md:53
msgid "// Drops now, but is then uninitialized.\n"
msgstr "// 现在丢弃，但随后处于未初始化状态。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:56
msgid "// Uninitialized does not drop.\n"
msgstr "// 未初始化值不会丢弃。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:59
msgid "// After a partial move, only the remaining fields are dropped.\n"
msgstr "// 部分移动后，只丢弃剩余字段。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:61
msgid "\"first\""
msgstr "\"第一个\""

#: src/destructors.md:61
msgid "\"forgotten\""
msgstr "\"已忘记\""

#: src/destructors.md:61
msgid "// Perform a partial move, leaving only `partial_move.0` initialized.\n"
msgstr "// 执行一次部分移动，只留下 `partial_move.0` 已初始化。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:63
msgid "// When partial_move's scope ends, only the first field is dropped.\n"
msgstr "// 当 partial_move 的作用域结束时，只丢弃第一个字段。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:71
msgid "Drop scopes"
msgstr "drop 作用域"

#: src/destructors.md:77
msgid ""
"Each variable or temporary is associated to a _drop scope_. When control "
"flow leaves a drop scope all variables associated to that scope are dropped "
"in reverse order of declaration (for variables) or creation (for "
"temporaries)."
msgstr ""
"每个变量或临时值都关联到一个 _drop 作用域_。当控制流离开某个 drop 作用域时，"
"所有关联到该作用域的变量都会按声明（对变量而言）或创建（对临时值而言）的逆序"
"丢弃。"

#: src/destructors.md:83
msgid ""
"Drop scopes can be determined by replacing [`for`](expressions/loop-"
"expr.md#iterator-loops), [`if`](expressions/if-expr.md#if-expressions), and "
"[`while`](expressions/loop-expr.md#predicate-loops) expressions with "
"equivalent expressions using [`match`](expressions/match-expr.md), [`loop`]"
"(expressions/loop-expr.md#infinite-loops) and `break`."
msgstr ""
"drop 作用域可以通过将 [`for`](expressions/loop-expr.md#iterator-loops)、"
"[`if`](expressions/if-expr.md#if-expressions) 和 [`while`](expressions/loop-"
"expr.md#predicate-loops) 表达式替换为使用 [`match`](expressions/match-"
"expr.md)、[`loop`](expressions/loop-expr.md#infinite-loops) 和 `break` 的等价"
"表达式来确定。"

#: src/destructors.md:89
msgid ""
"Overloaded operators are not distinguished from built-in operators and "
"[binding modes](patterns.md#binding-modes) are not considered."
msgstr ""
"重载运算符不与内建运算符区分，也不考虑[绑定模式](patterns.md#binding-modes)。"

#: src/destructors.md:95
msgid "Given a function, or closure, there are drop scopes for:"
msgstr "给定一个函数或闭包时，以下项都有 drop 作用域："

#: src/destructors.md:101
msgid "The entire function"
msgstr "整个函数"

#: src/destructors.md:107
msgid "Each [statement](statements.md)"
msgstr "每个[语句](statements.md)"

#: src/destructors.md:113
msgid "Each [expression](expressions.md)"
msgstr "每个[表达式](expressions.md)"

#: src/destructors.md:119
msgid "Each block, including the function body"
msgstr "每个块，包括函数体"

#: src/destructors.md:120
msgid ""
"In the case of a [block expression](expressions/block-expr.md), the scope "
"for the block and the expression are the same scope."
msgstr ""
"对于[块表达式](expressions/block-expr.md)，块的作用域和表达式的作用域是同一个"
"作用域。"

#: src/destructors.md:126
msgid "Each arm of a `match` expression"
msgstr "`match` 表达式的每个分支"

#: src/destructors.md:132
msgid ""
"Drop scopes are nested within one another as follows. When multiple scopes "
"are left at once, such as when returning from a function, variables are "
"dropped from the inside outwards."
msgstr ""
"drop 作用域按如下方式相互嵌套。当一次离开多个作用域时，例如从函数返回时，变量"
"会从内向外丢弃。"

#: src/destructors.md:138
msgid "The entire function scope is the outer most scope."
msgstr "整个函数作用域是最外层作用域。"

#: src/destructors.md:144
msgid ""
"The function body block is contained within the scope of the entire function."
msgstr "函数体块包含在整个函数的作用域内。"

#: src/destructors.md:150
msgid ""
"The parent of the expression in an expression statement is the scope of the "
"statement."
msgstr "表达式语句中的表达式的父作用域是该语句的作用域。"

#: src/destructors.md:156
msgid ""
"The parent of the initializer of a [`let` statement](statements.md#let-"
"statements) is the `let` statement's scope."
msgstr ""
"[`let` 语句](statements.md#let-statements)初始化器的父作用域是该 `let` 语句的"
"作用域。"

#: src/destructors.md:162
msgid ""
"The parent of a statement scope is the scope of the block that contains the "
"statement."
msgstr "语句作用域的父作用域是包含该语句的块的作用域。"

#: src/destructors.md:168
msgid ""
"The parent of the expression for a `match` guard is the scope of the arm "
"that the guard is for."
msgstr "`match` 守卫表达式的父作用域是该守卫所属分支的作用域。"

#: src/destructors.md:174
msgid ""
"The parent of the expression after the `=>` in a `match` expression is the "
"scope of the arm that it's in."
msgstr "`match` 表达式中 `=>` 之后的表达式的父作用域是其所在分支的作用域。"

#: src/destructors.md:180
msgid ""
"The parent of the arm scope is the scope of the `match` expression that it "
"belongs to."
msgstr "分支作用域的父作用域是其所属 `match` 表达式的作用域。"

#: src/destructors.md:186
msgid ""
"The parent of all other scopes is the scope of the immediately enclosing "
"expression."
msgstr "所有其他作用域的父作用域都是直接包围它的表达式的作用域。"

#: src/destructors.md:192
msgid "Scopes of function parameters"
msgstr "函数参数的作用域"

#: src/destructors.md:194
msgid ""
"All function parameters are in the scope of the entire function body, so are "
"dropped last when evaluating the function. Each actual function parameter is "
"dropped after any bindings introduced in that parameter's pattern."
msgstr ""
"所有函数参数都在整个函数体的作用域内，因此在函数求值时最后丢弃。每个实际函数"
"参数会在该参数的模式引入的任何绑定之后丢弃。"

#: src/destructors.md:200 src/destructors.md:232 src/destructors.md:253
#: src/destructors.md:298 src/destructors.md:317 src/destructors.md:415
#: src/destructors.md:481
msgid "\"drop({})\""
msgstr "\"drop({})\""

#: src/destructors.md:202
msgid ""
"// Drops `y`, then the second parameter, then `x`, then the first parameter\n"
msgstr "// 依次丢弃 `y`、第二个参数、`x`、第一个参数\n"

#: src/destructors.md:208
msgid "// drop order is 3 2 0 1\n"
msgstr "// 丢弃顺序为 3 2 0 1\n"

#: src/destructors.md:211 src/paths.md:172
msgid "\"0\""
msgstr "\"0\""

#: src/destructors.md:212
msgid "\"2\""
msgstr "\"2\""

#: src/destructors.md:212
msgid "\"3\""
msgstr "\"3\""

#: src/destructors.md:220
msgid "Scopes of local variables"
msgstr "局部变量的作用域"

#: src/destructors.md:226
msgid ""
"Local variables declared in a `let` statement are associated to the scope of "
"the block that contains the `let` statement."
msgstr "在 `let` 语句中声明的局部变量关联到包含该 `let` 语句的块的作用域。"

#: src/destructors.md:235
msgid "\"Dropped last in outer scope\""
msgstr "\"在外层作用域中最后丢弃\""

#: src/destructors.md:237 src/destructors.md:263
msgid "\"Dropped in inner scope\""
msgstr "\"在内层作用域中丢弃\""

#: src/destructors.md:239
msgid "\"Dropped first in outer scope\""
msgstr "\"在外层作用域中最先丢弃\""

#: src/destructors.md:246
msgid ""
"Local variables declared in a `match` expression or pattern-matching `match` "
"guard are associated to the arm scope of the `match` arm that they are "
"declared in."
msgstr ""
"在 `match` 表达式或模式匹配 `match` 守卫中声明的局部变量关联到声明它们的 "
"`match` 分支的分支作用域。"

#: src/destructors.md:256
msgid "\"Dropped last in the first arm's scope\""
msgstr "\"在第一个分支的作用域中最后丢弃\""

#: src/destructors.md:257
msgid ""
"// When guard evaluation succeeds, control-flow stays in the arm and\n"
"    // values may be moved from the scrutinee into the arm's bindings,\n"
"    // causing them to be dropped in the arm's scope.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 当守卫求值成功时，控制流停留在该分支中，\n"
"    // 值可以从被匹配值移动到该分支的绑定中，\n"
"    // 从而使它们在该分支的作用域中被丢弃。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:260
msgid "\"Dropped second in the first arm's scope\""
msgstr "\"在第一个分支的作用域中第二个丢弃\""

#: src/destructors.md:261
msgid "\"Dropped first in the first arm's scope\""
msgstr "\"在第一个分支的作用域中第一个丢弃\""

#: src/destructors.md:264
msgid ""
"// Pattern-matching guards' bindings and temporaries are dropped in\n"
"        // reverse order, dropping each guard condition operand's bindings\n"
"        // before its temporaries. Lastly, variables bound by the arm's\n"
"        // pattern are dropped.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 模式匹配守卫的绑定和临时值按逆序丢弃，\n"
"        // 每个守卫条件操作数的绑定会先于其临时值丢弃。\n"
"        // 最后，丢弃由该分支的模式绑定的变量。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:272
msgid "\"Dropped in the enclosing temporary scope\""
msgstr "\"在外围临时作用域中丢弃\""

#: src/destructors.md:273
msgid ""
"// When guard evaluation fails, control-flow leaves the arm scope,\n"
"    // causing bindings and temporaries from earlier pattern-matching\n"
"    // guard condition operands to be dropped. This occurs before "
"evaluating\n"
"    // the next arm's guard or body.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 当守卫求值失败时，控制流离开该分支作用域，\n"
"    // 导致来自较早模式匹配守卫条件操作数的绑定和临时值被丢弃。\n"
"    // 这发生在对下一个分支的守卫或主体求值之前。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:277
msgid "\"Dropped in the first arm's scope\""
msgstr "\"在第一个分支的作用域中丢弃\""

#: src/destructors.md:279
msgid ""
"// When a guard is executed multiple times due to self-overlapping\n"
"    // or-patterns, control-flow leaves the arm scope when the guard fails\n"
"    // and re-enters the arm scope before executing the guard again.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 当守卫因自重叠的 or-patterns（或模式）而执行多次时，\n"
"    // 控制流会在守卫失败时离开分支作用域，\n"
"    // 并在再次执行守卫前重新进入该分支作用域。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:282
msgid "\"Dropped in the second arm's scope twice\""
msgstr "\"在第二个分支的作用域中丢弃两次\""

#: src/destructors.md:292
msgid ""
"Variables in patterns are dropped in reverse order of declaration within the "
"pattern."
msgstr "模式中的变量会按其在模式内声明的逆序丢弃。"

#: src/destructors.md:302
msgid "\"Dropped last\""
msgstr "\"最后丢弃\""

#: src/destructors.md:303
msgid "\"Dropped first\""
msgstr "\"最先丢弃\""

#: src/destructors.md:311
msgid ""
"For the purpose of drop order, [or-patterns](patterns.md#or-patterns) "
"declare bindings in the order given by the first subpattern."
msgstr ""
"就丢弃顺序而言，[or-patterns（或模式）](patterns.md#or-patterns)按第一个子模"
"式给出的顺序声明绑定。"

#: src/destructors.md:319
msgid "// Drops `x` before `y`.\n"
msgstr "// 先丢弃 `x`，再丢弃 `y`。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:322
msgid ""
"//   ^^^^^^^^^^   ^^^^^^^^^^^ This is the second subpattern.\n"
"//   |\n"
"//   This is the first subpattern.\n"
"//\n"
"//   In the first subpattern, `x` is declared before `y`. Since it is\n"
"//   the first subpattern, that is the order used even if the second\n"
"//   subpattern, where the bindings are declared in the opposite\n"
"//   order, is matched.\n"
msgstr ""
"//   ^^^^^^^^^^   ^^^^^^^^^^^ 这是第二个子模式。\n"
"//   |\n"
"//   这是第一个子模式。\n"
"//\n"
"//   在第一个子模式中，`x` 先于 `y` 声明。因为它是\n"
"//   第一个子模式，所以即使匹配的是绑定声明顺序相反的\n"
"//   第二个子模式，也会使用这个顺序。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:332
msgid ""
"// Here we match the first subpattern, and the drops happen according\n"
"// to the declaration order in the first subpattern.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 这里匹配第一个子模式，丢弃按照第一个子模式中的\n"
"// 声明顺序发生。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:336 src/destructors.md:344
msgid "\"Declared first, dropped last\""
msgstr "\"先声明，后丢弃\""

#: src/destructors.md:337 src/destructors.md:343
msgid "\"Declared last, dropped first\""
msgstr "\"后声明，先丢弃\""

#: src/destructors.md:339
msgid ""
"// Here we match the second subpattern, and the drops still happen\n"
"// according to the declaration order in the first subpattern.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 这里匹配第二个子模式，而丢弃仍然按照第一个子模式中的\n"
"// 声明顺序发生。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:352
msgid "Temporary scopes"
msgstr "临时作用域"

#: src/destructors.md:358
msgid ""
"The _temporary scope_ of an expression is the scope that is used for the "
"temporary variable that holds the result of that expression when used in a "
"[place context](expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-expressions), "
"unless it is [promoted](destructors.md#constant-promotion)."
msgstr ""
"表达式的_临时作用域_是一个作用域：当该表达式在[位置上下文]"
"(expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-expressions)中使用时，保存该表达"
"式结果的临时变量会使用这个作用域，除非该表达式被[提升]"
"(destructors.md#constant-promotion)。"

#: src/destructors.md:364
msgid ""
"Apart from lifetime extension, the temporary scope of an expression is the "
"smallest scope that contains the expression and is one of the following:"
msgstr ""
"除生命周期延长之外，表达式的临时作用域是包含该表达式且属于以下项之一的最小作"
"用域："

#: src/destructors.md:366
msgid "The entire function."
msgstr "整个函数。"

#: src/destructors.md:367
msgid "A statement."
msgstr "一个语句。"

#: src/destructors.md:368
msgid ""
"The body of an [`if`](expressions/if-expr.md#if-expressions), [`while`]"
"(expressions/loop-expr.md#predicate-loops) or [`loop`](expressions/loop-"
"expr.md#infinite-loops) expression."
msgstr ""
"[`if`](expressions/if-expr.md#if-expressions)、[`while`](expressions/loop-"
"expr.md#predicate-loops) 或 [`loop`](expressions/loop-expr.md#infinite-"
"loops) 表达式的主体。"

#: src/destructors.md:369
msgid "The `else` block of an `if` expression."
msgstr "`if` 表达式的 `else` 块。"

#: src/destructors.md:370
msgid ""
"The non-pattern matching condition expression of an `if` or `while` "
"expression or a non-pattern-matching `match` [guard condition operand]"
"(expressions/match-expr.md#match-guard-chains)."
msgstr ""
"`if` 或 `while` 表达式的非模式匹配条件表达式，或者非模式匹配的 `match` [守卫"
"条件操作数](expressions/match-expr.md#match-guard-chains)。"

#: src/destructors.md:371
msgid ""
"The pattern-matching guard, if present, and body expression for a `match` "
"arm."
msgstr "`match` 分支的模式匹配守卫（如果存在）以及主体表达式。"

#: src/destructors.md:372
msgid ""
"Each operand of a [lazy boolean expression](expressions/operator-"
"expr.md#lazy-boolean-operators)."
msgstr ""
"[惰性布尔表达式](expressions/operator-expr.md#lazy-boolean-operators)的每个操"
"作数。"

#: src/destructors.md:373
msgid ""
"The pattern-matching condition(s) and consequent body of [`if`](expressions/"
"if-expr.md#if-expressions) ([destructors.scope.temporary.edition2024]"
"(destructors.md#r-destructors.scope.temporary.edition2024))."
msgstr ""
"[`if`](expressions/if-expr.md#if-expressions) 的模式匹配条件以及后件主体"
"（[destructors.scope.temporary.edition2024](destructors.md#r-"
"destructors.scope.temporary.edition2024)）。"

#: src/destructors.md:374
msgid ""
"The pattern-matching condition and loop body of [`while`](expressions/loop-"
"expr.md#predicate-loops)."
msgstr ""
"[`while`](expressions/loop-expr.md#predicate-loops) 的模式匹配条件和循环体。"

#: src/destructors.md:375
msgid ""
"The entirety of the tail expression of a block "
"([destructors.scope.temporary.edition2024](destructors.md#r-"
"destructors.scope.temporary.edition2024))."
msgstr ""
"块的尾表达式整体（[destructors.scope.temporary.edition2024](destructors.md#r-"
"destructors.scope.temporary.edition2024)）。"

#: src/destructors.md:381
msgid ""
"The [scrutinee](glossary.md#scrutinee) of a `match` expression is not a "
"temporary scope, so temporaries in the scrutinee can be dropped after the "
"`match` expression. For example, the temporary for `1` in `match 1 { ref mut "
"z => z };` lives until the end of the statement."
msgstr ""
"`match` 表达式的[被匹配值](glossary.md#scrutinee)不是临时作用域，因此被匹配值"
"中的临时值可以在 `match` 表达式之后才丢弃。例如，`match 1 { ref mut z => "
"z };` 中 `1` 的临时值会存活到该语句结束。"

#: src/destructors.md:390
msgid ""
"The desugaring of a [destructuring assignment](expressions/operator-"
"expr.md#r-expr.assign.destructure) restricts the temporary scope of its "
"assigned value operand (the RHS). For details, see "
"[expr.assign.destructure.tmp-scopes](expressions/operator-expr.md#r-"
"expr.assign.destructure.tmp-scopes)."
msgstr ""
"[解构赋值](expressions/operator-expr.md#r-expr.assign.destructure)的脱糖会限"
"制其被赋值操作数（RHS）的临时作用域。详情见 [expr.assign.destructure.tmp-"
"scopes](expressions/operator-expr.md#r-expr.assign.destructure.tmp-scopes)。"

#: src/destructors.md:403
msgid ""
"The 2024 edition added two new temporary scope narrowing rules: `if let` "
"temporaries are dropped before the `else` block, and temporaries of tail "
"expressions of blocks are dropped immediately after the tail expression is "
"evaluated."
msgstr ""
"2024 版次新增了两条临时作用域收窄规则：`if let` 临时值会在 `else` 块之前丢"
"弃，块尾表达式的临时值会在尾表达式求值后立即丢弃。"

