#: src/destructors.md:473
msgid "Operands"
msgstr "操作数"

#: src/destructors.md:475
msgid ""
"Temporaries are also created to hold the result of operands to an expression "
"while the other operands are evaluated. The temporaries are associated to "
"the scope of the expression with that operand. Since the temporaries are "
"moved from once the expression is evaluated, dropping them has no effect "
"unless one of the operands to an expression breaks out of the expression, "
"returns, or [panics](panic.md)."
msgstr ""
"在对其他操作数求值期间，也会创建临时值来保存表达式操作数的结果。这些临时值关"
"联到包含该操作数的表达式的作用域。由于表达式一经求值完成就会从这些临时值中移"
"出，因此丢弃它们没有效果，除非该表达式的某个操作数跳出该表达式、返回，或发生 "
"[panic](panic.md)。"

#: src/destructors.md:485
msgid ""
"// Tuple expression doesn't finish evaluating so operands drop in reverse "
"order\n"
msgstr "// 元组表达式未完成求值，因此操作数按逆序丢弃\n"

#: src/destructors.md:487
msgid "\"Outer tuple first\""
msgstr "\"外层元组第一个\""

#: src/destructors.md:488
msgid "\"Outer tuple second\""
msgstr "\"外层元组第二个\""

#: src/destructors.md:490
msgid "\"Inner tuple first\""
msgstr "\"内层元组第一个\""

#: src/destructors.md:491
msgid "\"Inner tuple second\""
msgstr "\"内层元组第二个\""

#: src/destructors.md:494
msgid "\"Never created\""
msgstr "\"从未创建\""

#: src/destructors.md:503
msgid "Constant promotion"
msgstr "常量提升"

#: src/destructors.md:505
msgid ""
"Promotion of a value expression to a `'static` slot occurs when the "
"expression could be written in a constant and borrowed, and that borrow "
"could be dereferenced where the expression was originally written, without "
"changing the runtime behavior. That is, the promoted expression can be "
"evaluated at compile-time and the resulting value does not contain [interior "
"mutability](interior-mutability.md) or [destructors](destructors.md) (these "
"properties are determined based on the value where possible, e.g. `&None` "
"always has the type `&'static Option<_>`, as it contains nothing disallowed)."
msgstr ""
"当一个值表达式可以写在常量中并被借用，而且该借用可以在该表达式原本所在的位置"
"被解引用且不改变运行时行为时，就会发生到 `'static` 存储槽的提升。也就是说，被"
"提升的表达式可以在编译时求值，并且所得值不包含[内部可变性](interior-"
"mutability.md)或[析构器](destructors.md)（这些性质会在可能时基于该值确定，例"
"如 `&None` 始终具有类型 `&'static Option<_>`，因为它不包含任何被禁止的内"
"容）。"

#: src/destructors.md:511
msgid "Temporary lifetime extension"
msgstr "临时生命周期延长"

#: src/destructors.md:517
msgid ""
"The exact rules for temporary lifetime extension are subject to change. This "
"is describing the current behavior only."
msgstr "临时生命周期延长的确切规则可能会改变。这里描述的只是当前行为。"

#: src/destructors.md:526
msgid ""
"The temporary scopes for expressions in `let` statements are sometimes "
"_extended_ to the scope of the block containing the `let` statement. This is "
"done when the usual temporary scope would be too small, based on certain "
"syntactic rules. For example:"
msgstr ""
"`let` 语句中表达式的临时作用域有时会被_延长_到包含该 `let` 语句的块的作用域。"
"基于某些语法规则，当通常的临时作用域过小时，就会这样做。例如："

#: src/destructors.md:529
msgid ""
"// Usually a temporary would be dropped by now, but the temporary for `0` "
"lives\n"
"// to the end of the block.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 通常临时值到这里已经会被丢弃，但 `0` 的临时值会存活\n"
"// 到块的末尾。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:539
msgid ""
"Lifetime extension also applies to `static` and `const` items, where it "
"makes temporaries live until the end of the program. For example:"
msgstr ""
"生命周期延长也适用于 `static` 和 `const` 项，在这些项中它会让临时值存活到程序"
"结束。例如："

#: src/destructors.md:542
msgid ""
"// Usually this would be a dangling reference as the `Vec` would only\n"
"// exist inside the initializer expression of `C`, but instead the\n"
"// borrow gets lifetime-extended so it effectively has `'static` lifetime.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 通常这会成为悬垂引用，因为该 `Vec` 只会存在于 `C` 的\n"
"// 初始化器表达式内部，但这里该借用会被生命周期延长，\n"
"// 因而实际上具有 `'static` 生命周期。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:553
msgid ""
"If a [borrow](expressions/operator-expr.md#r-expr.operator.borrow), "
"[dereference](expressions/operator-expr.md#the-dereference-operator), [field]"
"(expressions/field-expr.md), or [tuple indexing expression](expressions/"
"tuple-expr.md#tuple-indexing-expressions) has an extended temporary scope, "
"then so does its operand. If an [indexing expression](expressions/array-"
"expr.md#array-and-slice-indexing-expressions) has an extended temporary "
"scope, then the indexed expression also has an extended temporary scope."
msgstr ""
"如果[借用](expressions/operator-expr.md#r-expr.operator.borrow)、[解引用]"
"(expressions/operator-expr.md#the-dereference-operator)、[字段](expressions/"
"field-expr.md)或[元组索引表达式](expressions/tuple-expr.md#tuple-indexing-"
"expressions)具有被延长的临时作用域，那么它的操作数也如此。如果[索引表达式]"
"(expressions/array-expr.md#array-and-slice-indexing-expressions)具有被延长的"
"临时作用域，那么被索引的表达式也具有被延长的临时作用域。"

#: src/destructors.md:559
msgid "Extending based on patterns"
msgstr "基于模式的延长"

#: src/destructors.md:565
msgid "An _extending pattern_ is either:"
msgstr "_延长模式_是以下之一："

#: src/destructors.md:567
msgid ""
"An [identifier pattern](patterns.md#identifier-patterns) that binds by "
"reference or mutable reference."
msgstr ""
"通过引用或可变引用绑定的[标识符模式](patterns.md#identifier-patterns)。"

#: src/destructors.md:571
msgid "// Binds by reference.\n"
msgstr "// 通过引用绑定。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:573
msgid "// Binds by mutable reference.\n"
msgstr "// 通过可变引用绑定。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:577
msgid ""
"A [struct](patterns.md#struct-patterns), [tuple](patterns.md#tuple-"
"patterns), [tuple struct](patterns.md#tuple-struct-patterns), [slice]"
"(patterns.md#slice-patterns), or [or-pattern](patterns.md#or-patterns) where "
"at least one of the direct subpatterns is an extending pattern."
msgstr ""
"至少一个直接子模式是延长模式的[结构体](patterns.md#struct-patterns)、[元组]"
"(patterns.md#tuple-patterns)、[元组结构体](patterns.md#tuple-struct-"
"patterns)、[切片](patterns.md#slice-patterns)或 [or-pattern（或模式）]"
"(patterns.md#or-patterns)。"

#: src/destructors.md:584
msgid "// Struct pattern.\n"
msgstr "// 结构体模式。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:586
msgid "// Tuple struct pattern.\n"
msgstr "// 元组结构体模式。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:588
msgid "// Tuple pattern.\n"
msgstr "// 元组模式。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:590
msgid "// Slice pattern.\n"
msgstr "// 切片模式。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:592
msgid "// Or pattern.\n"
msgstr "// Or 模式。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:594 src/names/name-resolution.md:109
#: src/names/name-resolution.md:112
msgid "//\n"
msgstr "//\n"

#: src/destructors.md:595
msgid "// All of the temporaries above are still live here.\n"
msgstr "// 以上所有临时值在这里仍然存活。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:599
msgid ""
"So `ref x`, `V(ref x)` and `[ref x, y]` are all extending patterns, but `x`, "
"`&ref x` and `&(ref x,)` are not."
msgstr ""
"因此 `ref x`、`V(ref x)` 和 `[ref x, y]` 都是延长模式，但 `x`、`&ref x` 和 "
"`&(ref x,)` 不是。"

#: src/destructors.md:605
msgid ""
"If the pattern in a `let` statement is an extending pattern then the "
"temporary scope of the initializer expression is extended."
msgstr ""
"如果 `let` 语句中的模式是延长模式，则初始化器表达式的临时作用域会被延长。"

#: src/destructors.md:608
msgid "// This is an extending pattern, so the temporary scope is extended.\n"
msgstr "// 这是延长模式，因此临时作用域会被延长。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:615
msgid ""
"// This is neither an extending pattern nor an extending expression,\n"
"// so the temporary is dropped at the semicolon.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 这既不是延长模式，也不是延长表达式，\n"
"// 因此临时值会在分号处丢弃。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:623
msgid ""
"// This is not an extending pattern but it is an extending expression,\n"
"// so the temporary lives beyond the `let` statement.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 这不是延长模式，但它是延长表达式，\n"
"// 因此临时值会存活到 `let` 语句之后。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:634
msgid "Extending based on expressions"
msgstr "基于表达式的延长"

#: src/destructors.md:640
msgid ""
"For a let statement with an initializer, an _extending expression_ is an "
"expression which is one of the following:"
msgstr "对于带初始化器的 `let` 语句，_延长表达式_是以下表达式之一："

#: src/destructors.md:642
msgid "The initializer expression."
msgstr "初始化器表达式。"

#: src/destructors.md:643
msgid ""
"The operand of an extending [borrow](expressions/operator-expr.md#r-"
"expr.operator.borrow) expression."
msgstr ""
"延长[借用](expressions/operator-expr.md#r-expr.operator.borrow)表达式的操作"
"数。"

#: src/destructors.md:644
msgid ""
"The [super operands](expressions.md#r-expr.super-macros) of an extending "
"[super macro call](expressions.md#r-expr.super-macros) expression."
msgstr ""
"延长 [super 宏调用](expressions.md#r-expr.super-macros)表达式的 [super 操作"
"数](expressions.md#r-expr.super-macros)。"

#: src/destructors.md:645
msgid ""
"The operand(s) of an extending [array](expressions/array-expr.md#array-"
"expressions), [cast](expressions/operator-expr.md#type-cast-expressions), "
"[braced struct](expressions/struct-expr.md), or [tuple](expressions/tuple-"
"expr.md#tuple-expressions) expression."
msgstr ""
"延长[数组](expressions/array-expr.md#array-expressions)、[类型转换]"
"(expressions/operator-expr.md#type-cast-expressions)、[大括号结构体]"
"(expressions/struct-expr.md)或[元组](expressions/tuple-expr.md#tuple-"
"expressions)表达式的操作数。"

#: src/destructors.md:646
msgid ""
"The arguments to an extending [tuple struct](types/struct.md#r-"
"type.struct.tuple) or [tuple enum variant](types/enum.md#r-"
"type.enum.declaration) constructor expression."
msgstr ""
"延长[元组结构体](types/struct.md#r-type.struct.tuple)或[元组枚举变体](types/"
"enum.md#r-type.enum.declaration)构造器表达式的实参。"

#: src/destructors.md:647
msgid ""
"The final expression of an extending [block expression](expressions/block-"
"expr.md) except for an [async block expression](expressions/block-expr.md#r-"
"expr.block.async)."
msgstr ""
"延长[块表达式](expressions/block-expr.md)的末尾表达式，但 [async 块表达式]"
"(expressions/block-expr.md#r-expr.block.async)除外。"

#: src/destructors.md:648
msgid ""
"The final expression of an extending [`if`](expressions/if-expr.md#if-"
"expressions) expression's consequent, `else if`, or `else` block."
msgstr ""
"延长 [`if`](expressions/if-expr.md#if-expressions) 表达式的后件、`else if` "
"或 `else` 块的末尾表达式。"

#: src/destructors.md:649
msgid ""
"An arm expression of an extending [`match`](expressions/match-expr.md) "
"expression."
msgstr "延长 [`match`](expressions/match-expr.md) 表达式的分支表达式。"

#: src/destructors.md:655
msgid ""
"The desugaring of a [destructuring assignment](expressions/operator-"
"expr.md#r-expr.assign.destructure) makes its assigned value operand (the "
"RHS) an extending expression within a newly-introduced block. For details, "
"see [expr.assign.destructure.tmp-ext](expressions/operator-expr.md#r-"
"expr.assign.destructure.tmp-ext)."
msgstr ""
"[解构赋值](expressions/operator-expr.md#r-expr.assign.destructure)的脱糖会使"
"其被赋值操作数（RHS）成为新引入块内的延长表达式。详情见 "
"[expr.assign.destructure.tmp-ext](expressions/operator-expr.md#r-"
"expr.assign.destructure.tmp-ext)。"

#: src/destructors.md:660
msgid ""
"So the borrow expressions in `&mut 0`, `(&1, &mut 2)`, and `Some(&mut 3)` "
"are all extending expressions. The borrows in `&0 + &1` and `f(&mut 0)` are "
"not."
msgstr ""
"因此，`&mut 0`、`(&1, &mut 2)` 和 `Some(&mut 3)` 中的借用表达式都是延长表达"
"式。`&0 + &1` 和 `f(&mut 0)` 中的借用则不是。"

#: src/destructors.md:666
msgid ""
"The operand of an extending [borrow](expressions/operator-expr.md#r-"
"expr.operator.borrow) expression has its [temporary scope](destructors.md#r-"
"destructors.scope.temporary) [extended](destructors.md#r-"
"destructors.scope.lifetime-extension)."
msgstr ""
"延长[借用](expressions/operator-expr.md#r-expr.operator.borrow)表达式的操作"
"数，其[临时作用域](destructors.md#r-destructors.scope.temporary)会被[延长]"
"(destructors.md#r-destructors.scope.lifetime-extension)。"

#: src/destructors.md:672
msgid ""
"The [super temporaries](expressions.md#r-expr.super-macros) of an extending "
"[super macro call](expressions.md#r-expr.super-macros) expression have their "
"[scopes](destructors.md#r-destructors.scope.temporary) [extended]"
"(destructors.md#r-destructors.scope.lifetime-extension)."
msgstr ""
"延长 [super 宏调用](expressions.md#r-expr.super-macros)表达式的 [super 临时"
"值](expressions.md#r-expr.super-macros)，其[作用域](destructors.md#r-"
"destructors.scope.temporary)会被[延长](destructors.md#r-"
"destructors.scope.lifetime-extension)。"

#: src/destructors.md:678
msgid ""
"`rustc` does not treat [array repeat operands](expressions/array-expr.md#r-"
"expr.array.repeat-operand) of extending [array](types/array.md) expressions "
"as extending expressions. Whether it should is an open question."
msgstr ""
"`rustc` 不会把延长[数组](types/array.md)表达式的[数组重复操作数](expressions/"
"array-expr.md#r-expr.array.repeat-operand)视为延长表达式。是否应当如此仍是开"
"放问题。"

#: src/destructors.md:680
msgid ""
"For details, see [Rust issue #146092](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/"
"issues/146092)."
msgstr ""
"详情见 [Rust issue #146092](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/issues/"
"146092)。"

