msgstr "// 原始借用的操作数。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:700
msgid "// Operand of cast.\n"
msgstr "// 类型转换的操作数。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:702
msgid "// Operand of tuple constructor.\n"
msgstr "// 元组构造器的操作数。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:705
msgid "// Argument to tuple struct constructor.\n"
msgstr "// 元组结构体构造器的实参。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:707
msgid "// Argument to tuple enum variant constructor.\n"
msgstr "// 元组枚举变体构造器的实参。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:709
msgid "// Final expr of block.\n"
msgstr "// 块的末尾表达式。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:711
msgid "// Final expr of `const` block.\n"
msgstr "// `const` 块的末尾表达式。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:713
msgid "// Final expr of `unsafe` block.\n"
msgstr "// `unsafe` 块的末尾表达式。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:715
msgid ""
"//              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n"
"//           Final exprs of `if`/`else` blocks.\n"
msgstr ""
"//              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n"
"//           `if`/`else` 块的末尾表达式。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:719
msgid "// `match` arm expression.\n"
msgstr "// `match` 分支表达式。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:721
msgid "// Super operand of super macro call expression.\n"
msgstr "// super 宏调用表达式的 super 操作数。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:726
msgid ""
"//\n"
"// All of the temporaries above are still live here.\n"
msgstr ""
"//\n"
"// 以上所有临时值在这里仍然存活。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:732
msgid ""
"Here are some examples where expressions don't have extended temporary "
"scopes:"
msgstr "下面是一些表达式不具有被延长的临时作用域的示例："

#: src/destructors.md:735
msgid ""
"// Arguments to function calls are not extending expressions. The\n"
"// temporary is dropped at the semicolon.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 函数调用的实参不是延长表达式。\n"
"// 临时值会在分号处丢弃。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:745
msgid "// Receivers of method calls are not extending expressions.\n"
msgstr "// 方法调用的接收者不是延长表达式。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:752
msgid "// Scrutinees of match expressions are not extending expressions.\n"
msgstr "// match 表达式的被匹配值不是延长表达式。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:759
msgid "// Final expressions of `async` blocks are not extending expressions.\n"
msgstr "// `async` 块的末尾表达式不是延长表达式。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:766
msgid "// Final expressions of closures are not extending expressions.\n"
msgstr "// 闭包的末尾表达式不是延长表达式。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:773
msgid "// Operands of loop breaks are not extending expressions.\n"
msgstr "// loop break 的操作数不是延长表达式。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:780
msgid "// Operands of breaks to labels are not extending expressions.\n"
msgstr "// 到标签的 break 的操作数不是延长表达式。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:788
msgid ""
"// The argument to `pin!` is only an extending expression if the call\n"
"// is an extending expression. Since it's not, the inner block is not\n"
"// an extending expression, so the temporaries in its trailing\n"
"// expression are dropped immediately.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 只有当 `pin!` 调用本身是延长表达式时，传给 `pin!` 的实参\n"
"// 才是延长表达式。由于这里不是，内部块也不是延长表达式，\n"
"// 所以其尾随表达式中的临时值会立即丢弃。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:806
msgid "Not running destructors"
msgstr "不运行析构器"

#: src/destructors.md:812
msgid "Manually suppressing destructors"
msgstr "手动抑制析构器"

#: src/destructors.md:814
msgid ""
"[`core::mem::forget`](../core/mem/fn.forget.html) can be used to prevent the "
"destructor of a variable from being run, and [`core::mem::ManuallyDrop`](../"
"core/mem/manually_drop/struct.ManuallyDrop.html) provides a wrapper to "
"prevent a variable or field from being dropped automatically."
msgstr ""
"可以使用 [`core::mem::forget`](../core/mem/fn.forget.html) 防止变量的析构器运"
"行，而 [`core::mem::ManuallyDrop`](../core/mem/manually_drop/"
"struct.ManuallyDrop.html) 提供了一个包装器，用于防止变量或字段被自动丢弃。"

#: src/destructors.md:820
msgid ""
"Preventing a destructor from being run via [`core::mem::forget`](../core/mem/"
"fn.forget.html) or other means is safe even if it has a type that isn't "
"`'static`. Besides the places where destructors are guaranteed to run as "
"defined by this document, types may _not_ safely rely on a destructor being "
"run for soundness."
msgstr ""
"通过 [`core::mem::forget`](../core/mem/fn.forget.html) 或其他方式防止析构器运"
"行是安全的，即使相关值具有非 `'static` 类型也是如此。除了本文档定义的析构器保"
"证会运行的位置之外，类型不得为保证健全性而依赖析构器一定会运行。"

#: src/destructors.md:829
msgid "Process termination without unwinding"
msgstr "不展开而终止进程"

#: src/destructors.md:831
msgid ""
"There are some ways to terminate the process without [unwinding]"
"(panic.md#unwinding), in which case destructors will not be run."
msgstr ""
"有一些方式会在不[展开](panic.md#unwinding)的情况下终止进程，此时析构器不会运"
"行。"

#: src/destructors.md:833
msgid ""
"The standard library provides [`std::process::exit`](../std/process/"
"fn.exit.html) and [`std::process::abort`](../std/process/fn.abort.html) to "
"do this explicitly. Additionally, if the [panic handler](panic.md#r-"
"panic.panic_handler.std) is set to `abort`, panicking will always terminate "
"the process without destructors being run."
msgstr ""
"标准库提供了 [`std::process::exit`](../std/process/fn.exit.html) 和 "
"[`std::process::abort`](../std/process/fn.abort.html) 来显式执行这种终止。此"
"外，如果 [panic 处理器](panic.md#r-panic.panic_handler.std)被设置为 `abort`，"
"则 panic 始终会在不运行析构器的情况下终止进程。"

#: src/destructors.md:835
msgid ""
"There is one additional case to be aware of: when a panic reaches a [non-"
"unwinding ABI boundary](items/functions.md#unwinding), either no destructors "
"will run, or all destructors up until the ABI boundary will run."
msgstr ""
"还有一种额外情况需要注意：当 panic 到达[非展开式 ABI 边界](items/"
"functions.md#unwinding)时，要么不会运行任何析构器，要么会运行直到该 ABI 边界"
"为止的所有析构器。"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:7
msgid ""
"Rust has rules that allow lifetimes to be elided in various places where the "
"compiler can infer a sensible default choice."
msgstr ""
"Rust 有一些规则，允许在编译器可以推断出合理默认选择的各种位置省略生命周期。"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:13
msgid "Lifetime elision in functions"
msgstr "函数中的生命周期省略"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:19
msgid ""
"In order to make common patterns more ergonomic, lifetime arguments can be "
"_elided_ in [function item](types/function-item.md), [function pointer]"
"(types/function-pointer.md), and [closure trait](types/closure.md) "
"signatures. The following rules are used to infer lifetime parameters for "
"elided lifetimes."
msgstr ""
"为了让常见模式更符合人体工学，可以在 [function item](types/function-"
"item.md)、[function pointer](types/function-pointer.md) 和 [closure trait]"
"(types/closure.md) 签名中_省略_生命周期实参。以下规则用于为被省略的生命周期推"
"断生命周期参数。"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:25
msgid "It is an error to elide lifetime parameters that cannot be inferred."
msgstr "省略无法推断的生命周期参数是错误。"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:31
msgid ""
"The placeholder lifetime, `'_`, can also be used to have a lifetime inferred "
"in the same way. For lifetimes in paths, using `'_` is preferred."
msgstr ""
"占位生命周期 `'_` 也可以用于以相同方式让生命周期被推断。对于路径中的生命周"
"期，优先使用 `'_`。"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:37
msgid ""
"Trait object lifetimes follow different rules discussed [below](#default-"
"trait-object-lifetimes)."
msgstr ""
"trait object 生命周期遵循[下文](#default-trait-object-lifetimes)讨论的不同规"
"则。"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:43
msgid ""
"Each elided lifetime in the parameters becomes a distinct lifetime parameter."
msgstr "参数中每个被省略的生命周期都会成为一个不同的生命周期参数。"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:49
msgid ""
"If there is exactly one lifetime used in the parameters (elided or not), "
"that lifetime is assigned to _all_ elided output lifetimes."
msgstr ""
"如果参数中恰好使用了一个生命周期（无论是否被省略），该生命周期会被赋给_所有_"
"被省略的输出生命周期。"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:55
msgid "In method signatures there is another rule"
msgstr "在方法签名中还有另一条规则"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:57
msgid ""
"If the receiver has type `&Self`  or `&mut Self`, then the lifetime of that "
"reference to `Self` is assigned to all elided output lifetime parameters."
msgstr ""
"如果接收者的类型为 `&Self`  或 `&mut Self`，则该指向 `Self` 的引用的生命周期"
"会被赋给所有被省略的输出生命周期参数。"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:68 src/lifetime-elision.md:72
#: src/lifetime-elision.md:75 src/lifetime-elision.md:78
#: src/lifetime-elision.md:81 src/lifetime-elision.md:84
#: src/lifetime-elision.md:88 src/lifetime-elision.md:92
#: src/lifetime-elision.md:95
msgid "// elided\n"
msgstr "// 已省略\n"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:69
msgid "// also elided\n"
msgstr "// 也是已省略\n"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:70 src/lifetime-elision.md:73
#: src/lifetime-elision.md:76 src/lifetime-elision.md:79
#: src/lifetime-elision.md:82 src/lifetime-elision.md:85
#: src/lifetime-elision.md:89 src/lifetime-elision.md:93
#: src/lifetime-elision.md:96
msgid "// expanded\n"
msgstr "// 已展开\n"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:87
msgid "// elided - preferred\n"
msgstr "// 已省略 - 首选形式\n"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:100
msgid ""
"// The following examples show situations where it is not allowed to elide "
"the\n"
"// lifetime parameter.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 以下示例展示不允许省略\n"
"// 生命周期参数的情况。\n"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:103
msgid "// Cannot infer, because there are no parameters to infer from.\n"
msgstr "// 无法推断，因为没有可供推断的参数。\n"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:105 src/lifetime-elision.md:108
msgid "// ILLEGAL\n"
msgstr "// 非法\n"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:106
msgid ""
"// Cannot infer, ambiguous if it is borrowed from the first or second "
"parameter.\n"
msgstr "// 无法推断，不明确它是从第一个参数还是第二个参数借用而来。\n"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:116
msgid "Default trait object lifetimes"
msgstr "默认 trait object 生命周期"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:122
msgid ""
"The assumed lifetime of references held by a [trait object](types/trait-"
"object.md) is called its _default object lifetime bound_. These were defined "
"in [RFC 599](https://github.com/rust-lang/rfcs/blob/master/text/0599-default-"
"object-bound.md) and amended in [RFC 1156](https://github.com/rust-lang/rfcs/"
"blob/master/text/1156-adjust-default-object-bounds.md)."
msgstr ""
"由 [trait object](types/trait-object.md) 持有的引用的假定生命周期称为其_默认"
"对象生命周期约束_。这些约束在 [RFC 599](https://github.com/rust-lang/rfcs/"
"blob/master/text/0599-default-object-bound.md) 中定义，并在 [RFC 1156]"
"(https://github.com/rust-lang/rfcs/blob/master/text/1156-adjust-default-"
"object-bounds.md) 中修订。"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:128
msgid ""
"These default object lifetime bounds are used instead of the lifetime "
"parameter elision rules defined above when the lifetime bound is omitted "
"entirely."
msgstr ""
"当生命周期约束被完全省略时，会使用这些默认对象生命周期约束，而不是上面定义的"
"生命周期参数省略规则。"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:134
msgid ""
"If `'_` is used as the lifetime bound then the bound follows the usual "
"elision rules."
msgstr "如果将 `'_` 用作生命周期约束，则该约束遵循通常的省略规则。"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:140
msgid ""
"If the trait object is used as a type argument of a generic type then the "
"containing type is first used to try to infer a bound."
msgstr ""
"如果 trait object 被用作泛型类型的类型实参，则会先使用包含它的类型来尝试推断"
"约束。"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:146
msgid ""
"If there is a unique bound from the containing type then that is the default."
msgstr "如果从包含类型得到唯一约束，则该约束就是默认值。"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:152
msgid ""
"If there is more than one bound from the containing type then an explicit "
"bound must be specified."
msgstr "如果从包含类型得到多个约束，则必须指定显式约束。"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:158
msgid "If neither of those rules apply, then the bounds on the trait are used:"
msgstr "如果这些规则都不适用，则使用 trait 上的约束："

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:164
msgid ""
"If the trait is defined with a single lifetime _bound_ then that bound is "
"used."
msgstr "如果 trait 定义时带有单个生命周期_约束_，则使用该约束。"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:170
msgid "If `'static` is used for any lifetime bound then `'static` is used."
msgstr "如果任一生命周期约束使用了 `'static`，则使用 `'static`。"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:176
msgid ""
"If the trait has no lifetime bounds, then the lifetime is inferred in "
"expressions and is `'static` outside of expressions."
msgstr ""
"如果 trait 没有生命周期约束，则生命周期在表达式中被推断，而在表达式之外为 "
"`'static`。"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:179 src/lifetime-elision.md:219
msgid "// For the following trait...\n"
msgstr "// 对于以下 trait...\n"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:181
msgid "// These two are the same because Box<T> has no lifetime bound on T\n"
msgstr "// 这二者相同，因为 Box<T> 对 T 没有生命周期约束\n"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:185 src/lifetime-elision.md:225
msgid "// ...and so are these:\n"
msgstr "// ...这些也是如此：\n"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:189
msgid "// ...so are these, because &'a T requires T: 'a\n"
msgstr "// ...这些也是如此，因为 &'a T 要求 T: 'a\n"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:193
msgid "// std::cell::Ref<'a, T> also requires T: 'a, so these are the same\n"
msgstr "// std::cell::Ref<'a, T> 也要求 T: 'a，所以这些相同\n"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:200
msgid "// This is an example of an error.\n"
msgstr "// 这是一个错误示例。\n"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:207
msgid ""
"//                                  ^^^^^^^\n"
"// Error: the lifetime bound for this object type cannot be deduced from "
"context\n"
msgstr ""
"//                                  ^^^^^^^\n"
"// 错误：无法从上下文推断此对象类型的生命周期约束\n"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:216
msgid ""
"Note that the innermost object sets the bound, so `&'a Box<dyn Foo>` is "
"still `&'a Box<dyn Foo + 'static>`."
msgstr ""
"注意，最内层对象会设置约束，因此 `&'a Box<dyn Foo>` 仍然是 `&'a Box<dyn Foo "
"+ 'static>`。"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:221
msgid "// ...these two are the same:\n"
msgstr "// ...这二者相同：\n"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:235
msgid "`const` and `static` elision"
msgstr "`const` 和 `static` 省略"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:241
msgid ""
"Both [constant](items/constant-items.md) and [static](items/static-items.md) "
"declarations of reference types have _implicit_ `'static` lifetimes unless "
"an explicit lifetime is specified. As such, the constant declarations "
"involving `'static` above may be written without the lifetimes."
msgstr ""
"除非指定显式生命周期，否则引用类型的 [constant](items/constant-items.md) 声明"
"和 [static](items/static-items.md) 声明都具有_隐式_的 `'static` 生命周期。因"
"此，上面涉及 `'static` 的常量声明可以写成不带生命周期的形式。"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:244
msgid "// STRING: &'static str\n"
msgstr "// STRING: &'static str\n"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:251
msgid "// BITS_N_STRINGS: BitsNStrings<'static>\n"
msgstr "// BITS_N_STRINGS: BitsNStrings<'static>\n"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:263
msgid ""
"Note that if the `static` or `const` items include function or closure "
"references, which themselves include references, the compiler will first try "
"the standard elision rules. If it is unable to resolve the lifetimes by its "
"usual rules, then it will error. By way of example:"
msgstr ""
"注意，如果 `static` 或 `const` 项包含函数引用或闭包引用，而这些引用本身又包含"
"引用，则编译器会先尝试标准省略规则。如果它无法按通常规则解析生命周期，则会报"
"错。例如："

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:269
msgid "// Resolved as `for<'a> fn(&'a str) -> &'a str`.\n"
msgstr "// 解析为 `for<'a> fn(&'a str) -> &'a str`。\n"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:272
msgid ""
"// Resolved as `for<'a, 'b, 'c> Fn(&'a Foo, &'b Bar, &'c Baz) -> usize`.\n"
msgstr "// 解析为 `for<'a, 'b, 'c> Fn(&'a Foo, &'b Bar, &'c Baz) -> usize`。\n"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:281
msgid ""
"// There is insufficient information to bound the return reference lifetime\n"
"// relative to the argument lifetimes, so this is an error.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 信息不足，无法相对于实参生命周期来约束返回引用生命周期，\n"
"// 因此这是一个错误。\n"

#: src/lifetime-elision.md:284
msgid ""
"//                                            ^\n"
"// this function's return type contains a borrowed value, but the signature\n"
"// does not say whether it is borrowed from argument 1 or argument 2\n"
msgstr ""
"//                                            ^\n"
"// 此函数的返回类型包含一个借用值，但签名\n"
"// 没有说明它是从实参 1 还是实参 2 借用而来\n"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:11
msgid ""
"Certain types and traits that exist in [the standard library](../std/"
"index.html) are known to the Rust compiler. This chapter documents the "
"special features of these types and traits."
msgstr ""
"存在于[标准库](../std/index.html)中的某些类型和 trait 是 Rust 编译器知晓的。"
"本章记录这些类型和 trait 的特殊特性。"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:23
msgid ""
"[`Box<T>`](../alloc/boxed/struct.Box.html) has a few special features that "
"Rust doesn't currently allow for user defined types."
msgstr ""
"[`Box<T>`](../alloc/boxed/struct.Box.html) 具有一些 Rust 目前不允许用户定义类"
"型拥有的特殊特性。"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:29
msgid ""
"The [dereference operator](expressions/operator-expr.md#the-dereference-"
"operator) for `Box<T>` produces a place which can be [moved from]"
"(expressions.md#r-expr.move.movable-place). This means that the `*` operator "
"and the destructor of `Box<T>` are built-in to the language."
msgstr ""
"`Box<T>` 的[解引用运算符](expressions/operator-expr.md#the-dereference-"
"operator)会产生一个可以[从中移动](expressions.md#r-expr.move.movable-place)的"
"位置。这意味着 `*` 运算符和 `Box<T>` 的析构器是内建于语言中的。"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:35
msgid ""
"[Methods](items/associated-items.md#associated-functions-and-methods) can "
"take `Box<Self>` as a receiver."
msgstr ""
"[方法](items/associated-items.md#associated-functions-and-methods)可以接受 "
"`Box<Self>` 作为接收者。"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:41
msgid ""
"A trait may be implemented for `Box<T>` in the same crate as `T`, which the "
"[orphan rules](items/implementations.md#trait-implementation-coherence) "
"prevent for other generic types."
msgstr ""
"可以在与 `T` 相同的 crate 中为 `Box<T>` 实现 trait，而[孤儿规则](items/"
"implementations.md#trait-implementation-coherence)会禁止对其他泛型类型这样"
"做。"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:49
msgid "`Rc<T>`"
msgstr "`Rc<T>`"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:55
msgid ""
"[Methods](items/associated-items.md#associated-functions-and-methods) can "
"take [`Rc<Self>`](../alloc/rc/struct.Rc.html) as a receiver."
msgstr ""
"[方法](items/associated-items.md#associated-functions-and-methods)可以接受 "
"[`Rc<Self>`](../alloc/rc/struct.Rc.html) 作为接收者。"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:61
msgid "`Arc<T>`"
msgstr "`Arc<T>`"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:67
msgid ""
"[Methods](items/associated-items.md#associated-functions-and-methods) can "
"take [`Arc<Self>`](../alloc/sync/struct.Arc.html) as a receiver."
msgstr ""
"[方法](items/associated-items.md#associated-functions-and-methods)可以接受 "
"[`Arc<Self>`](../alloc/sync/struct.Arc.html) 作为接收者。"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:73
msgid "`Pin<P>`"
msgstr "`Pin<P>`"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:79
msgid ""
"[Methods](items/associated-items.md#associated-functions-and-methods) can "
"take [`Pin<P>`](../core/pin/struct.Pin.html) as a receiver."
msgstr ""
"[方法](items/associated-items.md#associated-functions-and-methods)可以接受 "
"[`Pin<P>`](../core/pin/struct.Pin.html) 作为接收者。"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:85
msgid "`UnsafeCell<T>`"
msgstr "`UnsafeCell<T>`"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:91
msgid ""
"[`std::cell::UnsafeCell<T>`](../core/cell/struct.UnsafeCell.html) is used "
"for [interior mutability](interior-mutability.md). It ensures that the "
"compiler doesn't perform optimisations that are incorrect for such types."
msgstr ""
"[`std::cell::UnsafeCell<T>`](../core/cell/struct.UnsafeCell.html) 用于[内部可"
"变性](interior-mutability.md)。它确保编译器不会执行对这类类型而言不正确的优"
"化。"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:97
msgid ""
"It also ensures that [`static` items](items/static-items.md) which have a "
"type with interior mutability aren't placed in memory marked as read only."
msgstr ""
"它还确保类型具有内部可变性的 [`static` 条目](items/static-items.md)不会被放置"
"在标记为只读的内存中。"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:103
msgid "`PhantomData<T>`"
msgstr "`PhantomData<T>`"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:105
msgid ""
"[`std::marker::PhantomData<T>`](../core/marker/struct.PhantomData.html) is a "
"[zero-sized](glossary.md#r-glossary.zst), minimum alignment, type that is "
"considered to own a `T` for the purposes of [variance]"
"(subtyping.md#variance), [drop check](../nomicon/dropck.html), and [auto "
"traits](#auto-traits)."
msgstr ""
"[`std::marker::PhantomData<T>`](../core/marker/struct.PhantomData.html) 是一"
"种[零大小](glossary.md#r-glossary.zst)、最小对齐的类型；出于[型变]"
"(subtyping.md#variance)、[drop 检查](../nomicon/dropck.html)和[auto trait]"
"(#auto-traits)的目的，它被视为拥有一个 `T`。"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:111
msgid "Operator traits"
msgstr "运算符 trait"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:113
msgid ""
"The traits in [`std::ops`](../core/ops/index.html) and [`std::cmp`](../core/"
"cmp/index.html) are used to overload [operators](expressions/operator-"
"expr.md), [indexing expressions](expressions/array-expr.md#array-and-slice-"
"indexing-expressions), and [call expressions](expressions/call-expr.md)."
msgstr ""
"[`std::ops`](../core/ops/index.html) 和 [`std::cmp`](../core/cmp/index.html) "
"中的 trait 用于重载[运算符](expressions/operator-expr.md)、[索引表达式]"
"(expressions/array-expr.md#array-and-slice-indexing-expressions)和[调用表达"
"式](expressions/call-expr.md)。"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:119
msgid "`Deref` and `DerefMut`"
msgstr "`Deref` 和 `DerefMut`"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:121
msgid ""
"As well as overloading the unary `*` operator, [`Deref`](../core/ops/deref/"
"trait.Deref.html) and [`DerefMut`](../core/ops/deref/trait.DerefMut.html) "
"are also used in [method resolution](expressions/method-call-expr.md) and "
"[deref coercions](type-coercions.md#coercion-types)."
msgstr ""
"除了重载一元 `*` 运算符外，[`Deref`](../core/ops/deref/trait.Deref.html) 和 "
"[`DerefMut`](../core/ops/deref/trait.DerefMut.html) 还用于[方法解析]"
"(expressions/method-call-expr.md)和[deref 强制转换](type-"
"coercions.md#coercion-types)。"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:127
msgid "`Drop`"
msgstr "`Drop`"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:129
msgid ""
"The [`Drop`](../core/ops/drop/trait.Drop.html) trait provides a [destructor]"
"(destructors.md), to be run whenever a value of this type is to be destroyed."
msgstr ""
"[`Drop`](../core/ops/drop/trait.Drop.html) trait 提供一个[析构器]"
"(destructors.md)，每当该类型的值即将被销毁时运行。"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:135
msgid "`Copy`"
msgstr "`Copy`"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:141
msgid ""
"The [`Copy`](../core/marker/trait.Copy.html) trait changes the semantics of "
"a type implementing it."
msgstr ""
"[`Copy`](../core/marker/trait.Copy.html) trait 会改变实现它的类型的语义。"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:147
msgid ""
"Values whose type implements `Copy` are copied rather than moved upon "
"assignment."
msgstr "类型实现了 `Copy` 的值在赋值时会被复制，而不是被移动。"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:153
msgid ""
"`Copy` can only be implemented for types which do not implement `Drop`, and "
"whose fields are all `Copy`. For enums, this means all fields of all "
"variants have to be `Copy`. For unions, this means all variants have to be "
"`Copy`."
msgstr ""
"`Copy` 只能为未实现 `Drop` 且其字段全都是 `Copy` 的类型实现。对于枚举，这意味"
"着所有变体的所有字段都必须是 `Copy`。对于联合体，这意味着所有变体都必须是 "
"`Copy`。"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:159
msgid "`Copy` is implemented by the compiler for"
msgstr "编译器为以下类型实现了 `Copy`："

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:165
msgid "[Tuples](types/tuple.md) of `Copy` types"
msgstr "`Copy` 类型组成的[元组](types/tuple.md)"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:177
msgid "[Function items](types/function-item.md)"
msgstr "[函数项](types/function-item.md)"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:183
msgid ""
"[Closures](types/closure.md) that capture no values or that only capture "
"values of `Copy` types"
msgstr "不捕获任何值或只捕获 `Copy` 类型的值的[闭包](types/closure.md)"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:189
msgid "`Clone`"
msgstr "`Clone`"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:195
msgid ""
"The [`Clone`](../core/clone/trait.Clone.html) trait is a supertrait of "
"`Copy`, so it also needs compiler generated implementations."
msgstr ""
"[`Clone`](../core/clone/trait.Clone.html) trait 是 `Copy` 的 supertrait，因此"
"它也需要由编译器生成的实现。"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:201
msgid "It is implemented by the compiler for the following types:"
msgstr "编译器会为以下类型实现它："

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:207
msgid "Types with a built-in `Copy` implementation (see above)"
msgstr "具有内置 `Copy` 实现的类型（见上文）"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:213
msgid "[Tuples](types/tuple.md) of `Clone` types"
msgstr "`Clone` 类型组成的[元组](types/tuple.md)"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:219
msgid ""
"[Closures](types/closure.md) that only capture values of `Clone` types or "
"capture no values from the environment"
msgstr ""
"只捕获 `Clone` 类型的值或不从环境中捕获任何值的[闭包](types/closure.md)"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:225
msgid "`Send`"
msgstr "`Send`"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:227
msgid ""
"The [`Send`](../core/marker/trait.Send.html) trait indicates that a value of "
"this type is safe to send from one thread to another."
msgstr ""
"[`Send`](../core/marker/trait.Send.html) trait 表示此类型的值可以安全地从一个"
"线程发送到另一个线程。"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:233
msgid "`Sync`"
msgstr "`Sync`"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:239
msgid ""
"The [`Sync`](../core/marker/trait.Sync.html) trait indicates that a value of "
"this type is safe to share between multiple threads."
msgstr ""
"[`Sync`](../core/marker/trait.Sync.html) trait 表示此类型的值可以安全地在多个"
"线程之间共享。"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:245
msgid ""
"This trait must be implemented for all types used in immutable [`static` "
"items](items/static-items.md)."
msgstr ""
"所有用于不可变 [`static` 项](items/static-items.md)的类型都必须实现此 trait。"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:251
msgid "`Termination`"
msgstr "`Termination`"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:253
msgid ""
"The [`Termination`](../std/process/trait.Termination.html) trait indicates "
"the acceptable return types for the [main function](crates-and-source-"
"files.md#main-functions) and [test functions](attributes/testing.md#the-test-"
"attribute)."
msgstr ""
"[`Termination`](../std/process/trait.Termination.html) trait 表示[main 函数]"
"(crates-and-source-files.md#main-functions)和[测试函数](attributes/"
"testing.md#the-test-attribute)可接受的返回类型。"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:259
msgid "Auto traits"
msgstr "auto trait"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:261
msgid ""
"The [`Send`](../core/marker/trait.Send.html), [`Sync`](../core/marker/"
"trait.Sync.html), [`Unpin`](../core/marker/trait.Unpin.html), [`UnwindSafe`]"
"(../core/panic/unwind_safe/trait.UnwindSafe.html), and [`RefUnwindSafe`](../"
"core/panic/unwind_safe/trait.RefUnwindSafe.html) traits are _auto traits_. "
"Auto traits have special properties."
msgstr ""
"[`Send`](../core/marker/trait.Send.html)、[`Sync`](../core/marker/"
"trait.Sync.html)、[`Unpin`](../core/marker/trait.Unpin.html)、[`UnwindSafe`]"
"(../core/panic/unwind_safe/trait.UnwindSafe.html) 和 [`RefUnwindSafe`](../"
"core/panic/unwind_safe/trait.RefUnwindSafe.html) trait 是 _auto trait_。auto "
"trait 具有特殊属性。"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:267
msgid ""
"If no explicit implementation or negative implementation is written out for "
"an auto trait for a given type, then the compiler implements it "
"automatically according to the following rules:"
msgstr ""
"如果没有为给定类型写出某个 auto trait 的显式实现或否定实现，那么编译器会根据"
"以下规则自动实现它："

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:273
msgid ""
"`&T`, `&mut T`, `*const T`, `*mut T`, `[T; n]`, and `[T]` implement the "
"trait if `T` does."
msgstr ""
"如果 `T` 实现该 trait，则 `&T`、`&mut T`、`*const T`、`*mut T`、`[T; n]` 和 "
"`[T]` 也实现该 trait。"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:279
msgid ""
"Function item types and function pointers automatically implement the trait."
msgstr "函数项类型和函数指针会自动实现该 trait。"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:285
msgid ""
"Structs, enums, unions, and tuples implement the trait if all of their "
"fields do."
msgstr ""
"如果结构体、枚举、联合体和元组的所有字段都实现该 trait，则它们也实现该 "
"trait。"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:291
msgid ""
"Closures implement the trait if the types of all of their captures do. A "
"closure that captures a `T` by shared reference and a `U` by value "
"implements any auto traits that both `&T` and `U` do."
msgstr ""
"如果闭包所有捕获项的类型都实现该 trait，则闭包也实现该 trait。通过共享引用捕"
"获一个 `T` 并按值捕获一个 `U` 的闭包，会实现 `&T` 和 `U` 二者都实现的任何 "
"auto trait。"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:297
msgid ""
"For generic types (counting the built-in types above as generic over `T`), "
"if a generic implementation is available, then the compiler does not "
"automatically implement it for types that could use the implementation "
"except that they do not meet the requisite trait bounds. For instance, the "
"standard library implements `Send` for all `&T` where `T` is `Sync`; this "
"means that the compiler will not implement `Send` for `&T` if `T` is `Send` "
"but not `Sync`."
msgstr ""
"对于泛型类型（将上述内置类型视为关于 `T` 的泛型类型），如果存在可用的泛型实"
"现，那么对于本可以使用该实现、只是未满足所需 trait 约束的类型，编译器不会自动"
"实现它。例如，标准库为所有满足 `T` 为 `Sync` 的 `&T` 实现 `Send`；这意味着如"
"果 `T` 是 `Send` 但不是 `Sync`，编译器不会为 `&T` 实现 `Send`。"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:303
msgid ""
"Auto traits can also have negative implementations, shown as `impl !"
"AutoTrait for T` in the standard library documentation, that override the "
"automatic implementations. For example `*mut T` has a negative "
"implementation of `Send`, and so `*mut T` is not `Send`, even if `T` is. "
"There is currently no stable way to specify additional negative "
"implementations; they exist only in the standard library."
msgstr ""
"auto trait 也可以有否定实现，在标准库文档中显示为 `impl !AutoTrait for T`，它"
"们会覆盖自动实现。例如，`*mut T` 有一个 `Send` 的否定实现，因此即使 `T` 是 "
"`Send`，`*mut T` 也不是 `Send`。目前没有稳定方式指定额外的否定实现；它们只存"
"在于标准库中。"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:309
msgid ""
"Auto traits may be added as an additional bound to any [trait object](types/"
"trait-object.md), even though normally only one trait is allowed. For "
"instance, `Box<dyn Debug + Send + UnwindSafe>` is a valid type."
msgstr ""
"auto trait 可以作为附加约束添加到任何 [trait object](types/trait-object.md) "
"上，即使通常只允许一个 trait。例如，`Box<dyn Debug + Send + UnwindSafe>` 是一"
"个有效类型。"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:315
msgid "`Sized`"
msgstr "`Sized`"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:321
msgid ""
"The [`Sized`](../core/marker/trait.Sized.html) trait indicates that the size "
"of this type is known at compile-time; that is, it's not a [dynamically "
"sized type](dynamically-sized-types.md)."
msgstr ""
"[`Sized`](../core/marker/trait.Sized.html) trait 表示此类型的大小在编译时已"
"知；也就是说，它不是[动态大小类型](dynamically-sized-types.md)。"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:327
msgid ""
"[Type parameters](types/parameters.md) (except `Self` in traits) are `Sized` "
"by default, as are [associated types](items/associated-items.md#associated-"
"types)."
msgstr ""
"[类型参数](types/parameters.md)（trait 中的 `Self` 除外）默认是 `Sized`，[关"
"联类型](items/associated-items.md#associated-types)也是如此。"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:333
msgid ""
"`Sized` is always implemented automatically by the compiler, not by "
"[implementation items](items/implementations.md)."
msgstr ""
"`Sized` 始终由编译器自动实现，而不是由[实现项](items/implementations.md)实"
"现。"

#: src/special-types-and-traits.md:339
msgid ""
"These implicit `Sized` bounds may be relaxed by using the special `?Sized` "
"bound."
msgstr "这些隐式 `Sized` 约束可以通过使用特殊的 `?Sized` 约束来放宽。"

#: src/names.md:11
msgid ""
"An _entity_ is a language construct that can be referred to in some way "
"within the source program, usually via a [path](paths.md). Entities include "
"[types](types.md), [items](items.md), [generic parameters](items/"
"generics.md), [variable bindings](patterns.md), [loop labels](expressions/"
"loop-expr.md#loop-labels), [lifetimes](tokens.md#lifetimes-and-loop-labels), "
"[fields](expressions/field-expr.md), [attributes](attributes.md), and [lints]"
"(attributes/diagnostics.md#lint-check-attributes)."
msgstr ""
"_实体_是源程序中可以通过某种方式引用的语言构造，通常经由[路径](paths.md)引"
"用。实体包括[类型](types.md)、[项](items.md)、[泛型参数](items/generics.md)、"
"[变量绑定](patterns.md)、[循环标签](expressions/loop-expr.md#loop-labels)、"
"[生命周期](tokens.md#lifetimes-and-loop-labels)、[字段](expressions/field-"
"expr.md)、[属性](attributes.md)和 [lint](attributes/diagnostics.md#lint-"
"check-attributes)。"

#: src/names.md:13
msgid ""
"A _declaration_ is a syntactical construct that can introduce a _name_ to "
"refer to an entity. Entity names are valid within a [_scope_](names/"
"scopes.md) --- a region of source text where that name may be referenced."
msgstr ""
"_声明_是一种可以引入_名称_来指代实体的语法构造。实体名称在[_作用域_](names/"
"scopes.md)内有效 --- 作用域是源文本中可以引用该名称的一片区域。"

#: src/names.md:15
msgid ""
"Some entities are [explicitly declared](#explicitly-declared-entities) in "
"the source code, and some are [implicitly declared](#implicitly-declared-"
"entities) as part of the language or compiler extensions."
msgstr ""
"有些实体在源代码中[显式声明](#explicitly-declared-entities)，有些实体则作为语"
"言或编译器扩展的一部分[隐式声明](#implicitly-declared-entities)。"

#: src/names.md:17
msgid ""
"[_Paths_](paths.md) are used to refer to an entity, possibly in another "
"module or type."
msgstr "[_路径_](paths.md)用于引用实体，该实体可能位于另一个模块或类型中。"

#: src/names.md:19
msgid ""
"Lifetimes and loop labels use a [dedicated syntax](tokens.md#lifetimes-and-"
"loop-labels) using a leading quote."
msgstr ""
"生命周期和循环标签使用带有前导引号的[专用语法](tokens.md#lifetimes-and-loop-"
"labels)。"

#: src/names.md:21
msgid ""
"Names are segregated into different [_namespaces_](names/namespaces.md), "
"allowing entities in different namespaces to share the same name without "
"conflict."
msgstr ""
"名称被划分到不同的[_命名空间_](names/namespaces.md)中，从而允许不同命名空间中"
"的实体共享同一名称而不发生冲突。"

#: src/names.md:23
msgid ""
"[_Name resolution_](names/name-resolution.md) is the compile-time process of "
"tying paths, identifiers, and labels to entity declarations."
msgstr ""
"[_名称解析_](names/name-resolution.md)是在编译时将路径、标识符和标签关联到实"
"体声明的过程。"

#: src/names.md:25
msgid ""
"Access to certain names may be restricted based on their [_visibility_]"
"(visibility-and-privacy.md)."
msgstr ""
"对某些名称的访问可以根据其[_可见性_](visibility-and-privacy.md)而受到限制。"

#: src/names.md:31
msgid "Explicitly declared entities"
msgstr "显式声明的实体"

#: src/names.md:37
msgid "Entities that explicitly introduce a name in the source code are:"
msgstr "在源代码中显式引入名称的实体包括："

