#: src/names/namespaces.md:59
msgid ""
"An example of how overlapping names in different namespaces can be used "
"unambiguously:"
msgstr "以下示例展示了不同命名空间中的重叠名称如何能被无歧义地使用："

#: src/names/namespaces.md:62
msgid ""
"// Foo introduces a type in the type namespace and a constructor in the "
"value\n"
"// namespace.\n"
msgstr ""
"// Foo 在类型命名空间中引入一个类型，并在值命名空间中引入一个构造器。\n"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:65
msgid "// The `Foo` macro is declared in the macro namespace.\n"
msgstr "// `Foo` 宏声明在宏命名空间中。\n"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:70
msgid ""
"// `Foo` in the `f` parameter type refers to `Foo` in the type namespace.\n"
"// `'Foo` introduces a new lifetime in the lifetime namespace.\n"
msgstr ""
"// `f` 参数类型中的 `Foo` 指称类型命名空间中的 `Foo`。\n"
"// `'Foo` 在生命周期命名空间中引入一个新的生命周期。\n"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:74
msgid "// `Foo` refers to the `Foo` constructor in the value namespace.\n"
msgstr "// `Foo` 指称值命名空间中的 `Foo` 构造器。\n"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:76
msgid "// `Foo` refers to the `Foo` macro in the macro namespace.\n"
msgstr "// `Foo` 指称宏命名空间中的 `Foo` 宏。\n"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:78
msgid "// `'Foo` introduces a label in the label namespace.\n"
msgstr "// `'Foo` 在标签命名空间中引入一个标签。\n"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:80
msgid ""
"// `'Foo` refers to the `'Foo` lifetime parameter, and `Foo`\n"
"        // refers to the type namespace.\n"
msgstr ""
"// `'Foo` 指称 `'Foo` 生命周期参数，而 `Foo`\n"
"        // 指称类型命名空间。\n"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:83
msgid "// `'Foo` refers to the label.\n"
msgstr "// `'Foo` 指称该标签。\n"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:93
msgid "Named entities without a namespace"
msgstr "没有命名空间的具名实体"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:95
msgid ""
"The following entities have explicit names, but the names are not a part of "
"any specific namespace."
msgstr "以下实体具有显式名称，但这些名称不属于任何特定命名空间。"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:97
msgid "Fields"
msgstr "字段"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:103
msgid ""
"Even though struct, enum, and union fields are named, the named fields do "
"not live in an explicit namespace. They can only be accessed via a [field "
"expression](../expressions/field-expr.md), which only inspects the field "
"names of the specific type being accessed."
msgstr ""
"尽管 struct、enum 和 union 字段都有名称，但这些具名字段并不位于显式命名空间"
"中。它们只能通过[字段表达式](../expressions/field-expr.md)访问，而字段表达式"
"只检查正在被访问的特定类型的字段名称。"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:111
msgid ""
"A [use declaration](../items/use-declarations.md) has named aliases that it "
"imports into scope, but the `use` item itself does not belong to a specific "
"namespace. Instead, it can introduce aliases into multiple namespaces, "
"depending on the item kind being imported."
msgstr ""
"[use 声明](../items/use-declarations.md)具有它导入到作用域中的具名别名，但 "
"`use` 项本身不属于特定命名空间。相反，它可以根据所导入的项的种类，将别名引入"
"多个命名空间。"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:117
msgid "Sub-namespaces"
msgstr "子命名空间"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:123
msgid ""
"The macro namespace is split into two sub-namespaces: one for [bang-style "
"macros](../macros.md) and one for [attributes](../attributes.md). When an "
"attribute is resolved, any bang-style macros in scope will be ignored. And "
"conversely resolving a bang-style macro will ignore attribute macros in "
"scope. This prevents one style from shadowing another."
msgstr ""
"宏命名空间被划分为两个子命名空间：一个用于[感叹号风格宏](../macros.md)，另一"
"个用于[属性](../attributes.md)。解析属性时，作用域中的任何感叹号风格宏都会被"
"忽略。反过来，解析感叹号风格宏时，也会忽略作用域中的属性宏。这会防止一种风格"
"遮蔽另一种风格。"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:125
msgid ""
"For example, the [`cfg` attribute](../conditional-compilation.md#the-cfg-"
"attribute) and the [`cfg` macro](../conditional-compilation.md#the-cfg-"
"macro) are two different entities with the same name in the macro namespace, "
"but they can still be used in their respective context."
msgstr ""
"例如，[`cfg` 属性](../conditional-compilation.md#the-cfg-attribute)和 [`cfg` "
"宏](../conditional-compilation.md#the-cfg-macro)是宏命名空间中两个同名的不同"
"实体，但它们仍然可以在各自对应的上下文中使用。"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:132
msgid ""
"`use` imports still cannot create duplicate bindings of the same name in a "
"module or block, regardless of sub-namespace."
msgstr "无论子命名空间如何，`use` 导入仍然不能在模块或块中创建同名的重复绑定。"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:140
msgid "// error[E0252]: the name `mymac` is defined multiple times.\n"
msgstr "// error[E0252]: 名称 `mymac` 被定义了多次。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:11
msgid ""
"A _scope_ is the region of source text where a named [entity](../names.md) "
"may be referenced with that name. The following sections provide details on "
"the scoping rules and behavior, which depend on the kind of entity and where "
"it is declared. The process of how names are resolved to entities is "
"described in the [name resolution](name-resolution.md) chapter. More "
"information on \"drop scopes\" used for the purpose of running destructors "
"may be found in the [destructors](../destructors.md) chapter."
msgstr ""
"_作用域_ 是源文本中的一个区域，在该区域内，具名[实体](../names.md)可以通过该"
"名称被引用。以下各节详细说明作用域规则和行为，这些规则和行为取决于实体的种类"
"及其声明位置。名称如何解析为实体的过程在[名称解析](name-resolution.md)一章中"
"描述。关于用于运行析构器的 \"drop scopes\" 的更多信息，可以在[析构器](../"
"destructors.md)一章中找到。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:17
msgid "Item scopes"
msgstr "项作用域"

#: src/names/scopes.md:23
msgid ""
"The name of an [item](../items.md) declared directly in a [module](../items/"
"modules.md) has a scope that extends from the start of the module to the end "
"of the module. These items are also members of the module and can be "
"referred to with a [path](../paths.md) leading from their module."
msgstr ""
"直接在[模块](../items/modules.md)中声明的[项](../items.md)的名称，其作用域从"
"该模块的开头延伸到该模块的末尾。这些项也是该模块的成员，并且可以通过从其模块"
"引出的[路径](../paths.md)来引用。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:29
msgid ""
"The name of an item declared as a [statement](../statements.md) has a scope "
"that extends from the start of the block the item statement is in until the "
"end of the block."
msgstr ""
"作为[语句](../statements.md)声明的项的名称，其作用域从该项语句所在块的开头延"
"伸到该块的末尾。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:35
msgid ""
"It is an error to introduce an item with a duplicate name of another item in "
"the same [namespace](namespaces.md) within the same module or block. "
"[Asterisk glob imports](../items/use-declarations.md) have special behavior "
"for dealing with duplicate names and shadowing, see the linked chapter for "
"more details."
msgstr ""
"在同一模块或块内，如果在同一[命名空间](namespaces.md)中引入一个与另一项名称重"
"复的项，则是错误。[星号 glob 导入](../items/use-declarations.md)在处理重复名"
"称和遮蔽时具有特殊行为，更多细节见链接章节。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:41
msgid "Items in a module may shadow items in a [prelude](#prelude-scopes)."
msgstr "模块中的项可以遮蔽 [prelude](#prelude-scopes) 中的项。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:47
msgid ""
"Item names from outer modules are not in scope within a nested module. A "
"[path](../paths.md) may be used to refer to an item in another module."
msgstr ""
"外层模块中的项名称在嵌套模块内不在作用域中。可以使用[路径](../paths.md)来引用"
"另一个模块中的项。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:53
msgid "Associated item scopes"
msgstr "关联项作用域"

#: src/names/scopes.md:59
msgid ""
"[Associated items](../items/associated-items.md) are not scoped and can only "
"be referred to by using a [path](../paths.md) leading from the type or trait "
"they are associated with. [Methods](../items/associated-items.md#methods) "
"can also be referred to via [call expressions](../expressions/call-expr.md)."
msgstr ""
"[关联项](../items/associated-items.md)没有作用域，只能通过从其关联的类型或 "
"trait 引出的[路径](../paths.md)来引用。[方法](../items/associated-"
"items.md#methods)也可以通过[调用表达式](../expressions/call-expr.md)来引用。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:65
msgid ""
"Similar to items within a module or block,  it is an error to introduce an "
"item within a trait or implementation that is a duplicate of another item in "
"the trait or impl in the same namespace."
msgstr ""
"与模块或块内的项类似，如果在 trait 或实现内引入的项与该 trait 或 impl 中同一"
"命名空间内的另一项重复，则是错误。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:71
msgid "Pattern binding scopes"
msgstr "模式绑定作用域"

#: src/names/scopes.md:73
msgid ""
"The scope of a local variable [pattern](../patterns.md) binding depends on "
"where it is used:"
msgstr "局部变量[模式](../patterns.md)绑定的作用域取决于其使用位置："

#: src/names/scopes.md:79
msgid ""
"[`let` statement](../statements.md#let-statements) bindings range from just "
"after the `let` statement until the end of the block where it is declared."
msgstr ""
"[`let` 语句](../statements.md#let-statements)绑定的范围从该 `let` 语句之后开"
"始，直到其声明所在块的末尾。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:84
msgid ""
"[Function parameter](../items/functions.md#function-parameters) bindings are "
"within the body of the function."
msgstr ""
"[函数参数](../items/functions.md#function-parameters)绑定位于函数体内。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:89
msgid ""
"[Closure parameter](../expressions/closure-expr.md) bindings are within the "
"closure body."
msgstr "[闭包参数](../expressions/closure-expr.md)绑定位于闭包体内。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:94
msgid ""
"[`for`](../expressions/loop-expr.md#iterator-loops) bindings are within the "
"loop body."
msgstr "[`for`](../expressions/loop-expr.md#iterator-loops) 绑定位于循环体内。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:99
msgid ""
"[`if let`](../expressions/if-expr.md#if-let-patterns) and [`while let`](../"
"expressions/loop-expr.md#while-let-patterns) bindings are valid in the "
"following conditions as well as the consequent block."
msgstr ""
"[`if let`](../expressions/if-expr.md#if-let-patterns) 和 [`while let`](../"
"expressions/loop-expr.md#while-let-patterns) 绑定在后续条件以及结果块中有效。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:104
msgid ""
"[`match` arms](../expressions/match-expr.md) bindings are within the [match "
"guard](../expressions/match-expr.md#match-guards) and the match arm "
"expression."
msgstr ""
"[`match` 分支](../expressions/match-expr.md)绑定位于 [match 守卫](../"
"expressions/match-expr.md#match-guards)和 match 分支表达式内。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:109
msgid ""
"[`match` guard `let`](../expressions/match-expr.md#r-expr.match.guard.let) "
"bindings are valid in the following guard conditions and the match arm "
"expression."
msgstr ""
"[`match` 守卫 `let`](../expressions/match-expr.md#r-expr.match.guard.let) 绑"
"定在后续守卫条件和 match 分支表达式中有效。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:115
msgid "Local variable scopes do not extend into item declarations."
msgstr "局部变量作用域不会延伸到项声明中。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:118
msgid "Pattern binding shadowing"
msgstr "模式绑定遮蔽"

#: src/names/scopes.md:124
msgid ""
"Pattern bindings are allowed to shadow any name in scope with the following "
"exceptions which are an error:"
msgstr "模式绑定允许遮蔽作用域内的任何名称，但以下例外会构成错误："

#: src/names/scopes.md:126
msgid "[Const generic parameters](../items/generics.md#const-generics)"
msgstr "[const 泛型参数](../items/generics.md#const-generics)"

#: src/names/scopes.md:127
msgid "[Static items](../items/static-items.md)"
msgstr "[静态项](../items/static-items.md)"

#: src/names/scopes.md:128
msgid "[Const items](../items/constant-items.md)"
msgstr "[常量项](../items/constant-items.md)"

#: src/names/scopes.md:129
msgid ""
"Constructors for [structs](../items/structs.md) and [enums](../items/"
"enumerations.md)"
msgstr ""
"[结构体](../items/structs.md)和[枚举](../items/enumerations.md)的构造器"

#: src/names/scopes.md:131
msgid ""
"The following example illustrates how local bindings can shadow item "
"declarations:"
msgstr "以下示例展示局部绑定如何遮蔽项声明："

#: src/names/scopes.md:135
msgid ""
"// Since there are no local variables in scope yet, this resolves to the "
"function.\n"
msgstr "// 由于作用域中尚无局部变量，因此这里解析为函数。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:136
msgid "// prints `function`\n"
msgstr "// 打印 `function`\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:137
msgid "\"closure\""
msgstr "\"closure\""

#: src/names/scopes.md:138
msgid "\"function\""
msgstr "\"function\""

#: src/names/scopes.md:139
msgid "// This resolves to the local closure since it shadows the item.\n"
msgstr "// 这里解析为局部闭包，因为它遮蔽了该项。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:140
msgid "// prints `closure`\n"
msgstr "// 打印 `closure`\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:148
msgid "Generic parameter scopes"
msgstr "泛型参数作用域"

#: src/names/scopes.md:154
msgid ""
"Generic parameters are declared in a [GenericParams](../items/"
"generics.md#grammar-GenericParams) list. The scope of a generic parameter is "
"within the item it is declared on."
msgstr ""
"泛型参数在 [GenericParams](../items/generics.md#grammar-GenericParams) 列表中"
"声明。泛型参数的作用域位于声明它的项内。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:160
msgid ""
"All parameters are in scope within the generic parameter list regardless of "
"the order they are declared. The following shows some examples where a "
"parameter may be referenced before it is declared:"
msgstr ""
"无论声明顺序如何，所有参数都在泛型参数列表内的作用域中。以下展示一些参数可以"
"在声明前被引用的示例："

#: src/names/scopes.md:163
msgid "// The 'b bound is referenced before it is declared.\n"
msgstr "// 'b 约束在声明前被引用。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:166
msgid ""
"// The const N is referenced in the trait bound before it is declared.\n"
msgstr "// const N 在声明前于 trait 约束中被引用。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:175
msgid ""
"Generic parameters are also in scope for type bounds and where clauses, for "
"example:"
msgstr "泛型参数也在类型约束和 where 子句的作用域中，例如："

#: src/names/scopes.md:178
msgid ""
"// The <'a, U> for `SomeTrait` refer to the 'a and U parameters of "
"`bounds_scope`.\n"
msgstr "// `SomeTrait` 的 <'a, U> 指代 `bounds_scope` 的 'a 和 U 参数。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:191
msgid ""
"It is an error for [items](../items.md) declared inside a function to refer "
"to a generic parameter from their outer scope."
msgstr "在函数内部声明的[项](../items.md)引用其外层作用域中的泛型参数是错误。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:195
msgid "// ERROR: can't use generic parameters from outer function\n"
msgstr "// ERROR: 不能使用外层函数的泛型参数\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:199
msgid "Generic parameter shadowing"
msgstr "泛型参数遮蔽"

#: src/names/scopes.md:205
msgid ""
"It is an error to shadow a generic parameter with the exception that items "
"declared within functions are allowed to shadow generic parameter names from "
"the function."
msgstr ""
"遮蔽泛型参数是错误，但有一个例外：在函数内声明的项允许遮蔽来自该函数的泛型参"
"数名称。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:209
msgid ""
"// Items within functions are allowed to shadow generic parameter in scope.\n"
msgstr "// 函数内的项允许遮蔽作用域中的泛型参数。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:218
msgid "// ERROR: 'a is already in use\n"
msgstr "// ERROR: 'a 已被使用\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:219 src/names/scopes.md:221
msgid "// ERROR: T is already in use\n"
msgstr "// ERROR: T 已被使用\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:220
msgid "// ERROR: N is already in use\n"
msgstr "// ERROR: N 已被使用\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:229
msgid "Lifetime scopes"
msgstr "生命周期作用域"

#: src/names/scopes.md:231
msgid ""
"Lifetime parameters are declared in a [GenericParams](../items/"
"generics.md#grammar-GenericParams) list and [higher-ranked trait bounds](../"
"trait-bounds.md#higher-ranked-trait-bounds)."
msgstr ""
"生命周期参数在 [GenericParams](../items/generics.md#grammar-GenericParams) 列"
"表和[高阶 trait 约束](../trait-bounds.md#higher-ranked-trait-bounds)中声明。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:237
msgid ""
"The `'static` lifetime and [placeholder lifetime](../lifetime-elision.md) "
"`'_` have a special meaning and cannot be declared as a parameter."
msgstr ""
"`'static` 生命周期和[占位生命周期](../lifetime-elision.md) `'_` 具有特殊含"
"义，不能声明为参数。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:239
msgid "Lifetime generic parameter scopes"
msgstr "生命周期泛型参数作用域"

#: src/names/scopes.md:245
msgid ""
"[Constant](../items/constant-items.md) and [static](../items/static-"
"items.md) items and [const contexts](../const_eval.md#const-context) only "
"ever allow `'static` lifetime references, so no other lifetime may be in "
"scope within them. [Associated consts](../items/associated-"
"items.md#associated-constants) do allow referring to lifetimes declared in "
"their trait or implementation."
msgstr ""
"[常量](../items/constant-items.md)项、[静态](../items/static-items.md)项以及 "
"[const 上下文](../const_eval.md#const-context)始终只允许 `'static` 生命周期引"
"用，因此其中不能有其他生命周期在作用域中。[关联常量](../items/associated-"
"items.md#associated-constants)确实允许引用在其 trait 或实现中声明的生命周期。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:247
msgid "Higher-ranked trait bound scopes"
msgstr "高阶 trait 约束作用域"

#: src/names/scopes.md:253
msgid ""
"The scope of a lifetime parameter declared as a [higher-ranked trait bound]"
"(../trait-bounds.md#higher-ranked-trait-bounds) depends on the scenario "
"where it is used."
msgstr ""
"声明为[高阶 trait 约束](../trait-bounds.md#higher-ranked-trait-bounds)的生命"
"周期参数，其作用域取决于它的使用场景。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:255
msgid ""
"As a [TypeBoundWhereClauseItem](../items/generics.md#grammar-"
"TypeBoundWhereClauseItem) the declared lifetimes are in scope in the type "
"and the type bounds."
msgstr ""
"作为 [TypeBoundWhereClauseItem](../items/generics.md#grammar-"
"TypeBoundWhereClauseItem) 时，声明的生命周期在类型和类型约束中处于作用域内。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:256
msgid ""
"As a [TraitBound](../trait-bounds.md#grammar-TraitBound) the declared "
"lifetimes are in scope within the bound type path."
msgstr ""
"作为 [TraitBound](../trait-bounds.md#grammar-TraitBound) 时，声明的生命周期在"
"约束类型路径内处于作用域内。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:257
msgid ""
"As a [BareFunctionType](../types/function-pointer.md#grammar-"
"BareFunctionType) the declared lifetimes are in scope within the function "
"parameters and return type."
msgstr ""
"作为 [BareFunctionType](../types/function-pointer.md#grammar-"
"BareFunctionType) 时，声明的生命周期在函数参数和返回类型内处于作用域内。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:263
msgid "// 'a is in scope in both the type and the type bounds.\n"
msgstr "// 'a 在类型和类型约束中都处于作用域内。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:268
msgid "// 'a is in scope within the bound.\n"
msgstr "// 'a 在约束内处于作用域内。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:275
msgid "// 'a is in scope in both the parameters and return type.\n"
msgstr "// 'a 在参数和返回类型中都处于作用域内。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:280
msgid "Impl trait restrictions"
msgstr "Impl trait 限制"

#: src/names/scopes.md:286
msgid ""
"[Impl trait](../types/impl-trait.md) types can only reference lifetimes "
"declared on a function or implementation."
msgstr ""
"[Impl trait](../types/impl-trait.md) 类型只能引用在函数或实现上声明的生命周"
"期。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:305
msgid ""
"// The `impl Trait2` here is not allowed to refer to 'b but it is allowed "
"to\n"
"// refer to 'a.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 这里的 `impl Trait2` 不允许引用 'b，但允许\n"
"// 引用 'a。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:318
msgid "Loop label scopes"
msgstr "循环标签作用域"

#: src/names/scopes.md:324
msgid ""
"[Loop labels](../expressions/loop-expr.md#loop-labels) may be declared by a "
"[loop expression](../expressions/loop-expr.md). The scope of a loop label is "
"from the point it is declared till the end of the loop expression. The scope "
"does not extend into [items](../items.md), [closures](../expressions/closure-"
"expr.md), [async blocks](../expressions/block-expr.md#async-blocks), [const "
"arguments](../items/generics.md#const-generics), [const contexts](../"
"const_eval.md#const-context), and the iterator expression of the defining "
"[`for` loop](../expressions/loop-expr.md#iterator-loops)."
msgstr ""
"[循环标签](../expressions/loop-expr.md#loop-labels)可以由[循环表达式](../"
"expressions/loop-expr.md)声明。循环标签的作用域从其声明点开始，直到循环表达式"
"的末尾。该作用域不会延伸到[项](../items.md)、[闭包](../expressions/closure-"
"expr.md)、[async 块](../expressions/block-expr.md#async-blocks)、[const 参数]"
"(../items/generics.md#const-generics)、[const 上下文](../const_eval.md#const-"
"context)，以及定义该标签的 [`for` 循环](../expressions/loop-expr.md#iterator-"
"loops)的迭代表达式中。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:332
msgid ""
"// Using 'a here would be an error.\n"
"        // break 'a;\n"
msgstr ""
"// 在这里使用 'a 会是错误。\n"
"        // break 'a;\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:336
msgid "// The label is in scope for the expression of `while` loops.\n"
msgstr "// 该标签在 `while` 循环的表达式中处于作用域内。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:338 src/names/scopes.md:339
msgid "// Loop does not run.\n"
msgstr "// 循环不会运行。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:340
msgid "// The label is not in scope in the defining `for` loop:\n"
msgstr "// 该标签在定义它的 `for` 循环中不在作用域内：\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:343
msgid ""
"// This will break the outer loop, skipping the inner loop and stopping\n"
"    // the outer loop.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 这会跳出外层循环，跳过内层循环并停止\n"
"    // 外层循环。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:346
msgid "// This does not run.\n"
msgstr "// 这里不会运行。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:348
msgid "// This does not run, either.\n"
msgstr "// 这里也不会运行。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:357
msgid ""
"Loop labels may shadow labels of the same name in outer scopes. References "
"to a label refer to the closest definition."
msgstr "循环标签可以遮蔽外层作用域中同名的标签。对标签的引用指向最近的定义。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:360
msgid "// Loop label shadowing example.\n"
msgstr "// 循环标签遮蔽示例。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:363
msgid ""
"// This terminates the inner loop, but the outer loop continues to run.\n"
msgstr "// 这会终止内层循环，但外层循环会继续运行。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:373
msgid "Prelude scopes"
msgstr "Prelude 作用域"

#: src/names/scopes.md:379
msgid ""
"[Preludes](preludes.md) bring entities into scope of every module. The "
"entities are not members of the module, but are implicitly queried during "
"[name resolution](name-resolution.md)."
msgstr ""
"[Preludes](preludes.md) 将实体带入每个模块的作用域中。这些实体不是模块的成"
"员，但会在[名称解析](name-resolution.md)期间被隐式查询。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:385
msgid "The prelude names may be shadowed by declarations in a module."
msgstr "prelude 名称可以被模块中的声明遮蔽。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:391
msgid ""
"The preludes are layered such that one shadows another if they contain "
"entities of the same name. The order that preludes may shadow other preludes "
"is the following where earlier entries may shadow later ones:"
msgstr ""
"prelude 是分层的，因此如果它们包含同名实体，一个 prelude 会遮蔽另一个 "
"prelude。prelude 可以遮蔽其他 prelude 的顺序如下，其中较早的条目可以遮蔽较后"
"的条目："

#: src/names/scopes.md:393
msgid "[Extern prelude](preludes.md#extern-prelude)"
msgstr "[Extern prelude](preludes.md#extern-prelude)"

#: src/names/scopes.md:394
msgid "[Tool prelude](preludes.md#tool-prelude)"
msgstr "[Tool prelude](preludes.md#tool-prelude)"

#: src/names/scopes.md:395
msgid "[`macro_use` prelude](preludes.md#macro_use-prelude)"
msgstr "[`macro_use` prelude](preludes.md#macro_use-prelude)"

#: src/names/scopes.md:396
msgid "[Standard library prelude](preludes.md#standard-library-prelude)"
msgstr "[标准库 prelude](preludes.md#standard-library-prelude)"

#: src/names/scopes.md:397
msgid "[Language prelude](preludes.md#language-prelude)"
msgstr "[语言 prelude](preludes.md#language-prelude)"

#: src/names/scopes.md:403
msgid "`macro_rules` scopes"
msgstr "`macro_rules` 作用域"

#: src/names/scopes.md:405
msgid ""
"The scope of `macro_rules` macros is described in the [Macros By Example](../"
"macros-by-example.md) chapter. The behavior depends on the use of the "
"[`macro_use`](../macros-by-example.md#the-macro_use-attribute) and "
"[`macro_export`](../macros-by-example.md#the-macro_export-attribute) "
"attributes."
msgstr ""
"`macro_rules` 宏的作用域在 [Macros By Example](../macros-by-example.md) 章节"
"中描述。其行为取决于 [`macro_use`](../macros-by-example.md#the-macro_use-"
"attribute) 和 [`macro_export`](../macros-by-example.md#the-macro_export-"
"attribute) 属性的使用。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:417
msgid ""
"[Derive macro helper attributes](../procedural-macros.md#derive-macro-helper-"
"attributes) are in scope in the item where their corresponding [`derive` "
"attribute](../attributes/derive.md) is specified. The scope extends from "
"just after the `derive` attribute to the end of the item. <!-- Note: Not "
"strictly true, see https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/issues/79202, but this "
"is the intention. -->"
msgstr ""
"[派生宏辅助属性](../procedural-macros.md#derive-macro-helper-attributes)在指"
"定其对应 [`derive` 属性](../attributes/derive.md)的项中处于作用域内。该作用域"
"从 `derive` 属性之后开始，延伸到该项的末尾。<!-- Note: Not strictly true, "
"see https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/issues/79202, but this is the "
"intention. -->"

#: src/names/scopes.md:423
msgid "Helper attributes shadow other attributes of the same name in scope."
msgstr "辅助属性会遮蔽作用域中同名的其他属性。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:429
msgid "`Self` scope"
msgstr "`Self` 作用域"

#: src/names/scopes.md:435
msgid ""
"Although [`Self`](../paths.md#self-1) is a keyword with special meaning, it "
"interacts with name resolution in a way similar to normal names."
msgstr ""
"虽然 [`Self`](../paths.md#self-1) 是具有特殊含义的关键字，但它以类似普通名称"
"的方式与名称解析交互。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:441
msgid ""
"The implicit `Self` type in the definition of a [struct](../items/"
"structs.md), [enum](../items/enumerations.mdr), [union](../items/unions.md), "
"[trait](../items/traits.md), or [implementation](../items/"
"implementations.md) is treated similarly to a [generic parameter](#generic-"
"parameter-scopes), and is in scope in the same way as a generic type "
"parameter."
msgstr ""
"[结构体](../items/structs.md)、[枚举](../items/enumerations.mdr)、[联合体]"
"(../items/unions.md)、[trait](../items/traits.md)或[实现](../items/"
"implementations.md)定义中的隐式 `Self` 类型，会被类似[泛型参数](#generic-"
"parameter-scopes)地处理，并以与泛型类型参数相同的方式处于作用域内。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:447
msgid ""
"The implicit `Self` constructor in the value [namespace](namespaces.md) of "
"an [implementation](../items/implementations.md) is in scope within the body "
"of the implementation (the implementation's [associated items](../items/"
"associated-items.md))."
msgstr ""
"[实现](../items/implementations.md)的值[命名空间](namespaces.md)中的隐式 "
"`Self` 构造器，在该实现的主体（该实现的[关联项](../items/associated-"
"items.md)）内处于作用域内。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:450
msgid "// Self type within struct definition.\n"
msgstr "// 结构体定义内的 Self 类型。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:454
msgid "// Self type within generic parameters.\n"
msgstr "// 泛型参数内的 Self 类型。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:457
msgid "// Self value constructor within an implementation.\n"
msgstr "// 实现内的 Self 值构造器。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:461
msgid "// Self type\n"
msgstr "// Self 类型\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:462
msgid "// Self value constructor\n"
msgstr "// Self 值构造器\n"

#: src/names/preludes.md:11
msgid ""
"A _prelude_ is a collection of names that are automatically brought into "
"scope of every module in a crate."
msgstr ""
"<em>prelude</em>（预导入集）是一组会自动引入到 crate 中每个模块作用域内的名"
"称。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:13
msgid ""
"These prelude names are not part of the module itself: they are implicitly "
"queried during [name resolution](name-resolution.md). For example, even "
"though something like [`Box`](../../alloc/boxed/struct.Box.html) is in scope "
"in every module, you cannot refer to it as `self::Box` because it is not a "
"member of the current module."
msgstr ""
"这些 prelude 名称并不是模块本身的一部分：它们会在[名称解析](name-"
"resolution.md)期间被隐式查询。例如，尽管像 [`Box`](../../alloc/boxed/"
"struct.Box.html) 这样的名称在每个模块中都在作用域内，但你不能用 `self::Box` "
"指代它，因为它不是当前模块的成员。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:19
msgid "There are several different preludes:"
msgstr "存在几种不同的 prelude："

#: src/names/preludes.md:21
msgid "[Standard library prelude](preludes.md#r-names.preludes.std)"
