msgstr "`no_implicit_prelude` 属性"

#: src/names/preludes.md:286
msgid ""
"The _`no_implicit_prelude` [attribute](../attributes.md)_ is used to prevent "
"implicit preludes from being brought into scope."
msgstr ""
"_`no_implicit_prelude` [属性](../attributes.md)_ 用于阻止隐式 prelude 被引入"
"作用域。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:293
