#: src/names/preludes.md:318
msgid ""
"The `no_implicit_prelude` attribute may only be applied to the crate or to a "
"module."
msgstr "`no_implicit_prelude` 属性只能应用于 crate 或模块。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:333
msgid ""
"The `no_implicit_prelude` attribute may be used any number of times on a "
"form."
msgstr "`no_implicit_prelude` 属性可以在一个形式上使用任意多次。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:348
msgid ""
"The `no_implicit_prelude` attribute prevents the [standard library prelude]"
"(preludes.md#r-names.preludes.std), [extern prelude](#extern-prelude), "
"[`macro_use` prelude](#macro_use-prelude), and the [tool prelude](#tool-"
"prelude) from being brought into scope for the module and its descendants."
msgstr ""
"`no_implicit_prelude` 属性会阻止[标准库 prelude](preludes.md#r-"
"names.preludes.std)、[extern prelude](#extern-prelude)、[`macro_use` prelude]"
"(#macro_use-prelude)和[工具 prelude](#tool-prelude)被引入该模块及其后代的作用"
"域。"

