#: src/paths.md:809
msgid ""
"Paths in expressions allow for paths with generic arguments to be specified. "
"They are used in various places in [expressions](expressions.md) and "
"[patterns](patterns.md)."
msgstr ""
"表达式中的路径允许指定带有泛型实参的路径。它们用于[表达式](expressions.md)和"
"[模式](patterns.md)中的多种位置。"

#: src/paths.md:815
msgid ""
"The `::` token is required before the opening `<` for generic arguments to "
"avoid ambiguity with the less-than operator. This is colloquially known as "
"\"turbofish\" syntax."
msgstr ""
"为避免与小于运算符产生歧义，泛型实参的开头 `<` 前必须有 `::` token。这通常称"
"为 “turbofish” 语法。"

#: src/paths.md:826
msgid ""
"The order of generic arguments is restricted to lifetime arguments, then "
"type arguments, then const arguments, then equality constraints."
msgstr ""
"泛型实参的顺序限定为：先是生命周期实参，然后是类型实参，然后是 const 实参，最"
"后是等式约束。"

#: src/paths.md:832
msgid ""
"Const arguments must be surrounded by braces unless they are a [literal]"
"(expressions/literal-expr.md), an [inferred const](items/generics.md#r-"
"items.generics.const.inferred), or a single segment path. An [inferred const]"
"(items/generics.md#r-items.generics.const.inferred) may not be surrounded by "
"braces."
msgstr ""
"const 实参必须用花括号括起来，除非它们是[字面量](expressions/literal-"
"expr.md)、[推断 const](items/generics.md#r-items.generics.const.inferred)或单"
"段路径。[推断 const](items/generics.md#r-items.generics.const.inferred) 不能"
"用花括号括起来。"

#: src/paths.md:845
msgid "// Multi-segment path must be braced.\n"
msgstr "// Multi-segment path must be braced.\n"

#: src/paths.md:858
msgid ""
"In a generic argument list, an [inferred const](items/generics.md#r-"
"items.generics.const.inferred) is parsed as an [inferred type](types/"
"inferred.md#grammar-InferredType) but then semantically treated as a "
"separate kind of [const generic argument](items/generics.md#r-"
"items.generics.const.argument)."
msgstr ""
"在泛型实参列表中，[推断 const](items/generics.md#r-"
"items.generics.const.inferred) 会被解析为[推断类型](types/"
"inferred.md#grammar-InferredType)，但随后在语义上被视为一种单独的 [const 泛型"
"实参](items/generics.md#r-items.generics.const.argument)。"

#: src/paths.md:867
msgid ""
"The synthetic type parameters corresponding to `impl Trait` types are "
"implicit, and these cannot be explicitly specified."
msgstr "与 `impl Trait` 类型对应的合成类型参数是隐式的，不能显式指定这些参数。"

