"Multiple glob imports are allowed to import the same name, and that name is "
"allowed to be used if the imports are of the same item (following "
"reexports). The visibility of the name is the maximum visibility of the "
"imports."
msgstr ""
"允许多个 glob 导入导入同一个名称；如果这些导入（跟随重导出后）指向同一个项，"
"则该名称允许被使用。该名称的可见性是这些导入中的最大可见性。"

