"    //\n"
"    // The visibility of `Ambig` is `pub` because that is the\n"
"    // maximum visibility between these two `use` declarations.\n"
msgstr ""
"// These both import the same `Ambig`.\n"
"    //\n"
"    // The visibility of `Ambig` is `pub` because that is the\n"
"    // maximum visibility between these two `use` declarations.\n"

