#: src/names/name-resolution.md:305
msgid ""
"Names in imports and macro invocations may not be resolved through glob "
"imports when there is another candidate available in an [outer scope](#r-"
"names.resolution.general.scopes)."
msgstr ""
"当[外层作用域](#r-names.resolution.general.scopes)中有另一个可用候选时，导入"
"和宏调用中的名称不得通过 glob 导入解析。"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:315
msgid ""
"When one of [`core::panic!`](../../core/macro.panic.html) or [`std::panic!`]"
"(../../std/macro.panic.html) is brought into scope due to the [standard "
"library prelude](./preludes.md#r-names.preludes.std), and a user-written "
"[glob import](../items/use-declarations.md#r-items.use.glob) brings the "
"other into scope, `rustc` currently allows use of `panic!`, even though it "
"is ambiguous. The user-written glob import takes precedence to resolve this "
"ambiguity."
msgstr ""
"当 [`core::panic!`](../../core/macro.panic.html) 或 [`std::panic!`](../../"
"std/macro.panic.html) 之一由于[标准库 prelude](./preludes.md#r-"
"names.preludes.std)进入作用域，并且用户编写的 [glob 导入](../items/use-"
"declarations.md#r-items.use.glob)将另一个带入作用域时，即使存在歧义，`rustc` "
"目前也允许使用 `panic!`。用户编写的 glob 导入会优先用于解析此歧义。"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:317
msgid ""
"In Rust 2021 and later, [`core::panic!`](../../core/macro.panic.html) and "
"[`std::panic!`](../../std/macro.panic.html) operate identically. But in "
"earlier editions, they differ; only [`std::panic!`](../../std/"
"macro.panic.html) accepts a [`String`](../../alloc/string/"
"struct.String.html) as the format argument."
msgstr ""
"在 Rust 2021 及以后，[`core::panic!`](../../core/macro.panic.html) 和 "
"[`std::panic!`](../../std/macro.panic.html) 的行为相同。但在更早的 edition 中"
"它们不同；只有 [`std::panic!`](../../std/macro.panic.html) 接受 [`String`]"
"(../../alloc/string/struct.String.html) 作为格式实参。"

