"此行为的复杂性。此歧义错误将来可能会被移除。"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:463
msgid ""
"Macros are resolved by iterating through the available scopes to find the "
"available candidates. Macros are split into two sub-namespaces, one for "
"function-like macros, and the other for attributes and derives. Resolution "
"candidates from the incorrect sub-namespace are ignored."
msgstr ""
"解析宏时，会遍历可用作用域以查找可用候选。宏分为两个子命名空间，一个用于类函"
"数宏，另一个用于属性和 derive。来自错误子命名空间的解析候选会被忽略。"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:469
msgid ""
"The available scope kinds are visited in the following order. Each of these "
"scope kinds represent one or more scopes."
msgstr ""
"可用的作用域种类会按以下顺序访问。每种作用域种类都代表一个或多个作用域。"

