msgid ""
"The compiler will attempt to resolve derive helpers that are used before "
"their associated macro introduces them into scope. This scope is visited "
"after the scope for resolving derive helper candidates that are correctly in "
"scope. This behavior is slated for removal."
msgstr ""
"编译器会尝试解析在其关联宏将它们引入作用域之前使用的 derive 辅助属性。这个作"
"用域会在用于解析已正确进入作用域的 derive 辅助属性候选的作用域之后访问。此行"
"为计划移除。"

