"作用域交错访问它们。"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:502
msgid ""
"Starting in edition 2018 the `#[macro_use]` prelude is not visited when "
"[`#[no_implicit_prelude]`](preludes.md#r-names.preludes.no_implicit_prelude) "
"is present."
msgstr ""
