"names.preludes.no_implicit_prelude) 时，不会访问 `#[macro_use]` prelude。"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:511
msgid ""
"The names `cfg` and `cfg_attr` are reserved in the macro attribute [sub-"
"namespace](../names/namespaces.md#r-names.namespaces.sub-namespaces)."
msgstr ""
"名称 `cfg` 和 `cfg_attr` 保留在宏属性[子命名空间](../names/namespaces.md#r-"
"names.namespaces.sub-namespaces)中。"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:523
msgid ""
"Names may not be resolved through ambiguous candidates inside of macro "
"expansions. Candidates inside of macro expansions are ambiguous when they "
"would shadow a candidate for the same name from outside of the first "
"candidate's macro expansion and the invocation of the name being resolved is "
"also from outside of the first candidate's macro expansion."
msgstr ""
"名称不得通过宏展开内的有歧义候选来解析。当宏展开内的候选会遮蔽来自第一个候选"
"的宏展开之外的同名候选，并且正在解析的名称的调用也来自第一个候选的宏展开之外"
"时，宏展开内的这些候选就是有歧义的。"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:533
msgid "// Introduce outer candidate definition for `ambig` macro invocation.\n"
msgstr ""
"// Introduce outer candidate definition for `ambig` macro invocation.\n"

