#: src/inline-assembly.md:1059 src/glossary.md:146
msgid "Scope"
msgstr "作用域"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1065
msgid "Inline assembly can be used in one of three ways."
msgstr "内联汇编可以通过三种方式之一使用。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1071
msgid ""
"With the `asm!` macro, the assembly code is emitted in a function scope and "
"integrated into the compiler-generated assembly code of a function. This "
"assembly code must obey [strict rules](#rules-for-inline-assembly) to avoid "
"undefined behavior. Note that in some cases the compiler may choose to emit "
"the assembly code as a separate function and generate a call to it."
msgstr ""
"使用 `asm!` 宏时，汇编代码会在函数作用域中发出，并集成到编译器生成的函数汇编"
"代码中。此汇编代码必须遵守[严格规则](#rules-for-inline-assembly)，以避免未定"
"义行为。注意，在某些情况下，编译器可能会选择将汇编代码作为单独的函数发出，并"
"生成对它的调用。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1075 src/inline-assembly.md:1089
#: src/inline-assembly.md:1103 src/inline-assembly.md:1205
#: src/inline-assembly.md:1220 src/inline-assembly.md:1333
#: src/inline-assembly.md:1360 src/inline-assembly.md:1633
#: src/inline-assembly.md:1637 src/inline-assembly.md:1641
#: src/inline-assembly.md:1645 src/inline-assembly.md:1648
#: src/inline-assembly.md:1657 src/inline-assembly.md:1813
#: src/inline-assembly.md:1860
msgid "\"/* {} */\""
msgstr "\"/* {} */\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1083
msgid ""
"With the `naked_asm!` macro, the assembly code is emitted in a function "
"scope and constitutes the full assembly code of a function. The `naked_asm!` "
"macro is only allowed in [naked functions](attributes/codegen.md#the-naked-"
"attribute)."
msgstr ""
"使用 `naked_asm!` 宏时，汇编代码会在函数作用域中发出，并构成函数的完整汇编代"
"码。`naked_asm!` 宏只允许用于 [naked 函数](attributes/codegen.md#the-naked-"
"attribute)。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1098
msgid ""
"With the `global_asm!` macro, the assembly code is emitted in a global "
"scope, outside a function. This can be used to hand-write entire functions "
"using assembly code, and generally provides much more freedom to use "
"arbitrary registers and assembler directives."
msgstr ""
"使用 `global_asm!` 宏时，汇编代码会在函数外部的全局作用域中发出。这可用于用汇"
"编代码手写整个函数，并且通常为使用任意寄存器和汇编器指令提供大得多的自由度。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1110
msgid "Template string arguments"
msgstr "模板字符串参数"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1116
msgid ""
"The assembler template uses the same syntax as [format strings](../alloc/fmt/"
"index.html#syntax) (i.e. placeholders are specified by curly braces)."
msgstr ""
"汇编器模板使用与[格式字符串](../alloc/fmt/index.html#syntax)相同的语法（即，"
"占位符由花括号指定）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1122
msgid ""
"The corresponding arguments are accessed in order, by index, or by name."
msgstr "对应的参数会按顺序、按索引或按名称访问。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1128
msgid "// This\n"
msgstr "// 这样\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1130 src/inline-assembly.md:1831
msgid "\"mov {}, {}\""
msgstr "\"mov {}, {}\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1130
msgid "// ... this\n"
msgstr "// ... 这样\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1132
msgid "\"mov {0}, {1}\""
msgstr "\"mov {0}, {1}\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1132
msgid "// ... and this\n"
msgstr "// ... 以及这样\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1134
msgid "\"mov {out}, {in}\""
msgstr "\"mov {out}, {in}\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1134
msgid "// all have the same behavior\n"
msgstr "// 都具有相同的行为\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1145
msgid ""
"However, implicit named arguments (introduced by [RFC #2795](https://"
"github.com/rust-lang/rfcs/pull/2795)) are not supported."
msgstr ""
"但是，不支持隐式命名参数（由 [RFC #2795](https://github.com/rust-lang/rfcs/"
"pull/2795) 引入）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1149
msgid ""
"// We can't refer to `x` from the scope directly, we need an operand like "
"`in(reg) x`\n"
msgstr "// 不能直接引用作用域中的 `x`，需要像 `in(reg) x` 这样的操作数\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1151 src/inline-assembly.md:1182
msgid "\"/* {x} */\""
msgstr "\"/* {x} */\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1151
msgid "// ERROR: no argument named x\n"
msgstr "// ERROR：没有名为 x 的参数\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1153 src/inline-assembly.md:1184
#: src/inline-assembly.md:1199 src/inline-assembly.md:1208
#: src/inline-assembly.md:1223 src/inline-assembly.md:1238
#: src/inline-assembly.md:1538 src/inline-assembly.md:1590
#: src/inline-assembly.md:1598 src/inline-assembly.md:1613
#: src/inline-assembly.md:1660 src/inline-assembly.md:1816
#: src/inline-assembly.md:1863 src/inline-assembly.md:1990
#: src/inline-assembly.md:2023 src/inline-assembly.md:2187
#: src/inline-assembly.md:2264 src/inline-assembly.md:2464
#: src/inline-assembly.md:2479 src/inline-assembly.md:2495
#: src/inline-assembly.md:2521
msgid "\"Test not supported on this arch\""
msgstr "\"Test not supported on this arch\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1160
msgid ""
"An `asm!` invocation may have one or more template string arguments; an `asm!"
"` with multiple template string arguments is treated as if all the strings "
"were concatenated with a `\\n` between them. The expected use is for each "
"template string argument to correspond to a line of assembly code."
msgstr ""
"一次 `asm!` 调用可以有一个或多个模板字符串参数；带有多个模板字符串参数的 "
"`asm!` 会被视为所有字符串之间用 `\\n` 连接在一起。预期用法是每个模板字符串参"
"数对应一行汇编代码。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1165
msgid "// We can separate multiple strings as if they were written together\n"
msgstr "// 可以分开写多个字符串，就像它们写在一起一样\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1167
msgid "\"mov eax, 5\""
msgstr "\"mov eax, 5\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1167 src/inline-assembly.md:2150
msgid "\"mov ecx, eax\""
msgstr "\"mov ecx, eax\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1167 src/inline-assembly.md:1595
#: src/inline-assembly.md:1950 src/inline-assembly.md:2128
#: src/inline-assembly.md:2154
msgid "\"rax\""
msgstr "\"rax\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1167
msgid "\"rcx\""
msgstr "\"rcx\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1176
msgid "All template string arguments must appear before any other arguments."
msgstr "所有模板字符串参数都必须出现在任何其他参数之前。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1180
msgid "// The template strings need to appear first in the asm invocation\n"
msgstr "// 模板字符串需要首先出现在 asm 调用中\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1182 src/inline-assembly.md:2380
msgid "\"ud2\""
msgstr "\"ud2\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1182
msgid "// ERROR: unexpected token\n"
msgstr "// ERROR：意外的标记\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1191
msgid ""
"As with format strings, positional arguments must appear before named "
"arguments and explicit [register operands](#register-operands)."
msgstr ""
"与格式字符串一样，位置参数必须出现在命名参数和显式[寄存器操作数](#register-"
"operands)之前。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1194
msgid "// Named operands need to come after positional ones\n"
msgstr "// 命名操作数需要位于位置操作数之后\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1196
msgid "\"/* {x} {} */\""
msgstr "\"/* {x} {} */\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1196 src/inline-assembly.md:1205
msgid ""
"// ERROR: positional arguments cannot follow named arguments or explicit "
"register arguments\n"
msgstr "// ERROR：位置参数不能跟在命名参数或显式寄存器参数之后\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1203
msgid "// We also can't put explicit registers before positional operands\n"
msgstr "// 也不能把显式寄存器放在位置操作数之前\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1205 src/inline-assembly.md:1220
#: src/inline-assembly.md:1567 src/inline-assembly.md:1587
#: src/inline-assembly.md:2671
msgid "\"eax\""
msgstr "\"eax\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1215
msgid ""
"Explicit register operands cannot be used by placeholders in the template "
"string."
msgstr "模板字符串中的占位符不能引用显式寄存器操作数。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1218
msgid ""
"// Explicit register operands don't get substituted, use `eax` explicitly in "
"the string\n"
msgstr "// 显式寄存器操作数不会被替换，请在字符串中显式使用 `eax`\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1220
msgid "// ERROR: invalid reference to argument at index 0\n"
msgstr "// ERROR：对索引 0 处参数的引用无效\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1230
msgid ""
"All other named and positional operands must appear at least once in the "
"template string, otherwise a compiler error is generated."
msgstr ""
"所有其他命名操作数和位置操作数都必须在模板字符串中至少出现一次，否则会生成编"
"译器错误。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1233
msgid "// We have to name all of the operands in the format string\n"
msgstr "// 必须在格式字符串中命名所有操作数\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1235
msgid "// ERROR: multiple unused asm arguments\n"
msgstr "// ERROR：多个未使用的 asm 参数\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1245
msgid ""
"The exact assembly code syntax is target-specific and opaque to the compiler "
"except for the way operands are substituted into the template string to form "
"the code passed to the assembler."
msgstr ""
"确切的汇编代码语法是目标特定的，并且除了操作数被替换进模板字符串以形成传递给"
"汇编器的代码这一方式之外，对编译器是不透明的。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1251
msgid ""
"Currently, all supported targets follow the assembly code syntax used by "
"LLVM's internal assembler which usually corresponds to that of the GNU "
"assembler (GAS). On x86, the `.intel_syntax noprefix` mode of GAS is used by "
"default. On ARM, the `.syntax unified` mode is used. These targets impose an "
"additional restriction on the assembly code: any assembler state (e.g. the "
"current section which can be changed with `.section`) must be restored to "
"its original value at the end of the asm string. Assembly code that does not "
"conform to the GAS syntax will result in assembler-specific behavior. "
"Further constraints on the directives used by inline assembly are indicated "
"by [Directives Support](#directives-support)."
msgstr ""
"目前，所有受支持目标都遵循 LLVM 内部汇编器所用的汇编代码语法，该语法通常对应"
"于 GNU 汇编器（GAS）的语法。在 x86 上，默认使用 GAS 的 `.intel_syntax "
"noprefix` 模式。在 ARM 上，使用 `.syntax unified` 模式。这些目标对汇编代码施"
"加一个额外限制：任何汇编器状态（例如可用 `.section` 改变的当前节）都必须在 "
"asm 字符串结束时恢复为其原始值。不符合 GAS 语法的汇编代码会导致汇编器特定的行"
"为。内联汇编所用汇编器指令的进一步约束由[指令支持](#directives-support)指明。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1266
msgid ""
"Only the [`cfg`](conditional-compilation.md#the-cfg-attribute) and "
"[`cfg_attr`](conditional-compilation.md#the-cfg_attr-attribute) attributes "
"are accepted semantically on inline assembly template strings and operands. "
"Other attributes are parsed but rejected when the assembly macro is expanded."
msgstr ""
"只有 [`cfg`](conditional-compilation.md#the-cfg-attribute) 和 [`cfg_attr`]"
"(conditional-compilation.md#the-cfg_attr-attribute) 属性在内联汇编模板字符串"
"和操作数上会被语义上接受。其他属性会被解析，但在展开汇编宏时被拒绝。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1272 src/inline-assembly.md:1276
msgid "\"abort\""
msgstr "\"abort\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1273
msgid "\".cfi_startproc\""
msgstr "\".cfi_startproc\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1274
msgid ""
"// ...\n"
"    \"ret\""
msgstr ""
"// ...\n"
"    \"ret\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1277 src/inline-assembly.md:2846
msgid "\".cfi_endproc\""
msgstr "\".cfi_endproc\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1285
msgid ""
"In `rustc`, the assembly macros implement handling of these attributes "
"separately from the normal system that handles similar attributes in the "
"language. This accounts for the limited kinds of attributes supported and "
"may give rise to subtle differences in behavior."
msgstr ""
"在 `rustc` 中，汇编宏对这些属性的处理独立于语言中处理类似属性的常规系统。这解"
"释了受支持属性种类有限的原因，也可能产生行为上的细微差异。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1294
msgid ""
"Syntactically there must be at least one template string before the first "
"operand."
msgstr "从语法上讲，在第一个操作数之前必须至少有一个模板字符串。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1297
msgid ""
"// This is rejected because `a = out(reg) x` does not parse as a\n"
"// template string.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 这会被拒绝，因为 `a = out(reg) x` 不会被解析为\n"
"// 模板字符串。\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1301
msgid ""
"// ERROR.\n"
"    \"\""
msgstr ""
"// 错误。\n"
"    \"\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1313
msgid "Operand type"
msgstr "操作数类型"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1319
msgid "Several types of operands are supported:"
msgstr "支持多种类型的操作数："

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1325
msgid "`in(<reg>) <expr>`"
msgstr "`in(<reg>) <expr>`"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1326 src/inline-assembly.md:1351
#: src/inline-assembly.md:1388
msgid ""
"`<reg>` can refer to a register class or an explicit register. The allocated "
"register name is substituted into the asm template string."
msgstr ""
"`<reg>` 可以指代寄存器类或显式寄存器。分配到的寄存器名称会替换到 asm 模板字符"
"串中。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1327 src/inline-assembly.md:1389
msgid ""
"The allocated register will contain the value of `<expr>` at the start of "
"the assembly code."
msgstr "在汇编代码开始时，分配到的寄存器将包含 `<expr>` 的值。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1328
msgid ""
"The allocated register must contain the same value at the end of the "
"assembly code (except if a `lateout` is allocated to the same register)."
msgstr ""
"在汇编代码结束时，分配到的寄存器必须包含相同的值（除非 `lateout` 被分配到同一"
"寄存器）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1331
msgid "// ``in` can be used to pass values into inline assembly...\n"
msgstr "// ``in` 可用于向内联汇编传递值...\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1341
msgid ""
"If the value's type is smaller than the register, the value of the upper "
"bits is platform-specific. Some targets zero out the upper bits, while "
"others leave them untouched."
msgstr ""
"如果值的类型小于寄存器，则高位的值是平台特定的。一些目标会将高位清零，而其他"
"目标则保持高位不变。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1350
msgid "`out(<reg>) <expr>`"
msgstr "`out(<reg>) <expr>`"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1352
msgid ""
"The allocated register will contain an undefined value at the start of the "
"assembly code."
msgstr "在汇编代码开始时，分配到的寄存器将包含未定义值。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1353
msgid ""
"`<expr>` must be a (possibly uninitialized) place expression, to which the "
"contents of the allocated register are written at the end of the assembly "
"code."
msgstr ""
"`<expr>` 必须是一个（可能未初始化的）位置表达式，汇编代码结束时，分配到的寄存"
"器的内容会写入其中。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1354
msgid ""
"An underscore (`_`) may be specified instead of an expression, which will "
"cause the contents of the register to be discarded at the end of the "
"assembly code (effectively acting as a clobber)."
msgstr ""
"可以指定下划线（`_`）来代替表达式，这会导致寄存器的内容在汇编代码结束时被丢弃"
"（实际上起到 clobber 的作用）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1358
msgid "// and `out` can be used to pass values back to rust.\n"
msgstr "// 而 `out` 可用于将值传回 Rust。\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1368
msgid "`lateout(<reg>) <expr>`"
msgstr "`lateout(<reg>) <expr>`"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1369
msgid ""
"Identical to `out` except that the register allocator can reuse a register "
"allocated to an `in`."
msgstr "与 `out` 相同，只是寄存器分配器可以复用分配给某个 `in` 的寄存器。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1370 src/inline-assembly.md:1426
msgid ""
"You should only write to the register after all inputs are read, otherwise "
"you may clobber an input."
msgstr ""
"只有在读取完所有输入之后，才应该写入该寄存器；否则可能会 clobber 某个输入。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1374
msgid ""
"// `lateout` is the same as `out`\n"
"// but the compiler knows we don't care about the value of any inputs by "
"the\n"
"// time we overwrite it.\n"
msgstr ""
"// `lateout` 与 `out` 相同\n"
"// 但编译器知道，到我们覆盖它时，已经不关心任何输入的\n"
"// 值。\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1378
msgid "\"mov {}, 5\""
msgstr "\"mov {}, 5\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1387
msgid "`inout(<reg>) <expr>`"
msgstr "`inout(<reg>) <expr>`"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1390
msgid ""
"`<expr>` must be a mutable initialized place expression, to which the "
"contents of the allocated register are written at the end of the assembly "
"code."
msgstr ""
"`<expr>` 必须是一个已初始化的可变位置表达式，汇编代码结束时，分配到的寄存器的"
"内容会写入其中。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1394
msgid "// `inout` can be used to modify values in-register\n"
msgstr "// `inout` 可用于在寄存器内修改值\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1396 src/inline-assembly.md:1415
#: src/inline-assembly.md:1432 src/inline-assembly.md:2249
#: src/inline-assembly.md:2260
msgid "\"inc {}\""
msgstr "\"inc {}\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1405
msgid "`inout(<reg>) <in expr> => <out expr>`"
msgstr "`inout(<reg>) <in expr> => <out expr>`"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1406
msgid ""
"Same as `inout` except that the initial value of the register is taken from "
"the value of `<in expr>`."
msgstr "与 `inout` 相同，只是寄存器的初始值取自 `<in expr>` 的值。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1407
msgid ""
"`<out expr>` must be a (possibly uninitialized) place expression, to which "
"the contents of the allocated register are written at the end of the "
"assembly code."
msgstr ""
"`<out expr>` 必须是一个（可能未初始化的）位置表达式，汇编代码结束时，分配到的"
"寄存器的内容会写入其中。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1408
msgid ""
"An underscore (`_`) may be specified instead of an expression for `<out "
"expr>`, which will cause the contents of the register to be discarded at the "
"end of the assembly code (effectively acting as a clobber)."
msgstr ""
"对于 `<out expr>`，可以指定下划线（`_`）来代替表达式，这会导致寄存器的内容在"
"汇编代码结束时被丢弃（实际上起到 clobber 的作用）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1409
msgid "`<in expr>` and `<out expr>` may have different types."
msgstr "`<in expr>` 和 `<out expr>` 可以具有不同类型。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1413
msgid "// `inout` can also move values to different places\n"
msgstr "// `inout` 还可将值移动到不同位置\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1424
msgid "`inlateout(<reg>) <expr>` / `inlateout(<reg>) <in expr> => <out expr>`"
msgstr "`inlateout(<reg>) <expr>` / `inlateout(<reg>) <in expr> => <out expr>`"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1425
msgid ""
"Identical to `inout` except that the register allocator can reuse a register "
"allocated to an `in` (this can happen if the compiler knows the `in` has the "
"same initial value as the `inlateout`)."
msgstr ""
"与 `inout` 相同，只是寄存器分配器可以复用分配给某个 `in` 的寄存器（如果编译器"
"知道该 `in` 与 `inlateout` 具有相同初始值，就可能发生这种情况）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1430
msgid "// `inlateout` is `inout` using `lateout`\n"
msgstr "// `inlateout` 是使用 `lateout` 的 `inout`\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1441
msgid "`sym <path>`"
msgstr "`sym <path>`"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1442
msgid "`<path>` must refer to a `fn` or `static`."
msgstr "`<path>` 必须指向 `fn` 或 `static`。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1443
msgid ""
"A mangled symbol name referring to the item is substituted into the asm "
"template string."
msgstr "指向该项的经名称修饰的符号名会替换到 asm 模板字符串中。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1444
msgid ""
"The substituted string does not include any modifiers (e.g. GOT, PLT, "
"relocations, etc)."
msgstr "替换进去的字符串不包含任何修饰符（例如 GOT、PLT、重定位等）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1445
msgid ""
"`<path>` is allowed to point to a `#[thread_local]` static, in which case "
"the assembly code can combine the symbol with relocations (e.g. `@plt`, "
"`@TPOFF`) to read from thread-local data."
msgstr ""
"`<path>` 允许指向 `#[thread_local]` static；在这种情况下，汇编代码可以将该符"
"号与重定位（例如 `@plt`、`@TPOFF`）组合起来，以读取线程局部数据。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1450
msgid "\"Hello from inline assembly\""
msgstr "\"Hello from inline assembly\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1451
msgid ""
"// `sym` can be used to refer to a function (even if it doesn't have an\n"
"// external name we can directly write)\n"
msgstr ""
"// `sym` 可用于指代函数（即使它没有我们可以直接写出的\n"
"// 外部名称）\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1454 src/inline-assembly.md:2128
#: src/inline-assembly.md:2149 src/inline-assembly.md:2151
#: src/inline-assembly.md:2178
msgid "\"call {}\""
msgstr "\"call {}\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1462
msgid "`const <expr>`"
msgstr "`const <expr>`"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1463
msgid ""
"`<expr>` must be an integer constant expression. This expression follows the "
"same rules as inline `const` blocks."
msgstr ""
"`<expr>` 必须是整数常量表达式。该表达式遵循与内联 `const` 块相同的规则。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1464
msgid ""
"The type of the expression may be any integer type, but defaults to `i32` "
"just like integer literals."
msgstr "该表达式的类型可以是任意整数类型，但和整数字面量一样，默认是 `i32`。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1465
msgid ""
"The value of the expression is formatted as a string and substituted "
"directly into the asm template string."
msgstr "该表达式的值会被格式化为字符串，并直接替换到 asm 模板字符串中。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1468
msgid "// swizzle [0, 1, 2, 3] => [3, 2, 0, 1]\n"
msgstr "// 重排 [0, 1, 2, 3] => [3, 2, 0, 1]\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1472
msgid ""
"// Pass a constant value into an instruction that expects an immediate like "
"`pshufd`\n"
msgstr "// 将常量值传入像 `pshufd` 这样期望立即数的指令\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1475
msgid "\"pshufd {xmm}, {xmm}, {shuffle}\""
msgstr "\"pshufd {xmm}, {xmm}, {shuffle}\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1489
msgid "`label <block>`"
msgstr "`label <block>`"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1490
msgid ""
"The address of the block is substituted into the asm template string. The "
"assembly code may jump to the substituted address."
msgstr "该块的地址会替换到 asm 模板字符串中。汇编代码可以跳转到替换后的地址。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1491
msgid ""
"For targets that distinguish between direct jumps and indirect jumps (e.g. "
"x86-64 with `cf-protection` enabled), the assembly code must not jump to the "
"substituted address indirectly."
msgstr ""
"对于区分直接跳转和间接跳转的目标（例如启用了 `cf-protection` 的 x86-64），汇"
"编代码不得间接跳转到替换后的地址。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1492
msgid "After execution of the block, the `asm!` expression returns."
msgstr "该块执行完毕后，`asm!` 表达式返回。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1493
msgid "The type of the block must be unit or `!` (never)."
msgstr "该块的类型必须是单元类型或 `!`（never）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1494
msgid ""
"The block starts a new safety context; unsafe operations within the `label` "
"block must be wrapped in an inner `unsafe` block, even though the entire "
"`asm!` expression is already wrapped in `unsafe`."
msgstr ""
"该块会开启新的安全上下文；`label` 块内的 unsafe 操作必须包裹在内部 `unsafe` "
"块中，即使整个 `asm!` 表达式已经包裹在 `unsafe` 中。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1499 src/inline-assembly.md:2398
msgid "\"jmp {}\""
msgstr "\"jmp {}\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1500
msgid "\"Hello from inline assembly label\""
msgstr "\"Hello from inline assembly label\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1509
msgid ""
"Operand expressions are evaluated from left to right, just like function "
"call arguments. After the `asm!` has executed, outputs are written to in "
"left to right order. This is significant if two outputs point to the same "
"place: that place will contain the value of the rightmost output."
msgstr ""
"操作数表达式按从左到右的顺序求值，就像函数调用实参一样。`asm!` 执行后，输出按"
"从左到右的顺序写入。如果两个输出指向同一位置，这一点就很重要：该位置将包含最"
"右侧输出的值。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1513
msgid "// y gets its value from the second output, rather than the first\n"
msgstr "// y 的值来自第二个输出，而不是第一个输出\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1515
msgid "\"mov {}, 0\""
msgstr "\"mov {}, 0\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1515
msgid "\"mov {}, 1\""
msgstr "\"mov {}, 1\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1524
msgid ""
"Because `naked_asm!` defines a whole function body and the compiler cannot "
"emit any additional code to handle operands, it can only use `sym` and "
"`const` operands."
msgstr ""
"由于 `naked_asm!` 定义整个函数体，而编译器无法发出任何额外代码来处理操作数，"
"因此它只能使用 `sym` 和 `const` 操作数。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1530
msgid ""
"Because `global_asm!` exists outside a function, it can only use `sym` and "
"`const` operands."
msgstr "由于 `global_asm!` 位于函数之外，它只能使用 `sym` 和 `const` 操作数。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1533
msgid "// register operands aren't allowed, since we aren't in a function\n"
msgstr "// 不允许使用寄存器操作数，因为我们不在函数内\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1536
msgid "// ERROR: the `in` operand cannot be used with `global_asm!`\n"
msgstr "// 错误：`in` 操作数不能与 `global_asm!` 一起使用\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1545
msgid "// `const` and `sym` are both allowed, however\n"
msgstr "// 不过，`const` 和 `sym` 都是允许的\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1547
msgid "\"/* {} {} */\""
msgstr "\"/* {} {} */\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1554
msgid "Register operands"
msgstr "寄存器操作数"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1560
msgid ""
"Input and output operands can be specified either as an explicit register or "
"as a register class from which the register allocator can select a register. "
"Explicit registers are specified as string literals (e.g. `\"eax\"`) while "
"register classes are specified as identifiers (e.g. `reg`)."
msgstr ""
"输入和输出操作数既可以指定为显式寄存器，也可以指定为寄存器类，由寄存器分配器"
"从该类中选择一个寄存器。显式寄存器用字符串字面量指定（例如 `\"eax\"`），而寄"
"存器类用标识符指定（例如 `reg`）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1564
msgid ""
"// We can name both `reg`, or an explicit register like `eax` to get an\n"
"// integer register\n"
msgstr ""
"// 可以指定 `reg`，也可以指定像 `eax` 这样的显式寄存器，来获得\n"
"// 整数寄存器\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1567 src/inline-assembly.md:2177
msgid "\"mov eax, {:e}\""
msgstr "\"mov eax, {:e}\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1576
msgid ""
"Note that explicit registers treat register aliases (e.g. `r14` vs `lr` on "
"ARM) and smaller views of a register (e.g. `eax` vs `rax`) as equivalent to "
"the base register."
msgstr ""
"注意，显式寄存器会将寄存器别名（例如 ARM 上的 `r14` 与 `lr`）以及寄存器的较小"
"视图（例如 `eax` 与 `rax`）视为等同于基寄存器。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1582
msgid ""
"It is a compile-time error to use the same explicit register for two input "
"operands or two output operands."
msgstr "为两个输入操作数或两个输出操作数使用同一个显式寄存器是编译时错误。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1585
msgid "// We can't name eax twice\n"
msgstr "// 不能两次指定 eax\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1587
msgid "// ERROR: register `eax` conflicts with register `eax`\n"
msgstr "// 错误：寄存器 `eax` 与寄存器 `eax` 冲突\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1593
msgid "// ... even using different aliases\n"
msgstr "// ... 即使使用不同别名也不行\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1595 src/inline-assembly.md:1610
msgid "\"ax\""
msgstr "\"ax\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1595
msgid "// ERROR: register `rax` conflicts with register `ax`\n"
msgstr "// 错误：寄存器 `rax` 与寄存器 `ax` 冲突\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1605
msgid ""
"Additionally, it is also a compile-time error to use overlapping registers "
"(e.g. ARM VFP) in input operands or in output operands."
msgstr ""
"此外，在输入操作数或输出操作数中使用重叠的寄存器（例如 ARM VFP）也是编译时错"
"误。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1608
msgid "// al overlaps with ax, so we can't name both of them.\n"
msgstr "// al 与 ax 重叠，所以不能同时指定二者。\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1610
msgid "\"al\""
msgstr "\"al\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1610
msgid "// ERROR: register `al` conflicts with register `ax`\n"
msgstr "// 错误：寄存器 `al` 与寄存器 `ax` 冲突\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1620
msgid "Only the following types are allowed as operands for inline assembly:"
msgstr "只有以下类型可以作为内联汇编的操作数："

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1621
msgid "Integers (signed and unsigned)"
msgstr "整数（有符号和无符号）"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1622
msgid "Floating-point numbers"
msgstr "浮点数"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1623
msgid "Pointers (thin only)"
msgstr "指针（仅限瘦指针）"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1624
msgid "Function pointers"
msgstr "函数指针"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1625
msgid ""
"SIMD vectors (structs defined with `#[repr(simd)]` and which implement "
"`Copy`). This includes architecture-specific vector types defined in "
"`std::arch` such as `__m128` (x86) or `int8x16_t` (ARM)."
msgstr ""
"SIMD 向量（使用 `#[repr(simd)]` 定义且实现 `Copy` 的结构体）。这包括在 "
"`std::arch` 中定义的架构特定向量类型，例如 `__m128`（x86）或 `int8x16_t`"
"（ARM）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1630
msgid "// Integers are allowed...\n"
msgstr "// 整数是允许的...\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1634
msgid "// and pointers...\n"
msgstr "// 指针也可以...\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1638
msgid "// floats as well...\n"
msgstr "// 浮点数也可以...\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1642
msgid "// even function pointers and simd vectors.\n"
msgstr "// 甚至函数指针和 SIMD 向量也可以。\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1655
msgid "// Complex types like structs are not allowed\n"
msgstr "// 像结构体这样的复杂类型不允许使用\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:1657
msgid "// ERROR: cannot use value of type `Foo` for inline assembly\n"
msgstr "// 错误：不能将类型为 `Foo` 的值用于内联汇编\n"

