#: src/inline-assembly.md:2224
msgid ""
"The list of clobbered registers for each ABI is updated in rustc as "
"architectures gain new registers: this ensures that `asm!` clobbers will "
"continue to be correct when LLVM starts using these new registers in its "
"generated code."
msgstr ""
"随着各个架构获得新的寄存器，rustc 中每个 ABI 的 clobber 寄存器列表也会更新："
"这可确保当 LLVM 开始在其生成的代码中使用这些新寄存器时，`asm!` 的 clobber 仍"
"将保持正确。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2230
msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2236
msgid ""
"Flags are used to further influence the behavior of the inline assembly "
"code. Currently the following options are defined:"
msgstr "这些标志用于进一步影响内联汇编代码的行为。目前定义了以下选项："

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2242
msgid ""
"`pure`: The assembly code has no side effects, must eventually return, and "
"its outputs depend only on its direct inputs (i.e. the values themselves, "
"not what they point to) or values read from memory (unless the `nomem` "
"options is also set). This allows the compiler to execute the assembly code "
"fewer times than specified in the program (e.g. by hoisting it out of a "
"loop) or even eliminate it entirely if the outputs are not used. The `pure` "
"option must be combined with either the `nomem` or `readonly` options, "
"otherwise a compile-time error is emitted."
msgstr ""
"`pure`：该汇编代码没有副作用，必须最终返回，并且其输出仅依赖于它的直接输入"
"（即值本身，而不是它们所指向的内容）或从内存中读取的值（除非也设置了 `nomem` "
"选项）。这允许编译器比程序中指定的次数更少地执行该汇编代码（例如把它提升出循"
"环），如果其输出未被使用，甚至可以将其完全消除。`pure` 选项必须与 `nomem` 或 "
"`readonly` 选项之一组合使用，否则会产生编译时错误。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2247
msgid ""
"// pure can be used to optimize by assuming the assembly has no side "
"effects\n"
msgstr "// 可以通过假定汇编没有副作用来使用 pure 进行优化\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2257
msgid ""
"// Either nomem or readonly must be satisfied, to indicate whether or not\n"
"// memory is allowed to be read\n"
msgstr ""
"// 必须满足 nomem 或 readonly 之一，以表明是否\n"
"// 允许读取内存\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2260
msgid ""
"// ERROR: the `pure` option must be combined with either `nomem` or "
"`readonly`\n"
msgstr "// ERROR: `pure` 选项必须与 `nomem` 或 `readonly` 之一组合使用\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2271
msgid ""
"`nomem`: The assembly code does not read from or write to any memory "
"accessible outside of the assembly code. This allows the compiler to cache "
"the values of modified global variables in registers across execution of the "
"assembly code since it knows that they are not read from or written to by "
"it. The compiler also assumes that the assembly code does not perform any "
"kind of synchronization with other threads, e.g. via fences."
msgstr ""
"`nomem`：该汇编代码不会读取或写入任何在汇编代码之外可访问的内存。由于编译器知"
"道这些被修改的全局变量不会被该汇编代码读取或写入，因此它可以在执行该汇编代码"
"期间将这些全局变量的值缓存于寄存器中。编译器还会假定该汇编代码不会执行任何与"
"其他线程同步的操作，例如通过 fence。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2277
msgid ""
"// Accessing outside memory from assembly when `nomem` is\n"
"// specified is disallowed\n"
msgstr ""
"// 当指定 `nomem` 时，从汇编访问外部内存\n"
"// 是不允许的\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2281
msgid "\"mov {val:e}, dword ptr [{ptr}]\""
msgstr "\"mov {val:e}, dword ptr [{ptr}]\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2287
msgid ""
"// Writing to outside memory from assembly when `nomem` is\n"
"// specified is also undefined behaviour\n"
msgstr ""
"// 当指定 `nomem` 时，从汇编向外部内存写入\n"
"// 也是未定义行为\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2291
msgid "\"mov  dword ptr [{ptr}], {val:e}\""
msgstr "\"mov  dword ptr [{ptr}], {val:e}\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2303
msgid ""
"// If we allocate our own memory, such as via `push`, however.\n"
"// we can still use it\n"
msgstr ""
"// 不过，如果我们分配了自己的内存，例如通过 `push`，\n"
"// 我们仍然可以使用它\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2307 src/inline-assembly.md:2354
msgid "\"push {x}\""
msgstr "\"push {x}\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2307 src/inline-assembly.md:2354
msgid "\"add qword ptr [rsp], 1\""
msgstr "\"add qword ptr [rsp], 1\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2307 src/inline-assembly.md:2354
msgid "\"pop {x}\""
msgstr "\"pop {x}\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2320
msgid ""
"`readonly`: The assembly code does not write to any memory accessible "
"outside of the assembly code. This allows the compiler to cache the values "
"of unmodified global variables in registers across execution of the assembly "
"code since it knows that they are not written to by it. The compiler also "
"assumes that this assembly code does not perform any kind of synchronization "
"with other threads, e.g. via fences."
msgstr ""
"`readonly`：该汇编代码不会写入任何在汇编代码之外可访问的内存。由于编译器知道"
"这些未被修改的全局变量不会被该汇编代码写入，因此它可以在执行该汇编代码期间将"
"这些全局变量的值缓存于寄存器中。编译器还会假定该汇编代码不会执行任何与其他线"
"程同步的操作，例如通过 fence。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2325
msgid "// We cannot modify outside memory when `readonly` is specified\n"
msgstr "// 当指定 `readonly` 时，我们不能修改外部内存\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2328
msgid "\"mov dword ptr[{}], 1\""
msgstr "\"mov dword ptr[{}], 1\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2336
msgid "// We can still read from it, though\n"
msgstr "// 不过，我们仍然可以从中读取\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2339
msgid "\"mov {x}, qword ptr [{x}]\""
msgstr "\"mov {x}, qword ptr [{x}]\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2351
msgid "// Same exception applies as with nomem.\n"
msgstr "// 与 `nomem` 相同的例外在这里也适用。\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2367
msgid ""
"`preserves_flags`: The assembly code does not modify the flags register "
"(defined in the rules below). This allows the compiler to avoid recomputing "
"the condition flags after execution of the assembly code."
msgstr ""
"`preserves_flags`：该汇编代码不会修改标志寄存器（定义见下文规则）。这允许编译"
"器在执行该汇编代码后避免重新计算条件标志。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2373
msgid ""
"`noreturn`: The assembly code does not fall through; behavior is undefined "
"if it does. It may still jump to `label` blocks. If any `label` blocks "
"return unit, the `asm!` block will return unit. Otherwise it will return `!` "
"(never). As with a call to a function that does not return, local variables "
"in scope are not dropped before execution of the assembly code."
msgstr ""
"`noreturn`：该汇编代码不会从末尾继续执行；如果发生这种情况，行为是未定义的。"
"它仍然可以跳转到 `label` 块。若任一 `label` 块返回 unit，则 `asm!` 块将返回 "
"unit。否则它将返回 `!`（never）。与调用一个不返回的函数一样，作用域中的局部变"
"量不会在执行汇编代码之前被 drop。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2379
msgid ""
"// We can use an instruction to trap execution inside of a noreturn block\n"
msgstr "// 我们可以使用一条指令把执行困在一个 noreturn 块内\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2382
msgid "\"no return\""
msgstr "\"no return\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2388
msgid ""
"// You are responsible for not falling past the end of a noreturn asm block\n"
msgstr "// 你有责任确保执行不会越过 noreturn asm 块的末尾\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2397
msgid "// You may still jump to a `label` block\n"
msgstr "// 你仍然可以跳转到 `label` 块\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2408
msgid ""
"`nostack`: The assembly code does not push data to the stack, or write to "
"the stack red-zone (if supported by the target). If this option is _not_ "
"used then the stack pointer is guaranteed by the compiler at the start of "
"the assembly code to be suitably aligned (according to the target ABI) for a "
"function call."
msgstr ""
"`nostack`：该汇编代码不会将数据压入栈中，也不会写入栈 red-zone（如果目标支"
"持）。如果 _未_ 使用该选项，那么编译器会保证栈指针在汇编代码开始时已经为函数"
"调用进行了合适的对齐（依据目标 ABI）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2412
msgid "// `push` and `pop` are UB when used with nostack\n"
msgstr "// 与 nostack 一起使用时，`push` 和 `pop` 会导致 UB\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2414
msgid "\"push rax\""
msgstr "\"push rax\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2414
msgid "\"pop rax\""
msgstr "\"pop rax\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2422
msgid ""
"`att_syntax`: This option is only valid on x86, and causes the assembler to "
"use the `.att_syntax prefix` mode of the GNU assembler. Register operands "
"are substituted in with a leading `%`."
msgstr ""
"`att_syntax`：该选项仅在 x86 上有效，并使汇编器使用 GNU assembler 的 "
"`.att_syntax prefix` 模式。寄存器操作数在替换时会带有前导 `%`。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2427
msgid "// We need to use AT&T Syntax here. src, dest order for operands\n"
msgstr "// 这里我们需要使用 AT&T 语法。操作数顺序为 src, dest\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2430
msgid "\"mov {y:e}, {x:e}\""
msgstr "\"mov {y:e}, {x:e}\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2444
msgid ""
"`raw`: This causes the template string to be parsed as a raw assembly "
"string, with no special handling for `{` and `}`. This is primarily useful "
"when including raw assembly code from an external file using `include_str!`."
msgstr ""
"`raw`：这会使模板字符串被解析为原始汇编字符串，对 `{` 和 `}` 不作特殊处理。这"
"在使用 `include_str!` 从外部文件包含原始汇编代码时尤其有用。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2450
msgid "The compiler performs some additional checks on options:"
msgstr "编译器还会对选项执行一些额外检查："

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2456
msgid ""
"The `nomem` and `readonly` options are mutually exclusive: it is a compile-"
"time error to specify both."
msgstr "`nomem` 和 `readonly` 选项互斥：同时指定这两者会产生编译时错误。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2459
msgid ""
"// nomem is strictly stronger than readonly, they can't be specified "
"together\n"
msgstr "// nomem 严格强于 readonly，二者不能同时指定\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2461
msgid "// ERROR: the `nomem` and `readonly` options are mutually exclusive\n"
msgstr "// ERROR: `nomem` 和 `readonly` 选项互斥\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2471
msgid ""
"It is a compile-time error to specify `pure` on an asm block with no outputs "
"or only discarded outputs (`_`)."
msgstr ""
"在没有输出或只有被丢弃的输出（`_`）的 asm 块上指定 `pure` 会产生编译时错误。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2474
msgid "// pure blocks need at least one output\n"
msgstr "// pure 块至少需要一个输出\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2476
msgid "// ERROR: asm with the `pure` option must have at least one output\n"
msgstr "// ERROR: 带有 `pure` 选项的 asm 必须至少有一个输出\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2486
msgid ""
"It is a compile-time error to specify `noreturn` on an asm block with "
"outputs and without labels."
msgstr "在带有输出且没有标签的 asm 块上指定 `noreturn` 会产生编译时错误。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2490
msgid "// noreturn can't have outputs\n"
msgstr "// noreturn 不能有输出\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2492
msgid "\"mov {:e}, 1\""
msgstr "\"mov {:e}, 1\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2492
msgid "// ERROR: asm outputs are not allowed with the `noreturn` option\n"
msgstr "// ERROR: 使用 `noreturn` 选项时不允许 asm 输出\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2502
msgid ""
"It is a compile-time error to have any `label` blocks in an asm block with "
"outputs."
msgstr "在带有输出的 asm 块中包含任何 `label` 块都会产生编译时错误。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2508
msgid ""
"`naked_asm!` only supports the `att_syntax` and `raw` options. The remaining "
"options are not meaningful because the inline assembly defines the whole "
"function body."
msgstr ""
"`naked_asm!` 仅支持 `att_syntax` 和 `raw` 选项。其余选项没有意义，因为内联汇"
"编定义了整个函数体。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2514
msgid ""
"`global_asm!` only supports the `att_syntax` and `raw` options. The "
"remaining options are not meaningful for global-scope inline assembly."
msgstr ""
"`global_asm!` 仅支持 `att_syntax` 和 `raw` 选项。其余选项对于全局作用域的内联"
"汇编没有意义。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2518
msgid "// nomem is useless on global_asm!\n"
msgstr "// nomem 对 global_asm! 没有用处\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2528
msgid "Rules for inline assembly"
msgstr "内联汇编规则"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2534
msgid ""
"To avoid undefined behavior, these rules must be followed when using "
"function-scope inline assembly (`asm!`):"
msgstr ""
"为避免未定义行为，在使用函数作用域的内联汇编（`asm!`）时，必须遵守以下规则："

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2540
msgid ""
"Any registers not specified as inputs will contain an undefined value on "
"entry to the assembly code."
msgstr "任何未指定为输入的寄存器，在进入汇编代码时都将包含未定义值。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2541 src/inline-assembly.md:2752
msgid ""
"An \"undefined value\" in the context of inline assembly means that the "
"register can (non-deterministically) have any one of the possible values "
"allowed by the architecture. Notably it is not the same as an LLVM `undef` "
"which can have a different value every time you read it (since such a "
"concept does not exist in assembly code)."
msgstr ""
"内联汇编语境中的“未定义值”是指寄存器可以（非确定性地）拥有该架构所允许的任一"
"可能值。特别要注意，它不同于 LLVM `undef`，后者可以在每次读取时具有不同的值"
"（因为汇编代码中不存在这样的概念）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2547
msgid ""
"Any registers not specified as outputs must have the same value upon exiting "
"the assembly code as they had on entry, otherwise behavior is undefined."
msgstr ""
"任何未指定为输出的寄存器，在退出汇编代码时都必须与进入时具有相同的值，否则行"
"为是未定义的。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2548
msgid ""
"This only applies to registers which can be specified as an input or output. "
"Other registers follow target-specific rules."
msgstr ""
"这仅适用于那些可以指定为输入或输出的寄存器。其他寄存器遵循目标特定规则。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2549
msgid ""
"Note that a `lateout` may be allocated to the same register as an `in`, in "
"which case this rule does not apply. Code should not rely on this however "
"since it depends on the results of register allocation."
msgstr ""
"请注意，`lateout` 可能会被分配到与 `in` 相同的寄存器，在这种情况下此规则不适"
"用。不过，代码不应依赖这一点，因为这取决于寄存器分配的结果。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2555
msgid "Behavior is undefined if execution unwinds out of the assembly code."
msgstr "如果执行从汇编代码中展开出去，行为是未定义的。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2556
msgid ""
"This also applies if the assembly code calls a function which then unwinds."
msgstr "如果汇编代码调用了一个随后发生展开的函数，这同样适用。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2562 src/inline-assembly.md:2777
msgid ""
"The set of memory locations that assembly code is allowed to read and write "
"are the same as those allowed for an FFI function."
msgstr ""
"汇编代码允许读写的内存位置集合，与 FFI 函数允许读写的内存位置集合相同。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2563
msgid "If the `readonly` option is set, then only memory reads are allowed."
msgstr "如果设置了 `readonly` 选项，则只允许读取内存。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2564
msgid ""
"If the `nomem` option is set then no reads or writes to memory are allowed."
msgstr "如果设置了 `nomem` 选项，则不允许对内存进行任何读取或写入。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2565
msgid ""
"These rules do not apply to memory which is private to the assembly code, "
"such as stack space allocated within it."
msgstr "这些规则不适用于汇编代码私有的内存，例如其内部所分配的栈空间。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2571
msgid ""
"The compiler cannot assume that the instructions in the assembly code are "
"the ones that will actually end up executed."
msgstr "编译器不能假定汇编代码中的指令就是最终实际会被执行的那些指令。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2572
msgid ""
"This effectively means that the compiler must treat the assembly code as a "
"black box and only take the interface specification into account, not the "
"instructions themselves."
msgstr ""
"这实际上意味着编译器必须将汇编代码视为黑盒，只考虑接口规范，而不考虑指令本"
"身。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2573 src/inline-assembly.md:2785
msgid "Runtime code patching is allowed, via target-specific mechanisms."
msgstr "可以通过目标特定的机制进行运行时代码修补。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2574
msgid ""
"However there is no guarantee that each block of assembly code in the source "
"directly corresponds to a single instance of instructions in the object "
"file; the compiler is free to duplicate or deduplicate the assembly code in "
"`asm!` blocks."
msgstr ""
"不过，无法保证源代码中的每个汇编代码块都直接对应目标文件中的单个指令实例；编"
"译器可以自由地复制或去重 `asm!` 块中的汇编代码。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2580
msgid ""
"Unless the `nostack` option is set, assembly code is allowed to use stack "
"space below the stack pointer."
msgstr "除非设置了 `nostack` 选项，否则允许汇编代码使用栈指针以下的栈空间。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2581
msgid ""
"On entry to the assembly code the stack pointer is guaranteed to be suitably "
"aligned (according to the target ABI) for a function call."
msgstr ""
"在进入汇编代码时，保证栈指针已经为函数调用进行了合适的对齐（依据目标 ABI）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2582
msgid ""
"You are responsible for making sure you don't overflow the stack (e.g. use "
"stack probing to ensure you hit a guard page)."
msgstr "你有责任确保不会发生栈溢出（例如使用栈探测来确保命中保护页）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2583
msgid ""
"You should adjust the stack pointer when allocating stack memory as required "
"by the target ABI."
msgstr "在分配栈内存时，你应当按照目标 ABI 的要求调整栈指针。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2584
msgid ""
"The stack pointer must be restored to its original value before leaving the "
"assembly code."
msgstr "在离开汇编代码之前，必须将栈指针恢复为其原始值。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2590
msgid ""
"Unless the `nostack` option is set, assembly code is allowed to modify the "
"caller's stack frame when the target ABI requires storing certain values in "
"the caller's frame (e.g., when saving the `lr` on PowerPC64)."
msgstr ""
"除非设置了 `nostack` 选项，否则当目标 ABI 要求将某些值存储在调用者的栈帧中"
"时，允许汇编代码修改调用者的栈帧（例如在 PowerPC64 上保存 `lr` 时）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2596
msgid ""
"If the `noreturn` option is set then behavior is undefined if execution "
"falls through the end of the assembly code."
msgstr ""
"如果设置了 `noreturn` 选项，那么当执行从汇编代码末尾继续落出时，行为是未定义"
"的。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2602
msgid ""
"If the `pure` option is set then behavior is undefined if the `asm!` has "
"side-effects other than its direct outputs. Behavior is also undefined if "
"two executions of the `asm!` code with the same inputs result in different "
"outputs."
msgstr ""
"如果设置了 `pure` 选项，那么当 `asm!` 具有除其直接输出以外的副作用时，行为是"
"未定义的。如果以相同输入执行两次 `asm!` 代码却产生不同输出，行为也是未定义"
"的。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2603
msgid ""
"When used with the `nomem` option, \"inputs\" are just the direct inputs of "
"the `asm!`."
msgstr "与 `nomem` 选项一起使用时，“输入”仅指 `asm!` 的直接输入。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2604
msgid ""
"When used with the `readonly` option, \"inputs\" comprise the direct inputs "
"of the assembly code and any memory that it is allowed to read."
msgstr ""
"与 `readonly` 选项一起使用时，“输入”包括汇编代码的直接输入，以及它允许读取的"
"任何内存。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2610
msgid ""
"These flags registers must be restored upon exiting the assembly code if the "
"`preserves_flags` option is set:"
msgstr ""
"如果设置了 `preserves_flags` 选项，则退出汇编代码时必须恢复这些标志寄存器："

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2612
msgid "Status flags in `EFLAGS` (CF, PF, AF, ZF, SF, OF)."
msgstr "`EFLAGS` 中的状态标志（CF、PF、AF、ZF、SF、OF）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2613
msgid "Floating-point status word (all)."
msgstr "浮点状态字（全部）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2614
msgid "Floating-point exception flags in `MXCSR` (PE, UE, OE, ZE, DE, IE)."
msgstr "`MXCSR` 中的浮点异常标志（PE、UE、OE、ZE、DE、IE）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2616
msgid "Condition flags in `CPSR` (N, Z, C, V)"
msgstr "`CPSR` 中的条件标志（N、Z、C、V）"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2617
msgid "Saturation flag in `CPSR` (Q)"
msgstr "`CPSR` 中的饱和标志（Q）"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2618
msgid "Greater than or equal flags in `CPSR` (GE)."
msgstr "`CPSR` 中的大于或等于标志（GE）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2619
msgid "Condition flags in `FPSCR` (N, Z, C, V)"
msgstr "`FPSCR` 中的条件标志（N、Z、C、V）"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2620
msgid "Saturation flag in `FPSCR` (QC)"
msgstr "`FPSCR` 中的饱和标志（QC）"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2621
msgid ""
"Floating-point exception flags in `FPSCR` (IDC, IXC, UFC, OFC, DZC, IOC)."
msgstr "`FPSCR` 中的浮点异常标志（IDC、IXC、UFC、OFC、DZC、IOC）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2623
msgid "Condition flags (`NZCV` register)."
msgstr "条件标志（`NZCV` 寄存器）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2624
msgid "Floating-point status (`FPSR` register)."
msgstr "浮点状态（`FPSR` 寄存器）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2626
msgid "Floating-point exception flags in `fcsr` (`fflags`)."
msgstr "`fcsr` 中的浮点异常标志（`fflags`）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2627
msgid "Vector extension state (`vtype`, `vl`, `vxsat`, and `vxrm`)."
msgstr "向量扩展状态（`vtype`、`vl`、`vxsat` 和 `vxrm`）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2629
msgid "Floating-point condition flags in `$fcc[0-7]`."
msgstr "`$fcc[0-7]` 中的浮点条件标志。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2631
msgid ""
"Floating-point status and sticky bits in the `fpscr` (any field other than "
"DRN, VE, OE, UE, ZE, XE, NI, or RN)."
msgstr ""
"`fpscr` 中的浮点状态和粘滞位（除 DRN、VE、OE、UE、ZE、XE、NI 或 RN 以外的任何"
"字段）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2632
msgid "Vector status and sticky bits in the `vscr` (any field other than NJ)."
msgstr "`vscr` 中的向量状态和粘滞位（除 NJ 以外的任何字段）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2633
msgid "PowerPC SPE"
msgstr "PowerPC SPE"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2634
msgid ""
"The sticky and status bits of the `spefscr` (any field other than FINXE, "
"FINVE, FDBZE, FUNFE, FOVFE, or FRMC)."
msgstr ""
"`spefscr` 的粘滞位和状态位（除 FINXE、FINVE、FDBZE、FUNFE、FOVFE 或 FRMC 以外"
"的任何字段）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2636
msgid "The condition code register `cc`."
msgstr "条件码寄存器 `cc`。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2642
msgid ""
"On x86, the direction flag (DF in `EFLAGS`) is clear on entry to the "
"assembly code and must be clear on exit."
msgstr ""
"在 x86 上，进入汇编代码时方向标志（`EFLAGS` 中的 DF）是清除的，退出时也必须是"
"清除的。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2643
msgid ""
"Behavior is undefined if the direction flag is set on exiting the assembly "
"code."
msgstr "如果退出汇编代码时方向标志被设置，则行为是未定义的。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2649
msgid ""
"On x86, the x87 floating-point register stack must remain unchanged unless "
"all of the `st([0-7])` registers have been marked as clobbered with "
"`out(\"st(0)\") _, out(\"st(1)\") _, ...`."
msgstr ""
"在 x86 上，x87 浮点寄存器栈必须保持不变，除非所有 `st([0-7])` 寄存器都已用 "
"`out(\"st(0)\") _, out(\"st(1)\") _, ...` 标记为 clobber。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2650
msgid ""
"If all x87 registers are clobbered then the x87 register stack is guaranteed "
"to be empty upon entering the assembly code. Assembly code must ensure that "
"the x87 register stack is also empty when exiting the assembly code."
msgstr ""
"如果所有 x87 寄存器都被 clobber，则进入汇编代码时保证 x87 寄存器栈为空。汇编"
"代码必须确保退出汇编代码时 x87 寄存器栈也为空。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:2657
msgid ""
"// we can do complex stuff with x87 if we clobber the entire x87 stack\n"
msgstr ""
"// we can do complex stuff with x87 if we clobber the entire x87 stack\n"

