msgstr "//                                              ~~\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:205
msgid "//                                     Promoted temporary.\n"
msgstr "//                                     被提升的临时项。\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:212
msgid ""
"In other words --- to focus on what's allowed rather than what's not allowed "
"--- shared borrows of interior mutable data and mutable borrows are only "
"allowed in a [const context](#const-context) when the borrowed [place "
"expression](expressions.md#r-expr.place-value.place-memory-location) is "
"_transient_, _indirect_, or _static_."
msgstr ""
"换句话说，为了聚焦于允许的情况而非不允许的情况，只有当被借用的[位置表达式]"
"(expressions.md#r-expr.place-value.place-memory-location)是_瞬时的_、_间接的_"
"或 _static_ 时，内部可变数据的共享借用和可变借用才允许出现在 [const 上下文]"
"(#const-context)中。"

#: src/const_eval.md:214
msgid ""
"A place expression is _transient_ if it is a variable local to the current "
"const context or an expression whose temporary scope is contained inside the "
"current const context."
msgstr ""
"如果一个位置表达式是当前 const 上下文局部的变量，或是其临时作用域包含在当前 "
"const 上下文内的表达式，则它是_瞬时的_。"

#: src/const_eval.md:217
msgid "// The borrow is of a variable local to the initializer, therefore\n"
msgstr "// 该借用是对初始化器局部变量的借用，因此\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:218
msgid "// this place expression is transient.\n"
msgstr "// 此位置表达式是瞬时的。\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:223
msgid "// The borrow is of a temporary whose scope has not been extended,\n"
msgstr "// 该借用是对作用域未被延长的临时项的借用，\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:224
msgid "// therefore this place expression is transient.\n"
msgstr "// 因此此位置表达式是瞬时的。\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:229
msgid "// When a temporary is promoted but not lifetime extended, its\n"
msgstr "// 当临时项被提升但生命周期未被延长时，其\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:230
msgid "// place expression is still treated as transient.\n"
msgstr "// 位置表达式仍被视为瞬时的。\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:234
msgid ""
"A place expression is _indirect_ if it is a [dereference expression]"
"(expressions/operator-expr.md#r-expr.deref)."
msgstr ""
"如果一个位置表达式是[解引用表达式](expressions/operator-expr.md#r-"
"expr.deref)，则它是_间接的_。"

#: src/const_eval.md:240
msgid "A place expression is _static_ if it is a `static` item."
msgstr "如果一个位置表达式是 `static` 条目，则它是 _static_。"

#: src/const_eval.md:254
msgid "One surprising consequence of these rules is that we allow this,"
msgstr "这些规则的一个令人意外的结果是，我们允许这样写，"

#: src/const_eval.md:258
msgid "//                                    ~~~~~~~\n"
msgstr "//                                    ~~~~~~~\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:259
msgid "// Empty arrays are promoted even behind mutable borrows.\n"
msgstr "// 即使位于可变借用之后，空数组也会被提升。\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:262
msgid "but we disallow this similar code:"
msgstr "但不允许下面这段类似的代码："

#: src/const_eval.md:266
msgid "//               ~~~~~~~\n"
msgstr "//               ~~~~~~~\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:267
msgid "//           Tail expression.\n"
msgstr "//           尾表达式。\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:270
msgid ""
"The difference between these is that, in the first, the empty array is "
"[promoted](destructors.md#constant-promotion) but its scope does not undergo "
"[temporary lifetime extension](destructors.md#r-destructors.scope.lifetime-"
"extension), so we consider the [place expression](expressions.md#r-"
"expr.place-value.place-memory-location) to be transient (even though after "
"promotion the place indeed lives to the end of the program). In the second, "
"the scope of the empty array temporary does undergo lifetime extension, and "
"so it is rejected due to being a mutable borrow of a lifetime-extended "
"temporary (and therefore borrowing a non-transient place expression)."
msgstr ""
"二者的区别在于，在第一个示例中，空数组会被[提升](destructors.md#constant-"
"promotion)，但它的作用域不会经历[临时生命周期延长](destructors.md#r-"
"destructors.scope.lifetime-extension)，因此我们认为该 [位置表达式]"
"(expressions.md#r-expr.place-value.place-memory-location)是瞬时的（尽管在提升"
"之后，该位置确实会存活到程序结束）。在第二个示例中，空数组临时值的作用域确实"
"会经历生命周期延长，因此它会因作为对生命周期被延长的临时值的可变借用而被拒绝"
"（也因此借用了非瞬时的位置表达式）。"

#: src/const_eval.md:272
msgid ""
"The effect is surprising because temporary lifetime extension, in this case, "
"causes less code to compile than would without it."
msgstr ""
"这种效果令人意外，因为在此情形下，临时生命周期延长会使可编译的代码少于没有它"
"时的情况。"

#: src/const_eval.md:274
msgid ""
"See [issue #143129](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/issues/143129) for "
"more details."
msgstr ""
"更多细节见 [issue #143129](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/issues/143129)。"

#: src/const_eval.md:283
