msgstr "[分组](expressions/grouped-expr.md)表达式。"

#: src/const_eval.md:312
msgid ""
"[Cast](expressions/operator-expr.md#type-cast-expressions) expressions, "
"except"
msgstr ""
"[类型转换](expressions/operator-expr.md#type-cast-expressions)表达式，但不包"
"括"

#: src/const_eval.md:313
msgid "pointer to address casts and"
msgstr "指针到地址的转换，以及"

#: src/const_eval.md:314
msgid "function pointer to address casts."
msgstr "函数指针到地址的转换。"

#: src/const_eval.md:320
msgid ""
"Calls of [const functions](items/functions.md#const-functions) and const "
"methods."
msgstr ""
"对 [const 函数](items/functions.md#const-functions)和 const 方法的调用。"

#: src/const_eval.md:326
msgid ""
"[loop](expressions/loop-expr.md#infinite-loops) and [while](expressions/loop-"
"expr.md#predicate-loops) expressions."
msgstr ""
"[loop](expressions/loop-expr.md#infinite-loops) 和 [while](expressions/loop-"
"expr.md#predicate-loops) 表达式。"

#: src/const_eval.md:332
msgid ""
"[if](expressions/if-expr.md#if-expressions) and [match](expressions/match-"
"expr.md) expressions."
msgstr ""
"[if](expressions/if-expr.md#if-expressions) 和 [match](expressions/match-"
"expr.md) 表达式。"

#: src/const_eval.md:338
msgid "Const context"
msgstr "const 上下文"

#: src/const_eval.md:345
msgid "A _const context_ is one of the following:"
msgstr "_const 上下文_是下列情形之一："

#: src/const_eval.md:351
msgid "[Array type length expressions](types/array.md)"
msgstr "[数组类型长度表达式](types/array.md)"

#: src/const_eval.md:357
msgid "[Array repeat length expressions](expressions/array-expr.md)"
msgstr "[数组重复长度表达式](expressions/array-expr.md)"

#: src/const_eval.md:363
msgid "The initializer of"
msgstr "下列项的初始化器"

#: src/const_eval.md:364
msgid "[constants](items/constant-items.md)"
msgstr "[常量](items/constant-items.md)"

#: src/const_eval.md:365
msgid "[statics](items/static-items.md)"
msgstr "[静态项](items/static-items.md)"

#: src/const_eval.md:366
msgid "[enum discriminants](items/enumerations.md#discriminants)"
msgstr "[枚举判别值](items/enumerations.md#discriminants)"

#: src/const_eval.md:372
msgid "A [const generic argument](items/generics.md#const-generics)"
msgstr "一个 [const 泛型实参](items/generics.md#const-generics)"

#: src/const_eval.md:378
msgid "A [const block](expressions/block-expr.md#const-blocks)"
msgstr "一个 [const 块](expressions/block-expr.md#const-blocks)"

#: src/const_eval.md:384
msgid ""
"Array type length expressions, array repeat length expressions, and const "
"generic arguments are restricted in their use of outer generic parameters: "
"such an expression must either be a single const generic parameter, or an "
"expression that does not reference any generic parameters."
msgstr ""
"数组类型长度表达式、数组重复长度表达式和 const 泛型实参在使用外层泛型参数方面"
"受到限制：这样的表达式必须要么是单个 const 泛型参数，要么是不引用任何泛型参数"
"的表达式。"

#: src/const_eval.md:396
msgid ""
"A _const function_ is a function that can be called from a const context. It "
"is defined with the `const` qualifier, and also includes [tuple struct]"
"(items/structs.md) and [tuple enum variant](items/enumerations.md) "
"constructors."
msgstr ""
"_const 函数_是可以从 const 上下文调用的函数。它使用 `const` 限定符定义，并且"
"还包括 [tuple struct](items/structs.md) 和 [tuple enum variant](items/"
"enumerations.md) 构造器。"

#: src/const_eval.md:415
msgid ""
"When called from a const context, a const function is interpreted by the "
"compiler at compile time. The interpretation happens in the environment of "
"the compilation target and not the host. So `usize` is `32` bits if you are "
"compiling against a `32` bit system, irrelevant of whether you are building "
"on a `64` bit or a `32` bit system."
msgstr ""
"当从 const 上下文调用时，const 函数会在编译时由编译器解释执行。解释执行发生在"
"编译目标的环境中，而不是宿主环境中。因此，如果你是针对 `32` 位系统编译，那么 "
"`usize` 就是 `32` 位，这与你是在 `64` 位系统还是 `32` 位系统上构建无关。"

#: src/const_eval.md:421
msgid ""
"When a const function is called from outside a const context, it behaves the "
"same as if it did not have the `const` qualifier."
msgstr ""
"当 const 函数从 const 上下文之外被调用时，其行为就像没有 `const` 限定符一样。"

#: src/const_eval.md:427
msgid ""
"The body of a const function may only use [constant expressions](#constant-"
"expressions)."
msgstr "const 函数的函数体只能使用[常量表达式](#constant-expressions)。"

#: src/const_eval.md:433
msgid ""
"Const functions are not allowed to be [async](items/functions.md#async-"
"functions)."
msgstr "const 函数不允许为 [async](items/functions.md#async-functions)。"

#: src/const_eval.md:439
msgid ""
"The types of a const function's parameters and return type are restricted to "
"those that are compatible with a const context."
msgstr "const 函数的参数类型和返回类型被限制为与 const 上下文兼容的类型。"

#: src/abi.md:5 src/glossary.md:19
msgid "Application binary interface (ABI)"
msgstr "应用二进制接口（ABI）"

#: src/abi.md:11
msgid ""
"This section documents features that affect the ABI of the compiled output "
"of a crate."
msgstr "本节记录会影响 crate 编译输出 ABI 的特性。"

#: src/abi.md:13
msgid ""
"See _[extern functions](items/functions.md#extern-function-qualifier)_ for "
"information on specifying the ABI for exporting functions. See _[external "
"blocks](items/external-blocks.md)_ for information on specifying the ABI for "
"linking external libraries."
msgstr ""
"有关为导出函数指定 ABI 的信息，请参阅 _[extern functions](items/"
"functions.md#extern-function-qualifier)_。有关为链接外部库指定 ABI 的信息，请"
"参阅 _[external blocks](items/external-blocks.md)_。"

#: src/abi.md:20
msgid "The `used` attribute"
msgstr "`used` 属性"

#: src/abi.md:26
msgid ""
"The _`used` [attribute](attributes.md)_ forces a [static](items/static-"
"items.md) to be kept in the output object file (.o, .rlib, etc., excluding "
"final binaries) even if it's never used or referenced by any other item in "
"the crate. The linker, however, is still free to remove it."
msgstr ""
"_`used` [属性](attributes.md)_强制将 [static](items/static-items.md) 保留在输"
"出目标文件（.o、.rlib 等，不包括最终二进制文件）中，即使它从未被 crate 中的任"
"何其他项使用或引用。不过，链接器仍然可以移除它。"

#: src/abi.md:33
msgid "// lib.rs\n"
msgstr "// lib.rs\n"

#: src/abi.md:35
msgid "// This is kept because of `#[used]`.\n"
msgstr "// 由于 `#[used]`，这会被保留。\n"

#: src/abi.md:39
msgid "// This is removable because it's unused.\n"
msgstr "// 由于它未被使用，这可以被移除。\n"

#: src/abi.md:43
msgid "// This is kept because it's publicly reachable.\n"
msgstr "// 由于它公开可达，这会被保留。\n"

#: src/abi.md:46
msgid "// This is kept because it's referenced by a publicly\n"
msgstr "// 由于它被一个公开可达的函数\n"

#: src/abi.md:47
msgid "// reachable function.\n"
msgstr "// 引用，这会被保留。\n"

#: src/abi.md:51
msgid "// This is removable because it's referenced only by a\n"
msgstr "// 由于它只被一个私有且未使用的\n"

#: src/abi.md:52
msgid "// private, unused (dead) function.\n"
msgstr "// （dead）函数引用，这可以被移除。\n"

#: src/abi.md:74
msgid ""
"The `used` attribute uses the [MetaWord](attributes.md#grammar-MetaWord) "
"syntax."
msgstr "`used` 属性使用 [MetaWord](attributes.md#grammar-MetaWord) 语法。"

#: src/abi.md:80
msgid ""
"The `used` attribute may only be applied to [`static` items](items/static-"
"items.md#r-items.static)."
msgstr ""
"`used` 属性只能应用于 [`static` 项](items/static-items.md#r-items.static)。"

#: src/abi.md:86
msgid "Only the first use of `used` on an item has effect."
msgstr "在一个项上，只有第一次使用 `used` 会生效。"

#: src/abi.md:101
msgid "The `no_mangle` attribute"
msgstr "`no_mangle` 属性"

#: src/abi.md:107
msgid ""
"The _`no_mangle` attribute_ may be used on any [item](items.md) to disable "
"standard symbol name mangling. The symbol for the item will be the "
"identifier of the item's name."
msgstr ""
"_`no_mangle` 属性_可用于任何[项](items.md)，以禁用标准符号名修饰。该项的符号"
"将是项名称的标识符。"

#: src/abi.md:113
msgid ""
"Additionally, the item will be publicly exported from the produced library "
"or object file, similar to the [`used` attribute](#the-used-attribute)."
msgstr ""
"此外，类似于 [`used` 属性](#the-used-attribute)，该项将从生成的库或目标文件中"
"公开导出。"

#: src/abi.md:119
msgid ""
"This attribute is unsafe as an unmangled symbol may collide with another "
"symbol with the same name (or with a well-known symbol), leading to "
"undefined behavior."
msgstr ""
"此属性是 unsafe 的，因为未修饰的符号可能会与同名的另一个符号（或知名符号）发"
"生冲突，从而导致未定义行为。"

#: src/abi.md:134
msgid ""
"Before the 2024 edition it is allowed to use the `no_mangle` attribute "
"without the `unsafe` qualification."
msgstr ""
"在 2024 edition 之前，允许在不带 `unsafe` 限定的情况下使用 `no_mangle` 属性。"

#: src/abi.md:143
msgid "The `link_section` attribute"
msgstr "`link_section` 属性"

#: src/abi.md:149
msgid ""
"The _`link_section` attribute_ specifies the section of the object file that "
"a [function](items/functions.md) or [static](items/static-items.md)'s "
"content will be placed into."
msgstr ""
"_`link_section` 属性_指定[函数](items/functions.md)或 [static](items/static-"
"items.md) 的内容将被放入目标文件的哪个节。"

#: src/abi.md:155
msgid ""
"The `link_section` attribute uses the [MetaNameValueStr]"
"(attributes.md#grammar-MetaNameValueStr) syntax to specify the section name."
msgstr ""
"`link_section` 属性使用 [MetaNameValueStr](attributes.md#grammar-"
"MetaNameValueStr) 语法来指定节名称。"

#: src/abi.md:161
msgid "\".example_section\""
msgstr "\".example_section\""

#: src/abi.md:170
msgid ""
"This attribute is unsafe as it allows users to place data and code into "
"sections of memory not expecting them, such as mutable data into read-only "
"areas."
msgstr ""
"此属性是 unsafe 的，因为它允许用户将数据和代码放入并不预期它们的内存节中，例"
"如将可变数据放入只读区域。"

#: src/abi.md:176
msgid "Only the first use of `link_section` on an item has effect."
msgstr "在一个项上，只有第一次使用 `link_section` 会生效。"

#: src/abi.md:195
msgid ""
"Before the 2024 edition it is allowed to use the `link_section` attribute "
"without the `unsafe` qualification."
msgstr ""
"在 2024 edition 之前，允许在不带 `unsafe` 限定的情况下使用 `link_section` 属"
"性。"

#: src/abi.md:204
msgid "The `export_name` attribute"
msgstr "`export_name` 属性"

#: src/abi.md:210
msgid ""
"The _`export_name` attribute_ specifies the name of the symbol that will be "
"exported on a [function](items/functions.md) or [static](items/static-"
"items.md)."
msgstr ""
"_`export_name` 属性_指定将在[函数](items/functions.md)或 [static](items/"
"static-items.md) 上导出的符号名称。"

#: src/abi.md:216
msgid ""
"The `export_name `attribute uses the [MetaNameValueStr]"
"(attributes.md#grammar-MetaNameValueStr) syntax to specify the symbol name."
msgstr ""
"`export_name `属性使用 [MetaNameValueStr](attributes.md#grammar-"
"MetaNameValueStr) 语法来指定符号名称。"

#: src/abi.md:219
msgid "\"exported_symbol_name\""
msgstr "\"exported_symbol_name\""

#: src/abi.md:227
msgid ""
"This attribute is unsafe as a symbol with a custom name may collide with "
"another symbol with the same name (or with a well-known symbol), leading to "
"undefined behavior."
msgstr ""
"此属性是 unsafe 的，因为具有自定义名称的符号可能会与同名的另一个符号（或知名"
"符号）发生冲突，从而导致未定义行为。"

#: src/abi.md:233
msgid "Only the first use of `export_name` on an item has effect."
msgstr "在一个项上，只有第一次使用 `export_name` 会生效。"

#: src/abi.md:252
msgid ""
"Before the 2024 edition it is allowed to use the `export_name` attribute "
"without the `unsafe` qualification."
msgstr ""
"在 2024 edition 之前，允许在不带 `unsafe` 限定的情况下使用 `export_name` 属"
"性。"

#: src/runtime.md:7
msgid ""
"This section documents features that define some aspects of the Rust runtime."
msgstr "本节记录定义 Rust 运行时某些方面的特性。"

#: src/runtime.md:14
msgid "The `global_allocator` attribute"
msgstr "`global_allocator` 属性"

#: src/runtime.md:20
msgid ""
"The _`global_allocator` [attribute](attributes.md#r-attributes)_ selects a "
"[memory allocator](../std/alloc/index.html)."
msgstr ""
"_`global_allocator` [属性](attributes.md#r-attributes)_ 会选择一个[内存分配"
"器](../std/alloc/index.html)。"

#: src/runtime.md:52
msgid ""
"The `global_allocator` attribute uses the [MetaWord](attributes.md#grammar-"
"MetaWord) syntax."
msgstr ""
"`global_allocator` 属性使用 [MetaWord](attributes.md#grammar-MetaWord) 语法。"

#: src/runtime.md:58
msgid ""
"The `global_allocator` attribute may only be applied to a [static item]"
"(items/static-items.md) whose type implements the [`GlobalAlloc`](../core/"
"alloc/global/trait.GlobalAlloc.html) trait."
msgstr ""
"`global_allocator` 属性只能应用于类型实现 [`GlobalAlloc`](../core/alloc/"
"global/trait.GlobalAlloc.html) trait 的[静态项](items/static-items.md)。"

#: src/runtime.md:64
msgid "The `global_allocator` attribute may only be used once on an item."
msgstr "`global_allocator` 属性在一个项上只能使用一次。"

#: src/runtime.md:70
msgid ""
"The `global_allocator` attribute may only be used once in the crate graph."
msgstr "`global_allocator` 属性在 crate 图中只能使用一次。"

#: src/runtime.md:76
msgid ""
"The `global_allocator` attribute is exported from the [standard library "
"prelude](../core/prelude/v1/index.html)."
msgstr ""
"`global_allocator` 属性从[标准库 prelude](../core/prelude/v1/index.html)中导"
"出。"

#: src/runtime.md:83
msgid "The `windows_subsystem` attribute"
msgstr "`windows_subsystem` 属性"

#: src/runtime.md:89
msgid ""
"The _`windows_subsystem` [attribute](attributes.md#r-attributes)_ sets the "
"[subsystem](https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/fcc1zstk.aspx) when "
"linking on a Windows target."
msgstr ""
"_`windows_subsystem` [属性](attributes.md#r-attributes)_ 会在链接 Windows 目"
"标时设置[子系统](https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/fcc1zstk.aspx)。"

#: src/runtime.md:106
msgid ""
"The `windows_subsystem` attribute uses the [MetaNameValueStr]"
"(attributes.md#grammar-MetaNameValueStr) syntax. Accepted values are "
"`\"console\"` and `\"windows\"`."
msgstr ""
"`windows_subsystem` 属性使用 [MetaNameValueStr](attributes.md#grammar-"
"MetaNameValueStr) 语法。接受的值为 `\"console\"` 和 `\"windows\"`。"

#: src/runtime.md:112
msgid ""
"The `windows_subsystem` attribute may only be applied to the crate root."
msgstr "`windows_subsystem` 属性只能应用于 crate 根。"

#: src/runtime.md:118
msgid "Only the first use of `windows_subsystem` has effect."
msgstr "只有第一次使用 `windows_subsystem` 会生效。"

#: src/runtime.md:133
msgid ""
"The `windows_subsystem` attribute is ignored on non-Windows targets and non-"
"`bin` [crate types](linkage.md)."
msgstr ""
"`windows_subsystem` 属性在非 Windows 目标和非 `bin` [crate 类型](linkage.md)"
"上会被忽略。"

#: src/runtime.md:139
msgid ""
"The `\"console\"` subsystem is the default. If a console process is run from "
"an existing console then it will be attached to that console; otherwise a "
"new console window will be created."
msgstr ""
"`\"console\"` 子系统是默认值。如果控制台进程从已有控制台运行，它会附加到该控"
"制台；否则会创建一个新的控制台窗口。"

#: src/runtime.md:145
msgid ""
"The `\"windows\"` subsystem will run detached from any existing console."
msgstr "`\"windows\"` 子系统会以脱离任何已有控制台的方式运行。"

#: src/runtime.md:151
msgid ""
"The `\"windows\"` subsystem is commonly used by GUI applications that do not "
"want to display a console window on startup."
msgstr ""
"`\"windows\"` 子系统通常由不希望在启动时显示控制台窗口的 GUI 应用程序使用。"

